{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-GapBetweenSSSBRepetition","paragraph_zero_based":47688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the gap between two adjacent S-SSB repetitions in frequency domain in one RB set, and the gap is between the lowest subcarrier of the upper PSBCH and the highest subcarrier of the lower PSBCH. The Unit is PRB.","paragraph_zero_based":47689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-NumOfSSSBRepetition","paragraph_zero_based":47690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the number of S-SSB repetitions in frequency domain in one RB set. S-SSB in the frequency domain indicated by sl-AbsoluteFrequencySSB is applicable in region with no OCB requirement, or with OCB exemption.","paragraph_zero_based":47691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RBSetIndex","paragraph_zero_based":47692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the index of RB-set for which the configuration applies.","paragraph_zero_based":47693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-RelayIndicationMP","paragraph_zero_based":47695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-RelayIndicationMP is used to indicate the L2 U2N Relay UE supporting RRC connection establishment/resume for MP operation triggered by receiving RemoteUEInformationSidelink containing the connectionForMP as specified in 5.3.3.1a and 5.3.13.1a in Rel-18.","paragraph_zero_based":47696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RelayIndicationMP information element","paragraph_zero_based":47697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RELAYINDICATIONMP-START","paragraph_zero_based":47699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RelayIndicationMP-r18 ::=   ENUMERATED {support}","paragraph_zero_based":47701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RELAYINDICATIONMP-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-RelayUE-Config","paragraph_zero_based":47706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-RelayUE-Config specifies the configuration information for NR sidelink U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":47707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RelayUE-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":47708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RELAYUE-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":47710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["09977ef87c540c5a7845ff124efecc03cb1ef38f20441014df2c431283f57aa2","e368a48d385ce329b38536a0eb2c70f2a1be165b29a2f7f96e06f65a089ed77a","f4cddfb9cea1514e6b7b0eafd219842386258fb3f1d74784916ea553cb199ccc","215f1a952683ff14bcf556b83066434ce1601755a0ca1efa34529f73a8faffe8","9c38bb68f31bd00b122136627355d73d9e5d5ee43397b7b7f3b22838b08653ed","8be66199fcb8418fbfecbbda875380a97bc54789834e551f879b23c275209560","86ccba1e65348d6dfe1dba5838903ac41ea11b60409931ebd802e1db99bd51fc","f188c3d78f1e1808a4767477bcfa1066947c6f2e3a27fb8007a50564d54b0d69","b6eeb71ff20c3f8bdc38b83215f10c9d264ea36ad481f1feab83d3d93a56f8e9","1a610c16c7c2466d247b19c3e6f599b50621cad7ca64b5a22e2683077fdca9a9","38961da5ed1c50d2ba8abc3ed66