{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-RelayUE-ConfigU2U specifies the threshold configuration information for NR sidelink U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":47736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RelayUE-ConfigU2U information element","paragraph_zero_based":47737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RELAYUE-CONFIGU2U-START","paragraph_zero_based":47739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RelayUE-ConfigU2U-r18::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":47741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig-r18         SL-RSRP-Range-r16                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":47742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sd-RSRP-ThreshDiscConfig-r18          SL-RSRP-Range-r16                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":47743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sd-hystMaxRelay-r18                   Hysteresis                                            OPTIONAL    -- Cond SD-RSRP-ThreshRelay","paragraph_zero_based":47744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":47745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RELAYUE-CONFIGU2U-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":47748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RelayUE-ConfigU2U field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":47750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig","paragraph_zero_based":47751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the threshold of SL-RSRP for a U2U Relay UE to evaluate AS layer conditions for discovery. The U2U relay UE applies the value of this field to decide which UE(s) can be announced as proximity UE(s) in the discovery message when performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model A, and decide whether to forward the discovery message when performing the U2U Relay Discovery with Model B as specified in [65]. ","paragraph_zero_based":47752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sd-RSRP-ThreshDiscConfig","paragraph_zero_based":47753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the threshold of SD-RSRP for a U2U Relay UE to evaluate AS layer conditions for discovery. The U2U relay UE applies the value of this field to evaluate AS layer conditions to decide which UE(s) can be announced as proximity UE(s) in the discovery message when performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model A, and decide whether to forward the discovery message when performing the U2U Relay Discovery with Model B or U2U relay communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304 [65].","paragraph_zero_based":47754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":47756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":47757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RSRP-ThreshRelay","paragraph_zero_based":47758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if sl-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig is included. Otherwise, the field is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":47759}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9f8cfb8ddcd09b2113802bc7a15d27d2fac402ea60b3475d59e8aff566f551aa","a05cb3b6816c2cf2375fc0d10c