{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RemoteUE-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":47784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ReselectionConfig","paragraph_zero_based":47785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes the parameters used by the U2N remote UE when selecting/ reselecting a U2N relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":47786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"thresHighRemote","paragraph_zero_based":47787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the threshold of Uu RSRP for a UE that is in network coverage to evaluate AS layer conditions for U2N remote UE operation.","paragraph_zero_based":47788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ReselectionConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":47790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP","paragraph_zero_based":47791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Specifies L3 filter coefficient for SL communication/ discovery RSRP measurement results from L1 filter.","paragraph_zero_based":47792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RSRP-Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":47793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the threshold of SL communication/ discovery RSRP for a U2N remote UE to perform relay UE selection/ reselection.","paragraph_zero_based":47794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":47796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":47797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RSRP-Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":47798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if sl-RSRP-Thresh is included. Otherwise, the field is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":47799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ThreshHighRemote","paragraph_zero_based":47800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present if threshHighRemote is included. Otherwise, the field is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":47801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":47802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U","paragraph_zero_based":47803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U specifies the threshold configuration information for NR sidelink U2U Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":47804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U information element","paragraph_zero_based":47805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":47806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-REMOTEUE-CONFIGU2U-START","paragraph_zero_based":47807}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3e2e0436bdea1e023e8050f174f91c07ce9c91a0c52d46811233aac015f0e089","f72d5e55da662886338dbef3c342cea993649e7dec343c4f2374b7784b3d715d","011a77efe9349fb5f31a0a432be7cc707ef575ec3440ed3ef2cd8569889c4288","4e6060bf0aeff7935cbc0046916939b25c04cb628bdfe5c8f552a1b2bff8c9ba","a956079a481f2984c99f51f0e0bb04a3e6887fc7908f9fb98732f675bdfc01f3","61c58b9fc56ba6b6e7bf6edc5168ae092ff1e07dd90cc02955702080ef784888","693b89f315046fa60eacb8d2ef89373e0e2309c76de17bdb2a89b666f3e5693a","8cc4f3813cdd6f30f2eb3997722cd014b0065e9c4a124474e367b8d2a4a6267e","9b707dbc55a099558eebb4d4ac982af70e58567235141da1249c9c17b2928d8a","dc5ccc821dacf44908db48470ba1e267a5b93daec94d2cae26992cfe87f1c0b4","2472d7074bd6fceaf6249f7762420ce116cf35f2c1274315abf38588db6e5fde","d8de67a099bebf9028d79a050564bd9bbbcb7032ab0d666d74425fa65f8f5eb3","e2b39fd42b10a53ff5979