{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LCH-Setup","paragraph_zero_based":48384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present upon creation of a new sidelink logical channel via the dedicated signalling and in case of sidelink DRB configuration via system information and pre-configuration; otherwise the field is optionally present, Need M.","paragraph_zero_based":48385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LCH-SetupOnly","paragraph_zero_based":48386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is mandatory present upon creation of a new sidelink logical channel via the dedicated signalling and in case of sidelink DRB configuration via system information and pre-configuration. Otherwise, it is absent, Need M.","paragraph_zero_based":48387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex","paragraph_zero_based":48389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex is used to identify a SL RLC bearer configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":48390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex information element","paragraph_zero_based":48391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":48392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RLC-BEARERCONFIGINDEX-START","paragraph_zero_based":48393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex-r16 ::=                    INTEGER (1..maxSL-LCID-r16)","paragraph_zero_based":48395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex-v1800 ::=                  INTEGER (maxSL-LCID-Plus1-r18..maxSL-LCID-r18)","paragraph_zero_based":48397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RLC-BEARERCONFIGINDEX-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-RLC-ChannelConfig","paragraph_zero_based":48402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-RLC-ChannelConfig specifies the configuration information for PC5 Relay RLC channel between L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, or between L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":48403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-RLC-ChannelConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":48404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":48405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RLC-RLC-CHANNEL-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":48406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e1da6eec317fad4cbce89296de4a1efe3d057b087d65150abe7af7af6a404de0","62a1fd5495feb1b421e9ef3206ae13252e572317507c03e0768034c0052cf1fc","f6a678984b59b647881d30680bc1b427d74696f0e4d46691dec534be7370ab25","d719ddf8cc322d31d1a4ccb631212cdf52dc09810c5a432c40dc251a7cc6ee5d","87a44bc71c5c9cc2e4df3c46436b8f46c3f440fb1daddaf10bdda05b9f7c1368","34bcd2059a4956104c8c6e0eee29d7d944c39e4e29e57e8f10398569a91a4310","6837fec4a97891bee750bc702afc1608ad7a8053ba7a619922ef10004daa5707","1a466a99f7832b9047292388c9776a937c45d9fee9bd9ce578a5348655ac615a","dbec015afb28d5a9193124c7efb1c756e9834ee921209c4e482979386724345a","0beab1dbca06e0294e0b2a842044385938313df67d69506c869ba453fa65423f","c4c864d565917ae522a98348