{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the time gap between DCI reception and the first sidelink transmission scheduled by the DCI (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 8.1.2.1). Value 1 included in this field corresponds to 1 slot, value 2 corresponds to 2 slots and so on, based on the numerology of sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":48528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PSFCH-ToPUCCH","paragraph_zero_based":48529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For dynamic grant and configured grant type 2, this field configures the values (in number of slot lengths) of the PSFCH to PUCCH gap. The field PSFCH-to-HARQ_feedback timing indicator in DCI format 3_0 selects one of the configured values of the PSFCH to PUCCH gap.","paragraph_zero_based":48530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RNTI","paragraph_zero_based":48531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the SL-RNTI used for monitoring the network scheduling to transmit NR sidelink communication (i.e. the mode 1).","paragraph_zero_based":48532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MAC-MainConfigSL field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":48534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BSR-Config","paragraph_zero_based":48535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is to configure the sidelink buffer status report.","paragraph_zero_based":48536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PrioritizationThres","paragraph_zero_based":48537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SL priority threshold, which is used to determine whether SL TX is prioritized over UL TX, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. Network does not configure the sl-PrioritizationThres and the ul-PrioritizationThres to the UE separately.","paragraph_zero_based":48538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ul-PrioritizationThres","paragraph_zero_based":48539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the UL priority threshold, which is used to determine whether SL TX is prioritized over UL TX, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. Network does not configure the sl-PrioritizationThres and the ul-PrioritizationThres to the UE separately.","paragraph_zero_based":48540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-SDAP-Config","paragraph_zero_based":48542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-SDAP-Config is used to set the configurable SDAP parameters for a Sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":48543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SDAP-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":48544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":48545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-SDAP-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":48546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SDAP-Config-r16 ::=                  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":48548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-SDAP-Header-r16                      ENUMERATED {present, absent},","paragraph_zero_based":48549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-DefaultRB-r16                        BOOLEAN,","paragraph_zero_based":48550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-MappedQoS-Flows-r16                  CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":48551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3969294a43f9dd9e5736f243f64ceee7a0dbe13e7d2eb92411513acf8e45ff7f","9697cec386888875f7dc65feb52168faf657abff2cb260cee29ff635019fc70f","74201216a86bf1c1da368516636e12aaafeea72e164e53eb349a