w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LocalIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":48642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the local UE ID of the L2 U2N Remote UE used in SRAP as specified in TS 38.351 [66].","paragraph_zero_based":48643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappingToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":48644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of mappings between the bearer identity of the L2 U2N Remote UE and the egress RLC channel as specified in TS 38.351 [66] to be added or modified.","paragraph_zero_based":48645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappingToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":48646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of mappings between the bearer identity of the L2 U2N Remote UE and the egress RLC channel as specified in TS 38.351 [66] to be released.","paragraph_zero_based":48647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5c83506486d8654f858f4f9766b25cde9b747786928a65f0ffd9b5ca3cfa5f34","5e5cb411b9df6870b16dcfa9bfe3733e746325a514648b9bc1f8ea790486880b","ee515d72ac890b1008b6ae494300f72883e85963680edf17ebe63f3b3631c72b","3ef80e510cf212b3ecdbaf4abd3a4570a09d5c31f71bcf713f25acef29c2a829","e9e5a8d6f0a5889e17dd87353e51db97ccb0025785aea500cb2998756d277bcd","fdc49124ffdf92137283295bf5ffc59606a69381edd5e1ca030c5f6ce2d37836","f6e507a3edbe8a1b0f0c0be2827944d147d8e645a1b805ab8c04a53a7de8b635","fb32e1a8a93ac3df9cfa48696e84f2843086b94b13a3f5d54b711c907d248571","ec5e9bb19f8adb6dc581a43acdd8c2fa171026dc209b869c82f3d02421848675","633cb617b306cc92bc0556e4e898d0e33d9f483376f4d05ecf9f60002bfa7936","5a1494614fb8285b80c2cb7a48cba69708b54b7442b7f4d421169133919f496c","311fceccf82ae918feb6d1a2c799882084185c40b65667f7087dab53a061c9