{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RemoteUE-RB-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":48648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Identity of the end-to-end Uu bearer identity of the L2 U2N Remote UE. The value 3 for the field srb-identity-r17 (i.e., for configuring SRB3) is not supported in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":48649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EgressRLC-ChannelUu","paragraph_zero_based":48650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the egress RLC channel on Uu Hop for uplink transmissions at the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":48651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5","paragraph_zero_based":48652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the egress RLC channel on PC5 Hop for downlink transmissions at the L2 U2N Relay UE and for uplink transmissions at the L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":48653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":48655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":48656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2RelayUE","paragraph_zero_based":48657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2N Relay UE, the field is optionally present, Need M. Otherwise, it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":48658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-SRAP-ConfigU2U","paragraph_zero_based":48660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-SRAP-ConfigU2U is used to set the configurable SRAP parameters used by L2 U2U Relay UE and L2 U2U Remote UE as specified in TS 38.351 [66].","paragraph_zero_based":48661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SRAP-ConfigU2U information element","paragraph_zero_based":48662},{"literal_text_al