{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CFR-CONFIGMCCH-MTCH-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CFR-ConfigMCCH-MTCH field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":48892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"commonControlResourceSetExt","paragraph_zero_based":48893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An additional common control resource set which may be configured and used for searchSpaceMCCH/searchSpaceMTCH or UE-specific search space in the BWP where searchSpaceMCCH is configured. It is contained in the bandwidth of the CFR for broadcast and larger than CORESET#0.","paragraph_zero_based":48894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"locationAndBandwidthBroadcast","paragraph_zero_based":48895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates starting PRB and the number of PRBs of CFR used for MCCH and MTCH reception.","paragraph_zero_based":48896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value sameAsSib1ConfiguredLocationAndBW means the CFR for broadcast has the same location and size as the locationAndBandwidth for initial BWP (for (e)RedCap UEs: initialDownlinkBWP-RedCap if it is configured and includes CD-SSB and the entire CORESET#0) configured in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":48897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value locationAndBandwidth is used to configure CFR with bandwidth that is larger than and fully contains the bandwidth for the initial DL BWP (for (e)RedCap UEs: initialDownlinkBWP-RedCap if it is configured and includes CD-SSB and the entire CORESET#0) configured in SIB1 and CORESET#0. The value of the field shall be interpreted as defined in TS 38.214 [19] with assumptions as described in TS 38.213 [13].","paragraph_zero_based":48898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is not included in cfr-ConfigMCCH-MTCH-RedCap if initialDownlinkBWP-RedCap in SIB1 is configured but does not include CD-SSB and the entire CORESET#0.","paragraph_zero_based":48899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the field is absent, the CFR for broadcast has the same location and size as CORESET#0.","paragraph_zero_based":48900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdsch-ConfigMCCH","paragraph_zero_based":48901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates PDSCH parameters used for MCCH transmission. If the field is absent, PDSCH parameters used for MCCH are the same as those of PDSCH configuration provided in initialDownlinkBWP in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":48902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":48904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":48905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NotSIB1CommonControlResource","paragraph_zero_based":48906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optional present in case commonControlResourceSet is not configured in SIB1, Need R, otherwise it is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":48907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DRX-ConfigPTM","paragraph_zero_based":48909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DRX-Config-PTM is used to configure DRX related parameters for PTM transmission as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":48910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-Config-PTM information element","paragraph_zero_based":48911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef7