{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGPTM-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":48961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-Config-PTM field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":48963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-HARQ-RTT-Timer-DL-PTM","paragraph_zero_based":48964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of symbols of the CFR where the transport block was received.","paragraph_zero_based":48965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimerPTM","paragraph_zero_based":48966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":48967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycleStartOffsetPTM","paragraph_zero_based":48968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycle-PTM in ms and drx-StartOffset-PTM in multiples of 1 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":48969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimerPTM","paragraph_zero_based":48970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":48971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-RetransmissionTimer-DL-PTM","paragraph_zero_based":48972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the CFR where the transport block was received. value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":48973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-SlotOffsetPTM","paragraph_zero_based":48974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in 1/32 ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0 ms, value 1 corresponds to 1/32 ms, value 2 corresponds to 2/32 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":48975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":48977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":48978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HARQFeedback","paragraph_zero_based":48979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if HARQ feedback is enabled for a G-RNTI/G-CS-RNTI associated with this DRX configuration. It is optionally present. Need R, otherwise. ","paragraph_zero_based":48980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBS-NeighbourCellList","paragraph_zero_based":48982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MBS-NeighbourCellList indicates a list of neighbour cells where ongoing MBS sessions provided via broadcast MRB in the current cell may also be provided, as indicated in the mtch-NeighbourCell.","paragraph_zero_based":48983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["301a1fd43a8a1c5283766cec5aaa99fa620b165a95ea087ded2f6eab0a150e5a","e704b6a0b928860fee079b528c33b524d957c98a498c3f5affd3c15d40e05c68","3aa3528901f5d0518f61729b9036a7d5add5fe8fa96878aa5af3d04b0135b31e","174798257560c3bb6236843063c1e9b59151cfa800794968b6e99d9ee859200f","d66af8a71109b8a9453302bda013af457eb1101b059b117325cec270c43e0a64","274379d093c18112ff3f7324b95fc83298920d7991136771964768158a589e8c","fb332530242251818d65f16538d50f40e71440676c997841cb0a5daef903867e","21b8cf85a22f432320583ed9ac6f30da044a939cde5e3a389380c6bd7acf1a98","02f4