{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":49152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MTCH-Mapping","paragraph_zero_based":49153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if the number of actual transmitted SSBs determined according to ssb-PositionsInBurst in SIB1 is more than 1, and searchspaceMTCH is not set to zero (including the case where searchSpaceMTCH is absent and searchSpaceMCCH is not set to zero). Otherwise, it is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":49154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBS-SessionInfoListMulticast","paragraph_zero_based":49156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MBS-SessionInfoListMulticast provides a list of MBS multicast sessions transmitted via multicast MRB for RRC_INACTIVE UEs and, for each MBS multicast session, the associated G-RNTI and scheduling information.","paragraph_zero_based":49157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-SessionInfoListMulticast information element","paragraph_zero_based":49158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":49159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBS-SESSIONINFOLISTMULTICAST-START","paragraph_zero_based":49160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-SessionInfoListMulticast-r18 ::=      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofMBS-Session-r17)) OF MBS-SessionInfoMulticast-r18","paragraph_zero_based":49162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":49163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBS-SessionInfoMulticast-r18 ::=   SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":49164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mbs-SessionId-r18                  TMGI-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":49165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    g-RNTI-r18                         RNTI-Value                                   OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":49166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mrb-ListMulticast-r18              MRB-ListMulticast-r18                        OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":49167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mtch-SchedulingInfo-r18            DRX-ConfigPTM-Index-r17                      OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":49168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mtch-NeighbourCell-r18             BIT STRING (SIZE(maxNeighCellMBS-r17))       OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":49169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdsch-ConfigIndex-r18              PDSCH-ConfigIndex-r17                        OPTIONAL, -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":49170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mtch-SSB-MappingWindowIndex-r18    MTCH-SSB-MappingWindowIndex-r17              OPTIONAL, -- Cond MTCH-Mapping","paragraph_zero_based":49171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    thresholdIndex-r18                 INTEGER (0..maxNrofThresholdMBS-1-r18)       OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":49172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdcp-SyncIndicator-r18             ENUMERATED {true}                            OPTIONAL, -- Cond RRCRelease","paragraph_zero_based":49173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    stopMonitoringRNTI-r18             ENUMERATED {true}                            OPTIONAL, -- Cond G-RNTI","paragraph_zero_based":49174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":49175}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["08c047063a43218be6e5eb0156509c0e7ff3520bdf904c7b231e2d6c295233b4","69