{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CarrierToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":50376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the carrier(s) to be added/modified for transmission by UE transmitting RRCReconfigurationSidelink message, corresponding to the frequency in sl-FreqInfoListSizeExt broadcast in SIB12 or corresponding to the frequency in sl-PreconfigFreqInfoListSizeExt in SL-PreconfigurationNR.","paragraph_zero_based":50377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CarrierToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":50378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the carrier(s) to be released for the transmission by UE transmitting RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":50379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CSI-RS-FreqAllocation","paragraph_zero_based":50380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency domain position for sidelink CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":50381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-CSI-RS-FirstSymbol","paragraph_zero_based":50382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the position of first symbol of sidelink CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":50383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5","paragraph_zero_based":50384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR sidelink DRX configuration for unicast communication, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]","paragraph_zero_based":50385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report","paragraph_zero_based":50386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the latency bound of SL CSI report from the associated SL CSI triggering in terms of number of slots.","paragraph_zero_based":50387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report","paragraph_zero_based":50388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report from the associated SL Inter-UE coordination explicit request triggering in terms of number of slots.","paragraph_zero_based":50389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LocalID-PairToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":50390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate a list of local ID pair which is assigned for one end-to-end PC5 connection by the L2 U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":50391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":50392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":50393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LogicalChannelIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":50394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the identity of the sidelink logical channel, as specified in TS 38.321 [3], clause 6.2.4. If the sl-LogicalChannelIdentity-v1800 is present, the UE shall ignore the sl-LogicalChannelIndentity-r16 field.","paragraph_zero_based":50395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList","paragraph_zero_based":50396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the QoS flows to be mapped to the configured sidelink DRB. Each entry is indicated by the SL-PQFI, which is used between UEs, as defined in TS 23.287 [55].","paragraph_zero_based":50397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":50398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the QoS flows to be released from the configured sidelink DRB. Each entry is indicated by the SL-PQFI, which is used between UEs, as defined in TS 23.287 [55].","paragraph_zero_based":50399}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eb526853b3b7c29e5ee7d24b09bb75c8407a9d14672cc05e0238feb2d4d818a2","29e79ca25fe4ae4cfd0909cdbfd4