{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasConfig","paragraph_zero_based":50400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the sidelink measurement configuration for the unicast destination.","paragraph_zero_based":50401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-OffsetToCarrier","paragraph_zero_based":50402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Offset in frequency domain between Point A (lowest subcarrier of common RB 0) and the lowest usable subcarrier on this carrier in number of PRBs (using the subcarrierSpacing defined for this carrier). The maximum value corresponds to 275*8-1. See TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.2.","paragraph_zero_based":50403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-OutOfOrderDelivery","paragraph_zero_based":50404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not outOfOrderDelivery specified in TS 38.323 [5] is configured. This field should be either always present or always absent, after the sidelink radio bearer is established.","paragraph_zero_based":50405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PDCP-SN-Size","paragraph_zero_based":50406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the PDCP SN size of the configured sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":50407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-Resetconfig","paragraph_zero_based":50408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the full configuration should be applicable for the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":50409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":50410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the additional Sidelink RLC bearer to be added / modified for the configured sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":50411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":50412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the additional Sidelink RLC bearer to be released for the configured sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":50413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SDAP-Header","paragraph_zero_based":50414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not a SDAP header is present on this sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":50415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SFN-DFN-Offset","paragraph_zero_based":50416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SFN-DFN offset to be used for determining the SFN timeline based on the DFN timeline.","paragraph_zero_based":50417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SRB-IdentityWithDuplication","paragraph_zero_based":50418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the sidelink SRB for which duplication is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":50419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex","paragraph_zero_based":50420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the identity of the configuration of a sidelink DRB. In case of L2 U2U relay, only value 4-31 can be signaled for end-to-end sidelink DRB, and all other values are reserved.","paragraph_zero_based":50421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":50422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5 field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":50423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["76819f28abd48d1f4520436e0cb32a7267dbee5106f4c86b907e69c3cf1b7229","7efeab1fdccd4a1bac7392d3d8b3729b33ad745eca9af2bc20b02aadb44a3901","5c612dad167d64cfa5db0bc3b87fc4a512a36fe5bc562f4f1f6075894b306a43","071d74e10a1a485abab1b40226db87f648b1f0af7912109ca7ab9a1db7a520e3","84add5ec28759014e8034d0b5d104858391e192a0e8940318e5e685e6bce6308","fb73fffb22c999e