{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Initiate the measurement reporting procedure, stop performing the related measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":50904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T325","paragraph_zero_based":50905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCRelease message with deprioritisationTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":50906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":50907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Stop deprioritisation of all frequencies or NR signalled by RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":50908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T330","paragraph_zero_based":50909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving LoggedMeasurementConfiguration message","paragraph_zero_based":50910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon log volume exceeding the suitable UE memory, upon initiating the release of LoggedMeasurementConfiguration procedure","paragraph_zero_based":50911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions specified in 5.5a.1.4","paragraph_zero_based":50912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T331","paragraph_zero_based":50913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving RRCRelease message with measIdleDuration","paragraph_zero_based":50914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving RRCSetup, RRCResume, RRCRelease with idle/inactive measurement configuration, upon cell selection/reselection to a cell that does not belong to the validityArea (if configured), or upon cell re-selection to another RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":50915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3.","paragraph_zero_based":50916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T342","paragraph_zero_based":50917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with DelayBudgetReport.","paragraph_zero_based":50918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing delayBudgetReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, and upon receiving delayBudgetReportingConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":50919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":50920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T345","paragraph_zero_based":50921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with overheatingAssistance","paragraph_zero_based":50922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing overheatingAssistanceConfig during the connection re-establishment procedure, upon initiating the connection resumption procedure, and upon receiving overheatingAssistanceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":50923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":50924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346a (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":50925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with drx-Preference.","paragraph_zero_based":50926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing drx-PreferenceConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving drx-PreferenceConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":50927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae930ed","original_member_sha256":"cf818f4a328fc82c7558ea21f216bee86ef70a3f095c39da9ef1e843f48973c6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e2930cf4f42128afa926e32ced76bb23ad81e33bd68a6991538cefedc32e12a5","8c40b2fdf09c8ba057b75d16ffd269575faebad2674291515ccfa2868a5064a8","7ed825f2ead87211cbfed4bd07871effc832192b2f3e4339234fb058bab1fdaf","53d34e92a314ed2e3460766827541f4dcc7d715ab076230388ac772eb7fc5cc9","