{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2 during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2 set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":50976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":50977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346n","paragraph_zero_based":50978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of MUSIM temporary restriction of musim-CapRestriction for constraint combination of bands and/or band(s) or combination bands to avoid ","paragraph_zero_based":50979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing musim-CapabilityRestrictionConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, or upon receiving musim-CapabilityRestrictionConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":50980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action. ","paragraph_zero_based":50981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T348","paragraph_zero_based":50982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of MUSIM temporary restriction of musim-CapRestriction for serving cell(s) with capabilities restricted, release of SCell or release of SCG. ","paragraph_zero_based":50983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCReconfiguration message that does not exceed UE temporary capability restriction transmitted via musim-CapRestriction.","paragraph_zero_based":50984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE may apply the temporary UE capability restriction in accordance with the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-CapRestriction.","paragraph_zero_based":50985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T350","paragraph_zero_based":50986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting DedicatedSIBRequest message with requestedSIB-List and/or  requestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":50987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the requested SIB(s) or posSIB(s), upon releasing onDemandSIB-Request during the connection re-establishment procedures, upon receiving onDemandSIB-Request set to release, upon reception of RRCRelease or upon successful change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":50988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action","paragraph_zero_based":50989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T380","paragraph_zero_based":50990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of t380 in RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":50991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup or RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":50992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.13.","paragraph_zero_based":50993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T390","paragraph_zero_based":50994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When access attempt is barred at access barring check for an Access Category. The UE maintains one instance of this timer per Access Category.","paragraph_zero_based":50995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon cell (re)selection, upon relay (re)selection, upon entering RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of RRCReconfiguration including reconfigurationWithSync, upon change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of MobilityFromNRCommand, or upon reception of RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":50996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":50997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T400","paragraph_zero_based":50998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of RRCReconfigurationSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":50999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9d1d70d9256212d4b7dc322b4b9f040a9786df5e243754184d613f861ae9