{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2405601.zip::R2-2405601 Rapp CR for SL relay_update.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink or RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":51000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the Sidelink radio link failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3.","paragraph_zero_based":51001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T420","paragraph_zero_based":51002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including sl-PathSwitchConfig where sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync","paragraph_zero_based":51003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE)","paragraph_zero_based":51004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the RRC re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":51005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T421","paragraph_zero_based":51006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including sl-IndirectPathAddChange where sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync","paragraph_zero_based":51007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE) if split SRB1 with duplication is configured, or upon reception of RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink if split SRB1 with duplication is not configured, or upon initiation of indirect path failure information procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":51008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the Failure Information Reporting as specified in 5.7.3c.","paragraph_zero_based":51009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T430","paragraph_zero_based":51010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start or restart from the subframe indicated by epochTime upon reception of SIB19, or upon reception of RRCReconfiguration message for the target cell including reconfigurationWithSync, or upon conditional reconfiguration execution i.e. when applying a stored RRCReconfiguration message for the target cell including reconfigurationWithSync, or upon satellite switch with resynchronization.","paragraph_zero_based":51011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Stop T430, if it is running, for the source cell upon reception of RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync, or upon conditional reconfiguration execution i.e. when applying a stored RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync, or upon satellite switch with resynchronization.","paragraph_zero_based":51012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.2.2.6.","paragraph_zero_based":51013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.1.2Timer handling","paragraph_zero_based":51015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the UE applies zero value for a timer, the timer shall be started and immediately expire unless explicitly stated otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":51016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7.2Counters","paragraph_zero_based":51017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Counter","paragraph_zero_based":51018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reset","paragraph_zero_based":51019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Incremented","paragraph_zero_based":51020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When reaching max value","paragraph_zero_based":51021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N310","paragraph_zero_based":51022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of \"in-sync\" indication from lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":51023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha2