aeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f8930defa5bd5ad451b1be25e646d64842b873db9305e780510591b8d03f811e","024879184595060dd72e261e2c718ba2c84b83b09ba78b4dd4dc9d671f694ed3","07cca60e4c02903ebdf716ee451d3a3120a49a638b03d08c49df5f0d8d1e4bbb","9615fe2c38abd87c5b9679a47b77790c5c21400c552defae4bac26fd7603ccc7","063fee3411263c6fd827fb868bd191e45b455103eaa0d54ab6e497ed62799f8b","bc05f257ec51ab93097af76020b1e89e4c902ce0d606e547c13c19e0b27e56f2","b817adf704b5ee4d087b981f7472c96060d9fb0b4420c43365103ed7aefa389b","cf106a5eb1cee108b0877cb67af81f033dc1f0edc026fb7608d8f282965fdd4d","1f4518c5f6ecb03080afc46b0c7499967bcfb94db653de411f2a15771243b790","a472979f39afed3f6d52e92bf260be72c3e576592cddd97cf47baa3ebe9cd17a","1c258065a59c14d87c6fe610c3d046535a8a4576f65de99b2c70525b5804b01a","18717903a288f714101ef485e99bb7320719f9dc2e2fe9b7865b78010e5c10a4","817d0e07b03540d8f385f1c9d1056bc7796990cf200e14331ccae5212350f676","e200e56d7185f11e4289e44743571cffa83c1fb22044fca8adb33b563695d70c","0497b6e5b1b6bb614a3137b6f2e00e414cd0a050a80037b34f16d7d15f190c50","80ea8f38860c9e30258f34391e967b843404df53c0d068d3dbf9de699e566752","2c0cb8165b8eabd6fe6a7aba3d6b03de35ef3423b6a256ddf7d1ccf62eacce9f","9605f232b62c609dad584c2da222e0a431773f55b5c9525c97b67862aa48c145","46de81b3515ee1017d457010f1d102d6a821826d5759bfefa8a96ccc0f9d3ccc","ea547134ddad93336116c99d4510d352f29541c014bf829ba7e5ed5d54cb9f61","2d7d69931c222d0a6f3a186a1e7b3ab44eee4287541a114858b747c72050fba7","1f497e41ff54bd015cfafddfa381006dabe6dc4b52d124dcb3b3608bd5ff0bac","8711acb86c480f92a65b339cbbdcfc09414c5b4af421e424a92ed6ce8a0fbbb0","c145bc64f8d55baeaa2c154b22de79266d1af8fe6b3dacd414766b9d77f206e9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The CR intends to fix the following issues:","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 1: In 5.8.9.1.2 and 5.8.9.7.2, “SL-RLC-BearerConfig” and  “SL-RLC-Config “ has been used to describe the SL radio bearer configuration for L2 U2U relay. However, in NR SL preconfiguration, both “sl-RLC-BearerPreConfigList-r16 “ and “sl-RLC-BearerConfigListSizeExt-v1800 “ contains the SL-RLC-BearerConfig and SL-RLC-Config, so there is ambiguity about which configuraiton list the UE shall use to derive PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration. Since “sl-RLC-BearerConfigListSizeExt-v1800“ is added for SL CA for V2X use case and not to be used for U2U relay, we think it is better to include the exact list name in the procedure to avoid UE to misimplement this feature. Similarly, there are two fields in SIB12 both containing SL-RLC-BearerConfig & SL-RLC-Config, so it is better to also explicitly descirbe the list name for SIB12 case.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 2: An end-to-end DRB release may be triggered by NW RRCReconfiguraton or may be triggered by UE-side reasons (RLF). Hence,it is not always true that there exists a NW configuraiton to provide SRAP configuration to allow the UE to reconfigure SRAP entity. So, we need to add the right conditon for this behaviour in 5.8.9.1a.1.2.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 3:  sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U is not provided in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, but directly under RRCReconfiguration.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 4: The level-1 bullet “if any sidelink QoS flow is (re)configured by source L2 U2U Remote UE and is mapped to a end-to-end sidelink DRB for transmission when the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE” is not needed because the text below has already clearly exaplained that “For L2 U2U Relay UE, an end-to-end sidelink DRB addition is initiated only in the case it receives new end-to-end sidelink DRB information from the source L2 U2U Remote UE as in clause 5.8.9.11.3”. We should just use the latter text, which is clearer than the level-1 bullet.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 5: For SRB release, the current level-1 conditon “if an end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release/failure is detected “ is already incldued in the top two level-1 conditions about PC5-RRC conneciton release and SL RLF becaue end-to-end PC5-RRC connection is also deemed as a PC5-RRC conneciton. Therefore, the PDCP entity has already been released and cannot be released again. Also, there is no need of “reconfigure SRAP entity” because when SRB is released, nothing needs to be kept for SRAP configuraiton and the default SL-U2U-RLC remains the same w/o change.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eb6a7dbe721083d77a82a18bb85c801237caab3e6c76f82262be57088e4c8fe0","cd8430d5a27ed1863c7c63f8b0e4aebaf14bdd8b6db48b7b94e7b2f91f438500","4f6d270c362421b4c69e285d6ed92c2a5001cb305a804f66c74a29f2b8a9c79a","408435610676119689364e4167a307551e27c73ee315fc33fb482d83a26afcd1","b3f1a289c9f262bd0953c1123f203eefe21c2b4361f8950aeb81aac1eccefefa","7ebe52d8aa97ba827ba17737667977b1a8411de351b69003c6857f048f18eb21","976740c426a78217e3498aa4a9ae98eb3b3d36a0234676f51fcb0e6ec1bf10f6","a1a120034665544ecfe1a61aa4f71fc69b55ac0c0078866a5b3ed60a7c90310a","c1e155a7eeedd8577029c3ade592f0952e78c34c44137f8224ddf24225832c91","da53ca639fd57ca742ef8265faa15e8308b85cd1745bf2d7b9720b80e7dfae36","c684d7d9cecdf2ca54ceeb53b30bebd3f9800a09328bb032d222da71945fd738","1ace13a2c94f08f3805f27dc86b0eae29f91c0373e9584c3596cb82c055fd1d8","d02d01f0f020a5fbcc5a911f97b986611038058d722a11eedd8a3282313853b7","2d6727fe7f0233748d6a0d397da61b75b602b913e723ca15b750303d64749963","fdafb16f9f8ebe683070903b7fc52dc4c50ba5438163d1174ec09b601dff1ce0","56cd5e105f4d6bf1b657df0321a81c16df7900d87f484848150e93e750dbff37","f5d94fa936fac94977c985e7ed9a7ab976bdd4c6291b449b57af25528797af8c","98ba6108c546a975a724a54ec4d16105608857fa1b227c80c3e94fce32b66a92","59e6ed5e8ca4de614c8be2ccdb2eb791c7b7e40e3d8af49b4acb78b91ec0e3c8","6e05abd592d730aa473062f4b33835f3fd942a48a789c7f1d760afe69c3ec68a","1d9659d2208d576b67f4bef41dca86c232ec766597e15b25f47597021f6d8f4b","498827ee513860a41d5afc34085a65d5128c0c52c659641870603f4aa3b5d5df","0c95cd095ecb191bc1ebf99c2dd39c67f87c72d12364d962ce589e37ce897e88","8c23747d1293842129b9327ee78633da33b2692595afc0dcb4f0b27417dc031a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 6: end-to-end SL SRB1/2/3/ share the same SRAP mapping with end-toend SL SRB0, so SL-SRB0 should be also covered by this SRB addition procedure in regards of SRAP mapping.","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 7: The introduction of UE informaiton transfer procedure is said to “transfer the UE information in sidelink”. But the associated figure in this section only shows “Remote UE” and “Relay UE”. It is clear that this is only used in L2 U2U relay case in R18, so the procedure should be clearly described as only happen between remote UE and relay UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 8: Editorial issue. “as define in 9.3” is not a proper way to introduce the IE defined fpr SL preconfiguration. To align with othe usage in 38.331, this should be changed to “include in SidelinkPreconfigNR”. Note that this is an editorial issue since Rel-17. However, as editotial CR does not meet the high requiremets for R17 CR, we prefer to fix this since Rel-18.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In subclause 5.8.9.1.2, added the IE name for the list containing SL-RLC-BearerConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.1a.1.2, added the missing condition “if the end-to-end DRB release is triggerd due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR” and change “sl-configDedicatedNR” to RRCReconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.1a.2.1,deleted the bullet about L2 U2U relay to avoid redundancy.","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.1a.2.2, Removed the usage of “sl-ConfigDedicatedNR”","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.1a.3, Deleted the text to “release PDCP entity” and “reconfigure SRAP entity” for end-to-end SRB release","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.1a.4, added “SRB0” for SRAP mapping configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.7.2, added the IE name for the list containing SL-RLC-Config. ","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.11.1, added “between Remote UE and Relay UE”.","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.15.3. changed “as defined in 9.3” to “included in SidelinkPreconfigNR”.","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The supporting of SL U2U relay communication.","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b7bb5d97c79c1040309fde20168d71afaeedd6685c8974ba061be395cf364d83","52938e2f0708eb5f700f14b9f0fab13719c827da20f0f53cd2e00ddf24e9c7b8","160d2445b56df8abecc6f2e945c343a456efefdd345281327b9be22da31f0705","f1c1ef84007683d63f38da70d862612ef0ba3ec6935e2f38a8df577f13675368","8098d6d9985d76bd64ae2462989e2c02b5da0f0c820031b06adc57a26c6c0c11","2f66ab05fface20501605ad0ba1d8d2cea32c98960e1fb10230777b8b1b79fdf","1e53ecd6e2e5632841c6c15ab9b432d1867ba53f18ac1e608c8fcaea206faa45","f68078a9a57ed87f54556996a8f432ce3aceadb373bd660875a4e017f12cdd72","3df163e6b309748a929d1d762e4bb975f8a9c257788cde6151619f1d169a50c4","27b65f6e2ad7016b5a58af278e28f23443078e1d441abc1d9e9153e79cd87e3c","344193fe6165d548758df47509c29bbde01a5597dbf4cbf52db5f942c66549f3","e6eff01630a934fd1194d17386f1d8a79f47d1eb43287cb0223da827db265756","4847afbc33096f5ac3bb6f9cc846978938df72d095a9ae38646dca6624d72d96","3e5720a4e58466f708668857e71d58a7a6be01add9c940259d4718480c50d5da","812a905f561d4f2009073e83c595f20584998874214a710db8193f4aaeccb544","5a0fb6bbdce0b0fe9dc0bb7aff54c854804053647b1876bfbb01270b966f96c9","7c4a04832a488bce05ae4e7d9006068896ae5ec9c7465da0faac6fcdd6377334","4a6a50ac9057a1bff7f5c02b029792c9dc9ece310296ad24ddaa66134992da4a","e0ec1f24ccb606aa201b952d8fd21ef7e35605a39161159b66e2c2d1955349e9","e1e60b45b19a82be08668149b8f991037501ed6fe976fdb2900e1fc785062037","b906676eecc6b5e4b944658221d812b11ca010372ca058e11e243ca74b58cb34","839f014b01235dd64e3fa8ffb69061cf7dc7fd1c65d97cdc5b1b48f0d3b2483c","25e124e125961fbe9021ab9d1eb02f11bf1ad7538162a946a8a0b519c8a833c6","ed02c951ee129ae42e2aa44ba53dcb25380e7deb21c181eb20ae9a3c55597cc1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[72,95],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p72"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If Sidelink UE implements this change and gNB does not, there is no inter-operability issue between UE and gNB.","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If Sidelink TX UE implements this change, but the Sidelink RX UE is not implemented this change, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Wrong UE implementation of Layer 2 UE-to-UE relay will occur.","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.2, 5.8.9.1a.1.2, 5.8.9.1a.2.1, 5.8.9.1a.2.2, 5.8.9.1a.3, 5.8.9.1a.4, 5.8.9.7.2, 5.8.9.11.1, 5.8.15.3","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t"