{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BEGIN OF CHNAGES","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.2Actions related to transmission of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink DRB that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1, due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, by upper layers, or due to end-to-end sidelink DRB release:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the entry included in the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink DRB that is to be established or modified, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sidelink DRB is a per-hop sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is performing NR sidelink communication with a peer UE without via a L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a sidelink DRB is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the sidelink DRB and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SLRB-Config to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SLRB-Config included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig and sl-RLC-BearerConfig corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the sidelink DRB is an end-to-end sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is acting as a L2 U2U Remote UE, and configure peer L2 U2U Remote UE with end-to-end SDAP and PDCP):","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SLRB-Config (excluding sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 and sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5) included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each additional sidelink RLC bearer that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.5.1, due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the entry included in the sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList corresponding to the additional sidelink RLC bearer;","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each additional sidelink RLC bearer that is to be established or modified, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.6.1, due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an additional sidelink RLC bearer is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the additional sidelink RLC bearer and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-BearerConfig to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-BearerConfig included in the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig and sl-RLC-BearerConfig corresponding to the additional sidelink RLC bearer;","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each carrier that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.1.1:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the corresponding sidelink carrier in the sl-CarrierToReleaseList;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each carrier that is to be added, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the corresponding sidelink carrier in the sl-CarrierToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-MeasConfig as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e38487f2fe32200e5aad0483dd827e5020560346d76293e2c43259ce6de92419","1dcb8248cefca644d31aa543931d2165f973e3605c6b794e3ef5092ce38f4b78","dc08507d6c0c71d1926ffae119fdd373d1b55b87395cd72e0fbe1187f69289c1","96525f689b54b5f53165701c89c2fe78a1db61da45b5f02ac24700e82f5250a4","da6323187d4e6955a870087affef0cddcf612e727dcae473bab2bd8e9e166f41","289fae33e5e5e1b89564b72da5393888fa04f55d1f7e42f5371b6e0618d8920d","74054300f1bb07eafffad75122c0dfa3e29585d70f5a735f6e176d74b8997164","dc21c374b37657d5717d409bc71ac0f7cd3912a6403a270e396fe3344c57192a","c6fc5d2e24d81464684ee6cf0b2e7fa6c09e832c5793ee25f4c224f2e923bb09","14ddd456735d7a0e4d811bcc7caa0ca14b3ca4e17b85064abde83708020f991c","392fbf74cffa74f3f85957ac18400549c9b73a92d2aa5168d351ec354b08b650","aee056b3ab025b9e2dd7913f0ede3858b4631a42624c0e3a85643bfa1b417faa","c4b100aea3443d4aebb33f6652e47fabe07be1cba392ac866ae7aee4d6a58747","c2f9bf6c5653c004b04fd127dfa4faa90e2dc7e96cfc9fa404a4c0b81ceb7570","bc4a4ab657886dec275e3fa50c9961946ec48a844569b45270dcbfc85fcbdcf7","9f4fedee6ef0f2b7bcae2268eb35f9c7c7756d295b47b5b45780a524553a04a4","