{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasConfig according to stored NR sidelink measurement configuration information for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasConfig according to stored NR sidelink measurement configuration received from SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-MeasConfig according to the sl-MeasPreConfig in SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T400 for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-CSI-RS-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-ResetConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Whether/how to set the parameters included in sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report, sl-CSI-RS-Config, sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report and sl-ResetConfig is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList/sl-FreqInfoToAddModListExt in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and if sl-ScheduledConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 according to stored NR sidelink DRX configuration information for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, or in RRC_CONNECTED and sl-UE-SelectedConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration, it is up to UE implementation to set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5.","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each PC5 Relay RLC channel that is to be released due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelID corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each PC5 Relay RLC channel that is to be established or modified due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PC5 Relay RLC channel is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the PC5 Relay RLC channel and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the received SL-RLC-ChannelConfig corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel, including setting sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 to the same value of sl-RLC-ChannelID received in SL-RLC-ChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a806aaf266d19056e9ab0f069dc53b8b07a36cd7159ff5f31f22378318c1042d","b965739e214d8d61d9d246f775a455ad02dd9a83fe01451a58cdeaae22ee8b1e","ae95569e47c52f7b7867ee0cc52d7ee623dd44dcea9ad87beec869f12e947e7a","1ec4a37a3e22a7d4ea7289cbc0c4b860aae14388f9a96d17cdab38f91e39b058","5c38d65e1eb5c6382149474b712b40fcd04d36f558af5058da93b8e9751fcd6b","9b88952565541431c959d68879adb987aaceac1021b57fc0a5710472f4720c1e","0f953039bc95711b304c1481cd7263cb4b727290a3835828c3179705a249b777","daceaf2e842bdeda771867c00b3e01abe7f1fca9e3e2b37df534683383669437","5537147f7c580575d9f17e98fae150d7b57c691ae9029a347e1a5c3dd1f6c0fc","729e8b443a8af48c2fff97a202f40bd427dbf2785dc6db07b04ccd2955190284","bd4bb0862c4c25fc6a413252a048ae04b998fb78ca8c0e74eb9681544a737db7","913c1804f71691d516063a75dbb1263df0aefaddc1a7a6a928f139aaabe42142","79b94a3ef1a5e37a93543da21fafe4caad04b29258f58b71bdf8d5e5c478dabf","127b3c144227a37eb6fc09e7c2a7b14f8c66999a282bf87b9ae78fcf9af11a01","d8d07708f2b6d7fcce08c6224aeeebf8eef33c21cb7543d4a36404f8bbe81e9f","8edc998a90fd78032ccafc82b023db82d20b6d467de1a8c1705ec5ebf965cc2a","c6e54f47ba248c074bdff0c3aadfcf4630bcbf42b9f019a9d423a1c5d23b3ca5","29f23b9533027ca401e635a492feb4e9ac7499e62c734ac2a7ae6ea1be28c76c","bef31d7d0dbb805a444fea178880115dba9ae96ffa8bdf0ee6432c8ab1ee3f22","468cf94cfcbaab6a0db19fd397038cb671d2ebe9217d9a0f44734eb72b741ca9","0eeb858aaae2c131c6a3f07c94b0bd89f14aab0f1ac0dd6de9c174820e0a2f22","170e66384d7c5b29415d4523d5b593ad40660071f96a90a00f4e68868b936ac1","d5094c0cee6e85dc23953032f5c57162a5d2181c01b273ed14d6e8ee0badc0b4","e740b1e6d2c97e8b6e2a2bb89e75f5ceb1c2589c9abc67e1b0b3c1a94842a253"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is operating as a L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the destination UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE that requested the SFN-DFN offset in a previous RemoteUEInformationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the SFN-DFN offset has changed since a previous transmission of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message, or no previous transmission of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message has occurred since the reception of the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset according to the relation between the SFN timeline of the PCell and the DFN timeline;","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE, and if the procedure is initiated to configure local ID pair to a connected L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the local ID pair is to be assigned or modified for an end-to-end PC5 connection, and if the per-hop PC5-RRC connection with this L2 U2U Remote UE and the per-hop PC5-RRC connection with its peer L2 U2U Remote UE are successfully established:","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include an entry in sl-LocalID-PairToAddModList, and set the fields as below:","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-RemoteUE-L2Identity to the source L2 ID of this L2 U2U Remote UE, and set sl-RemoteUE-LocalIdentity to include the new local UE ID assigned to this L2 U2U Remote UE, in the SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PeerRemoteUE-L2Identity to the destination L2 ID of the peer L2 U2U Remote UE, and set sl-PeerRemoteUE-LocalIdentity to include the new local UE ID assigned to the peer L2 U2U Remote UE, in the SL-SRAP-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and if the procedure is initiated to add/modify the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel of an end-to-end sidelink DRB to the connected L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Rx UE), based on configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and if the procedure is initiated to add/modify the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel to the connected L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Rx UE) based on configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PC5 Relay RLC channel is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new RLC channel ID and set sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new RLC channel ID;","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the PC5 Relay RLC channel and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the SL-RLC-BearerConfig derived based on the per-hop QoS of the end-to-end SLRB according to sl-RLC-BearerConfigList in SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the SL-RLC-BearerConfig derived based on the per-hop QoS of the end-to-end SLRB according to sl-RLC-BearerPreConfigList in SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and the procedure is initiated to release the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel of an end-to-end sidelink DRB to the connected L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Rx UE) according to clause 5.8.9.7.1; or","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2U Relay UE (i.e. Tx UE) and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, and the procedure is initiated to release the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel of an end-to-end sidelink DRB to the connected L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. Rx UE) according to clause 5.8.9.7.1:","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelID corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5.","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHNAGE","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1458f44968a00b1c323f00727b6d5ae697d01b68adaada558f02998966c50679","520d58ea356147a51e1b83dd5a183f08868c5e978cdf3208f2a6f03960fb1040","9d0f91fee12c7a7dc901e81b4170784be6bf4c6ccaa4319d2c66909cd3e6f8f9","5242e2aaa27a1cf1aea79728154b91b2774de40d709df01ed99912d0fe6e9abf","e02fe18e67f1fa32cb64350395c89bda1b1038ec9d1f3f96006013e42b043f8d","6eea92643526d33df2d3509a76db688b71ef2329a56983af425d076ce1cec75a","4cc50cb6a4979088e2e130b0f110cf45a09106412b1942d40a5ddc9626f9072d","3ccc6a310ea1330393748d2b788c777412d16f6aa2daf5c953c1db62c2167db5","ec1546e5c61d38a3fdab6acaf2f3dc26a7beb26cca2ea815bdda08a938634adc","9268c589fb04044781bb166421300ffa4477ae276b46975710b43c4ee385fb8c","f5072b467e8944f3627f9a6ac12e29fef713ed0c0d7e4dedb635ccc9bfc61734","e1298a07dfff13905c77f12e80fc467b83e11d527a2540106db4c28bce3f8892","1d7fb795af450ce8ce7ebeb2f66a922ed68d04e5bf64c05b5c4242e31f46da21","112cd3a610527ba909b74b1029f71200283d67ed949ec93cc8535a0d67c0d7b0","c87ffe33e95bf5bbf59cd903459c0040001c8e090c98cf0e84f3d88c8bd3b13a","925cd20b4df0e19ccff6db096f011ff0809be72d08d054cb4d138804934c6e5e","bdd1cd7698c0b05e9a9a4309753132111b5a267efc2f6e626e4e86fee7e0934e","c1628ab4fe3e1a43458111e411011274f85f86c7537a1443b51dc5e92a0fff34","ffad99cb2d183d6c65063d8540342990533e258196f3b87e9310266c202c69a4","733c808081de5e4cdbfe76e9654e044a491747db230733ad6e133f0c456def46","0d3d55427a0a640bfabcef0e5e43f452e010ac0fa88c1f8c3b274a9996cca28f","d7092ac01ec0b087915a6567d2cf23a96639ceb0e79f0843c5905f2f997bf28f","770cb015b67339bc0b169c6894a024a37a87a55b2211170dc1f0109e9692c00f","5c3f258dbaed758afa39a1da38897aa896965ead5f4af8eff1b3c9d765254b91"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.1.2Sidelink DRB release operations","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each sidelink DRB, whose sidelink DRB release conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered after the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity for NR sidelink communication associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SDAP entity for NR sidelink communication associated with this sidelink DRB is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the release of the sidelink DRB to the SDAP entity associated with this sidelink DRB (TS 37.324 [24], clause 5.3.3);","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release SDAP entities for NR sidelink communication, if any, that have no associated sidelink DRB as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-BearerConfigIndex included in the received sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList/sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseListSizeExt that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel for NR sidelink communication, associated with the sl-RLC-BearerConfigIndex.","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink DRB is a per-hop sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is performing NR sidelink communication with a peer UE without via a L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB release was triggered due to the configuration received within the SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity and the corresponding logical channel for NR sidelink communication associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink UE information procedure in clause 5.8.3 for unicast if needed.","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink radio link failure is detected for a specific destination:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink DRB for the specific destination.","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as a L2 U2U Remote UE, and if the end-to-end sidelink DRB release is triggered by end-to-end PC5 connection failure due to per-hop PC5 link failure, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3a:","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity(ies) of the end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) for the specific end-to-end PC5 connection;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink DRB is an end-to-end sidelink DRB in L2 U2U relay operation:","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel release according to 5.8.9.7.1, if there is no other end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) associated with this RLC channel and the PC5 Relay RLC channel is not released yet;","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bc6b35c0fc01df48b0b47a104609438496c586d399edbc4585c96bc04c693146","c210cecf61194293c916378cf9e7e9288120d0c38c6a3a4c2693071c42eda3f1","20ebe784a757c2d4a4ca940504ecb3c0b5cfd71548824a2593706716e86837f9","47fa0fbc9b1b03da1fe24a8f2243146d6c75693bba00a76665e22fedbd307356","3d138e1589bb433edfacbb711a9d659137c40ee34e6ecc9fd5352e93d8da6213","acdd76c726fe38fadf6baa502f3144c200e64b411ce4e636c78772241d9cbac8","eb1dab85c63ea6846eee14f61da42b2c2d8379b733cc76cbf2c8ef34d42efcaf","9e36ec899a6ed291948e0bba10b8fdfda83fb04092e42f6a8c7420b5bce85aac","1872f6724a919fb63e754e20ae6e35e37585a4d17f25f1b7c2c28a4f2d6d4c1a","d866f28814d2ef077c46f6718330911acc96e3d9fb38aa8d647ccfdd56a5807d","3753eb5aee205607df2271183d314bc6d67492656231e04e298f053d211f6bfc","1a13100acc690d2a437aa06378717038a6583e483654a1bce4fbe4901a45b199","4b210741f4addb78113d331e52266a8921970786515c8583ebfed6958309be1c","79e8e9330964fa3cf3e1148a0e7b07cb4a571992709d5f8ab68786e39ade32f9","ed185db5eb51e1fba2162c5851fd0a026679e7748faf1dccdab0db6d9890c0cc","889d83bf80e5e2f3e51a7167251ee54dfb5063d0e7fec93da668abf0143c94b3","257d301d8aeda89b0becb98f5dd62b5d1e723f320ebec9ffccf76dcdb8397418","8e54c6b7eb0c9882be2522e67119361bc2c6f8b3c000d3e6638bafb0e93104d4","5f9595fb3d64491059e8383317179bfb6758f399ebab53c69665c15383c8a89a","7181212e6a124b47a7ad42c78a45b3e0ede2008ad5a8ea780d13e7a64d7d67ad","f56ce7341fed487a44256a126313aadcc0006e1984dd28ac5ca08eff34081c1a","85a5dc32c4f7411e8734c1a7904f2e41d3cea10a880d91d10b3eb693853ae848","c7bdf92feb4fe21a8c1c618c921ff4d4f54960faa36488a8c3af6b5b1e4c676f","638ab40c1b1eec7129a9dc05c5b00f279d7748b7751cdfaea6cc2c8f3a816274"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as a source L2 U2U Remote or L2 U2U Relay UE and is in RRC_CONNECTED and if the end-to-end DRB release is triggerd due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the SRAP entity for the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U received in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is acting as a source L2 U2U Remote UE or L2 U2U Relay and is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or is out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the mapping between the end-to-end sidelink DRB and the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel, and reconfigure the SRAP entity.","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.2.1Sidelink DRB addition/modification conditions","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, a sidelink DRB addition is initiated only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any sidelink QoS flow is (re)configured by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR and is to be mapped to one sidelink DRB, which is not established; or","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any sidelink QoS flow is (re)configured by RRCReconfigurationSidelink and is to be mapped to a sidelink DRB, which is not established;","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The above conditions also apply to L2 U2U Remote UE for end-to-end sidelink DRB addition. For L2 U2U Relay UE, an end-to-end sidelink DRB addition is initiated only in the case it receives new end-to-end sidelink DRB information from the source L2 U2U Remote UE as in clause 5.8.9.11.3.","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication, a sidelink DRB modification is initiated only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any of the sidelink DRB related parameters is changed by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or RRCReconfigurationSidelink for one sidelink DRB, which is established;","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The above conditions also apply to L2 U2U Remote UE for end-to-end sidelink DRB modification. For L2 U2U Relay UE, an end-to-end sidelink DRB modification is initiated only in the case it receives updated end-to-end sidelink DRB information from the source L2 U2U Remote UE as in clause 5.8.9.11.3.","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.2.2Sidelink DRB addition/modification operations","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the sidelink DRB, whose sidelink DRB addition conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB addition was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB addition was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an SDAP entity for NR sidelink communication associated with the destination and the cast type of the sidelink DRB does not exist:","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish an SDAP entity for NR sidelink communication as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["69345f27e5131205d6a2eacc2b8a15c232e5b2ea0436e68a02d7f1e14d1ab067","27629cb77774b29b9fa0355f03dc298069591e2f2b96a3de9bd90b8efd2de4e0","747e5d29ea69b11d97548da0ad658468d63714ce3c25e7035fcee411855609b4","8236556eae8c4d4b61a64c9bc63190c83106d31afeb59366edeacf4caed7931b","586aa50c0316b6ea6337dcd8491dab77d9d24bd9497acef2d618c1dfa3d76ac2","2f80cf992fe2e64afa92eacef11f6b16be5d649a56c77906da72acdb7cbdc0fc","6aaf0892e7ba98c5d9e7b625109f58a4bc48556ec3fa3afb17038af21327443d","ba1979ddb10d17c517e1636995629b94f10a22c14e5be642c16588486f9f7625","396a28297cd6e504fb857e97c60dc2d4645bae84a727d1ed1655c406780ac39b","598c5b1d212755109b681343af0e29fbc9d4b34b057bdf6cd4d721d15488d1a0","982dd64eda5755f3663ddb98d88a4d50f6584db9faa58349c155ff2ceb5478bb","f87d10a087a46cc9662b73ad701dada8aa8d8dbf1b4a9b1c86b68b06d34a4417","8d7c0cdd4aacfeade9f3e3bb7dde58ba4ceb03a5217ba1685a6fb0dae2724200","9f311044babffbd8984ad882e8cc49c6da7dcabf43604977c533934988f14d1b","e4cf228ce18c25eef5d7978ae7715977eea9991b3b4e99be7eefd0fdd93ba2f8","4ad06e93125520a8ff5f9d914d806c8767dd908da3a46e6cb99d9394d3d4dc7b","c7fc405f2ab3eb9733d7327525050adedda2e6bb8bbfb172c7808527adad2907","884f1a5124fd722f7057c9960c28a1caea3208de126caeb092ddd5a8803d2d1e","524f5be75162b130a586e6257f9f1b2011d73529f462ad5f1bd35a5587c5e1dc","f356b92d2bc0c74d2066498065a812de93c2a1eb7bffb521d4007b712189d3d5","4c2ef0d89635cd7df90634c78a2835f6228f6e651f270e9cc9f8a65818fe7a8e","7621e5ae09ce220079d91bdfbc9ebe585df739a1d481ae8122b7939f9c27fafd","96e02a8b7fb4315b8b84fe50bc1ca0cf0689532dce3d72a3fb928caac25ad2c5","38132d673e6d8835ccdc7cd7abc460d41cd61ea8b2d7eb46687a314418f99994"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[240,263],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p240"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>(re)configure the SDAP entity in accordance with the sl-SDAP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-SDAP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish a PDCP entity for NR sidelink communication and configure it in accordance with the sl-PDCP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-PDCP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, associated with the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for a per-hop sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is performing NR sidelink communication with a peer UE without via a L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a RLC entity for NR sidelink communication and configure it in accordance with the sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-RLC-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, associated with sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this procedure was due to the reception of a RRCReconfigurationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink associated with the sidelink DRB, and perform the sidelink UE information procedure in clause 5.8.3 for unicast if needed;","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if this procedure was due to the reception of a RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e. for groupcast/broadcast):","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the MAC entity with a logical channel associated with the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR and assign a new LCID to this logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for an end-to-end sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE or L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>(re)configure the SRAP entity for the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U included in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.2 if needed, according to the derived PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration as described in clause 5.8.9.11;","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the PC5 Relay RLC channel applying the derived PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration as the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel;","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel for this end-to-end sidelink DRB to SRAP;","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When a sidelink DRB addition is due to the configuration by RRCReconfigurationSidelink, it is up to UE implementation to select the sidelink DRB configuration as necessary transmitting parameters for the sidelink DRB, from the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED), SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), SidelinkPreconfigNR (if out of coverage) with the same RLC mode as the one configured in RRCReconfigurationSidelink.","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the sidelink DRB, whose sidelink DRB modification conditions are met as in clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, the UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink communication shall:","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for groupcast and broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, if the sidelink DRB modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for unicast, after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the sidelink DRB modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the SDAP entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SDAP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-SDAP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the PDCP entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-PDCP-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-PDCP-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0