{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-RLC-ConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-RLC-Config received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel of the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 received in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig received in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for an end-to-end sidelink DRB (i.e. the UE is acting as L2 U2U Remote UE or L2 U2U Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the SRAP entity for the sidelink DRB, in accordance with the sl-SRAP-ConfigU2U received in RRCReconfiguration, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or out of coverage:","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the derived PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration of this end-to-end sidelink DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11 is changed:","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there is no other end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) associated with this RLC channel:","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel release as specified in 5.8.9.7.1 or 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification as specified in 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the PC5 Relay RLC channel applying the PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration as the egress PC5 relay RLC channel;","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reconfigure the SRAP entity with the the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel for the end-to-end sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.3Sidelink SRB release","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a PC5-RRC connection release for a specific destination is requested by upper layers or AS layer; or","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sidelink radio link failure is detected for a specific destination:","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink SRB for PC5-RRC message of the specific destination;","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination.","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if PC5-S transmission for a specific destination is terminated in upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink SRB(s) for PC5-S message of the specific destination if any;","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if discovery transmission for a specific destination is terminated in upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43