{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of the sidelink SRB4 for discovery message of the specific destination;","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if an end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release/failure is detected:","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":";","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the association between the end-to-end sidelink SRB and the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel,.","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1a.4Sidelink SRB addition","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of PC5-S message for a specific destination is requested by upper layers for sidelink SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of a sidelink SRB for PC5-S message if needed, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if in coverage on the frequency used for the NR sidelink communication as defined in TS 38.304 [20]:","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the allowed carrier(s) for the RLC bearer of the SRB before the reception of initial RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message which confirms SL CA carrier(s) addition as indicated in sl-FreqInfoList, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the allowed carrier for the RLC bearer of the SRB before the reception of initial RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message which confirms SL CA carrier(s) addition as indicated in sl-PreconfigFreqInfoList, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of discovery message for a specific destination is requested by upper layers for sidelink SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of a sidelink SRB4 for discovery message, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a PC5-RRC connection establishment for a specific destination is indicated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish PDCP entity, RLC entity and the logical channel of a sidelink SRB for PC5-RRC message of the specific destination if needed, as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is established for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if in coverage on the frequency used for the NR sidelink communication as defined in TS 38.304 [20]:","paragraph_zero_based":331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the allowed carrier(s) for the RLC bearer of the SRB before the reception of initial RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message which confirms SL CA carrier(s) addition, as indicated in sl-FreqInfoList, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the allowed carrier for the RLC bearer of the SRB before the reception of initial RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message which confirms SL CA carrier(s) addition as specified in clause 5.8.9.1.9, as indicated in sl-PreconfigFreqInfoList, to lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for end-to-end SRB0/1/2/3:","paragraph_zero_based":335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1ec4239bd9e60b4f96389e65bd5c3055600fc1637ba73cac6f5066ebf7a0b257","82d0f495694dad62ffdd06f61204b0cc8548ed578d534a931cb525f1fe49af5b","ecf9ac72dcceb6959f2e6aa1486d8cb276a48943bbc4f967299d74115e81c539","4ec8781ce3984cda1ef06ff628d5126e40aa444d0e85b25e970a58ec4508f441","94fdc29ad51784ae6f0dc4a5c294984f7cddbb27e8bbc19b9fa2436f8a82246f","4c18fa6244bdf283c6455185dd51b2d1bd501ea89b7e9911b24602a194d91427","e2ce94ccca60a7aaf869f8a364b54320a53909aa72622c0112de84e8fd326ac6","4728c4e2c447507068f2a2d9fbd060fd505d978d569ce5133b976a75638d1573","fceeeedb100efb6aae2ddceca8fb54a10defbb92ff416667568ffd6f43a58d3f","5619da58f2cdba1a888ff27e2cad23235121e8a5bd00d89fafff32663e41f0e3","afcbec2f03ac1f5f3b347989f3149f1ab9fabf51af27c4e41681f12ccbc0e1c6","47aeff0d06eddf1e9b6b09c2d9e26c96e4b8cd036ddbd9cdb2e7bbe96222d8fc","ad97b996ec4a721015e8100d8186e715bb2ee6da10b431fffb08a633acfe2136","45576b59cb7865ad4e42f8d5e89226c5c6bc79f0c547e629f94329daa90c9f4e","e3b727b16ef2d2589b1a91505584354cc5ba652b520baeb72f441fcd7fa46085","c88f75a3e1ae829e29ac4920720c81947c74542c5655e61a50adc7c0d68da161","52c0c65e029e82a60a911a9c325c363cf6671f451f617440915199038ffc8c46","c1d55a27219b82baf1da8cc0efc518db13356977862af05096ab3837ee87bcca","4b568c6bc1c36b9b419f3bbdff8b69d94952e41033928e85a4973445df92c9fd","ffdeae9c1a8167234c8120a4eb6589a55ab342369d52e8819ca87817c6a3e4f5","5dfaaf1f9baa79db18ca8dd2cd0e2efddba8a8e5f3c96289b7a97e98b0403323","e33cc015fbd7e2dcf7ee81c549923090a2b7d8b710c297c94a2552c6e1e71f5b","0cf426bdf8247b9132324d8a24660170d5b08fe3f1a3c3e47f1e9b3d0fc0c2e0","7206682fad6d8fbbbf4fdf049ef5811975dfe93a23b4767c767289fee2b388d2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[312,335],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p312"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting L2 U2U Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4 as the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel;","paragraph_zero_based":337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>associate this end-to-end sidelink SRB with the SL-U2U-RLC and configure the mapping between the end-to-end sidelink SRB and the egress PC5 Relay RLC channel to SRAP.","paragraph_zero_based":338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHNAGE","paragraph_zero_based":340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7.2PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between the L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-RLC0 as specified in clause 9.1.1.4:","paragraph_zero_based":344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in clause 9.2.4 if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE state;","paragraph_zero_based":345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between two UEs for L2 U2U relay operation UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2U Relay operation in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTVE or out of coverage, the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification can be triggered due to the addition/modification/release of the end-to-end SL DRB(s). The source L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U Relay UE derive the configuration for the corresponding PC5 Relay RLC channel based on SIB12/Preconfiguration, as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The source L2 U2U Remote UE derives the configuration for the PC5 Relay RLC channel(s) between the source L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U relay UE (i.e. the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel(s)), by aggregating the QoS profile(s) of the QoS flow(s) with split QoS information of the first hop into a per-SLRB level QoS profile for each end-to-end Sidelink DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11.4, and considering the SL-RLC-Config in either sl-RLC-BearerConfigList or sl-RLC-BearerPreConfigList (linked to the SL-RadioBearerConfig which matches the per-SLRB level QoS profile) as the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The L2 U2U Relay UE derives the configuration for the PC5 Relay RLC channel(s) between L2 U2U relay UE and the target L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel(s)), by aggregating the QoS profile(s) of the QoS flow(s) with split QoS information of the second hop into a per-SLRB level QoS profile for each end-to-end Sidelink DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11.3, and considering the SL-RLC-Config in either sl-RLC-BearerConfigList or sl-RLC-BearerPreConfigList (linked to the SL-RadioBearerConfig which matches the per-SLRB level QoS profile) as the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered for an end-to-end sidelink DRB based on the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current configuration contains a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5; or","paragraph_zero_based":356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR has updated, based on which the PC5 Relay RLC channel is derived:","paragraph_zero_based":357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5829528b1d991d2c53ddcbffce835650ae938396db388587161f722d42fd6691","94d350b70cea7d8f259b144084cfab6ca12b00664286db2bfd5aaa50ce151ca1","4b05e76c28b4390eae74b8bc1e4a01a91b0fade9c7ed0cb54b04a97e749a5094","0633c6217ab0f3cc22325bddde13a55084bc3c33d61c3f9a2287965109ad9155","b92aeb5843557c6959acbd6301057a050cd7d07541363f34944f6424dfa19188","371d1b4c7923f153b8ced42eaff925ed9e684c6bf2b8112382b21292ed1e1f22","2cff04c917b22bb3489fd6dbef46dc6c67afd537c522d2c3ca73238d1892c213","1793f2d12ac6cbdda76da9b34c1c7bf86593a0626e7b6a4ab47db7d251f1fe0b","56f2ce0772d3b694b652925d30a3eaf8aead95830d56d56f93c10a2e450a7d33","935d69b91d7f000a14145f039f969baf2ce9040be96d831c60445c7661582067","2f4c4ff6afb961d633ab105563545dd753f0e9830c29cf7ef3bc4e37b712d423","262bff4220360706c6048de17dfa3a34148a8753bd91e9d0fa5a1865a5e620f7","bd742d9ec8bf22b1e0913cee366d402dbeca3db6d1dc7301a93585793348472d","dcc817b779640978631aa723c4f4a6e35c8e714a1009a5ee25ab026eed0452e6","1182e7c129dd11cca2952b2d3c597d72c6bc99b65439841117a62dbc967fb15b","75e139510ab63cbff145162e78218269ea8dd1d17e9fdcf6273f3a3392f51896","a806fe0eea73a7bedef47319d92e6c0de8341a7b1196cf04ee3c3bb5390daa49","4fcd6a4e3783420a6b6d163e47c2c32231eca17fa971ea34ebe61d7d4340d32e","206ff62daa2bed5c90a19e101b7c353a43319bb9b660f4d220ef790995256154","764e862ec96e8d2a03a1214820950998f7835273b163f4aa436a8349b358ed04","64ddc2abf3e7e2f5e11a447b99c7055b0eaf3e3f107bf8af5ae701aafba23dca","c66d876d9380bbc6553e511a9240e844fec092722f4004fb032ef0c1958fe2a2","575640f6c90a904935d6b3e4166eded626b6fbdd65b33ed3f7afd0226258c505","779b0d96eb61a64e6a77dc697239c1e0df8c5f854496aea83bb67c6448714109"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[336,359],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p336"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 was not configured before):","paragraph_zero_based":360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config (in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or SIB12, or SidelinkPreconfigNR) or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5.","paragraph_zero_based":362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHNAGE","paragraph_zero_based":363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.11UE information transfer on sidelink","paragraph_zero_based":364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.11.1General","paragraph_zero_based":365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.11.1-1: Sidelink UE information procedure","paragraph_zero_based":367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to transfer the UE information between a Remote UE and a Relay UE in sidelink. The L2 U2U Remote UE informs its end-to-end QoS information to its connected L2 U2U Relay UE in the UEInformationRequestSidelink message, and the L2 U2U Relay UE delivers the split QoS information of the first-hop to the Remote UE in the UEInformationResponseSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHNAGE","paragraph_zero_based":370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.15.3Selection and reselection of NR sidelink U2N Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2N Remote UE operation that is configured by upper layers to search for a NR sidelink U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has no serving cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RSRP measurement of the cell on which the UE camps (for L2 and L3 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE)/ the PCell (for L3 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED) is below threshHighRemote within sl-RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE does not have a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and SL-RSRP of the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE is available and is below sl-RSRP-Thresh; or","paragraph_zero_based":376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and SL-RSRP of the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE is not available, and SD-RSRP of the currently selected U2N Relay UE is below sl-RSRP-Thresh; or","paragraph_zero_based":377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:U2N Remote UE uses SL-RSRP measurements for relay reselection trigger evaluation when there is data transmission from U2N Relay UE to U2N Remote UE, and it is left to UE implementation whether to use SL-RSRP or SD-RSRP for relay reselection trigger evaluation in case of no data transmission from U2N Relay UE to U2N Remote UE. If SD-RSRP is used, the discovery procedure will be performed between the U2N Remote UE and the selected U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and upper layers indicate not to use the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and upper layers request the release of the PC5-RRC connection; or","paragraph_zero_based":380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and sidelink radio link failure is detected on the PC5-RRC connection with the current U2N Relay UE as specified in clause 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform NR sidelink discovery procedure as specified in clause 5.8.13 in order to search for candidate NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs;","paragraph_zero_based":382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>when evaluating the one or more detected NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs, apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 across measurements that concern the same U2N Relay UE ID and using the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED) or the preconfigured sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP included in SidelinkPreconfigNR (out of coverage), before using the SD-RSRP measurement results;","paragraph_zero_based":383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["affebdbebeb5f8ca5ee898ff78ee64ed3fa42062832f0bf705fce26df6165704","815e6d2fbb63f5fc85ddce87c25514b66a14a8afd245c859691a2bd3e88dfcae","130e47fe629c7fa6d1e4da6d83d23a74a91ec40f909ce17798b736960c805d20","22b53d671c78c42043cb8318e3636e79493231b345978b05becc77895f97184c","1d58f62cb287b65ea3b8c3a75a3ea24a86ae1c664c152129d61de5e52a55d88e","a4f52f33a66bedf41ffecea99a099827720bc9a43c2eac146fc8d77e943154b6","50841ade8dada898db704b322ff71cddb0760911773dcea21be72a5c616fe771","e0f2386df22901529fe1ea757243f26ae88e200c5091b57ecaa00a5bb590ebf9","2045eb331fd5dd0d9490f6350610c16b605047ef245f2f3b63814e0664786d3f","6c9f85069eaa1da24e9bc88b9cbe3486b4b6f0816cb896e28ddc23263ff5a5d8","0194ee497d358a7077eed18a40825e309c8bf2707a4b00237952de7960793192","fd153b80ec48958efb96c10982b01a485fae795c1fc7f38623abb78bb6d3acb6","65d23e02eafb87f0f3bb1cd06153015e692c78f8b0503edcf223f5090c11fdaf","90a703319092470ef9ebb27278b7acc350578b36014d644b9f8a6942c9892a7f","ec3e1c0de466a4e748c38977355c0a082cc1f8bd114621563ff845af13abf4a6","c0d28c6ab1ffbbbc1748c00d33a05c7ef9c67eb949f40f15589918258d9c3306","6247a26a077b8559a2b016f49797c9957574eafcd4a5eb0c416924edb6c20904","33144e98e84a4c26e03ef0e4a5009f8198a18cf930ac613b441422683d234d75","8af883037ef425db62e524cc85b9456121eeade800b039775ae47f69dba84a9e","a4b87f6c56edf12955a067e1730eef036e1bdd16707fa59ef18d4aaf6cba7082","a1aaaa917a67104d4b1894f2ea69fbd0184fe3759f9ae7b2535cea197f160ca1","a0b0ffc01d4e8a7ecd765a77c614a493acdc614e10e3bd068fa646f5fd0f8efa","3b43afbddd579e571fbe79cdc13b22f52acbf9780d4be36173f45105ee9efae1","124047406555f330d04d96d163e9d97fbb2b6f6c5080cdd922fb14274bcf5875"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[360,383],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p360"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider a candidate NR sidelink U2N Relay UE for which SD-RSRP exceeds sl-RSRP-Thresh by sl-HystMin has met the AS criteria;","paragraph_zero_based":384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE detects any suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UE(s):","paragraph_zero_based":385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider one of the available suitable NR sidelink U2N relay UE(s) can be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:A candidate NR sidelink U2N Relay UE which meets all AS layer criteria defined in 5.8.15.3 and higher layer criteria defined in TS 23.304 [65] can be regarded as suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UE by the NR sidelink U2N Remote UE. If multiple suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs are available, it is up to Remote UE implementation to choose one NR sidelink U2N Relay UE. The details of the interaction with upper layers are up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:For L2 U2N Remote UEs in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE and L3 U2N Remote UEs, the cell (re)selection procedure and relay (re)selection procedure run independently. If both suitable cells and suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs are available, it is up to NR sidelink U2N Remote UE implementation to select either a cell or a NR sidelink U2N Relay UE. Furthermore, L3 U2N Remote UE's selection on both cell and NR sidelink U2N Relay UE is also based on UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider no NR sidelink U2N Relay UE to be selected.","paragraph_zero_based":390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"END OF CHNAGES","paragraph_zero_based":392}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f43da851425b78445b6fa461c0557115eba9ac80cbc04eaeaf73708b61828a30","original_member_sha256":"051b79e36488270f0c5ad2ca5e6741123aa16567496056dbe520efe4a15d8e0e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["94f0f48e1b922ea6fedfc5d3abbb3ce78d5ddb28b7c51a0dfeed8198214b2fd9","80a72214ee1ec09c00461aecb3a512c771d8d57d119aad9d2e9d126cb6c1e19e","15e79a0fac8f836002b950e451252ddcc899edf27b500459329b7207a439daf6","31f54c186785d146a5582e48dcbf1fe2604643efc303744da0731d4c8f81f91d","31622b3302aee9b58ea164d2068a4da45efbfb516c775a41830930b757703cf6","9aee6a8bce249bea40146559477463ffa488e3705af19f96de9c67d64f5be129","aaa9598ced485d54f669fe81d234e4112661378e327ec0d5a88485dd7316a020","59242d04320ab7a67665e34e8a47dbb340cc453e75df606ba20fc88a8c0236b3","9b0fd78824d42aacb10b4c6981d54666b1b865c9fc4b1aa905ae1444da10f853"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[384,392],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406680.zip::R2-2406680 Correction on RRC_38331.docx:p384"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3GPP TSG-RAN2 Meeting #127R2-2406697","paragraph_zero_based":0},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maastricht, Netherlands, Aug 19th – 23rd, 2024","paragraph_zero_based":1},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CR-Form-v12.3","paragraph_zero_based":2},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CHANGE REQUEST","paragraph_zero_based":3},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"38.331","paragraph_zero_based":6},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CR","paragraph_zero_based":7},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4886","paragraph_zero_based":8},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rev","paragraph_zero_based":9},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":10},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Current version:","paragraph_zero_based":11},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"18.2.0","paragraph_zero_based":12},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For HELP on using this form: comprehensive instructions can be found at http://www.3gpp.org/Change-Requests.","paragraph_zero_based":15},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":16},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Proposed change affects:","paragraph_zero_based":18},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UICC apps","paragraph_zero_based":19},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ME","paragraph_zero_based":21},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"x","paragraph_zero_based":22},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Radio Access Network","paragraph_zero_based":23}],"source":"Whole authentic original