{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR’s revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.3Reception of an RRCReconfigurationSidelink by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions upon reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink:","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-ResetConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink reset configuration procedure as specified in 5.8.9.1.10;","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry value included in the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink DRB release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the slrb-ConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex value included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the SL-PQFI included in sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList;","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink DRB addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex value included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"434fef05e8d7c531bf190133739015a40f014084a67519390fc8dc896433137f","original_member_sha256":"c6d668d6935093953fc509b8816a1fc06b30897e87624bc3495b0bd88c0aafdc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b8c7901ad75283c46c1370c616b1bf1ed050e79e2fdd6d700b74dac09f18a6af","4b9ee7f3c0700540c67a34b5991504539afc75e15038590571b1c3c1df03f1da","b8c7901ad75283c46c1370c616b1bf1ed050e79e2fdd6d700b74dac09f18a6af","7f64d015353bc33323120fc27dad0039c28f37f43e492ccae30ff1481d0729a3","a625bf7e5406734554878dd80f91252aa858067a4b46704973f0733cb21d1ce4","e87654b6854675cd39176efa77da2ef06d5730cb479e88d0aa7c511280f438c3","f4f4b7d482f3f778bb4b284ddd6f4689055a1a93b24a6cdb2ba783bfac1f4ab7","ba8bc79db6f6969571d31a0ea53d7cccdcc4584222c34745b2b6ee0873ea796b","cb0d1226b0232abfdb3046b147ab616fef122cfa695c7fe55fbc75c9ac1bf490","45fb56abe707bb3b34a8543eadae56a171f84e7d983e4b15b9754c416807e618","7c10f96f08b642264f21912823a636c5c4378b019ea636c8df7c00d1fd4c8aa5","8499afa8f277555903144115c39fc8521cee211ac23bbb28dfecc5132dd89c06","0bfae43211d496f75cbf1a1057a661520aada66a280bb7122d609e64fb98808a","5a9f36ac5ebccd830f37cdfde116368737fb9c871cf5bde1c4a46706a5410f8f","fd49f5647a70d14b73fe103ec96bdee5ec661f6bd0cc595ed90a9472b6095c70","5d68a29c4defe45d0fc0671153ee20f22560fafea831797795ca320d4899d545","5e3ba9851ec3df43193863f174920c8930566a8277593d3c7ff63da7ec34bd4c","7a5d9830cabd2d09cf5ab41c5151b7e2d0469407de540a5dbd681a6c01800068","c1929881c2c63e1f2a7af2cad893898cae8a449eff71daafdb4b048c57a3e8dd","651071915833af1932b6ddb2460d4e25c9ea9e5b0887fb8eaf62a4546e4320d1","6c4cbedc3cac28200aa0be1a59f91531e9e581e522bb638b2c36837f0a128bdc","ae3d4e293f5eadb8797bb381982a031b20f45c05e151305c1466080c72dc4a3d","dd6ecef7a994c7365dcd20a382f8b424dfb9551ccd7c50a888debdce38b5827d","651071915833af1932b6ddb2460d4e25c9ea9e5b0887fb8eaf62a4546e4320d1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>add the SL-PQFI included in sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList to the corresponding sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the SL-PQFI included in sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList from the corresponding sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sidelink DRB release conditions as described in clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the sidelink DRB release procedure according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the sidelink DRB modification conditions as described in clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the sidelink DRB modification procedure according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry value included in the sl-RLC-BearerToReleaseList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the additional sidelink RLC bearer release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.5;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex value included in the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the additional sidelink RLC bearer addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-BearerConfigIndex value included in the sl-RLC-BearerToAddModList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the additional sidelink RLC bearer modification procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.6;","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-CarrierToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry value included in the sl-CarrierToReleaseList that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink carrier release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.1;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-CarrierToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-CarrierId value included in the sl-CarrierToAddModList that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the sidelink carrier addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.1b.2;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-MeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.8.10;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-CSI-RS-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"434fef05e8d7c531bf190133739015a40f014084a67519390fc8dc896433137f","original_member_sha256":"c6d668d6935093953fc509b8816a1fc06b30897e87624bc3495b0bd88c0aafdc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8c46eb6fec71f8001ecbc02fe0f32c2ca503c85f7254f62e630281412d07105b","ba222703e5a48c4566acff594361a32b1eeebd52ced6e13f62272051ea509953","e70f9e25211902106d39373ccd15aab717a85280d151e350ab8cdb4c2297b703","8d5e84447ae70a218ae533ed0e139140f455ab5f2df9182ce404d2aa0d649191","2f67c03fc23dfed9cb2be76cb21d1778a07c4c5d334f5c1065a8ef33b20189be","55ab0ada1bc339efa571722073ac16fa979aa9f18451c35061581f07e982d75e","5441918ca4f7a6d722def0f5b9c4171077da11f9d6309fe02ebbc9791550c72d","ed7c8dc4a70f7493d93dd5065e2778d374ed75463fdb9b02377848039deeecc6","be1e10fc7bb74e88ac082efd22f48ccc55c35109a60936a15b5d9848716d1ac5","07814977634d86bb68e3bae1746dae44c5178a7683750dd121b8e32d21a1d0bc","43a891f73a062eeb41cd2534f469535625d596abb134db9c0161e71bfac8a577","23db6dc582a182085fc7b1be1c89efcb14703a6a5fddfd8e4b992bfb96467d9e","4799b784330a5061313ffb02b4a41660225ce9c201feba4aaabb58fc32d2e89e","7eb9bdb9b9b334bb617bdbe135ff9797ec401dd97800cccf58e6f8bb67e514ca","fff7b15baf6dc580ca8ba71fa31b33dd248c0aca9d1ce28cc8c5c007cbaf01d6","6a4080cf1fc6b8ffb759b68a94a42cdbc52b9ec3ff543c3ca3acdc0a5a44d62f","d558611457bbcf76b330a1edbcfdd594305bc977c5cf7d370f8e00d786edff3c","77c7577a6fadb22867a0d92ed841220ede818535325a0577884944c9b8588214","39775faf743539c17509265b8c5c0f0d6b5fee52c2cfc39ce3f87cf47efdf514","2125cc7c84f0fb455f2fa5b4856af058b7fc3eb6c99c666edd07080f4286b9b8","da7aece914ca5ba49e506227b7b6a99e661e508968f12d3400fa05f886d82fe5","40d70d652df70922908a66b7d80cfd64927ade3c7de5a6b59ee2c47d1f30923c","0e32ad951bcf12341464a5cad9be2ebff90eac03166aa8425fa8eecbdb51ebf5","1d11e8db9ce00ad8575a97807a9e08e8ffcd825283d400217a887b0799b084da"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the sidelink CSI-RS configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configured sidelink CSI report latency bound;","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RLC-ChannelID value included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5 that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel release procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink includes the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5:","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 value included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 that is not part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition procedure, according to clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 value included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 that is part of the current UE sidelink configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the PC5 Relay RLC channel modification procedure according to clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5; and","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE accepts the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to perform sidelink DRX operation according to sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 for the associated destination as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configured sidelink IUC report latency bound;","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-LocalID-PairToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure SRAP entity to perform NR sidelink L2 U2U relay operation accordingly for the end-to-end PC5 connection with the peer L2 U2U Remote UE as defined in TS 38.351 [65];","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink (i.e. sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure):","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>continue using the configuration used prior to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message includes the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset:","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"434fef05e8d7c531bf190133739015a40f014084a67519390fc8dc896433137f","original_member_sha256":"c6d668d6935093953fc509b8816a1fc06b30897e87624bc3495b0bd88c0aafdc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["38171c4b61589884e883043f8bd16ed6397dc593c6d56e4c219ad354282776b1","d4f15e6808bdc408f2ee6a5b45a63db0bd4c9dafc08971359838ff1585c0eca5","1a4de7ba21bce058a9dd69b29a51dcbc246afe04b307b752f8e9788429c5bf42","95687654f6784180e60e57e101ddc7b04d3ac0d36fa48ae155fb713062371c85","2640ccdfe5c6520acfdb8994639ff99bff8a6b47f798f7da812cc6a7a6612344","3cdd0e5d25074bd7c3867c65cc7030dd2a1072c33bb500179f4f1e3f410288ab","639c5d75d877205f4364d77b7afe535310d8fe47ab1c3da797f3ba2be373fd3a","dc72c5327c97307f3240d370dd4d28dbe908952ea56c76ba88a680ae79c7ee44","e00f948c59a65f6c1defa8eac6622bb45aef9e6c10190b96870f3a1bb6078b92","6ebb0e8c155baf289ad87463a31d57d8b8a3b4a17567af6be36f70a1628b758c","3ac7d14ef3caf5344904fd9273b94cb92e866d9f916dd64a99584232a96b5392","9ec346448292bbdc964b524036640492ce553ac3909450555c849b2865c541ce","ed63ffd0c99f60115a6baa18433a1807f47eb927d5ab7cbf42b3feb1a4757628","8ae2eeba7d83323bcde34b220005301d95e2a8ce15dd73f1533416f450009df6","f57c3e96ad615bad88c1d97a05fef7cd99017a9d2c37b5684d352547861694a4","1232caa3b0733c2fc32d1df3ca90cb3af950afc400a087abf219d7aaf992cedb","8f47a5000cf03bcf3a91ba3a574e0a795f1fdafd58e0c5177172ee0126d55740","26527ac53402d35384bee8894dde7dd8c5be884e7b25859f2919a73171f07edf","154f7c8214841ff927d9108092ff4f6dde19d7e2b9c295642577de057a623f27","4b55a3bcf67c65d17f058712385a4458c97bcc6e63ac5d9e30de7cad542849cf","2db93820bdeb1aefd77c9d6d60def6618a28c433b2c0c4b16dbb3b70a06c4e25","0939efcb1aa10cc104817674cb93c979beb90313e02cab208403898a29a79931","932b0cee6e36f55488ea4db9dc9fb6c06f7804c8f75a56ea5ee6b15b9cbf840e","f77bc1afaf4ebcf5fb0db29c59ff5e0c9bc77a8505df5d18d39cbc4f75eb9e2c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configured SFN-DFN time offset;","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the received sl-SFN-DFN-Offset;","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE rejects the sidelink DRX configuration sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 received from the peer UE:","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the sl-DRX-ConfigReject in the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message;","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider no sidelink DRX to be applied for the corresponding sidelink unicast communication;","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When the same logical channel is configured with different RLC mode by another UE, the UE handles the case as sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure.","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:It is up to the UE implementation whether or not to indicate the rejection to the peer UE for a received sidelink DRX configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:When UE transmits SL-PRS in dedicated SL-PRS resource pool, the sidelink DRX configuration is not applied.","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7.2PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between the L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-RLC0 as specified in clause 9.1.1.4:","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in clause 9.2.4 if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE state;","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between two UEs for L2 U2U relay operation UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2U Relay operation in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTVE or out of coverage, the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification can be triggered due to the addition/modification/release of the end-to-end SL DRB(s). The source L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U Relay UE derive the configuration for the corresponding PC5 Relay RLC channel based on SIB12/Preconfiguration, as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The source L2 U2U Remote UE derives the configuration for the PC5 Relay RLC channel(s) between the source L2 U2U Remote UE and L2 U2U relay UE (i.e. the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel(s)), by aggregating the QoS profile(s) of the QoS flow(s) with split QoS information of the first hop into a per-SLRB level QoS profile for each end-to-end Sidelink DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11.4, and considering the SL-RLC-BearerConfig (linked to the SL-RadioBearerConfig which matches the per-SLRB level QoS profile) as the first hop PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"434fef05e8d7c531bf190133739015a40f014084a67519390fc8dc896433137f","original_member_sha256":"c6d668d6935093953fc509b8816a1fc06b30897e87624bc3495b0bd88c0aafdc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["30530d90bc04c7ff3732ed89a283febec03523d06df347b366a364920eb8c793","0ad0012b477d6f42052796906b5ab26085d40df3f18a6cbcf5f5398dea93b4df","6140bc0badc5c256f67f68cc849668ba9d7f9b802e0a4d80b68f098752de713d","0fd0ac458894a865785f75114eb71ed9be0bde5bd4c9f544f26485474e89d4f8","df2264d8e7d9dd8aea8945cbe209541752ada789218c3f004ed1aef75d643233","39befe08497da9e287a5a69fb1114020fe3e37dd1bf75aeca6a05799517768d7","f02692152535d1e01792b49c5f22f6a3e07e6eb876727cdceef3ae2cb9cc64f8","e1df665780c4424dc6d9fc5ec12f3eb4377a1757caa6d4bf70a33b24a86aad1b","663baefdf71fc7db05c48692e547b2b7b75a13c14a5dbff501af4fc9a7e0ae52","09e98f0362f1239fa7cfbba6d973c754f23f17c7397957fff8d3082490a66bb5","3368c3a31e3870c0ded004ecd996933a3626ec98905fc11d0bb7aee54ae7c9c1","e1ea704ae9fa1dbe874c9cc6db5597f27f236175b8a88a708260b030563da34c","908c3484cade3646926a9297ba1227538ce8aaeb586af90e33d4ed3758186a15","5dbb0ace3e7570f624af0b142530dd8334b3d865c9f4b404f94cbb5c265fe433","70825835ff43499c1da356530324b90ee63a39f460af0aa3003c3bbd9f424971","bd8f1d007e3441af57dcc491eada87d5f57c22915e7cda9da9a920b7956c8eb2","352f9609f49241d70b7f8fc2abcdc4f8cafe512226d28d655dc8340d6b048dd0","587d6a65275a50218e29561e59aa85dee486ff807266f5714b2ddbbbb2090e0e","fb6ae4240ab48c2a4615f56f389fd0235eaf42547f0b93ef3427b20a950293fd","2e592b23523a5260df97bc08496abeac07c1d4dda90aed74ab5c758168e61158","ee35f692083e959b2e0aac4cc7730fc1505367d3a71526a31ed2b27ff3869362","1cd64acd2e13959e8830a3c5268840599a5e399c87ba8480619f36be28990ee0","34d8c662e56ee1a4b5a39cd2fb14daff319bc8432b6bcaa2010ef03b58104740","ff457db0b051cea5c6852c730fabad3c5010255b315df845ca4e24d51a28ca71"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The L2 U2U Relay UE derives the configuration for the PC5 Relay RLC channel(s) between L2 U2U relay UE and the target L2 U2U Remote UE (i.e. the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel(s)), by aggregating the QoS profile(s) of the QoS flow(s) with split QoS information of the second hop into a per-SLRB level QoS profile for each end-to-end Sidelink DRB as described in clause 5.8.9.11.3, and considering the SL-RLC-BearerConfig (linked to the SL-RadioBearerConfig which matches the per-SLRB level QoS profile) as the second hop PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered for an end-to-end sidelink DRB based on the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current configuration contains a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5; or","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR has updated, based on which the PC5 Relay RLC channel is derived:","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 was not configured before):","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config (in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or SIB12, or SidelinkPreconfigNR) or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5.","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.2Actions related to transmission of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or upon change in any of the information in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink while in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has SIB request information to provide (e.g. the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1 and the requested SIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before):","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has not stored a valid version, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) that the UE requires for a positioning operation, and the requested posSIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before, and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set posSIB-ForwardingSupported to supported:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested posSIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE needs the SFN-DFN offset based on the request from upper layers and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set sfn-DFN-OffsetSupported to supported:","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-SFN-DFN-OffsetRequested to true;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has paging related information to provide (e.g. the UE has not sent sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before), set sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_IDLE:","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"434fef05e8d7c531bf190133739015a40f014084a67519390fc8dc896433137f","original_member_sha256":"c6d668d6935093953fc509b8816a1fc06b30897e87624bc3495b0bd88c0aafdc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d2a1f839acd90e3708fded6923ec33d3c6c7e18380e135f51c61e214a26cd79f","8ba66de61ad071d9a5ca956b1d02cdf8d63ae955a4e6635e353547e9934681b3","1f5d3c975da69a8153e4396ac9b5320e6d9297ffcd5582caed85ee9a8e0f5e63","062936dafa1e772beb9243bd120be095c7f88ee7f3a03b96a341c2542967ad03","1a4ad95ec6c8625b86b199bbe8eb3125342f54f2a0c2f1400af2f4f822cb77a1","6da768a6ffa4d56eb040fb3c0572f73080e9196cdbb757ac0aea3b65bf9a12a9","49154226fbe7a9de0efe8a4421f2be937b29fa1aff1a9e38bcae3d70075fd21c","69e8323f0fd36158c7756747fdb5e6819e00a2ff62d0366e09d9ee9e94276894","ccbe40db3d1ef29ff4611e5ddddf03a7fde2b2e4b48016d75f0650294e1e560a","736e94e5826c917b5d5d4141186ee754324a699bce07db7c67ec8515cc2ee368","32ae2c3558fdd73f4c9a5f4e7682b605fe0e2fe8c8981829dd42fb28c7b621d9","d6533b4e47d7bc52e1bb7ff36d9e45b678fc5b9196fdb894ef98fbe4ce2ac2ba","908c3484cade3646926a9297ba1227538ce8aaeb586af90e33d4ed3758186a15","b6908ed351d74d01e307652e79caba31bfdefd469648d4af392619f01be5aeaa","7873eb4c1c5d27709ec9161c45d547db7711a76b49a936abccb00406d83139c8","749915652b138c4eeb58261cebc4cf21c30eb89d8d8b6ab7d7a3a5fbd877c1a8","df9427c228567a203c8319d6e00085c5e66907667a24fe912a9b6b86c25fd271","21fba8aad7f716e637740dc58e213a77311394ddb781dfcf730d835a590339ab","a17c4f9fa33f910cd550f9f4635e8ee2a9ac2df5f2bb790f4b8d8acdccb622c4","a3aeef4eb74ec0a69328b36c4ec19f19afea5cb0f1d35fd81ea6a0ecf780d30a","cfc12dd6784af321ba6242273ac8fa1d33e62e129f3b0a12230a8fa928f8601e","8512a9dcfc79b0485536d1c95d054f3cd40ddbe0606a38b4e23c616c4a5a9a40","fdc7efa868d3ed8eb49d9e602cd26bc0e3f08d02c2ad87da0fae92f8d3775018","824eb0189c18c23ca2d0f3ee5e018be54165f08ca15ad4553f20711089a8cc8d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx:p216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2406697.zip::R2-2406697 Corrections for SL relay-331.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer, set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific Uu DRX cycle configured by upper layer;","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI and fullI-RNTI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer,","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the minimum value of UE specific Uu DRX cycles (configured by upper layer and configured by RRC);","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific DRX cycle configured by RRC;","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_CONNECTED, if L2 U2N remote UE had sent sl-RequestedSIB-List, sl-RequestedPosSIB-List, and/or sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE to the value release if sent before;","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon any change in the need of SFN-DFN offset while in RRC_CONNECTED, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE needs the SFN-DFN offset based on the request from upper layers and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set sfn-DFN-OffsetSupported to supported:","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-SFN-DFN-OffsetRequested to true;","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED shall:","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with sl-IndirectPathAddChange set to setup, and not configured with split SRB1 with duplication:","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include connectionForMP;","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon end-to-end PC5-RRC connection release; or","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"434fef05e8d7c531bf190133739015a40f014084a67519390fc8dc896433137f","original_member_sha256":"c6d668d6935093953fc509b8816a1fc06b30897e87624bc3495b0bd88c0aafdc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["78824712078dee9fad674202d43b4730faa92920501b0168f79a4141b84f6945","2ebdf4de0ae13cd