{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2407171.zip::R2-2407171- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGES","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.18.26Restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Child IAB-DU Restricted Beam Indication MAC CE is used by an IAB-node to indicate to its child node spatial resources and associated frequency information where simultaneous transmission/reception from the IAB-MT and transmission from the IAB-DU cells is restricted. IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication MAC CE is used by an IAB-node to indicate to its parent node recommendations for IAB-MT beams to be used for the UL or DL transmissions of the IAB-MT. Time resources where these restrictions/recommendations can apply are indicated via RRC, while the MAC CE further selects from these time resources the specific time resource configuration (comprising a list of slot indices) to which information provided in the MAC CE applies.","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of a Child IAB-DU Restricted Beam Indication MAC CE the IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-apply the configuration signalled in the MAC CE to the time slots indicated in IAB-ResourceConfig (as specified in TS 38.331 [5]) which contains iab-ResourceConfigID parameter which matches the Resource Configuration ID field of the MAC CE.","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity may:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if an IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication query has not been triggered:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger an IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication query for this Serving Cell.","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the MAC entity has UL resources allocated for new transmission the MAC entity shall:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication query that has been triggered and not cancelled:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the allocated UL resources can accommodate a IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication MAC CE plus its subheader as a result of LCP as defined in clause 5.4.3.1:","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the Multiplexing and Assembly procedure to generate the IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication MAC CE;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>cancel this IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication query.","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ND OF CHANGES","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d9d011c63c3d251478b414285a8b696398e51e6df9f4b032647a9ae762c61029","original_member_sha256":"d1a6bd19687d85e1704f0d784898e6446f67eb8794484d1e384699a9a0d13807","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b042be11c186fe6e93eb06fe23e42c65480906d8ed9aa944