{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2407505.zip::R2-2407505 38.306 CR for barring exemption for emergency call.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<UNCHANGED TEXT OMITTED>","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.4Other features","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Definitions for feature","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Access Category 1 selection assistance information enhancement","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE that is configured for delay tolerant service to support Access Category 1 selection assistance information enhancement, according to uac-AC1-SelectAssistInfo-r16 as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Barring exemption for emergency call","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support the barring exemption for emergency call, as specified in TS 38.331 [9] and in TS 38.304 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Beam Failure recovery for SDT","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support Beam failure recovery for RA-SDT initiated for MO-SDT and MT-SDT as specified in TS 38.321 [8] and TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eCall over IMS","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support eCall over IMS as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Equivalent SNPNs for cell (re)selection","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE in SNPN access mode to support cell (re)selection for equivalent SNPNs as specified in TS 38.304 [21].","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HSDN cell reselection","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support HSDN cell reselection priority handling in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE as specified in TS 38.304 [21] and TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Minimization of service interruption","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support minimization of service interruption including reporting to NAS of disaster roaming information for available PLMNs and Access Barring check for Access Identity 3, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mobile IAB cell reselection","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support mobile IAB cell reselection priority handling in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE, as specified in TS 38.304 [21] and TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUCCH repetition on common PUCCH resource","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support repetition transmission of PUCCH for Msg4 HARQ-ACK on common PUCCH resource (i.e., PUCCH resource before dedicated configuration is provided). The UE supports receiving repetition factor in system information, receiving repetition factor in DCI format 1_0 with CRC scrambled by TC-RNTI scheduling Msg4 PDSCH, Msg3 to report capability for PUCCH Msg4 HARQ-ACK repetition, extension of the repetition transmission of PUCCH before dedicated PUCCH resource configuration and RSRP threshold for Msg4 HARQ-ACK repetition on common PUCCH resources.","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE that includes LCID codepoint = one of {2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7} for UL CCCH when the LX field is set to 1 must support this feature.","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:This capability is applicable only for bands in Tables 5.2.2-1 and 5.2.3-1 in TS 38.101-5 [34] and HAPS operation bands in Clause 5.2 of TS 38.104 [35].","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Random access prioritization for MPS and MCS","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"a4bf078bb80c4fba0988dff958f3cd858f254214eebc5003084d06a93c38d9d4","original_member_sha256":"997b48ad979fc20ca8333c9b348238c599d44fc790fc15113919d476c7c42728","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fbcc288b805c013f628cd050c3a108793ab7b0d283256bbb71b22604c9c59ec4","6096b513f648abdaa2e29b18381d732adf1000807e3ec4a0ca21374f0726a5b2","de15083ac25b5f15bf781df8216b2781360aa3ec35d9171bb6873d51342b6f2b","ad0cc9a822d01058ff9f7336adedc11793f85beacc19f35572673256afc14f19","28124daae3d2684da2226627c90da0557f44a5792cbf9643e165062c84286237","bb992cca7204b942ae42754bc7443100816a6fbdd42ec7857b3dd8490714ec1b","4b89bc5c03a1e889494802b9631444a8b637975798572fd4f4bb5bc2e46904e6","f21023284e9d9b21458ef0b971069731dadfee1208e8edf74b6c70998b96dc74","4fb4c6cb1ef588665791130507cd8237010b0e72ac1c132b42b3f80812ac2d37","0908df062deeb3e88ead2ef27c45aedf836f5562b74c3839eb4804c87edfd9b7","a20e97a066660fa9f5678cfe3d0675ea8f5da860b692847f55a8d7b0ab98ce5b","8858c2fb08706a19b0588e3092a6eecdb02df228d7da396ce4971f8c81a51d80","35928e1b666bf202e832607c64f550f5702055a4e1b0e53cc7a883192c0dd73d","7d817acace13e35e5bfd7797acc8c1f55342997438cbce44fa30f6703cdead79","3d17e3bcbc386a08807d3129d551bf9ada8d93f3ab4e2e56695ec84f62be455e","bff1aa9e35c9a094ff7e5b2cc68163c849a9a5811bebec9fcc04f1acc75db19e","8d75107150be5fd17d8917ad635b053afbd184be030ef30715ee9afd9b0f145e","d9cd2da749ac7b127e2d81cbc7af58109be16ce2d1bc22d4e0de2a13ec14e221","a103a19e348806434219814b05008d5e790a517a342f5010b527d9292a7f563b","d03dbd49b2d97a1118629dbec7cccc05969bf7adc3448de38ac36118d8755ec1","6bfae8083ab85a491011d71a6703380640dc7c344e67d5a62d4c091f5864ede7","ed521034d28be83508495d2f611688f0c2c7e226404c9d70c8d8a2e5286b07c4","dee8aac28fa6bcb05c2082da7237a444583bdc90db07eecfa1310abbfded0f68","3d2fc85c95b3c95d42d82db6f64c923c08f982f89e52ff700facb40f4bd1a934"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2407505.zip::R2-2407505 38.306 CR for barring exemption for emergency call.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2407505.zip::R2-2407505 38.306 CR for barring exemption for emergency call.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE that is configured for MPS or MCS to support random access prioritization for Access Identity 1 or 2 as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Random access prioritisation for Slicing","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support slice-based prioritisation for random access as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Random access partitioning for Slicing","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support slice-based RACH partitioning as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Relaxed cell reselection on GSO","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support the relaxed cell reselection on GSO.","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Support of polarization signalling in NR NTN","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support the polarization signalling in NR NTN comprised of the following functional components:","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Support polarization indication reception in SIB indicating DL and/or UL polarization information using respective polarization type parameters to indicate: RHCP or LHCP or linear;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Support polarization signalling for target serving cell in handover command message;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Support polarization signalling for non-serving cell in RRM measurement configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TRS occasions for idle mode and RRC_INACTIVE UEs","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is optional for UE to support reading TRS configuration from SIB and receiving L1 indication for TRS availability.","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Receiving L1 indication via DCI format 2_7 is supported only if the UE supports receiving DCI format 2_7.","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of Change","paragraph_zero_based":160}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"a4bf078bb80c4fba0988dff958f3cd858f254214eebc5003084d06a93c38d9d4","original_member_sha256":"997b48ad979fc20ca8333c9b348238c599d44fc790fc15113919d476c7c42728","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fd62f63671a95cf924fe14437e4c21a2bc35ae51bea23b22b938b56e5c901126","8696331323078fef6ae20b55c2e404f231068d6f055ad97449301092a8c2a6a8","79696758a6aa17bc68b4d9c7a85d1cbb0e3bdd08ac86e711b5cf4714a46e4a1c","b9c45a39525b909b480fb33fb0296f2ff89026f23049e024d848ce38f7eae71c","b1b27a60c0d5434faf538e945ef3a9a2bb47527ee08aa7db129dc0ccd8b8faf6","2b709104728db6e139827430f228351ef521442f7f35e8c69a5ed71e82dc15d6","a1949ee1a859033e6db47fcd3fcbfb74c90b48e17e5b9ef7a32518375b9c5b0f","5a76d8af0b91b5dda265e0741de88edb7f8e4708c5fcf4b1fdf143e9bc8c6950","657757cdf64b7f8724b1ddaeed308ce926bea397b7e8b98950fdb0c56e3a3e16","40fe65d0a685681fccdc60d68c5739148e13d8520abf094807fae2a2edc2d6b9","116f1910c46c715597ad210391970577fe978b5bff1758e900467a573b321688","bdcc9006e8531fc356e6b34536e45c65eda6e39c4b14675df0eb0ac9051894d4","c5c6014d6bd575f157e6b3eef545b136d5f85e6efdd744288861f93f9791fbee","eba5ae21c3f77523728c429f5ed6a64d81951ec3e5c906aeb0066f59e70c3e7c","b6f62741870e091b91c42f51ad149f68f2ec2ef02e092a6a3fd2b4a29cb07181","a3f44e4c58a4c59c2d4535963239b92cb9e