_t_and_m_t":"ncr-BackhaulBeamInd-r18","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether NCR supports dedicated signalling for backhaul link beam indication.","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE indicating support of this feature shall also indicate support of ncr-AdaptiveBeamBackhaulAndC-Link-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e56e4fe7d8e6a5c607933a23a2f1897d8656bfbf7c4bce8238b8e629cd46568a","original_member_sha256":"e10e3900277b3ed34f68058bb1ac2dafe7ed9796062dcc576bb2e3c4decb02a1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4884147107a35e32ab00d420bc58f7ce5aa4e4883d0d4309c62fe4cf27b6a7bd","74a5c9b21bc53af38e24b783bb2bb689ec51f2662000aa25cde8eee223cd1479","f177479bd96f6af2e4f41e6ab4d1ab7f360285264d82a4a94241944ab6828fad","ea9a9f90333c3626c61aa8d0989873fedd3d923fa17d74a5fda9aa12ee969f87","3cde2e7c43fa5885732b93abf485c94c632d0b891d91f498a7845fb2b421e9ef","2d966c7b8964db807dfd599206e2ceaba02b9089cdeb7429153be7a06d4c6821","2c0dc74065cd9bf3dc728d8ccd3f3704a6936763c5d87649ad81da1cafdfcda8","97825e5f007487b1293c253159832edd3439c16e30c33b67fca83abb51c4c79c","7ca3560736d2dd04279025e1354d5a0750639dd03bc40203f3f98fa0baf05f5b","0092458bc02efe37abf33a18afa85fe51c5481b20c3d45a43a2216d908744a7e","7355c4a2494934de1f53e3c7ea9894d9d40adc832c80af166142beb00b62636f","aebd23f5a295ea5bd7ca491d131c039f084f05e8a49be77447d907d2586e5a84","260d116c565b83d77511b77ba4b7a9f963ac4d4da24f97e2313e91cc4308864a","29284aea2aed222df19c34515af4fa53e815a0fa8122a0861f39eb17bb90bb7d","4797a112230c9231ff22cb20243db0e56b6997bcb8a15b5f4f5669d1b8be2fb4","06011818150e32e64a99cf2aca6642a3eebb8051633fede474e26887f73c78e0","c5a4cca23caf15fe7077b737a9ac79c465254e21f7a5f99444a80cd7bdb07be7","cb394192c5538da886080212255a0ed44a2d0b171b2443cd5d175776de525443","42d91fff82f52240f6d5b96eee1d478bf6cd6cb06e7926c0a7b