ation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408214.zip::R2-2408214 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R17).docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408214.zip::R2-2408214 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R17).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 1: ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-AlmanacElement in A-GNSS-ProvideAssistanceData, LMF can provide model-1 to model-8 to UE, where model-8 refers to the almanac assistance data of NavIC introduced in Rel-16;","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-AlmanacReq in A-GNSS-RequestAssistanceData, UE can request model-1 to model-8 to LMF, where model-8 refers to the almanac assistance data of NavIC introduced in Rel-16:","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID to modelID relation (in GNSS-AlmanacReq)","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"modelID","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gps","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sbas","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qzss","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e51c2517ccef31616c1373519700b9598c20468e8d5224cbb63673246fdebcc3","original_member_sha256":"11e2ab804fb64d6fce64573faf419b8f335f0b1fa79af34934bcd97c1b0d748e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6eb56907e5bd598f20626b6c7c9ae45750366bfc2f551331fa2b66d48df47549","9236b6e55ffc4479ae838cff35fcc2821133409e21b025a248310d7d3940c3dd","e69398cfa5bfc52edc8d4a527656459cfc5e57db4e76c8332c99e98af919ec23","06602945ab6582cc34a8e5e78cfe3273785061cf83c63635a492d898bac25278","10c0908d4446734111f3593d33494e1d217726416174c26db321249cc4f79456","49ad088afdc6b14282e308c23900bdf6d5012932fb3245531a6ac76bdceff5fa","266b36323df826f18eeecc6fb4f8e8e448978c1a433dd57b05e17254c2b1cba0","8c46f27c77499ac7029fc965c8ba34e1cd48c415e9fd86ad16dc056762d28d42","770189bf1796aeb8e1cae7069bc2e524cd1595961b8835490f5ff36b3352ba0e","30f90e80dba8b2c9daedf3b63ef7af9ea915f82eccc394e95bb1e71ff5aca85b","047c09778610dea9770498271709cb444c4a907f68c2a64f57071bfb68a89c14","6eb56907e5bd598f20626b6c7c9ae45750366bfc2f551331fa2b66d48df47549","7df087bc70c5e458741f55815f32f9ec392849b43c00f01e363d45e5d8a63a30","cd56d5641f620c02ee3829db9af8bdeefacffc135626de337134a9bc2b1fec93","7c75a30f538021b2e1f8d12e09de01bbf69ed00824f817f19913b8c960db7126","a969166a11e07d41d2e4bffc0d5508bd472dd1a2b757651e063413cdebdeb2dc","de2c0b6d1bd681bf8db433934d0e1a8684ae1323742358ae31230830d9b80121","791432db3d136ebb210613d1c54aced49845b0df2e61756c122085101b5c5902","2255439e9ab76db8b806b7862b2536301cab202a98788314c55605c256a0e8f5","10dc44745f8048752143b5a0c02cc6088efcccc665e951671080de24dc486bd2","0ab0238712bdbc4ad0e0d514131f9ed73b0ca383d8fcc08c142a79d9092aee8e","efd5034cc0b5c9568618921aa927f40def4abcfc9c354a56d7ff3d1f106c11f6","8894420ccecfcdafb58e282a9fdb92c113b07e92315a20139742babcffa2ce1f","6d1e0f6810f4b6fc5b6b2a88d8bbffe9b7e8d2d6cc80d87750e3c291fd4c682d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408214.zip::R2-2408214 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R17).docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408214.zip::R2-2408214 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R17).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"galileo","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"glonass","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bds","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"navic","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"However in GNSS-AlmanacSupport in A-GNSS-ProvideCapabilities, there is only model-1 to model-7, model-8 is missing. This means that UE cannot indicate its support of NavIC almanac assistance data to LMF.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 2: ","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-UTC-Model in A-GNSS-ProvideAssistanceData, LMF can provide model-1 to model-5 to UE.","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-UTC-ModelReq in A-GNSS-RequestAssistanceData, UE can request model-1 to model-5 to LMF, where model-2 refers to the GNSS-UTC-Model assistance data of NavIC introduced in Rel-16:","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID to modelID relation (in GNSS-UTC-ModelReq)","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"modelID","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gps","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sbas","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qzss","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e51c2517ccef31616c1373519700b9598c20468e8d5224cbb63673246fdebcc3","original_member_sha256":"11e2ab804fb64d6fce64573faf419b8f335f0b1fa79af34934bcd97c1b0d748e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0ab0238712bdbc4ad0e0d514131f9ed73b0ca383d8fcc08c142a79d9092aee8e","b72d22f30f374f491a38e3817efec510b7f82dcee57eca115946a1cd43fb9b81","762a026b6ab722a5796cac827fab89f08c8c973debb946c8fc8a48b73711e4ab","01b23576478b3713635573bd20a1f2e324ad4918ef2becab79a94690b0199992","bd0b6e9c399e15316b80fdbdbac53a90f09fc76af3fa38ea2341f5c8277e88b7","08ab089cdaaa1c089601840fb38355d90388ead1730dfb0e90d52506730c2d65","6e05131a5f110b7fa820851bc9063847b2d7b75ad4c90f5396d86e1863470b09","4dd27b178fe547a0c942b3e19175afe366fb096c92e565a037f061086a816de0","5ad995705a1b88db14143a3eb7907c3aca933945debf784c8c9896d7c82c3249","fef19eb4d865e1a79f0deb90f4ca57d6b3b25e5ccb50aa302f0876b86a5ba4e3","3640103ba2bdf49b3ece5c27c239ec87bb431e16dca230600cb7ff13b13f07d9","fef19eb4d865e1a79f0deb90f4ca57d6b3b25e5ccb50aa302f0876b86a5ba4e3","366a0f20422eb05694b7aa324ad81ee38028110b027f15bd8470ea5450264d72","73c42c8938436942a19bccba47057bb623f16516b6a451070582fffcdea6a14a","5fea5396934ea8647e63aee2b2ad24aa8c77868c00a5aa5b2a073932441b2987","ad86c836ba2e012596bbf86d4f2a3735a406ffe2f9aeebf0607de58f610ff890","791432db3d136ebb210613d1c54aced49845b0df2e61756c122085101b5c5902","2255439e9ab76db8b806b7862b2536301cab202a98788314c55605c256a0e8f5","772f6cadadc7ba276c06e33d108defbec2902e851be81dec060267e6fee6bbeb","762a026b6ab722a5796cac827fab89f08c8c973debb946c8fc8a48b73711e4ab","efd5034cc0b5c9568618921aa927f40def4abcfc9c354a56d7ff3d1f106c11f6","0347726fb53da8dcab32e7808d8ef3788ee3d44bd1e799d6ca5de783bde8a2d2","6d1e0f6810f4b6fc5b6b2a88d8bbffe9b7e8d2d6cc80d87750e3c291fd4c682d","762a026b6ab722a5796cac827fab89f08c8c973debb946c8fc8a48b73711e4ab"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[72,95],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408214.zip::R2-2408214 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R17).docx:p72"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408214.zip::R2-2408214 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R17).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"galileo","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"glonass","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bds","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"navic","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"However in the field description of GNSS-UTC-ModelSupport in A-GNSS-ProvideCapabilities, if UE supports NavIC, the mandatory support of model-2 GNSS-UTC-Model assistance data is missing.","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Change 1: Add model-8 in GNSS-AlmanacSupport, and add in field description that ‘if the target device supports NavIC and GNSS-Almanac assistance, it shall support Model-8’;","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Change 2: Add in field description of GNSS-UTC-ModelSupport that ‘if the target device supports NavIC and GNSS-UTC-Model assistance, it shall support Model-2’.","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SA, (NG)EN-DC, NE-DC, NR-DC","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A-GNSS positioning","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR while the network is not, network will not understand model-8 reported in GNSS-AlmanacSupport;","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to this CR while the UE is not, UE will report a UE capability that does not align with network’s understanding, which further leads to unwanted/not-supported assistance data provision to UE.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e51c2517ccef31616c1373519700b9598c20468e8d5224cbb63673246fdebcc3","original_member_sha256":"11e2ab804fb64d6fce64573faf419b8f335f0b1fa79af34934bcd97c1b0d748e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b72d22f30f374f491a38e3817efec510b7f82dcee57eca115946a1cd43fb9b81","762a026b6ab722a5796cac827fab89f08c8c973debb946c8fc8a48b73711e4ab","01b23576478b3713635573bd20a1f2e324ad4918ef2becab79a94690b0199992","13ecf0b9c02dcc09a1f05aaa18dbe1db0f6ab11779d93edf03109365f07dbdc0","08ab089cdaaa1c089601840fb38355d90388ead1730dfb0e90d52506730c2d65","bd0b6e9c399e15316b80fdbdbac53a90f09fc76af3fa38ea2341f5c8277e88b7","4dd27b178fe547a0c942b3e19175afe366fb096c92e565a037f061086a816de0","0ab0238712bdbc4ad0e0d514131f9ed73b0ca383d8fcc08c142a79d9092aee8e","3ed6f13196f15704651b5755fd6b0f3e6d8504154eaca4e8f05254e06366a488","b1c88d7488b384dcf7ab03fcd4cbf5a0a9d14a44f4dcf81e7baf17ea03dfa813","047c09778610dea9770498271709cb444c4a907f68c2a64f57071bfb68a89c14","6eb56907e5bd598f20626b6c7c9ae45750366bfc2f551331fa2b66d48df47549","2ede60d9d14cf8f649ba6bb2384983d23a9f1f53bc8