ation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408215.zip::R2-2408215 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R18).docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408215.zip::R2-2408215 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 1: ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-AlmanacElement in A-GNSS-ProvideAssistanceData, LMF can provide model-1 to model-8 to UE, where model-8 refers to the almanac assistance data of NavIC introduced in Rel-16;","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-AlmanacReq in A-GNSS-RequestAssistanceData, UE can request model-1 to model-8 to LMF, where model-8 refers to the almanac assistance data of NavIC introduced in Rel-16:","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID to modelID relation (in GNSS-AlmanacReq)","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"modelID","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gps","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sbas","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qzss","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b1f4f45546def2664ca2ee7667b8fe23ed4539cfd8edba6b6f93bf09915e1a61","original_member_sha256":"daacb728659b141652fb097c21d93fe1c637dfd6fe5095d8417a2039f13bf59d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6eb56907e5bd598f20626b6c7c9ae45750366bfc2f551331fa2b66d48df47549","9236b6e55ffc4479ae838cff35fcc2821133409e21b025a248310d7d3940c3dd","f7bf699f294074729b11d76bfed853fe06606bb68a2e4b60067170ef532fa12f","06602945ab6582cc34a8e5e78cfe3273785061cf83c63635a492d898bac25278","10c0908d4446734111f3593d33494e1d217726416174c26db321249cc4f79456","868d3939e81f181c76f238ac7fac633deadb7b36febe8366cad79f59b967e0ce","266b36323df826f18eeecc6fb4f8e8e448978c1a433dd57b05e17254c2b1cba0","8c46f27c77499ac7029fc965c8ba34e1cd48c415e9fd86ad16dc056762d28d42","770189bf1796aeb8e1cae7069bc2e524cd1595961b8835490f5ff36b3352ba0e","30f90e80dba8b2c9daedf3b63ef7af9ea915f82eccc394e95bb1e71ff5aca85b","047c09778610dea9770498271709cb444c4a907f68c2a64f57071bfb68a89c14","6eb56907e5bd598f20626b6c7c9ae45750366bfc2f551331fa2b66d48df47549","7df087bc70c5e458741f55815f32f9ec392849b43c00f01e363d45e5d8a63a30","6b1c808471e5ffb613af6b356c38ef2b0cde80b7022c6b1c32fe1114d147274a","5ffda135f93877ff9931a194a6dae583cce596eda38fb5588b027d7c0eae1449","3f09fe38bed0e615ea49b6cf64f7497c1fa57d8793910872b69b464d48996b7a","4fdd059277acfd3c0deb98f06783368b88cdd9dff22fa482ffa5aa5f3a01345b","e80d14afe1a4170fd5d07fdc92fea1c0e8cf2052fc1a912188bb3dfe16190c00","fce96c886e3d664db6ae7432be557eb3ed40bb3df2727a3d5c1988da582a8b6a","1b948f122b11790675307c28e7790db9c54ab00617769e20f84ce55f72f72439","b58efa09da454a9c8dd0018339adef3b6e8e676c98b91ad687f87b491b4f0229","5862c63406540de204c7edf4c35f31d63a0bcecdff96da3cc077e3ab3e1cfd53","a085ef622a9613b90fc02ecfb9907c37dea9ab7173f2bebbd6d6b5163c19b64b","d377527a9a23d26df648914c75cb03b656f957e4985f76441d93386808653e97"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408215.zip::R2-2408215 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R18).docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408215.zip::R2-2408215 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"galileo","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"glonass","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bds","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"navic","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"However in GNSS-AlmanacSupport in A-GNSS-ProvideCapabilities, there is only model-1 to model-7, model-8 is missing. This means that UE cannot indicate its support of NavIC almanac assistance data to LMF.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 2: ","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-UTC-Model in A-GNSS-ProvideAssistanceData, LMF can provide model-1 to model-5 to UE.","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In GNSS-UTC-ModelReq in A-GNSS-RequestAssistanceData, UE can request model-1 to model-5 to LMF, where model-2 refers to the GNSS-UTC-Model assistance data of NavIC introduced in Rel-16:","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID to modelID relation (in GNSS-UTC-ModelReq)","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-ID","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"modelID","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gps","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sbas","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qzss","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b1f4f45546def2664ca2ee7667b8fe23ed4539cfd8edba6b6f93bf09915e1a61","original_member_sha256":"daacb728659b141652fb097c21d93fe1c637dfd6fe5095d8417a2039f13bf59d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b58efa09da454a9c8dd0018339adef3b6e8e676c98b91ad687f87b491b4f0229","b5e84277e5475f6612b64dd39733cdf8bfa30e42abc41126ca1473bd8c6b3b6b","d35437faeadb5359531415bf32fde6c71c0f7ee03169f89c59634d200eeeed72","50791516b95a2bc02dc7b7d49808b59a6e524b52bac7591ac4a485e33608f251","c6ee909e0dff6dfeba4a21f1c4436968a820d8d447f2509e54a1d0f54e87d719","f85a4bf0c542514733c968b6bbb0e7c7c3c8f9e14b0d81cd8f6f2437fd20f20c","2c70c2b623db75f003dfaf34ec7de09122f7018045b535dce37f4b5c0efbc17d","f596e76c023cd409b99e8c7b045e55614aca7428af7ad86939def884ba292772","c47b76b451cdb581363e5d044add6626191a6ac4c28275e6b75d66919bf93f6f","a4086b7ab7d669605b20547db0f17af621368a9aa8a5b784f9c7b502ef861f01","e41905d2e9b0ad92c90be9fb7fd65d0719de049b1ec5f38584c31e4b1620f2d8","c9ea0e1ab606c6bdad52ccb3ac6ac566ee0d5410910937b2d840ce36ab925b04","50ebcafd99655aaaaa1f9db89174ac445c33c5050a257430e010390c4621c66f","80ba412dcd0c2038c6d74fa43b42cec75f918a6ce787da79c711e01ea2bb1303","f689ac5f717e7141b4e63dfcc8859a91b227938b555b66fa9c2e5834e6b1cc23","a169a39cfe39b7e591ed431d23dfd843c8564374e4549801c74c50edbde9ce41","e80d14afe1a4170fd5d07fdc92fea1c0e8cf2052fc1a912188bb3dfe16190c00","fce96c886e3d664db6ae7432be557eb3ed40bb3df2727a3d5c1988da582a8b6a","aa9fe300dcc877c8bc7d69d192a4de3c7180807ce6894a8b26645b6be718de01","d35437faeadb5359531415bf32fde6c71c0f7ee03169f89c59634d200eeeed72","5862c63406540de204c7edf4c35f31d63a0bcecdff96da3cc077e3ab3e1cfd53","5ef4c8c3442b87b48b274ff01a8e65d8e14d377912747cac9ebfdd38a9afeb2d","d377527a9a23d26df648914c75cb03b656f957e4985f76441d93386808653e97","d35437faeadb5359531415bf32fde6c71c0f7ee03169f89c59634d200eeeed72"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[72,95],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408215.zip::R2-2408215 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R18).docx:p72"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408215.zip::R2-2408215 Correction on UE capability of supporting NavIC in A-GNSS positioning (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"galileo","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"glonass","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bds","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"navic","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"However in the field description of GNSS-UTC-ModelSupport in A-GNSS-ProvideCapabilities, if UE supports NavIC, the mandatory support of model-2 GNSS-UTC-Model assistance data is missing.","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Change 1: Add model-8 in GNSS-AlmanacSupport, and add in field description that ‘if the target device supports NavIC and GNSS-Almanac assistance, it shall support Model-8’;","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Change 2: Add in field description of GNSS-UTC-ModelSupport that ‘if the target device supports NavIC and GNSS-UTC-Model assistance, it shall support Model-2’.","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SA, (NG)EN-DC, NE-DC, NR-DC","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A-GNSS positioning","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR while the network is not, network will not understand model-8 reported in GNSS-AlmanacSupport;","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to this CR while the UE is not, UE will report a UE capability that does not align with network’s understanding, which further leads to unwanted/not-supported assistance data provision to UE.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"b1f4f45546def2664ca2ee7667b8fe23ed4539cfd8edba6b6f93bf09915e1a61","original_member_sha256":"daacb728659b141652fb097c21d93fe1c637dfd6fe5095d8417a2039f13bf59d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b5e84277e5475f6612b64dd39733cdf8bfa30e42abc41126ca1473bd8c6b3b6b","d35437faeadb5359531415bf32fde6c71c0f7ee03169f89c59634d200eeeed72","50791516b95a2bc02dc7b7d49808b59a6e524b52bac7591ac4a485e33608f251","e38ea183661b762cb07312089bff19ae1fdf79b9547d01020780d489627fdb12","f85a4bf0c542514733c968b6bbb0e7c7c3c8f9e14b0d81cd8f6f2437fd20f20c","c6ee909e0dff6dfeba4a21f1c4436968a820d8d447f2509e54a1d0f54e87d719","f596e76c023cd409b99e8c7b045e55614aca7428af7ad86939def884ba292772","b58efa09da454a9c8dd0018339adef3b6e8e676c98b91ad687f87b491b4f0229","b4fe68c4429f0570981abff3cecfce960de03ae813aff0bec61d02d76b7650b4","79089ce67c7cfeab3f47d6283c2636e88ae8f826dfb466fc01f61764c95ddc00","047c09778610dea9770498271709cb444c4a907f68c2a64f57071bfb68a89c14","6eb56907e5bd598f20626b6c7c9ae45750366bfc2f551331fa2b66d48df47549","2ede60d9d14cf8f649ba6bb2384983d23a9f1f53bc8