{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Currently the UE behaviours for cell baring determination and cell reservation are speciifed in an inconsistent manner in TS38.331 and TS38.304 among different features.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Descriptions related to cell baring determination and cell reservation are aligned.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 3.1:","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is clarified the UE behaviour to determine NPN-only Cell, based on the field cellReservedForOtherUse, applies to IAB-MT and NCR-MT.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 5.2.2.4.1:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is clarified that IAB-MT and NCR-MT ignore the field cellBarred in MIB.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bafc6734adae569e1ad3c721e47e11cb1321697d08c6aef0bfd46c8849de8330","652b78d40d6d8776ba284bb2cfe71ae65d398959740b4039db699708931e79a4","6867a8cd5c4da36ead8c9bfc003258d34e1a2679ba8b6a69997b0e02244887c3","1dd64eefc4519e3a18f3ea9ffdb907413a026ad5fb3da6434fd3c7e8853a1df8","3ae0e9c7394f8619172294d89814a8dcd5bd5685c8a0bcba532f2a2b5e7d9d21","77309b1a5ba6af64d7ce83ee62d1c10547e713a3268be0fe8c09eff6d1b05571","8cb5450142546fcfedd2be082e67fa702bf8f7e572a273ad35c8c8466533ccda","e0b0cd927f49b8f7b85e8df2de97644637d13f21b9cb9dd5c0dee02c8a3d068c","3b44fdc67087b0fafc23558e80e5c787c3cad31a27bc65294a6d3319cdb73f0e","8908b0b9973ab7f01d72c1050df5c7307a1591069603b7029ef0ec62227a35da","45bbd76a52557ff21a0bc76672bbf14d4f9898d33c54b93bb3aa9b967785a879","37bb5b0a9c3eb5ec3d5a7d97342087b8133cd43aa6cdf3dadcd33bfa2db586bd","9f2d316e93182024f26d575ef8040103d402edacad03f29f51fc34a717e8ac2f","1597bcb796debf2f0549e23ef81e9438326bee9d3035590ec10619ce7390d934","6328ec15dc23a78f8ec88af1d6701a6c6fec674dc0fb0565c880d613b3702608","85d236fd4b9cb58d5157c5f7e10a3e0e61205d3ef458b7ddb94d7e97873a3857","6508a7214c2b2675bfee68fafcb7040c1c82cbcf2cd81d7f1585f614da9e0c5e","4f4e8c60015220e5e84582a6115c4e0311fd8e5f589ea6e58fda11282c226704","b7b3378ebfd6814ced09b8fd459778ea52c718270a236f0ad8f853fb941ab01b","ed2eb1a8e6392ea5db084b27a99cd583b2f8c6b5432c434ff23a4d594331c703","15606c301499405a60da5e5522b2fb4cf60dbe8913ea677d43ca812386b69480","388bfdf05d57e924296f5759efa67ea2e69d5d94ad6f880e741407901806e66c","1e571052eacb21016b625d1bdda94ebb7d8541da70844aca17c2567bb2c3a50f","08268e72782ce146c6288136b31bd5c1cd1a032dca834a9fae806d6ef3ab0074"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 5.2.2.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The description is aligned for the UE behaviour to determine whether cell reselection to another cell on the same frequency as barred cell is allowed or not (i.e. changed to the pointer to 38.304).","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NCR-MT behaviour is moved up in the section because there is no need of “per frequency band” checking of cell barring (unlike IAB-MT or mobile-MT which requires it).","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 5.2.2.5:","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The description is aligned for the UE behaviour to determine whether cell reselection to another cell on the same frequency as barred cell is allowed or not (i.e. changed to the pointer to 38.304).","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 6.3.2:","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Redundant (specified elsewhere) field descriptions for IAB-MT and NCR-MT are removed.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The specification will remain inconsistent with other specification.","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.1, 5.2.2.4.1, 5.2.2.4.2, 5.2.2.5, 6.3.2","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["92207f4bc0ea5009ea219f2b732cbd79b2f87f2ad5934808c1b678081cce7056","a5288aa300102a1247d7e38ebe936d4958ed6e45530e4dc76bf7c2f3f78f6e6f","731b0ee175d6682e069e6c2447f6f8b3a00cb21b31d59647b82a5746e5da276f","d38d940bcabf886f183ee5919ae3048d5455416880d273f574c15d7d077d94b0","6295f17c59d081756b470142d396dd864fe23c1c305d8e661e73d9e6b2bb10b9","8ff6ff19880716c61cfac2aa351d7e2a6845937e08b4c3ae2d832b828c1e00e8","0526ec132c9c18832eeba0b6d167b6882fa2d8d1e53b8e8c73c598f68e52bf1f","834dcf7cb832becf50da2855fb69942f9331c3d3fe5f639fb7db48575376830d","97be0ce1fc38c13c2f59ed1a9bedb551353b47879971a2b2ade3a75f94347f01","2bf5741ff0ec626d3e6354064d9dfb9a0364bbdfa01bd75a0bcb08a6f77084d6","369a51e2b12f97a6ee72ae27dc80b10781fb62b8e60820beeaa9a62449a088ab","caa1ae2a7d1c9b69d495ff9f3e131976453b5bf603673f8f3b5884cd5406b4fd","deacd9cada944d679b94ca803e943129d866688fa4f8054f3c58614df65b4355","087e5c759dea9e2965bf60adfdbfd220fca2af51266ac445f3f17471d3d1a7ca","00a60550767a37ca466af519941cd05757c57646848d3081ed5a510aba1e3d32","87c2c238202b4039f1beeaa77d009b9eac6287c07a14b5eae807e56eb5addc30","d354ee4291e4ef4fe0b0cbdce29c9ecc597bbaf1d360aab721f4308175bfd9c4","ce08079cdea4729a88dbf58