{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a fixed VSAT UE and the cellBarredFixedVSAT in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredFixedVSAT is not included in the acquired SIB1, or","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a mobile VSAT UE and the cellBarredMobileVSAT in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredMobileVSAT is not included in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the access is for ATG:","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running; and","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cellBarredATG in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredATG is not included in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is a RedCap UE and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the RedCap UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if intraFreqReselectionRedCap is not present in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredRedCap1Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE supports 1 Rx branch; or","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredRedCap2Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE supports 2 Rx branches; or","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present in the acquired SIB1 and the UE supports only half-duplex FDD operation:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells based on intraFreqReselectionRedCap as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is a 2Rx XR UE and is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the 2Rx XR UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cellBarred2RxXR is present in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["298857a86aae1b6325489ead38a3125cc6ca53f88f0dd2b2700d223a3ae64050","da06f21b6706f6afd73312caf119ae19ca13e610533442972a916d2797f45f80","238af43c2001badf7b7d688adb41319723d055e5ab7bd3cc9dea7f6ed99f1393","eeae44158c0e969440bcc6961faa6443193c31aaca2ce06b8021e2b657b4b2f7","59762df1bc69c4e8db5d5a176e23d62904a78890dcf2bb77e14bf3a4ea4d7090","39906bf0c43cbb4ff196792a8c5c5352b93156e8c75e06e15a8af2dc906984c2","a54c831ba224abba61ec6174940ffd210d6584183d0e5d49811815b8d85b9ebe","1439ca1113bbfcb3fff925029921fd66b9e46f0f4a1846d2a0fd565cb0d434fe","df01ddc3f1cfcbcb267afa94581622adf8f5ac65d3c2bea7ff1f5ab94f42e499","fa05ab4ab26bfe3f45dbc748acdef336fdb16081df6653ae3e9e40cf648e3ee9","aae7d88efac220f6b51cd1fe29f234b2199158a18e8ec24a7d2934128d9e0761","e9c549b08226d66fde89873d3bbca57d5ff66a95db0386794c77af6ca338ab18","80df4bcf0152a597ea17d44bd597907075bc31074210bb7843606646c7ed91db","dfc2449b914db2ef88f1e7a2781155e0d495b031cf81e4572980d3757e92c5e7","b413c0efc082d166f12a46edfd05a88693677b89a8ab104c79ed860819eae3f3","a379145120da0bc0c87d77a078561e0a3cd49a56266b81994983fe68c12f3bc1","7bd186d1b48beec1f1381332d4cefffb17451fb4e406b1fd74d4ed8e46c76e28","29b94496644cb902e3cbe9a0ba15d56dbe282534e56077109b2a20f5e0facacf","5fcf22cd27a58809396829cf7635b155519945f1b343ff3fe61b0023c6fbe9e2","cd20b89ea372c04711709735837b9132ffbfa8e8f5498e1eeaf20774a3062c4e","1adef530d940ffb93bdb3e58c45b5974dcd8c3356febfc21802ce77061faa575","b7099ed7887d226f49f1f4c5d270747bbf6819ccfab5b984e2ce525042929fe7","5dcfcaceb6a641d62a83c37a8eed9088d4537eb93c162d4a5d5df303f8a74d9b","e6d59e7e68ee55ed73e8f6