{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20] upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports nes-CellDTX-DRX and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE supporting nes-CellDTX-DRX is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if cellBarred in the acquired MIB is set to barred:","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if cellBarredNES is absent in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is an eRedCap UE and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the eRedCap UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if intraFreqReselection-eRedCap is not present in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarred-eRedCap1Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE supports 1 Rx branch; or","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarred-eRedCap2Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE supports 2 Rx branches; or","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present in the acquired SIB1 and the UE supports only half-duplex FDD operation:","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells based on intraFreqReselection-eRedCap as specified in TS 38.304 [20] upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is NCR-MT and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ncr-Support is not present in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry of a selected SNPN or PLMN and in case of PLMN the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb1