08369.docx:p240"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use npn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding entry of npn-IdentityInfoList containing the selected PLMN or SNPN;","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry with the PLMN-Identity of the selected PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use plmn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, trackingAreaList, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding PLMN-IdentityInfo containing the selected PLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE in RRC_INACTIVE is configured for feature(s) that it does not support in current serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>not use the corresponding configuration in current serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:The requirement above applies only to UE that indicates different support of UE capabilities for TN and NTN.","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>disregard the frequencyBandList, if received, while in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the received posSIB-MappingInfo to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a stored valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, that the UE requires to operate within the cell in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the stored version of the required SIB or posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the required SIB or posSIB requested by upper layer as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList or frequencyBandListAerial for downlink for TDD, or one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList or frequencyBandListAerial for uplink for FDD, and they are not downlink only bands, and","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is IAB-MT or wide area NCR-MT (see TS 38.106 [79]) or supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial for a supported band in the downlink for TDD, or a supported band in uplink for FDD, and","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], and TS 38.101-5 [75]) which","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in uplinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP or, for (e)RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured), and which","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP or, for (e)RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured, and","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e916ce12436c6aaa516069a0d471c735bfc5572235aedfdd630fa5423e4a0b86","81990e2c1ffecc9bb23e7f41ad84bb20e2c312a773ef29c60b5a4db14ba73a68","0768e73ea2b1ca945d6744246de4487a47cc4eb0367e5cec2f37a63bbf12c3fb","23b24b29157f4d0a3d2bae7849a921de0e3eeb6f3feb8840276fb05b0836fa8d","ab394f81f644dee04b064ec13e2a4fbc97124be04e9269dff6e5989a38b1d767","2d8e93477262869ff0fe721821c20834239921d33a4ab69f6d190d2e4c89f010","7aae6ef6349ce1d474918c490c80858313453e8a2f22174dc1fb616d63d80cdd","a08cb023c7d5f759ea084f4cdc4fb153d3c08cdad8c8912bcf8e299f125f8049","04585c8b5f555d706b795b8c8fdc2273f4375fc7c15ce8f48964b008302499c3","9aea31b798dc2a855cd98809199e29dba1198ee8e3c9da66a470a56bbc57e919","92a4ca370338694e52a3507b9845e918b0e2c6335ce43e25d12e6a26d447027d","be8f1e3dafc6474b741bf4075252093444dad664c8657832ccdf14c2d9f1b420","755eca78af8cc323c7e8372e1774d97a3661bc6373125e63a81d81a9cd0d2195","2b718efe86cec0e1e3f0fa792406eb9e77c74b57895908411e48334cad49f83e","5754a4d4d99aee0f55aef051be39c379bdefd3d5d27641319f0587a1e9d98610","519cd29c2a4baef8fed852e70395026c01c75d1547f26694e506debbe71248a3","0c86df9d6ffde38be8dae7cd57a4e3b236128c246f0d9edbf92aac58abf3bf29","aca26348c4380f4dad6687ac947cd26cca3ead8d81252b3198930e01f80b6f95","2d7b75d26caeef877be90ff7ea9ff6d157420f58cca7a5bf169dd1b24f4455ec","fdfe5ef83dcb201981c1dfeecd2a91cbfbbe92de9c6412e8fdc45a0e9cdd609f","