{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports a downlink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], and TS 38.101-5 [75]) which","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in downlinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial downlink BWP or, for (e)RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured), and which","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial downlink BWP or, for (e)RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured, and","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if frequencyShift7p5khz is present and the UE supports corresponding 7.5kHz frequency shift on this band; or frequencyShift7p5khz is not present, and","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is neither a RedCap nor an eRedCap UE, or for TDD if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE, or for FDD if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is present, or if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and the (e)RedCap UE supports full-duplex FDD operation on this band:","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if neither trackingAreaCode nor trackingAreaList is provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list:","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if UE is IAB-MT but not a mobile IAB-MT and if iab-Support is not provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list nor the selected SNPN nor the registered SNPN nor SNPN of the equivalent SNPN list:","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if UE is a mobile IAB-MT and if mobileIAB-Support is not provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list nor the selected SNPN nor the registered SNPN nor SNPN of the equivalent SNPN list:","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20], upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply a supported uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth indicated in uplinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP or, for (e)RedCap UEs, RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP, if configured, and which","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP for the uplink or, for a (e)RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply a supported downlink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- is contained within the carrierBandwidth indicated in downlinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial downlink BWP or, for (e)RedCap UEs, RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP, if configured, and which","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP for the downlink or, for a (e)RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one frequency band in the frequencyBandListAerial, for FDD from frequencyBandListAerial for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandListAerial for downlink, for which SIB1 includes nr-NS-PmaxListAerial and the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in the nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c4e704a792e4962c73e403a87adae5692cedff0fad87bb547d94dfe0635f2780","86c896c9c96181b22f7bfad04cdbc9f91a628d8542b68b5247d60e44a31997df","97fe998f70e68e9f714444874b5b965f44d1c909ad756375851624fbd3700403","3bf2506af32be4beada001ed828eb60feb88fe1458648c50b2ded36571adc79b","04a3e2b22dcef66715351a331dae82f7cd69e5ce7035221c322441396a7d4dbc","9e10c0d6d0833ae63b1b9c4bc8e37752d6908de3ee67d33126cd692208db9a96","60778d21566fdee8b1955242afd63b55a9751d04ff19e76c31f7b00742464fd4","90e5e0c4465837ed55fc33f4bbc3c4aa9a8106a130d8