{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandListAerial, for FDD from frequencyBandListAerial for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandListAerial for downlink, which the UE supports and for which SIB1 includes nr-NS-PmaxListAerial and the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in the nr-NS-PmaxListAerial;","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one frequency band in the frequencyBandListAerial, for FDD from frequencyBandListAerial for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandListAerial for downlink, for which SIB1 does not include nr-NS-PmaxListAerial and the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in the nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList for the same NR frequency band number:","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandListAerial, for FDD from frequencyBandListAerial for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandListAerial for downlink, which the UE supports and for which SIB1 does not include nr-NS-PmaxListAerial and the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in the nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList for the same NR frequency band number;","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList, for FDD from frequencyBandList for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandList for downlink, which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present, and for (e)RedCap UEs in FDD, if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present, for which the UE supports full-duplex FDD operation;","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is aerial UE and SIB1 includes nr-NS-PmaxListAerial for the selected frequency band within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD but the UE capable of nr-NS-PmaxListAerial does not support any of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in the nr-NS-PmaxListAerial for the selected frequency band:","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection, or intraFreqReselectionRedCap for RedCap UEs, or intraFreqReselection-eRedCap for eRedCap UEs, or intraFreqReselection2RxXR for 2Rx XR UEs is set to notAllowed, upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the received posSIB-MappingInfo to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the PLMN identity or SNPN identity or PNI-NPN identity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if in RRC_INACTIVE and the forwarded information does not trigger message transmission by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the serving cell does not belong to the configured ran-NotificationAreaInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate an RNA update as specified in 5.3.13.8;","paragraph_zero_based":327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if configured to receive MBS multicast in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if SIB24 is not scheduled in SIB1 in the new cell (i.e., different from the cell where the UE received multicast in RRC_CONNECTED) after cell selection or in the cell after cell reselection:","paragraph_zero_based":329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>initiate RRC connection resume procedure for multicast reception as specified in 5.3.13.1d;","paragraph_zero_based":330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ims-EmergencySupport to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the eCallOverIMS-Support to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the UAC-AccessCategory1-SelectionAssistanceInfo or UAC-AC1-SelectAssistInfo for the selected PLMN/SNPN to upper layers, if present and set to a, b or c;","paragraph_zero_based":333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is in SNPN access mode:","paragraph_zero_based":334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>forward the imsEmergencySupportForSNPN indicators with the corresponding SNPN identities to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["414844ab8bebe8cb7dd819bd60948e191412bda0a5981f5d2e5fda28d1f9b90e","88c0551a57a98ac6eace79b7890300237ea5ac6ff88bd9221a89ee671ee6df2f","4a23d0a8bae2b689582b6b1054820434969a150eb0091ef7b261af7585556801","9f0fe70f4e06379ea07c6b08e8a6208d7ab7056e7f944ea17aff38f8dafd5a7a","820b51412e1c9dc7b41442bf21e68119855d1424ed1213f6ea2d50df995e946a","7d5d52876a7b80b258d08b975413b08252fee719ecb209f8fa0cdc9a1eb8f167","9042d8495a2