{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the specified PCCH configuration defined in 9.1.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, that the UE requires to operate within the cell in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required SIB;","paragraph_zero_based":339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required posSIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if the UE has not stored a valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus in posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-BroadcastStatus of the type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, contain at least one requested posSIB for which posSI-BroadcastStatus in posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-BroadcastStatus of the type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is aerial UE and, for the selected frequency band, it supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission value indicated by nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD:","paragraph_zero_based":352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values indicated by nr-NS-PmaxListAerial for the selected frequency band within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within nr-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the additionalPmax for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max in uplinkConfigCommon for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["310c5b9180c12c86bf0f1b812cedad64a0b8e39bd04c8348b39f704230a1c4dc","d47d34219aa38697da590e49a965c4c48ea01ee2d6334b57d2f93d9b5e77d4e6","2f669f6df17484ca88f056db1ba84f7b4dd7ed1d5a4abb46b60daea08ea0d1cb","ecce5620873cffbf7478ffca96daafb8df73a790e17898e8e516223d9050b496","3dc9023800c98901aaf00329bc67e7ef03e07c648bb814209de7698b80fdc8ea","79e43ea18f0127a88a910bd559341759f4589dfafcf72a76d0d747176700c87d","771ad2007a270d4b21325981fcc5513e13514f24224f51265833de5218fcc95e","62749bcf2a933461186585628f6c65204ec4b8305372b17d681991dcc0b4a2c7","4d9df603dacaf5a6512612ce91420962618414e6079a1bdf9095eefc81a18576","5552ac52c691cafbe88b99e476ffec9d6067c8f757f3e5998472b01438e4fbc0","5d75c9eacb319b42f1ff1427013eab904b51820edf47196f069ca71ba750a3d7","f396057f1e9dba70f88dafde6dc4490301e81a1ffc67a12b2bcd16a450fd94f6","38c7b73c543966b75701f898c5cbf772b1bea56f3eeabac54a0366c23f82561d","0542308b68aaabc8838faa642a6e5c3c802027aa958d123ce2c1bbdd25adfb79","87b9bd78924b1c80fb069eacf2ccd8c9b28b4511fab3d32b8b06ff43832b23ed","0de27c5ea0f888e58beb881bc7aa860ca01df35f1e87b4bcd1e2287a99428264","0c40aa98745332b31e2c3e321072e493d8b8d707e2d4f0ef37818e85554b17ba","3a52457f4d50b7856aa6b004cdde7c2b70cb7f436b589ffa376f45c4ac711c67","f255b4be632fee87a9d804f1d0f5778b51a5401b23e8a0e98bf33069b138eca9","19d35503026438f073b1ffb142851a4b6d84539a4aaf8d63757ba273491b10e4","c2d0d0257d8b03b519266aef08ba44c490cf51e356167448d9e94e2df415ab81","bc438785091b3b4f22b9e87c1593f4630853365e13829f52de2116025a8076bd","37d304ad9cbb64025829f4a30b00d31ea8512e7b87fd2613e79ef2019a9de7d0","6f8a38e433e98ad8ba39180a8d944e18ab880d14da3045bf92bce0d16e20aa6a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[336,359],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx:p336"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if supplementaryUplink is present in servingCellConfigCommon; and","paragraph_zero_based":360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink; and","paragraph_zero_based":361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-NS-PmaxList for a supported supplementary uplink band; and","paragraph_zero_based":362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is neither a RedCap nor an eRedCap UE, or for TDD if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE, or for FDD if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is present, or if the UE is an (e)RedCap UE and the (e)RedCap UE supports full-duplex FDD operation on the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink; and","paragraph_zero_based":363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.101-2 [39]) which","paragraph_zero_based":364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP of the SUL:","paragraph_zero_based":366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider supplementary uplink as configured in the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present, and for (e)RedCap UEs in FDD, if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present, for which the UE supports full-duplex FDD operation;","paragraph_zero_based":368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply a supported supplementary uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP of the SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink;","paragraph_zero_based":372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within nr-NS-PmaxList for the supplementaryUplink:","paragraph_zero_based":373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For an out of coverage L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE receiving SIB1 from its connected L2 U2N Relay UE, it is up to Remote UE implementation whether to consider and apply the following parameters: frequencyBandList, carrierBandwidth, frequencyShift7p5khz, frequency band, channel bandwidth, the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon, the specified PCCH configuration, additionalSpectrumEmission, additionalPmax, and p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20]; and","paragraph_zero_based":379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection, or intraFreqReselectionRedCap for RedCap UEs, or intraFreqReselection-eRedCap for eRedCap UEs, or intraFreqReselection2RxXR for 2Rx XR UEs is set to notAllowed;","paragraph_zero_based":380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.5Essential system information missing","paragraph_zero_based":382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9fb50e1d5e8fa3ac0accecc4a934b65a2aa50dd49bcc421e42e4bb871346fde9","592112fd31e89f63c7cabf3062d4170bb004b8a9af1c3e6931d98ce8df6237d8","797eadf771b46115a71fded788fd27de1f26fe9769e56d9681c753dfc0542195","cb1a841909a324ed2e49d0af947c7e4a2270f1fc8ee93884de9702d12db59860","3034964a7e22222cb3fc71f5341a241758f143a2e1a4d664b4278b4c50e5cdc0","f68f973c61ee772361635c7b7ee6c93d5f6f39a7cfd3c9aa7475118c60d92e69","9b74cc5602c88699288b1711c4de77e7e35ac55f64e6f2acd8c72b0fc2b786e2","179215484b0eca745611f5d8c04d8f9a64d37f659ff4e999ff7cf55cdf96875e","dc93af16544b29fa610f744a591a7265188a1e9b04c49875e09f88ccccbcbeec","4884d7132beab7b30c0b1f18f054f185c9d90fde823151c8d7fff5631133b5f6","4268bdd6c466234c44b0fc2a6b36746f620bf012d4f5c2c29e067cc5dfdfda89","8758021d949cafca62a957a5bf35391baba361859b4d4b534907c23fffd65960","ebbc81e1e6d896218d8025ae493b81f8d283a223ba128b7690d15a28ec834307","3fd8a73aa2a00fffe4f4419b7c5af9fba7ebcbfe356d78e37495bd4ef1b4b12c","a81dbcbe8e25e25a7ee03754dfe3f3674d4e57fc7771048ea2a3cd6166406a3f","084fdfebf99f24dfea7ed50998f6dbfa36f7b131be2e457376f4395c75ab5547","1b800482460920e28105e211778a5a8e23cd5394b4f39ace519349c430d20e7e","954c3d7aac4b557a9e00c1d83df966657005dfdb66b9d1659690583ef18a73ca","20952ce075ab865c76a99230410d6234027d9ae4628bbed385181029bb97aa96","5df4dc09c797576f26ea7c8f94183a4559b99b60c25f2e264bf5da7f26a9a5ca","10b00878e71e18622c060d60d524c4cfbfb4c7337ca65d886fc668844200f064","a13bc7ac6da10d008dd89dc313876efae75647dfae8a82bb12d4b6b7199957ab","081e2923d2859d8799757bea9552d27e8c06ddf7ef4d0eb5bbb8c7b42f20167c","71b3e713441440150135e46f97b8f073baae12c21dcb3ca501b475ca981ed947"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[360,383],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx:p360"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is unable to acquire the MIB or SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The SIB19 is essential for NTN access. If UE is unable to acquire the SIB19 for NTN access, the action is up to UE implementation (e.g., cell re-selection to other cells).","paragraph_zero_based":398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2: The SIB22 is essential for ATG access. If UE is unable to acquire the SIB22 for ATG access, the action is up to UE implementation (e.g., cell re-selection to other cells).","paragraph_zero_based":399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.3.2Radio resource control information elements","paragraph_zero_based":402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CellAccessRelatedInfo","paragraph_zero_based":403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CellAccessRelatedInfo indicates cell access related information for this cell.","paragraph_zero_based":404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CellAccessRelatedInfo information element","paragraph_zero_based":405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CELLACCESSRELATEDINFO-START","paragraph_zero_based":407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6cbf7db5c33a2b9daffe19ef18cb74e635269d096d554807ca7f881767be3245","d2cfbf1b76de39ef335e5f6e3bdb7c2e14fbf855dbaac800c3fe718ccb0e3303","0f88bdb5351c7f492d5cbfe515b50c5e8eab63d9b4153ae614630bb16dcaee3b","a35cfbf0ee95f420945be8e7da496d46f5e959d0242efdd8c8de8c49c83b3bf9","f86b0acf4d6433138eae2e255f5ae592550007d48f43717442c0a019c83907c1","317334f8ccddeeffeaa52ffd7733f2c3518753136deef64f68b0cbf3239ea52a","6a61ad66eb8466a2deb94387844e64bed662b0d076a1d8875061d82630c3f31f","ee2e0a40dbe2964bf980ea6ace9dbe298901e459a6fc5c06a900c761d58732d5","9c8151c312a07606a70e01f4f7f8769669a3dbe089d9d3409df2963a872597b1","620f3d2a7a229d9c7f06346dfed0a811f2ecbe91a9936c953cc556492dcc47cf","4bed0832670e647b9ff853636d1d124d0cd80399f91527fe329ba5902c458064","a361b0d7fe103bee1f00b205063142e631fe305a0c8364c3106700f253887eab","3c2c36230da9303c23c5325a6ec299bedca52c1a1a233ac43eb20a596197fa57","5955575dff06f9cde630d6895c90ba2842e5996ce78ad895cfdc4da68102090a","f337043217734e637a48feeaa4e0fe2048385d85079c2aa0963b87ee7f9d5b14","b086fd72931af83b642cb0ae0fad117e64ca655c06f877d953e6448f9f249d95","72ae6cfc70