{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408369.zip::R2-2408369.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mobileIAB-Support-r18            ENUMERATED {true}                                           OPTIONAL        -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NPN-IDENTITYINFOLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfoList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"iab-Support","paragraph_zero_based":489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field combines both the support of IAB and the cell status for IAB. If the field is present, the cell supports IAB and the cell is also considered as a candidate for cell (re)selection for IAB-nodes; if the field is absent, the cell does not support IAB and/or the cell is barred for IAB-node. This field is absent if mobileIAB-Cell is broadcasted in the cell.","paragraph_zero_based":490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-ID-Length","paragraph_zero_based":491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the length of the gNB ID out of the 36-bit long cellIdentity. This field is always present if the mobileIAB-Support is broadcasted.","paragraph_zero_based":492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mobileIAB-Support","paragraph_zero_based":493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the support of mobile IAB and whether the cell can be considered as a candidate for cell (re)selection for mobile IAB-node. This field is absent if mobileIAB-Cell is broadcasted in the cell. If the field is absent, the cell is barred for mobile IAB-node.","paragraph_zero_based":494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfo","paragraph_zero_based":495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The NPN-IdentityInfo contains one or more NPN identities and additional information associated with those NPNs. Only the same type of NPNs (either SNPNs or PNI-NPNs) can be listed in a NPN-IdentityInfo element.","paragraph_zero_based":496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"npn-IdentityList","paragraph_zero_based":497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The npn-IdentityList contains one or more NPN Identity elements.","paragraph_zero_based":498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trackingAreaCode","paragraph_zero_based":499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the Tracking Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. ","paragraph_zero_based":500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ranac","paragraph_zero_based":501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the RAN Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. ","paragraph_zero_based":502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellReservedForOperatorUse","paragraph_zero_based":503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d66ee83a11e596eb14b64f5886ad9a1363953496b37c5b7ad109af3e6b319447","original_member_sha256":"c496036bf0449256be5ad57c73f5bba9639937fda10ca8d81b5a96b75aefbfc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["38d273cb1a4f20e3bb1b26354ca41970b7ed8275bdf3afc906f40bc284dfdc2b","94b712e99c8577a5f300248802b7c1e4f14e7f77fdf13142b04feccff5e8ceec","179a981e7b7ba661edfd7c9e430dfd285cf59faaa5e0d0cff445f7352b788c71","85101efd0d0a46fb445c8430ef461fc58bd245a4a8f6bf287b059e03a80b57d7","82e59b4b1704e533a8c45e1d4be618b5d7cfd5dba2afb33ac3acc7fdcc6e7702","626f8efcddaf936377b264fdf1cc13b8d8ae1a658277abcbfd42e0c606e43000","2db5ec9b3b86de