{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408370.zip::R2-2408370.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Currently the UE behaviours for cell baring determination and cell reservation are speciifed in an inconsistent manner in TS38.331 and TS38.304 among different features.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTEs for IAB-MT and NCR-MT are removed, and corresponding normative procedural text is added.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Redundant descriptions (already clear in 38.331) on cell barring determination for NES, NTN, Half-duplex RedCap, ATG, VSAT, 2Rx XR. (e)RedCap, were removed.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Destriptions on cell reservation is split into two cases.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For non-IAB-MT/non-NCR-MT UEs","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NPN-capable IAB-MT/NCR-MT","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ceb2fed5ac41aa5a70361f6c6857a182e415c356d359a9f953135cf514892f5a","original_member_sha256":"315f0f255b36340f21e8203b9b979c7ecc29e421ee45b443dd903b4e229dd079","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7419f4d9ef80d74ede0285ab060d05a855f2f1e2927fb0ff76d9b350b554906f","74a4af8497604e82c5fd1a04f16400dc76d33b5d129f8e323248cf3a8341cdd7","4603d78ec2e100038563e0b231c3679955da00f6c7b62e16ac22ca04fe02e673","53d73a4466febf972e40fd8cb91b7fd472ad48e21e8c95239aa15352ad0c6577","0fe8552c94c4a441046fdc00dbb519f4be035cb8ff528325e5b18ee24629a644","2fdec87b5c5a9dac76b3d551d46356230bf443a94e1e10c1a73a16dae26c9f2c","f31f2f49295acd1f2f5447b8830efa77c5cd2dc27db4b1dc66e42c4fe58ad759","85234e4898355b61e568160f2c4236658983cde7f0dd5340897bffc742cc8765","8579117dc055216a85d634a9770e3f25e88ba38e68c88c9c8f0f849770fd0f2e","0ecf94618072777610b94e2b5893581804ef771926f38c949170059329281e04","8f2fa9f740aa2caf37aa9600ca6bb4b9099287b0593105211419100e4ad1bfca","0b49d996a9f7830a9e2395aa19362ec501bde07c212a4a90be8e031f75654f0b","e893cf605b72defaded33c8c2ddf7d3b4b8f1f5fbbaa45bf8dcc9f4c8416fea1","0cd69737a1aa70267fe624e7b4a8521e5bf68302ea39da3aafb36b71861adf63","b005976f0f9f0e7f805857951