nored by UEs supporting NTN while cellBarredNTN is included in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredATG (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to ATG UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarred2RxXR (IE type: \"barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to 2Rx XR UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ceb2fed5ac41aa5a70361f6c6857a182e415c356d359a9f953135cf514892f5a","original_member_sha256":"315f0f255b36340f21e8203b9b979c7ecc29e421ee45b443dd903b4e229dd079","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c3038af8a0b9662deaffe86ce7d1888e5af4fb15d3feae3533ba62a4222c3461","a296c74f06c4cf24ec992bba0689f9374652e8b47874cbb6490374c0bdec0671","2b06aef5b000f2b71d918088d134505324d050fb4664d938d73f9ebcbb636ece","761d9c3331a8e8240d5be7d1ae7a1b03e7a9893aed2bad34e415f370ddd3c39c","919dde5e871d6f7f7b3841795a5556f928d372a7d7e1e4e145d1786bdf41e114","ed3cfbd5ec95238568c37e09bfea45951c2efc24162ffacec12f73062f56d116","442c862d92e3302fe357752ca71f0ad79eecb22d2ef09410c06e0f54fe9c22a3","78f53779e294dd296c8912acdb513e7c956adfd16f90bc93682e452c7e0f1787","ce3524052d473c9e9400ad2455c1e0732d76763587c68c9b64e911a9ffd33109","af68d45522b430c54c18beefe8a4752d245d082b27d2d574158718669a6b26fa","0edb397af3e785f3805d81889022a082bec661df6d68578c8f37f71c2412844f","ebab530605aa048ab921851d3e6ca07ffa3b60f44312a1b1a47958a5b4fbd439","58e67f5adb33811089b1d120f071d92506e96fb12478d7a370627339f7f5d658","d026e492c70d1127afda9a50d72d6aeb943bdb845edbb2cdd274c58bb1c7e213","cc0d62ab39520548869a9f129a5e732e273cf71ea69f71fce0f183da18940db1","14fa9869ae1d8af4fa959f9f61d20035490749438df9fc06e0994cb7f86a66de","ed8d39634663cb3cb07d1d0f1a8c28fbd6c080a3ef5760e2437a75aae8a51903","0bcba927bc480389429141d3ede4001b282dd96f7a094c8d0570cfeabc8244c8","ce026eb9a41ba742299347345a8e42e65816fc9525cf371c6703d27a6de05042","e6706c862c1bca91b8e23cf1ca6ecb8199e2ba69c04c4fecd651f48e97e026ab","8da2500b649db38599d73ba3fed43047e9fdf461c3bb287bc59b80113f38c846","b610213d8d8257060296a8d41822dddcb932ae537df49881c59d4eb2b8a5f5bd","b2c20bacdf3e48efba1d6e9a12747aa9357a06ae4fad1ac4cdb8e858146a028e","9f407b2e251a38801b07d00eced73b79b2e84c71b89d7fb8393c0d3b6d640d4e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408370.zip::R2-2408370.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408370.zip::R2-2408370.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarred-eRedCap1Rx (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarred-eRedCap2Rx (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredFixedVSAT (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs. This field is only applicable to VSAT UEs using NTN access.","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredMobileVSAT (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs. This field is only applicable to VSAT UEs using NTN access.","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredNES (IE type: \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to UEs indicating any of the values in nes-CellDTX-DRX as specified in TS 38.306 [24].","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredNTN (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs. This field is ignored if the UE does not support NTN access.","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredRedCap1Rx (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to RedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellBarredRedCap2Rx (IE type: \"barred\" or \"not barred\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to RedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellReservedForOperatorUse (IE type: \"reserved\" or \"not reserved\") Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is specified per PLMN or per SNPN.","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellReservedForOtherUse (IE type: \"true\") Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellReservedForFutureUse (IE type: \"true\") Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs.","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-halfDuplexRedCapAllowed (IE type: \"true\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs. This field is only applicable to (e)RedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-iab-Support (IE type: \"true\")Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is specified per PLMN or per SNPN.","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-ncr-Support (IE type: \"true\")","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is common for all PLMNs and NPNs.","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-mobileIAB-Support (IE type: \"true\")","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicated in SIB1 message. In case of multiple PLMNs or NPNs indicated in SIB1, this field is specified per PLMN or per SNPN.","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ceb2fed5ac41aa5a70361f6c6857a182e415c356d359a9f953135cf514892f5a","original_member_sha256":"315f0f255b36340f21e8203b9b979c7ecc29e421ee45b443dd903b4e229dd079","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6bb7214325efb4f262850db51935b1f960c50942d0b4f7a653d889a66332dc88","b8adb100f3126cb56fefbbcd8334bc3bfa1271fdc792e22fb75de34c79395d24","6ea5fad1a35bc1d3f0dc429fd618f586cf5e3821cfc86b83479da403ae7dc696","97de6228354619e6b43b3d57dfa4ad9ca4908da8a284fe45441ffa1f53c76d28","a317ea9576364bbdabc0dfd082cad47c20120b0620194e0204677dac2cc6a2a0","53eab728ad2f9b4f99f24facbef513c5e63f05c1514ae42f41c131d2e56f4b11","73755ac4e15dd67f3f8a727e12786d0d958fadaf6e4d86a23a335a9b8d3e3319","9a95221ac0dc68f277108912e6e518d2e2c3416d50ff57f5ee19068735410ba2","fb1c24cd77b195c10546561af48cf9efbfac916f4214bf7d49cfd13cedc8a69a","d394568e2a29f4438b1619344b41ca0dd7e4bff7169336184270992ad4920949","2fb919481b8b5c54937cd0d88d63ed96c43b943b00de2a6d3a868b0a490028ad","a16286c440965cdb13456c8188806cd2d657a8d92a01884acaa0d54ef02a85cf","cf838f9de37a4ca0e090a335eb57277ee905419f5524f191920a10b89d4c11e3","b8bcdd8eeb5203033296d6a42