{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408370.zip::R2-2408370.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the cell is to be treated as if the cell status is \"barred\" due to being unable to acquire the SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE may exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for up to 300 seconds;","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-else:","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE shall exclude the barred cell as a candidate for cell selection/reselection for 300 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell selection of another cell may also include a change of RAT.","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If barring of a cell is triggered by the condition of trackingAreaCode and trackingAreaList not being provided, as specified in TS 38.331 [3], the barring only applies to this PLMN and the UE can re-evaluate the barring condition again due to selection of another PLMN.","paragraph_zero_based":245}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ceb2fed5ac41aa5a70361f6c6857a182e415c356d359a9f953135cf514892f5a","original_member_sha256":"315f0f255b36340f21e8203b9b979c7ecc29e421ee45b443dd903b4e229dd079","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2caa70477925dd76a11750660ceafc76fd6ee7cd7430377eb88d20692da9c791","c54ecda52d796d4ecdf47a00c9ee2ad9aa6b6b8778feb27c80dda9492c75b8f3","d1c0eef41422f8bf467063fcb10ba0916d86b00cc66b86b26afba838bcd58e05","48b65d02641516cacd76d79245f95b1a536ebdcef7b220d742dcf47993f1e9d7","1339d0c6c61555f147658d288a6248ade5ed9160c446a780050b0980167362bd","27cb10920230c9d4ffb2411085126e828e8b767dc382117b9996e12123afb740"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[240,245],"projection":"All w: