{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408387.zip::R2-2408387 - CR_Correction on NES field descriptions.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In the field description of powerOffset the “indicated by nzp-CSI-RS-resources” is incorrect as there is no such field. The correct description is “the resource set for channel measurement associated with the CSI-ReportConfig” similar to other field descriptions like in the description of nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceList.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field reportSubConfigParams indicates parameters, not resources since for Type-1 SD, a1-parameters does not indicate “resources”only for Type-2 SD does a2-parameters indicated “resources”","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field description of powerOffset the “indicated by nzp-CSI-RS-resources” is replaced by “the resource set for channel measurement associated with the CSI-ReportConfig”","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field description of reportSubConfigParams is updated to state the field indicates parameters, not resources. ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cf905337742c9f19496d5c85a2bc3ca156a35a8b1e77067904260ae404f7b0e1","original_member_sha256":"ec23412413a4460feb833f742d1419bbd28ea8915314355a29d962fd6d7655ac","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["34ce36488e535d1fa423c1915dcd2da992128a9f5b0084d11249fe1bc49ce1e2","0c34c8dbb43be8df80d0ad039edccb1aa3f9697d5ca943b58ba4f6b235e51c3c","c90de816b19111757902e6dfeff5f28160dfcdb2b617fc7e2a08d905dec606c1","90023f7e8ffc2af7105aa6a2707a42b6cb609a9e00875c6c5b3271f41a2506a0","eab45b631198354eae36848a25709261e984ff9784b7a9764059f3437fcbe032","841802a04932c5e2d368c5e2e3c4c0f64e17123c34bf9f299d5fc7ecdbba6639","b12d3af8fe6feee63dfb1a047b013348be161018a053abc5c008f8f69cb330bc","11d8c787a261cecfe6ba4f05c9054cce450c7368ebf280a4cbe59ae2c43f6d47","2cd33609d2411b0396400206d2e38b602da2c565093b2dfef04bc31ba5007ab0","388a5daeea7ea0e378e2758ee32e22cbeea2f1c4b5b7e3d4e5f16985ce084e