{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408468.zip::R2-2408468 (Rel-18) Correction on HARQ process.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Start of Change>","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.2.2HARQ process","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When a transmission takes place for the HARQ process, one or two (in case of downlink spatial multiplexing) TBs and the associated HARQ information are received from the HARQ entity.","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each received TB and associated HARQ information, the HARQ process shall:","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the NDI, when provided, has been toggled compared to the value of the previous received transmission corresponding to this TB; or","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is equal to the broadcast process, and this is the first received transmission for the TB according to the system information schedule indicated by RRC; or","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a MCCH-RNTI for MBS broadcast, and this is the first received transmission for the TB according to the broadcast MCCH schedule indicated by RRC; or","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a Multicast MCCH-RNTI for MBS multicast in RRC_INACTIVE, and this is the first received transmission for the TB according to the multicast MCCH schedule indicated by RRC; or","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a G-RNTI for MBS broadcast, and this is the first received transmission for the TB according to the MTCH schedule indicated by RRC or according to the scheduling indicated by DCI as specified in TS 38.214 [7]; or","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if this is the very first received transmission for this TB (i.e. there is no previous NDI for this TB):","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider this transmission to be a new transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider this transmission to be a retransmission.","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity then shall:","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if this is a new transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>attempt to decode the received data.","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if this is a retransmission:","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the data for this TB has not yet been successfully decoded:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d9500d743df528eaa6f79c82b73858ab5f893a44b9ae1866383034da0664ebbb","original_member_sha256":"93f0ae5e95c15dbf3441eef6a21cff070c81046db872fa11f765b60ddcf4ca20","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6133f18a31e39bf93b16a1c380c5bfcd3c1d691910abc60d76642d0154c95c63","ece38a2374c830d82051d1cf403ecfe4654edd08d94579c25b457fbbc967eefd","4600bcf7134b48100c0cb4fa87139504714338ae2fd685084f465d054e3fecea","cf4a077e60773b58ada16f64d761c296dbff060bf87a024b73eafe7eff7629ef","d02e8cbd697ae1810074c3012247d88e70339f7889a7482c352e21eca4a8f878","5e6e78c509901ae3936d881dd0c9b12c94a02c1a5b9226ba72b61bcdd6bc46b1","30ada0bedb15c5e794b9260edf5bf2f726bf479d8ff9d0e92d421dafefded0b0","0988c6306ca5a47b7e72e28a084b11844807bc53b6ea586865f643114f96e1ef","a927056a473f7b88e794a7a20482e1609e5fc3f4f34edc9dee1356592a424006","bc7823f0ce6c8e60c24a156beefc7e744240fa223612a89fa3d165526a3d804e","7dfed3c91202cb5a039f8b0e63106bc8d040df2efdb332055ad015d150694bdf","a66d79d5601351105a9686edd6f9f4e3831e3f54e5053129dd694504f37a3f94","996acbad65eaaaae205a6112e7c9aae00146e64ad31f84922cb72eced308bf05","8ef075752297027a2a66105cf4d537b20086cee77fb29d8130ecad49473b0f5f","4669ffa1477af7c3dd1fa075565910d54d2fc76c3c1f8e60655d0d4db6c553b1","93c76f6e2a28e04f310e67b2e026b1e6c32f05398f33dec256051c5838a24c82","3ce6ebfd60e99f34fabd5e1237b400b80ec308bd8145f3a54b8f2b15b0cf1f9c","e1d07f0fdcf63b66853f6cdcfae38b3af4a422140133cc32fcb0d5d599229050","2b0aa3cddc1ab9634efc97e83195eb6537cb278f8145140a0c58252b2f0b88d5","92d20e528a6007479b63f586e593744bdf4c77c5db1f6d075eb010f91b818247","b9234c9fd869315a68df9f58902ef54f18e83504c5589211e878b8ec7c5925c1","8b1e422d765fe97084972afa9810193e1789c3addfbb72d7ed6bf1d4664c9f17","461aa90ef5eb409c9d69a2392cf4b84e501eecc59e49d3cfcff39f07dd24185f","ba40983858269acbff2abb3643a7d09601fecdb806970f23b7ffb2b6022f7575"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408468.zip::R2-2408468 (Rel-18) Correction on HARQ process.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408468.zip::R2-2408468 (Rel-18) Correction on HARQ process.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the physical layer to combine the received data with the data currently in the soft buffer for this TB and attempt to decode the combined data.","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the data which the MAC entity attempted to decode was successfully decoded for this TB; or","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the data for this TB was successfully decoded before:","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the HARQ process is equal to the broadcast process:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>deliver the decoded MAC PDU to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if this is the first successful decoding of the data for this TB:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>deliver the decoded MAC PDU to the disassembly and demultiplexing entity.","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the physical layer to replace the data in the soft buffer for this TB with the data which the MAC entity attempted to decode.","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a Temporary C-RNTI and the Contention Resolution is not yet successful (see clause 5.1.5); or","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a MSGB-RNTI and the Random Access procedure is not yet successfully completed (see clause 5.1.4a); or","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is equal to the broadcast process; or","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a MCCH-RNTI or a G-RNTI for MBS broadcast; or","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a Multicast MCCH-RNTI for MBS multicast; or","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a G-RNTI or a G-CS-RNTI or a configured downlink assignment for MBS multicast and HARQ feedback is disabled for this G-RNTI or G-CS-RNTI or the corresponding G-CS-RNTI, as specified in clause 18 of TS 38.213 [6]; or","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the HARQ process is associated with a transmission indicated with a G-RNTI or a G-CS-RNTI or a configured downlink assignment for MBS multicast and NACK only HARQ feedback is used for this G-RNTI or G-CS-RNTI or the corresponding G-CS-RNTI and the data for this TB is successfully decoded and the transmission is not the first transmission of PDSCH where the configured downlink assignment was (re-)initialised; or","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the timeAlignmentTimer, associated with the TAG containing the Serving Cell on which the HARQ feedback is to be transmitted, is stopped or expired, and the Serving Cell is not configured with two TAGs, and if the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if configured, is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the Serving Cell on which the HARQ feedback is to be transmitted is configured with two TAGs and if the timeAlignmentTimer of the TAG, associated with the TCI state(s) used for transmitting the HARQ feedback, is stopped or expired:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>not instruct the physical layer to generate acknowledgement(s) of the data in this TB.","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the HARQ process is configured with disabled HARQ feedback and is not associated with a transmission indicated with a G-RNTI or a G-CS-RNTI or a configured downlink assignment for MBS multicast:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if harq-FeedbackEnablingforSPSactive is configured with value true and the transmission is the first transmission on the configured downlink assignment after activation of the configured downlink assignment:","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the physical layer to generate acknowledgement(s) of the data in this TB.","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>not instruct the physical layer to generate acknowledgement(s) of the data in this TB.","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d9500d743df528eaa6f79c82b73858ab5f893a44b9ae1866383034da0664ebbb","original_member_sha256":"93f0ae5e95c15dbf3441eef6a21cff070c81046db872fa11f765b60ddcf4ca20","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f4a1e9045ebc48e43a5dd79f8482a689264c0a11beacb4274a25a384b1674a6a","4256600d8c3ac2151a87684ce7fa68d4115ef306a2ed5da325955c0dceaa0101","1d458991996a62ce73742c69e990378a5a1867bc6178507b9be0446684d6da15","42d7e4d74259f6270abe824428bcb8fa6876547af94e9b0cd3668981564347dc","776b6494906a00c64706b34e67baa06880589a00749f6c197a7d59519a868eba","f31223515d4e045be04f6183785da30b07e181b8435778dbc33add01b946431d","447c78795b0d5f45877c0ccd141221f86938232f01095f07d998afb16d18d22e","59f4dd7d8b3011f22bdeb720741143cc9be71248733d28b3e8f1622cb08f6289","1c0bb4a8427fcb6e770c93c5045fe5588d07af3a29eb948b28edf8bed2114034","f420b9ec8d60031a7b07257d00bdcc5129bcd219cca8c63b8b5ca0a68234c5a6","a9d54f2f739cdb7d10057b7dca10a875eb7a53f5f34afc919faa6531fd8b54d2","b52938ffc287747d0dabb4dd64cfb97dc046f8d441dd632c710deb8de095dee8","4a2577cde547eaa8998a9a1862d51aeeddec26088192a1995e8a07b52d3e49db","d1eaf70373be43df27b9a5fceeaaac6b701c64736ddbcbf1573686bc1f09ac4d","7a252cb58431580618283db2b5a0c6add84b12273032be0b22405828cfb3044e","13d9b877f4dd23d2f82cfbc070243180681a8e7bd56527d3cb1ed45d3b00d637","07d52ce2850765f52f3a5a35f449c39eab35068ef2c26227dec03f4f1ef73e80","cc8d8d2bf2d91ff8c2a7fb8ae602151efa2d4b295412dc52df0a118b335515a7","0774363c5ddeb676e58648f8ac80e66ef4e24f40667dadce375dc1226147d183","82e934570a0a25bfe252e771eddccca684ce7bbe1b64194528c3a413d7017c85","3c29039afb130b7f48a78e240b6bea06f45c8aca326c0de87a75c0b8acb278e1","22d2b1f213ff78186edd5de5baec4d5c92049b0cdfc7cc00d7231d2ca34be6ba","f9f450ac4b8e2f81277aee5c01a7035ecc69107ebea6a57957bbd9659563d3e7","38b281124dce52a641677ae291dce05acf603c316c9e3d9ddf357ae32b77d358"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408468.zip::R2-2408468 (Rel-18) Correction on HARQ process.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408468.zip::R2-2408468 (Rel-18) Correction on HARQ process.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the physical layer to generate acknowledgement(s) of the data in this TB.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall ignore NDI received in all downlink assignments on PDCCH for its Temporary C-RNTI when determining if NDI on PDCCH for its C-RNTI has been toggled compared to the value in the previous transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:If the MAC entity receives a retransmission with a TB size different from the last TB size signalled for this TB, the UE behavior is left up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<End of Change>","paragraph_zero_based":172}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d9500d743df528eaa6f79c82b73858ab5f893a44b9ae1866383034da0664ebbb","original_member_sha256":"93f0ae5e95c15dbf3441eef6a21cff070c81046db872fa11f765b60ddcf4ca20","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4bc3634dad4c895568e165d9d2d9e6a22c3fb8c91519b2d2843f4af332ad86ef","80d4e125ef5ae713d038387b9a6c80897174405b77cb4f18ef336bc8df9e8583","180793981f7b9694fd7d9cfe7bc3494acc2d35c4565a272b439d9a3db1cde755","9197aaee5e4c0a273212bd58951278a13662a0a07b3cc10e7509006e7b19ae71","a9869e9372e1228549931c83c6788132c3cfbaf0439b896860c99dafe5f913fc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,172],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408468.zip::R2-2408468 (Rel-18) Correction on HARQ process.docx:p168"}
