le paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3bc04a55600a248d1895aede2a7b470e362bab537658b3360c340ab780e90b9b","original_member_sha256":"bc45667859fcb4c9d22b4980ef357233deb5243944ef156ddbd4d75489ba8acf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cd82451905aceaa481b4f1ecf1cf654ddb9092192e4acb6d9d25cc30604a46b4","bd9e1de26fb0a20e34f20600ac72bf97e9ebff144246ef46e6983a3ace5fcba1","14945f0104ef9ea7fb4c8d2c91f107b2f4e806099af743e41bc3eb072a850101","35cc1567e9ab284e5e441f9e5b00228ab0e2e7ad82e31aa033a7634b2d04d587","8f06b581597d654ac7f85ac15fbdb5f616d1b313e89bdb2eebf5112a7c057694","f343c617f89052a0392b649d445eee73fb414f32f3cb27bacba07de4814dc02a","1e929e1562d4a2eb1b5b79f13299eba4a9288c6dcc2b2d28ed7047f6372e97a2","4814628fdf44f61a833590ffb87e8a9ca477a42e24a25a63fd036f56108801c0","53c76b6e24d385c4ce1fea6fbf0fb5fedbdbdce2231ac44641d6307e7a4821b4","5ed48ed58b5e9a57a52d448dffbac718aeb674e9a4410be0d065a84afb11c0c6","e95c88ce3df5a5a8f2bf6c18af348684cbdba7fe46488e2b0eea664436d8bdd9","d75dedceec587dc49c373dbc5d298240a9350b9d2b578120ad4889a00121a687","cf94917e483fbfa5c7fd7b6b41481f2c432667628fb74e1361f70f341231968c","c5afd8bc8db9ba9486019515d4411ff97fc2a13fc06e000c62c9222469a783b1","2e8f35efad776b5a46f678801b68b9e4f378ad973a01a5a86b3ec7ec085caa2e","e347524ae1f426e557097ce0f2765db95501c64712e6cd69ce0f70bd414276d1","11736bbb66b6f9b9c5a9c45e55158ba41c98e4626c13ca06dab3446f0587eeac","4f51e3f47331e84ee8389a58119422434baeb4ca50bc5d5e6451fcd8479fc95e","e90b1215cb9951f579d92db1248f1c01258e1dc2717447f7bdf5e4ba04f8a131","d14439bfa865db145ddee2ed92c4347c581f3626bead30bbacf9738650ff1e3b","9370e825cd45c10bce73a3c8ba43fa37a902c661db38bad2be54e4cf56228845","1ee80140e27ecd2ce428dd17b408b1a9eb093ef0e71660dfd22bbee547be7db9","9663e759de8458ac43062ea138f70e81dbd7d8264b65541a17f2f892b927024a","3077c7c8adb9d7f8780fe98e3822436e0d87571a22b8f803ce4d2a75f94fae2f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408475.zip::R2-2408475-Introduction of new capability for intra-band EN-DC channel spacing(38.306).docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408475.zip::R2-2408475-Introduction of new capability for intra-band EN-DC channel spacing(38.306).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In current spec, the contiguity capabiltiy for intra-band EN-DC can be indicated as ‘contiguous’, ‘non-contiguous’ and ‘both’ separately. According to RAN4 LS R4-2410693, a new capability to support intra-band non-contiguous (NG)EN-DC with nominal channel spacing is introduced. The applicable requirement of the new capability is defined in clause 5.4B.1 in the TS 38.101-3.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Introduce a new per-BC capability to support intra-band non-contiguous (NG)EN-DC with nominal channel spacing. The UE indicating support of the new capability shall indicate support of “non-contiguous” in at least one among intrabandENDC-Support/intrabandENDC-SupportUL/intrabandENDC-Support-DL-v1790/ intrabandENDC-Support-UL-v1790. The new capability is applicable for all the DL and/or UL intra-band (NG)EN-DC component(s) supporting non-contiguous spectrum in the band combination.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options:","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" (NG)EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Intra-band (NG)EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3bc04a55600a248d1895aede2a7b470e362bab537658b3360c340ab780e90b9b","original_member_sha256":"bc45667859fcb4c9d22b4980ef357233deb5243944ef156ddbd4d75489ba8acf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["10a514b61083d781902a79d94dc88a64e4bc8a68282000f0ac850c14ddac6a50","e191b3c710fb0838f7308c1b8d2b9feb1c78b81b1760bea1855825039710abc1","6ecf2b5b7bc855504080edc6f5cee3fe42e404e8a2c89aff7a111b119fb8364f","4d3fb183990f8818781a8921722b521eb19022b64e3289e6f1f5d83505875fb2","664d91c913c7b1f4bb2c9258c2ebcb08fb30ab4feadf2100389a3b94d9a09614","44f48635b7f4eb3e5d91735addcbfb53b253488a7fa44bd265a9ea9c4d7af585","0ba0e27befd92b28f41a6d57b0cc890c8a38eef7862897a2cf0c73a17d