::R2-2408756 Clarification on LTM capabilities.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408756.zip::R2-2408756 Clarification on LTM capabilities.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"As CPAC, LTM SCG support should be excluded for RedCap and eRedCap UEs to maintain the simplicity and efficiency of RedCap and eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The description for ltm-InterFreq may be misunderstood that when the UE indicates support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 and ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18, it is allowed for the UE to support either inter-frequency MCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or inter-frequency SCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ltm-InterFreq-r18","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates UE supports inter-frequency MCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or inter-frequency SCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18 respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"“A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18.” may cause the same misunderstanding as described above.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LTM SCG is not supported for RedCap and eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"03e546605e6ae377fa3462339ee349a109d58298a33badec9c3d4d23cdb21d80","original_member_sha256":"6c62b7f636518ca2681e8dbaae9b2f381fd786775f737d1e399f1add131a8ebc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5877177e8fcfc39459bdafc9c3da47ee0c6c70591699ff5f7650d7489d783c03","adce0c6ee4d680644f826db0793750312eba912ed5a2de9a71159634707ce242","577c9d949ba0a74a07e5a1ba7104d20e53cf2fe2c8a406227da29f5a750fe0c7","d730d29ac2adb195253103e0297bec75113146fa61d5f162f0fe00d15f529f25","d8678451972d3d62bc621c6abf162f8f0ae908ce1cffa0d0c5bfcdfcb8b77308","35993305186f370174bc12e984393c7396bf3ac02f2b24bfda4a83e9f9f86065","e5d46b8b7a39a2cdc2b546aa1da79dafa02fb42c8b7dfb9d0e80e1226ab9e392","24b78453fa54772a834c543814d01d180ee5188560ab1233f3ffd92aa9a29c9d","372af7feb5675840ec4ba243f8882c46ce153557c01daa1279fcb9a78e4954ea","13c6e224a22ae74cff96db62a1e5c2d12949a4d51ad1122077a5a6beb404d476","f0aff98eaf8a1c7606130d1dacad65bf2b357dfda5412a52974d300c0aa6824d","9e5febf024042e07772639b9b248bea5bc360276e17f9c71fe63258f455c49b3","86b3568e3207dd50a5ddce71beed02e8f89b13c9534106d17d8187469fb15b6d","18de701f8d24e94291ec6577048adaec7c05a82def7f03940d223ee5c7c8cb7a","b35d38857b8762bfb39eeb5fe10226810fc2bf844fbfc390bcebacea11725293","c3a06118aaed5966eea96e71f6597b261e7792c08516e53855f6b2133b39a268","4b4076e02dd9df93c4121853bb964122b86735eef05e67885d7b1bcda2aa9629","ef67e74f0e8da24047ba516b8c60c7798debb0d8d11b97643ba255ccea7e6963","914d96fe3e623d0fecfa67e95753fb613fc4c1437786c80cda571ec112975703","413fd3f5937dc85abc547abcad73f262124c0e6e4eeee965506bfeafe7113f9a","78b0a5325683b8c88abda02a69e2c67b4d4bb04df90f661cbd35c8a5ba0f755a","db407d63424d31e543bbd1a58ce31858b05fcc7479d42193710483bab6c5cb50","a374340fa2a37e7f5e991171afe96ed915dd3f49b774364a51646557a490842d","5173df8b0e71cabe5b3ffcb4e21ee69ff3400d40b8ef5dfd57ac460d5022b19d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408756.zip::R2-2408756 Clarification on LTM capabilities.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408756.zip::R2-2408756 Clarification on LTM capabilities.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ltm-InterFreq indicates UE supports inter-frequency MCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 and inter-frequency SCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18 respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Remove “A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18.”. ","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It may be misunderstood that LTM SCG is supported for RedCap and eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It may be misunderstood that when the UE indicates support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 and ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18, it is allowed for the UE to support either inter-frequency MCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-MCG-IntraFreq-r18 or inter-frequency SCG LTM on all the bands where the UE indicates support of ltm-SCG-IntraFreq-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LTM, RedCap, eRedCap","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Interoperability:","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented in accordance with the changes and the network is not, there is no interoperability foreseen. If the network is implemented in accordance with the changes and the UE is not, there is no interoperability foreseen.","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4.2.21.1, 4.2.22.1, 4.2.9","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"03e546605e6ae377fa3462339ee349a109d58298a33badec9c3d4d23cdb21d80","original_member_sha256":"6c62b7f636518ca2681e8dbaae9b2f381fd786775f737d1e399f1add131a8ebc","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["38d6c1edfc2f54e8ed3feef8d7d94d65b84d661de858e23f2a4b92f5b1e900da","562231565eaf2cbf60c3814572adddc11e98aaef9e489f642ca12f2e48cd2f8d","2002f581399ad1050d32af8bb2b47e6c41e2d24973b507987b2bb90b1a2214fb","d7f5ee95989ea0e2c70f46ceb0be92d6c39d3a2a8a01072e3e97c5f2f8394c9a","6a1cfd2f5bc419ebbef09e49abf3ccc6f0295f1ef04889adf2ffff5faa4cc26c","35df97eeafa3f0461da993ec6f92b9dfa87e559cfc1d836e1a9d0d37c10e2420","658bcc049c69d0992735fe7f1ddfe628537a6c06ba4be7bb92a39df307d5f785","c0b2cc4b3a13fc9cdd45f2ca14892a976ed1963d0359c5eded4a0f89d8f327a1","17b1a6d31cd4f66830490e8f03d239ac5284c4f7c6a6478a8aed5c5c76dd9b2b","c3586008c7932d4ba4c8e51ed691fd31f197bdabeefcb58d81b9568785faa1e5","86344fcd6e6e7e5f6c4f5433e0f7b8ec9b4753d2b8057edf14d524450079c55e","6d991407955680a357b2f9fe7f40c59284da54ea4a84ef68446987bd14638