{"document_XML_sha256":"ce3f675dbdf7dff7bb1529732a85e609db8c9af0f60b5dd7ae8e0d9407609b84","original_member_sha256":"4cf21540dfb0441dbcd33349e5bf274128c82de02deeb796f8b7137478fd649a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["44a6fbae7a163b1a85ed245ef84f58295f78c87f19936130659d81858b9d2df9","cf27c4149ff5ab7e2768de53c3ba915e4506dac270c3b04e19aedb385a8b12c8","69c9b86f58c65fe7c3af9c0ad9156244d4ad04b7c0b9db44b78221ac0cd3e620","894663225c09b9bf8e0b91f9696de54639aa2f8e05e0a0523e46f1ad9cf1d041","aedae053d6bbf27188e314394dd8151f61c53c99cc11f803bceab62da97e353f","42f51dce803bf2578c05a45cdf12a26ba4def04b31f67d1cb6bced7fdd528b51","6380db2edc4a4cd61e3d1d86f239298435fa4a34a20208c3aa25e18e0cb859a5","0a82c9d19c366e8754df2de006d9599944fc2b64fe767e6ca5170ee60c82f1a3","015441e26cc4aae7f09268f4f3d4c0768976e381de11f6ad1fe127c02746e412","a19ea15ba1268cc5917af8c900754836d637719de1da230e218f355ba2903b02","b2436fb42d47aea5a0803f687e2c2b930392ed93f3856dd6b0f8bd2cebf836e3","878a52e85221e6093db1fbcf0dc577827b0e81c395a75f35435f81be2a38e3d3","6bd25366283f09e47a51374b5697d1ed82ab3f5dc80d2468b6e38cd1e88313bd","3a0a24809194e82c4ea45f7e94843427bf088f467efffa5558d1cf43962ebee9","a8cde9a6ea3e78eca6008d5c7f92031facb6816af32abcd77185ee706d1cebe0","6ebd5c8c75b4887ef25d2b524438ea739cf761fb64cd8cab2a8cfbaa6ae8441d","553909c5fd22cef54b461b692d1501ee8de0802ce544fa4dd45fab164306501b","fe15ae377dab1c1d107a98b83ae87a64223bc8c6833493185bb80ac44bc9b232","df242787365d98a120a1446f4789a815eb0e9be42eceb93c6a27519fbe7da253","c9f1f10d92a8cbacc59f51d28189cb119cc566e6fe247e76d7862d4f268dd99e","901d1ca76aa2d7fec485c92b30a9330916d614cdc5aba19069d60a48d9d16d19","16f1a3effcd1c3a21ab83a65bd5197b80998444c04b5b2823b03acb6d6ecdd45","eb5d3f17b9de33222b9733ddf76b5430cb34cf4bc601acb4ed77207f37ade3d4","30db146523868f26693c728a3bf74b4e4a3bcab1a432c972580aa7c2d62e8f21"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408814.zip::R2-2408814- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408814.zip::R2-2408814- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN1 agreed on indication of restricted and recommended beams for IAB-nodes.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Following agreements were made regarding the usage:","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Agreement (RAN1#105)","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of simultaneous MT/DU operation, ","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"the parent node can dynamically indicate to the child node at least a set of restricted beams at the IAB-DU of the child node","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"the child node can dynamically report to the parent node a set of recommended beams, not preferred beams, or both recommended and not preferred beams of the IAB-MT of the child node","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Whether the specification supports all reporting combinations.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Applicability to specific multiplexing cases or specific time-frequency resources","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Additional semi-static signaling ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Per-panel granularity in addition to per-beam granularity","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ce3f675dbdf7dff7bb1529732a85e609db8c9af0f60b5dd7ae8e0d9407609b84","original_member_sha256":"4cf21540dfb0441dbcd33349e5bf274128c82de02deeb796f8b7137478fd649a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0eafa71601fff5930957281fadefd563077f2bf537980fc8c65f7e07a3fc98fa","bdcfc1b0989a9cd9f274d984ba580eab4f1863f773f70a0a02d7c78f51b13780","369a096733683c16c035423553ac924d2532878d4cd9ea65a2eafc0450af7bc4","286fa751f617a44d52f1356a2107a3a14f25a23c99eda8e2beeffa6ec558b318","30ebe70b4b892ee095d95ba618377d37af9158a984949f010d9edf61faf55e87","53a9f0a2164156cf9b1aa528fc6c1455ff790fbf6a7421a13c64024480de64e1","067036c2ff89ccd8e969bc29b112c85293d11752c4af72fac3c698c3d48fb890","c0b52da664489bdd406be5d9779824acb448f29bc76a1594dcb86192867d4ef7","2259d63a2069e2a19afd747d197547973eab8e6cf380dbc517a34efa1723f54b","122187d528a70cc8783fef31f4f76ba426223610c301a6ceef3818bd11c8bd78","78f3707fd7f404500acfc61b47713f742f794c5692feb9fba514601e3c023d4e","620d8f979c6edadc1633ed178f94f29bc37e21a47b7a487bb748bf0e7921f1f9","f4086dc99ab38ea85858659b6b35b856fde459a4277586a1285e83b0181f1c98","91ab716885140be6a84e47abcc09d44995c531318bc75d96501dc23d7dec144a","9612b7dbb5a47a014d39936cadafbf7d564de8364a499bd388089f0232a522a2","6fd63604986a721cebfffcf794d61a8bddd10925656393ebc335ca4c75225300","492e021ed4dc23712844e7299390435a4eaac6510334cf34dc93d140959b528f","e539fab96ddc2b414fede7338b89ea1e6f30191c3175d2c4e69e27e3f5d657b1","93765f0ae159c3b7770cd03d0b202173a886ca8d15ecae5f458e75d737c0370c","e5df5503acfba411381518c02ddc76d233fe7cebb4f6ea9f2ffb98f2984a155f","1fc56dcec89191571fc0a37640e2172317c869737ae3945bc511d8849368d94c","18edfb2a93e8dd710cc4fb7e38cf8f489713d6193783fdf57d40535cc955d3ba","352562bb8bfa3367402ed06578a912f4d8489262708f48ee24310fb682bd8e38","3cf037d190998cdf1d05e8acac14a379247ef04810019179c4b9e3ceac3b299b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408814.zip::R2-2408814- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408814.zip::R2-2408814- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Relationship between child IAB-MT beam indication and parent IAB-DU beam indication","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note: This does not preclude any enhancements for either DU or MT-based CLI measurement and reports","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Agreement (RAN1#106)","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The child node indication of recommended beams to the parent node can include both IAB-MT DL beams and/or IAB-MT UL beams.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Indication via MAC-CE or UCI transmission","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Definition of IAB-MT DL beams and/or IAB-MT UL beams (e.g. TCI state ID, Spatial relation information ID, RS ID (including CSI-RS, SRS, SSB, etc.))","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Whether indication of “not preferred” beams is supported","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Agreement (RAN1#106)","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MAC-CE signaling from a parent node is supported for indication of beams of an IAB-DU in the direction of which simultaneous operation is restricted","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Details of beam indication (e.g. TCI state ID, Spatial relation information ID, RS ID (including CSI-RS, SRS, SSB, etc.))","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Applicability to other beams","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It is our understanding that","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Restricted beams are by the parent IAB-node to indicate a restricted use of IAB-DU beams.","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Recommended beams are by the IAB-node to indicate what IAB-MT beams are preferred/recommended (for transmissions on the parent backhaul link).","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Recommended beam indications are not related to or bound to an indication of a restricted beam. A recommended IAB-MT beam can be indicated without any need for an indication of an IAB-DU beam restriction.","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A recommended IAB-MT beam does not recommend on the use (or non-use, i.e., restriction) of IAB-DU beams.","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Opposite to above agreements, Rel-17 TS38.321 states that “IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication MAC CE is used by an IAB-node to indicate to its parent node recommendations for such a restriction”","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ce3f675dbdf7dff7bb1529732a85e609db8c9af0f60b5dd7ae8e0d9407609b84","original_member_sha256":"4cf21540dfb0441dbcd33349e5bf274128c82de02deeb796f8b7137478fd649a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7af68efad357f60457d1c32e5a42b08ef95a9ebd13e7b6660496472570006f7f","be8442f8d85c7fc54b880f3946ecbe36d6c5f8f31aa31909381adc0cbd765b09","e9019abe1a8822025b0a28394424758c48dab3aaeb27ebc7d4e696ba4ceb1e7b","6cb022876f977b264ab2d0aad65b73063c8458d9c11410d7ebde7e90df37e68f","7f87f003b66de141038582856fc1ad4196c31a971d438eb457b7244a74869911","77f07af56256256677f3579cf5c6d2742ca5cf8004ed35274bf31ac6d1e63635","befdeab9745c3f3cd8ed628101c28f70d7b4a930dc9b5ef76869984f6cd78f2b","4a38a188482eecfaee62e987ba8a3b3e9f83e9b5d3267b8072cddd485e33a4e1","52920a1481a721e6bb6954a03f0740fa2a66916937efcddada238c07688965e3","63c682b3f87ceb254f72fab8a567b0e0d0b65f82657093b125664a6a643adbee","ba867345379fcf14891e82b35049ccbc214030e884f9ddac9fa5e871576e469b","1c12f52822dd05300ef4623b6768c16da82033bedb54ce3684347d879e393e57","4e640b00466338977904ecd9f24b5c178d0e54c9a582725d06b5d89cb68652eb","9dd7a86964f5782fdd28f061a2d1e308e84c13ef06add692e3ea9b5a3a907219","32853ebce5d66c0796b2115e402928bda62526349644e07b46f22464f9436b21","8214461657ea650e8ddcaf9b975a1848305141d1eb530a06392388d68aa38541","fe5578098f038028d34c71b3f77cceb246716606805d5bf1735232d8b7922177","09195ac50499afb2d52083d86ddb2b5fd76cd9cebae6ad091ac2afe1783b58d9","fd428c949d9f4b0b9e0e6f86b250342c88324d9f24d360262f547211eb17cbff","0e5068f975e5ebd90cbccd02e28337e201192767c78bb3f2dd5ce424f8d19d7d","0dcf76411122396b7c569ba0513560fbd8420091570e799e4e2de9c64f5e356c","cbccd73262f6f76c2fef73351d6a0be3f765ea54293139d882a31e5b0a890a6e","b21905b97a6e1a8476bfd33871361e232cb4c12efdb0f41ee84796dda3a926f9","703c27b48dad56f900ae2d553f5e169ca1a2b07bf2002aa0188c3ae7ab5fae33"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[72,95],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408814.zip::R2-2408814- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx:p72"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408814.zip::R2-2408814- Correction on restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In section","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.18.26Restricted and recommended beam indication for IAB","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Child IAB-DU Restricted Beam Indication MAC CE is used by an IAB-node to indicate to its child node spatial resources and associated frequency information where simultaneous transmission/reception from the IAB-MT and transmission from the IAB-DU cells is restricted. IAB-MT Recommended Beam Indication MAC CE is used by an IAB-node to indicate to its parent node recommendations for such a restriction spatial resources and associated frequency information for transmission/reception from and to the IAB-MT of the IAB-node, based on the observed interference level at the IAB-node from the parent node transmissions. Time resources where these restrictions/recommendations can apply are indicated via RRC, while the MAC CE further selects from these time resources the specific time resource configuration (comprising a list of slot indices) to which information provided in the MAC CE applies.","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis ","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR SA, (NG)EN-DC, NE-DC,NR-DC  ","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: Measurements ","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, the IAB-node and its parent node may be misasligned in the interpretation about which beam to use. ","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2. If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there is no inter-operability issue","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the CR is not approved, the use of recommended IAB-MT beam indications is wrongly described and leads to ambiguous interpretation at IAB-node and its parent node.","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ce3f675dbdf7dff7bb1529732a85e609db8c9af0f60b5dd7ae8e0d9407609b84","original_member_sha256":"4cf21540dfb0441dbcd33349e5bf274128c82de02deeb796f8b7137478fd649a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0db897a8b85f4fe0765f40693a14f2fe7736b4bacffb91d31314b615bd9890e9","cfb3f20070363cc5b1a7d0092fe32af3e7124af503a83722d0749fb2917cdf73","4d039332bfcbbc80fc31255b9f9f0344507623b2bca72abef9dd0e11c68fb2cc","80057a9e7803dd67e108f08ca3f6aa72e89a50144b56f591641f3f44d19537f3","b3908a8d5aba31aa9026c8883d6f2c89ef596c4e71acdefe1f1342e5e5de5b89","d6