{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408827.zip::R2-2408827_Corrections to validity of configured uplink grant for SDT.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Valid and invalid configured uplink grant is determined as follows in current spec","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"“For an uplink grant configured for configured grant Type 1 for CG-SDT on the selected uplink carrier as in clause 5.27, when CG-SDT is triggered and not terminated, for each configured uplink grant valid according to TS 38.214 [7] for which the above formula is satisfied, the MAC entity shall:","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if, after initial transmission for CG-SDT with CCCH message has been performed according to clause 5.4.1, PDCCH addressed to the MAC entity's C-RNTI has not been received:","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SSB corresponding to the configured UL grant has the same SSB index as the SSB selected for initial transmission for CG-SDT with CCCH message (i.e., retransmission of initial transmission of CG-SDT):","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select this SSB;","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the SSB index corresponding to the configured uplink grant to the lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider this configured uplink grant as valid.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if at least one SSB configured for CG-SDT with SS-RSRP above cg-SDT-RSRP-ThresholdSSB is available:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if at least one SSB corresponding to the configured uplink grant with SS-RSRP above the cg-SDT-RSRP-ThresholdSSB is available:","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this is the initial transmission of CG-SDT with CCCH message after the CG-SDT procedure is initiated as in clause 5.27 (i.e., initial transmission for CG-SDT):","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select an SSB with SS-RSRP above cg-SDT-RSRP-ThresholdSSB amongst the SSB(s) associated with the configured uplink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"23ac61d78ba08dd9826b46899b903769cf46c3a8173197cf89dc0ba4e982a48a","original_member_sha256":"43c19dc78a1b4c8a0c750f94a0794aa2b2e6ff318d5500d0d31364d80b47828b","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","8c346d3f35120d629acf811bcc277866f99f111f7725c63c7907fd870dcaa868","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","23d22fcc41382ffc0e2ad80f3de3dca1708de877a36c2734a8968a04b21582d9","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","20f6ecff31ca60ac3d55a141b9a9ea45cfae834078e97d8e09ff7b295c5ef07b","dd3de490bf00baf5087f33777fa272abbec9623033d71526d5355fb97ee7f36f","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af6435503a27154aade28f9b","91d05c059c7cc369ae4f2682a7aae4c2da908726c6a67a0f0b2878dcfd9e83f5","68fa905f223b2cef3b2e08e50db7ba4f15bb23175dc4a7d9540faf617f99bcc8","a19fb65f700caf27a6c82154e03d3ba7fd0f37091074d7f7e5b4b78d649243d1","b92108fc1b4e68402c438528f2ef6617c67eea474faecd6d1dd9c1753bb5e6eb","84cf9a44dba9eb62c301e481f88e103f67e2b6e558478b1277ce4df58af81400","797fd57c60c168f0928fc9c2933a4b647e798726d83b24a3c82c1aa6fc5e6585","ec5e3c6e8856591c8f9b6398de6d5d7534f9fc52f0468c973dd9383f7518794b","27eae91a7565eeb220f1e2c127504fc61050c86a8c9703a4fe2eb984ccac5bc5","9fb2120117d3db9f251a26a658af94de57dd5493adfd8c0a669697cf75e6b54c","330ff95e552f1ede2930f26f071fabb1374fbb169c8810d40da456aba7a3c91f","507e27706bc5a0c0952b33062070fd6ee9b139625d5873bd9152f23b018ea727"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408827.zip::R2-2408827_Corrections to validity of configured uplink grant for SDT.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408827.zip::R2-2408827_Corrections to validity of configured uplink grant for SDT.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if PDCCH addressed to C-RNTI has been received after the initial transmission of CG-SDT with CCCH message (i.e., subsequent new transmission for CG-SDT):","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if SS-RSRP of the SSB selected for the previous transmission for CG-SDT is above cg-SDT-RSRP-ThresholdSSB and this SSB is associated with this configured uplink grant:","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select this SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if SS-RSRP of the SSB selected for the previous transmission for CG-SDT is not above cg-SDT-RSRP-ThresholdSSB:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select an SSB with SS-RSRP above cg-SDT-RSRP-ThresholdSSB amongst the SSB(s) associated with the configured uplink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SSB is selected above:","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate the SSB index to the lower layer;","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider this configured uplink grant as valid.","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider this configured uplink grant as not valid.","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if PDCCH addressed to C-RNTI after the initial transmission of the CG-SDT with CCCH message has been received:","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if there is data available for transmission for at least one RB configured for SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate Random Access procedure in clause 5.1.","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"“","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Case 1: if condition highlighted in yellow is not met, this configured uplink grant should be considered as not valid. This is missing in spec.","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Case 2: if condition highlighted in green is not met, this configured uplink grant should be considered as not valid. This is missing in spec.","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Case 3: if condition highlighted in grey is not met, this configured uplink grant should be considered as not valid. This is specified in spec.","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"23ac61d78ba08dd9826b46899b903769cf46c3a8173197cf89dc0ba4e982a48a","original_member_sha256":"43c19dc78a1b4c8a0c750f94a0794aa2b2e6ff318d5500d0d31364d80b47828b","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["370676f96fdb09ac84df3909aae778af0588efcb96a653e3a0ee4c32cab4d354","e2efa5360ffbc67a765c28d143e360aee18348bdf901f259ea4109a48395d39e","50b33072e542c44e3d3afd369b8996f604f89065ccec38cbaa0eef3f79cf970d","1a214a9d508184c5bd3f65016d1fe14deeadcba689176dd253f8acb7d17ae44f","28ce40194a0d1213ec7e70f7267a2b25dd3f522a6a21a857a893be3ece828e61","fc2a46b79e434d122dbd9536a61738a9c87b5185f7e1c86f3ba5490456302cf2","6d9df73890065995f9b368dbf80b75edb6c91e97b7861c0fca977451df12d32e","a2aa8afe52e0eab96bb4f5ad802c707b1189af1c5df165941c3084d36547b0d3","00159e7d3a76ad6f517976393b528818d0615ea852e8f83850f0f765980b1ba2","89d01f8abbfe322fde436325cdf86d6c448596f78dc0ac3ecfb19445917b97c9","589cbcc1d8fc5346f3e3028bf9e5466c5435d49973977f18548015f8116f1a20","f76e0987642f8df04e83383374ce4fafc6072b056adbfc0c6423b9ff90890c06","0547b37b651f7671b767c7fad3e2b6447e89b8174ba80abc380609394281069e","9a96c3f2c28562db674eb29db1f379b8bb629d948176dcb540170aadaee158fd","8eb74539161fb589781b70fd56ca561d9359862a6b1e506ac4f59369660b99db","e5df5b5f8286d3f82c92a500b1ec45b04a0631d4a2bdfbf13fb6ef63e65ea275","e795ada0f48620c0d8f9c6727e8dc2a1e2070a96e9211d99188dd534195ceb30","c95d851ddcd6c013d98892dafb70c16db36ac19aeb2b3ddf8c3225f5b999376e","a59e7f40535b110e58eaa110fd5f590a9aadce9a72770bdd519f3ad3d627d3e7","a65192bb4816c4848da2404b7adae4a4984c611bd9b5cb8414de46325c7cd6e8","cdf4dc833a8d674a7316af9c68b3dec86a921fb913a42acb9f0a3f19ca5e32e9","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","7423559940944ed0cc1fe176b76253cf9035dcdbfc0fac2f3e385feb311a2329","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009fb0a2849670c1b99dfd9f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[72,95],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408827.zip::R2-2408827_Corrections to validity of configured uplink grant for SDT.docx:p72"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408827.zip::R2-2408827_Corrections to validity of configured uplink grant for SDT.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Alternate 1:","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Specifed that configured uplink grant is invalid for case 1 and case 2.","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Alternate 2:","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Remove the part which specifies configured uplink grant is invalid for case 3. With this only the case(s) where configured uplink grant is valid are specified.","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options:","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CG-SDT ","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"There is no interoperability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE may use a configured uplink grant which is not valid.","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.2","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"23ac61d78ba08dd9826b46899b903769cf46c3a8173197cf89dc0ba4e982a48a","original_member_sha256":"43c19dc78a1b4c8a0c750f94a0794aa2b2e6ff318d5500d0d31364d80b47828b","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["986507dbe4f5bea8eee986af9a8803a0900fdddb439a6eef7ca60c39446a0551","a31810709f223ead4b507361335f0e7a2155160b21bc257ff27fd3863d95c001","3b08a8926f3ccf0f4cfd99039f9a49e78688da9cc5e1a6da5e834b92ed265703","864d0c32ce0c674aa1058e96d9989c9fd26f6dee6629ce8f2d0e77eb6900dd5d","75991623a3e9258cd36f20426cf77112ff772298abbe1f54aa6b25054012668e","04cc4f409d882e6eb92b821c3e6fa41e471b95ca75cc5e2ccff844a5eca5c8c0","85099c1d5d5742304d036928553bd82cd10a2315fcb36bef6a846f9bba1cbf3d","9fbc8bc9169dd68726648935eeba4b4ba80c4f8544b99d86f1450679c9da22f4","ef28be4da63b2490b7bdf56e050531fd9fa2cb9711b70d0d9192e0279ed987c7","991ad6391fa89a236ebc39b7435fa8d2b1e6183da6f2e4a625a42e906c1a60a9","a687a493ddc25a01af3785f1984f727b0e75f8033b0e2720b0181e201f3ff499","23da18bbbcbc650fad7a07ef8006251a7a06ae59113986d1a2b8d37f6d71a8d1","85f9fe225bf206da5b28016fbb39c62cb1368eb1244f4f20547ea6629294dc69","378adf0aa423995360841de5b3ff121413a3320bd55a44c2044b1a4823324310","4695eb01ff0db60090e5dab248770cd4b525a978f2383705f01131335805cd64","d3098623b4dfc23a1a4b383cc6c305d01a4c1c56ac54d5853c2f6542bbe0ad3e","d88bc81b05cdcb5373fcefe52e78f5e5b7ea4e37e19c0d9ebb00bb2abbe8ad2d","61cf31ccb32ca743f815831546a63f3d4f37ea5f4ff7e02e623d0e686dc91277","e1de391de0723d6ba8e28e762c5d882f99278fa3a7ef176e6a7fd3158cb8b233","d3262b1816fab55992cffb02c05a6ffa91b6523e243fbbc95fea56d1d4a60b90","c3683d587e9395b4366df402366a37ae834beabe3792a5a1f587771601d39ee1","ed998830d31c45491e1e04401