{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408877.zip::R2-2408877 - 38.331_CR5049_Rel17_Correction on SL Relay Measurement.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"     Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following text was agreed in R2-2407754 as normative text:","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When evaluating the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, the U2N Remote UE should apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 using the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED) or the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in SidelinkPreconfigNR (out of coverage), before using the SL-RSRP or SD-RSRP measurement results.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"However, the current formulation of “the U2N Remote UE should apply” is ambigious for UE implementation. According to the drafting rules, the verbal form of ‘should’ does not mandate the described behaviour. As a result, it is possible that the UE uses the incorrect filtercoefficient thereby affecting system performance.  ","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 5.8.15.3","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Update the text enforce the correct usage of filtercoefficient for the selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cf9478184242f88ff7ce245383d2711f1155dce7d2eab1717b6fe80ff910c016","original_member_sha256":"88e446fbff37f9c086ac89bde36c1b5a11d7d3f3b534469910eeb4d192c5abc5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["84c96d2f0b36f95ff7dc724214a5fe664ea623b0eeb77a49e426a8da15c10a2d","b31ecb67bb16d8323d90f54a73d6eee981226e082570a993b93487b2ba50a927","1e3336366b9dc08493ad2a4a19cdedd5bd3a3e55698f73c9ee86647187e9928b","6be0f986a71f6af97220eae048c0808d3eba6b326d42deeb99fa09586e297819","73eb04ef48bd67cf0ae3529f9fcbe531683c483f7c474b825c6dcb3e524215f8","4433aecfd99bda168e7f028e25d4b496f6267d191c3c67fb425eb836218069eb","3ce755cf7271cbc8af87a401591ebc460c603a29e42a74d8db8aa28979d18cb3","69a3461c7f5e1c40922276d1b51fed4674dbb1d93a6e6ca172dd2b1638f4aad5","925174f89dfa2d902060201c6a6395649a5bbbde06ae65ec993981b9dd46ef44","766f3d4e1676c391955673df79cb2262958ef649396992584efd16ff60ec8d3a","6838e1c8eac12b1b8e30e009f5449961b2f24612b2fea9f9630c281201d9af9b","48398198f8d0270348a45ab73b0815c243bdb951c72ef58dc0d7f1ee79377967","255117f7334d3945e3bf10ac86b872481743e7b67aee1e7f920930fca076356d","30355d9cf0ae5f2393898bc3a93495ddf842874212adc31c192f8d495be8c113","5ee0b7a9dca9df5fec14cc784782beb0915601860d4975710fe03838e917acfd","014abef4328f7cc247a7b9a91290d757e328c5fdc51a96181ad4572023e0dc7f","8173255e4ac593d62d42ea819a3be01da5e9fe2e0cdddc20c01a0ee72fc6bd93","7eb90307cd3d3b72a70e971c720a3d4407a8fe338335bf04ac7396ef876ddb56","e25fd9f858bcadcdc7e98db67e45e002d469b4f32746aff724f9aef21e6d4124","08a357ad41f115c9a65b09c06a5be1ef1e348c1a3dbffefd3bb5f2164d59b5e7","8a49a140471fc0315d1806ef9124c8f7e91693f2c45605780fff796d9f051bcc","d5aea25cb5cbd80d45555585efe6f41d631d0aca8c7636dfc0bf92130796de25","ffbfb6a350cc3c94fef2daba4b553569a36b084f3061cf3d70dd37d8547f8b00","a11270f5f06d7afd2c4172bd03040e5a448c3693bb6dc438b61256887e647c92"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2408877.zip::R2-2408877 - 38.331_CR5049_Rel17_Correction on SL Relay Measurement.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2408877.zip::R2-2408877 - 38.331_CR5049_Rel17_Correction on SL Relay Measurement.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR SA, Sidelink","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The support of SL U2N relay operations.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, there will be no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2. If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there is no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3. If one UE has implemented according to the CR and another UE has not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Without this clarification, there is an ambiguity in UE implementation. In the current formulation, it can lead to the usage of the incorrect filtercoefficient affecting the system performance.     ","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.15.3","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cf9478184242f88ff7ce245383d2711f1155dce7d2eab1717b6fe80ff910c016","original_member_sha256":"88e446fbff37f9c086ac89bde36c1b5a11d7d3f3b534469910eeb4d192c5abc5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc35e3aa91bce3937ba0a92d1bd8e87fcf4682e0ff0197110363ec4f3438fdb1","c078472dc77d9e411a1c0e7f2246f3af3aea314f969acdfc92b06b15cd96da29","45dd974235460f4424f3da505f5386227eaefc2952552641feea019a0cf24a4f","118a005a8f34bece75d26fd550e062c165ab33a48bd36ebcfefad2bb56a33933","a917148f8366e2f5efa8f0c49dd7550a611a63e4fb3df18477e88a5a9be441da","5ae273d916859e54b95e13b7f1e9378adcb0f609942b2865ebb759323fa94544","615b962ab516279a732c1e887785c351fa3ce557265a22477fabf70be782cbb7","324c6621ae816611d3c609d80cb14648b71bc17d2dff9c760334efe2570776cd","11a4ce46230dc472d4e0ae42b17d9615065294aea70a4f956d84e1279a062bdc","e6ed827c5b02175084ca570a452294cb1c29c7aaabfd08752273f3db2538b7ba","10c0bf88b094c57d115e2ce229e2c8afbd1e05afab5bdcabfb5b935291298b5c","845e682240a111b299fc93f476b344e80578da1689c415ebf547779234c65851","ef5ce564430fa4e4a83d40884c8d080780d9b00c9eec659a22f0d0f23bffafc6","4e708d0794918d555f36e497a145a0e4e847b0c3df99c32473885c9ca23662b5","b5ee9b0f83006442375b36fe93b47f6e60f5b4e9036fd0b205564e9f0bd0598c","da8e781073d7d61439fa47af8d136a54400cc22a1658eb557ba7a5b1c599fda2","2eb665df7a5ab53057c2be869d70bea8a85ee72df61784da7d4ef6fb0adfcf1c","1a9444c1883b6e6a58c8e28670fb83e9b796b87a19093bc9a297dfc32d35f787","cc099452b9184d35a2