{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409048.zip::R2-2409048_CR on 38.306 for Correction on PHR for mTRP PUSCH repetition (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"M","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-TDD DIFF","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR1-FR2 DIFF","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"additionalBS-Table-r18","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports using the refined buffer size table for BSR and, if delayStatusReport-r18 is supported, DSR, as specified in TS 38.321 [8] and TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"autonomousTransmission-r16","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports autonomous transmission of the MAC PDU generated for a deprioritized configured uplink grant as specified in TS 38.321 [8]. A UE supporting this feature shall also support lch-priorityBasedPrioritization-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cg-RetransmissionMonitoringDisabling-r18","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports disabling of waking-up to monitor possible grants for UL retransmissions of configured grants corresponding to a ConfiguredGrantConfig as specified in TS 38.321 [8] and TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of at least one of configuredUL-GrantType1, configuredUL-GrantType2, configuredUL-GrantType1-v1650, configuredUL-GrantType2-v1650, configuredUL-GrantType1-r16, configuredUL-GrantType2-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"directMCG-SCellActivation-r16, directMCG-SCellActivation-r17","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports direct NR MCG SCell activation, as specified in TS 38.321 [8], upon SCell addition, upon reconfiguration with sync of the MCG, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"4495a7d323453d2fb59c658e702b60f42d86f6325ecde37c1f1347fed1b371dc","original_member_sha256":"bb67c4ce90f1f4c0d2f5bba43fbf139e47fca6fb324e52e44bcf258d1775c74e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c5c194e57f543832f2ddae6cd06deb8ceec665411115b8658d6ce78c3ddbe8c3","3ebb4ee004d2adecd70624e18a820a60340cfb299616a61b58ecbccae0c7ae7e","213c0a85b11fa274015b081a1c8f2677fb3a273b06a1c86ba8495d84976b14be","500eace197b05918cf0a929b7dc9db2490ebd6780093b5344c08316ded8c19d3","a4fff30be4a272410e84136b0114be4ce7770139fea6957dc20c19828b5dce66","2d96edecfa349447be51ae45e97eb47b8f97cdc6cc62b5b3e513e272fcedbbd9","8786445883d9fd257804c0495a3ca061825636110ccb6915919b2479beb074d9","c21e7a4081fb7ebe32187ea6395a9f4a20d835521cead69bf4a2c1f619a74693","46aebc94d9c524e0a40d7e86da8d2b82c7c823d8113f84f2785c76edb9144ac7","c7103b92d06876aa88b75803c81950cf79d9208f660bb83bfa