{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409048.zip::R2-2409048_CR on 38.306 for Correction on PHR for mTRP PUSCH repetition (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"harq-FeedbackDisabled-r17","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports disabled HARQ feedback for downlink transmission. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate the support of nonTerrestrialNetwork-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"harq-RTT-TimerDL-ForNTN-MulticastMBS-r17","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the NTN extension of the drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL-PTM and drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL for MBS Multicast DRX in RRC connected mode.","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate the support of nonTerrestrialNetwork-r17, dynamicMulticastPCell-r17, and at least one of the following features:","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-ack-NACK-FeedbackForMulticast-r17","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-ack-NACK-FeedbackForSPS-Multicast-r17","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nack-OnlyFeedbackForMulticast-r17","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nack-OnlyFeedbackForSPS-Multicast-r17","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraCG-Prioritization-r17","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the HARQ process ID selection based on LCH priority as specified in TS 38.321 [8]. A UE supporting this feature shall also support jointPrioritizationCG-Retx-Timer-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"4495a7d323453d2fb59c658e702b60f42d86f6325ecde37c1f1347fed1b371dc","original_member_sha256":"bb67c4ce90f1f4c0d2f5bba43fbf139e47fca6fb324e52e44bcf258d1775c74e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8a88abb8ef69b54af8f74c18955008d76538042f5ef293bb89d0caa25cd4df1c","4a127748808a75647f8ec8b31912454a3466c8667848c56d4fbec9eb11b44747","e1506b4cac5f04f281027926620da4420d48e93ec70a57e89f8d756b8cbf9512","a6393e35085850e36d1d8bbe521f322374a2b2908016a4b8c733f16960389a8c","dd3ab7c3122d143c562081cf6f8b3b47ce0de5cc48e179201ca80b69cf6f8207","acd19f5e9f1f2a08d3db0dec2aae5ebbfecab625f6ddc21e119f65510c043812","6f719a453bf0ab98e787f43492f52682d0d8e10c3066399e666d53511de80644","e107e6a3c59f0750e3fea5e4beaa0db8bbbb904209b80a2202ae3e3ca6dff02c","69442d8c8292de5e9821d9d41755b1845310ff860592e3f14da72ae380d742ff","367bd5457844b5c6b560fffb4762b3c7d429c6c9bf858e2519ee85cbaf5cbb15","3aa5732efeaa1b4ee1690a0947899244ff65ee8ea4644589b1b7d8a7b5bbc2b7","ccae324d17647cc22daa922caebdb888a28d67a2506253302d8736eaa4e88bfc","d75866d903830506612d2b6c768a5eed79b2b28bf24a6a5abcfd4d886ddf5c15","6394f197df9299d0d99ddce3ff71a2114cae7f2a5844c15048304745834429a1","6ec1e58c6c713df941bb2b383a3fbe0