{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409048.zip::R2-2409048_CR on 38.306 for Correction on PHR for mTRP PUSCH repetition (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"jointPrioritizationCG-Retx-Timer-r17","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports simultaneous configuration of LCH based prioritization and cg-RetransmissionTimer-r16 as specified in TS 38.321 [8]. A UE supporting this feature shall also support lch-priorityBasedPrioritization-r16 and configuredGrantWithReTx-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lastTransmissionUL-r17","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports starting the drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL after the end of the last transmission within a bundle as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lch-PriorityBasedPrioritization-r16","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports prioritization between overlapping grants and between scheduling request and overlapping grants based on LCH priority as specified in TS 38.321 [8]. ","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lch-ToConfiguredGrantMapping-r16","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports restricting data transmission from a given LCH to a configured (sub-) set of configured grant configurations (see allowedCG-List-r16 in LogicalChannelConfig in TS 38.331 [9]) as specified in TS 38.321 [8]. ","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"4495a7d323453d2fb59c658e702b60f42d86f6325ecde37c1f1347fed1b371dc","original_member_sha256":"bb67c4ce90f1f4c0d2f5bba43fbf139e47fca6fb324e52e44bcf258d1775c74e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5615fb7b5db673a58b6823f313b652e735fd9f5e662691512ca64b2c5ba20eaa","6db169a79bae65fc9b66a2791e81daacea162c30b02c5a0a0d2172600436f321","c0287a3ca252c42d150ba19123fe6c0c44db82a9c7e22eee5e9d82095ecde125","8eff6d155f96646421ce4523123642058b3192697a144b88d3bfa4e2b60e2192","35b0d84b95768a158cda7f31457c7b419cb80d16a160087c03382adcd51d7339","3b6747fbff454f3586b25450a5de5703cf0e702aaeb4376a8f632a3f81a45eb0","e405c64376d77dc1ca408be7aa31ec60dc15d26f18727fd1fdbe7c014668fa94","48b17a2fddc2629e3d55256edb8ef2a6921390cdc0f09b7862e2604f97896dfd","e08d7feca95bf713b0ef601447020121bf8400f911675314e924c80d522407be","4dff243e6429737234f3a029eefff0637cb441531fe14e62107a2e47ee2583d8","7c1990e16ab1304b7a9249999021a38ad7fc2d393b9a91adfcd3f9c458d598f1","e38b3ce78c3b535df6daf24b480cb46de542d96f5302ce6085b51b2b4a163b70","0a997a317f2bf2a2ac5140d98932f2a561b78f0f25490c810cf06f89ea2f31db","6c269a918af675dc954dc5a2f0790dc94fd006fd605cdea5b