{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409048.zip::R2-2409048_CR on 38.306 for Correction on PHR for mTRP PUSCH repetition (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lch-ToGrantPriorityRestriction-r16","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports restricting data transmission from a given LCH to a configured (sub-) set of dynamic grant priority levels (see allowedPHY-PriorityIndex-r16 in LogicalChannelConfig in TS 38.331 [9]) as specified in TS 38.321 [8]. ","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lch-ToSCellRestriction","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports restricting data transmission from a given LCH to a configured (sub-) set of serving cells (see allowedServingCells in LogicalChannelConfig). A UE supporting pdcp-DuplicationMCG-OrSCG-DRB or pdcp-DuplicationSRB (see PDCP-Config) shall also support lch-ToSCellRestriction.","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lcp-Restriction","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports the selection of logical channels for each UL grant based on RRC configured restriction using RRC parameters allowedSCS-List, maxPUSCH-Duration, and configuredGrantType1Allowed as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"logicalChannelSR-DelayTimer","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the logicalChannelSR-DelayTimer as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"4495a7d323453d2fb59c658e702b60f42d86f6325ecde37c1f1347fed1b371dc","original_member_sha256":"bb67c4ce90f1f4c0d2f5bba43fbf139e47fca6fb324e52e44bcf258d1775c74e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["52f606bddf88cf9935f7a9d55c92bc6ffaa5a426791d6ee72b49ec359628b761","aca145b52755c85deb46585dcceea6772e7dc814b5c597033dbde849cdddce14","a216446d6af6e915aa167db57b8c58aa0967e2d21725df13f50c7a7064b481cb","8e1b402c8dc03c9bea2b5bba5efa0a4e1511c97cbef058c98200220d0e406983","39805eb06869e53731d68f4c0565b4e988d288f5d8d142a8c2608dc7e78f0fb2","becdc3322625a521e577041d6facbf55b08da6e91ae2cfba0154f4792e026f4a","1d00a49558507ebc4df074e6fd6f1396d00e500f37142f8b163876662a5486e8","ff8a3e05a29a02607ed1011e9eef3a8d83c349ad7833e8a15916fdf704a1df44","70712c1190d35e1898b8f8d6d4c919db1b0b972ab4cb5b1c33a0810d62b1822e","9540e538ccf66279256fc2907a68e138b53cf5be3a7eb3a73e00bc6b52f470ad","0d102ee2894e791b8a435139732e2fb3d1324ad137fded9bc6e4400c6aa9e3fa","5f365eb3b2a9d35c675a19f3f3be6dcdd09cd3441b3a47004aaa920991640f06","c1910958ce4032d8801ac3fc8e0b2b6369e4aa4bd1cdd2bc9f900d31b3d65552","10f1080148ae0abae9d59aff06c8cc05f