{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409048.zip::R2-2409048_CR on 38.306 for Correction on PHR for mTRP PUSCH repetition (R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"longDRX-Cycle","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports long DRX cycle as specified in TS 38.321 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mg-ActivationCommPRS-Meas-r17","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports preconfiguration of MGs in RRC signalling for PRS measurements and the use of DL MAC CE from the gNB, as specified in TS 38.321 [8], to activate/deactivate the preconfigured MG for PRS measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mg-ActivationRequestPRS-Meas-r17","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports preconfiguration of MGs in RRC signalling for PRS measurements and supports the use of UL MAC CE, as specified in TS 38.321 [8], to request the activation/deactivation of the preconfigured MG for PRS measurements. The UE can include this field only if the UE supports mg-ActivationCommPRS-Meas-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mTRP-PUSCH-PHR-Type1-Reporting-v17b0","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates UE supports reporting of Type 1 power headroom information only or not, for the case where the Serving Cell is configured with multiple TRP PUSCH repetition and the MAC entity this Serving Cell belongs to is configured with twoPHRMode as specified in TS 38.321[8].","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This feature is mandatory if the UE supports mTRP-PUSCH-twoPHR-Reporting-r17 for at least one frequency band. ","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"4495a7d323453d2fb59c658e702b60f42d86f6325ecde37c1f1347fed1b371dc","original_member_sha256":"bb67c4ce90f1f4c0d2f5bba43fbf139e47fca6fb324e52e44bcf258d1775c74e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62fbe435fc0e13acb9c567b416db23c0f7387835d08de141c47e3513a664d2ae","e221c083e5b79568998dcbe1407480cbefe43290798d3364a89ee4bd65af389b","a6991e6369b0afe94b533982a47a2a2f149699b45fa81557deb80286050983a2","2420259f6511c69103b649f7f11034eb96bc6ddcf708ce604294165122bfa991","7da0beaca7b9be25dd0beeead5be8adf9b9764f3e951b2c611af94197c43862b","044be890aaa3a2c3e55a4df1918c0d75dfed7b06873ea65a326300bbc17529a6","5d4892622415ee75adb7dc5e4513bb0fc126e2c79cc9e090e6efcda39d4cfb18","fe0e9d31b500c3b16b778126dccf6720bde87fafa85bf2eb8e52b8771240e516","10a47b269319730dda80b577bed56ce61addfb6bcda04ef6b9ceab6a7c0f291d","495537142fdc887c96cf9f9a0e9c945049195876ed8f9cae159db9b543a9115e","904be524d03bf1b7348b5c06cdfbbc202fb1d937e053e7732e9817654f0f431f","0092f8670c08c2eed3d644ecb