{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409054.zip::R2-2409054_38331_CR5070_ Correction on field description of reportOnLeave for U2N Relay_R17.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Fo reportOnLeave indication, it is configured and used for L2 U2N Relay related events, i.e., event Y1/Y2. While in the field description of reportOnLeave, it only clarifies how it is used for a cell in cellsTriggeredList but how it used for a L2 U2N Relay in relaysTriggeredList is missing.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Add “or for a L2 U2N Relay in relaysTriggeredList” in the field description of reportOnLeave to clarify how reportOnLeave is used for L2 U2N Relay related events.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dffe1a8445246f2278e7731f675967c0505370e1ba0a5bc356385f19baa56b49","original_member_sha256":"aed2ee8200170ca0334b7fb2250e431150a032326f0b60d8bff3f2577b7af0ff","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a5aa53605ff8d18416af99307a37de487173d6f9d95e7a0297685852e3637881","54006b51aada91dd64460a8bc447af93c992b856a9b1f19d9f63d02e8012575f","fd33838fcce1c77200cd62a94734d1b181e50a993fc3ce9fc87441bad4e8b03a","075ff6b5a42a3ef427074cc4187384b1136b3cf57e9ea21a3b803aa33c2ab6f3","f63b0ba62ca44dc728408c714799ae8f10df3e89c1e61435ca012fc01da6da8d","590333e93ad4f213773df1eae82ff2caf3f76713be97d958c1900b331d4d8faf","430e317fee6ba810b2d189209bf01a31699c54f21c81fb52221b9fc833348283","dc007ed42c577596ddf5f8f7b935edd9e062768d7b223912e6e3d9b4c442e86d","d96657be774a1cea08c1f1505d4a2b56f11ebe0fdbd1194b55a40f7f9c6acced","ce7ef77f61b7142b09d124f8abcfc38133d630f651cbbe477fc3217f9365822f","a334305b598a42c5f3f68cb66d59700f422ce983a8f3a2adce1c2e4de3615e97","c781d2665b887641b7d6c42fbf145a7d932aa625fd4c6602d1271462b3869ff6","2ac0a2d481a4fb937509479538c3d9249f3a44f55f9e277e4ecd0298c067b22c","6de8913aecfa2c