T field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportType","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type of the configured measurement report. In (NG)EN-DC, and NR-DC, network does not configure report of type ReportCGI-EUTRA for SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportCGI-EUTRA field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dffe1a8445246f2278e7731f675967c0505370e1ba0a5bc356385f19baa56b49","original_member_sha256":"aed2ee8200170ca0334b7fb2250e431150a032326f0b60d8bff3f2577b7af0ff","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7037969cf74cfd336d7ed86d8b9ba5e2d2e5e562e3b84beb829ba65fe6733c9a","8ab3c9e9924d3bd865ed8289cda51f1293eae0b87ffa06ce67b1fabb43eb424f","f7d86ef8566418ab9905aa12b081955cb37da1cc1abf8a72cc490f7bd6ac9cea","9483566513ce122d21f92f06f8f10a7cbd21827c648386848ba2de13b7532758","81388745aa45f27eaf59ec74da639a5851a230cd284ed8de54ad49ae80660700","dfa982af606d5501c95594e3c6a327a8d696bf18b32ec56c783cebcfb4ec7b94","6b26a8ffb4f680548c7b0e4d8e54eb2f135f4154de06acebb4094f72864d9234","a570e257157ca5e2f0265636532bd4b7aacc3b434dc4097173d15a5df86007f4","16c084d21c0e7819fb433566a831fdeb3041eec379ac2681f296eaabfe3e4ce9","0ab80713ed4b6183e0f5e52f49db562818bee60ce724645c1f81ddec88bd8ccb","17c409481d97aec7fcc0bc55637d6436ce0280a247cfeba1a36cfbfc0d6c0a83","279ac9f57cefb24b4908cfef7ef85c013c41de84244a4852097f70b638234fc7","5a7f96b0f7957e41e676b7fea443c2dd88c6702d841285cb5c5e819e5e1f8934","cf6efc035ae8403df2d57f5776d16dcf86353029f7dd56529d9ff2398599a503","be89c8ea2a7e4a42c16076a1cf375a95e389e48cee6e592329f0011bed07de82","e16df31c6bc13ddf2c9abdcbe13cc749f287d421f35065b10800366224dbecd2","e90e67f93964b5d4871d1ed504d60f97dc7880c0acd7e5def34fe908b4841cdf","cca5bbeba2f6409000a69cd6b1e