{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409117.zip::R2-2409117_38331_CR5080_ Correction on field description of reportOnLeave for U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Fo reportOnLeave indication, it is configured and used for L2 U2N Relay related events, i.e., event Y1/Y2/Z1. While in the field description of reportOnLeave, it only clarifies how it is used for a cell in cellsTriggeredList but how it used for a L2 U2N Relay in relaysTriggeredList is missing.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Add “or for a L2 U2N Relay in relaysTriggeredList” in the field description of reportOnLeave to clarify how reportOnLeave is used for L2 U2N Relay related events.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2e39d9409247d976bab1fc84affd6a30d9bbb347618ef63729a36e72e7264366","original_member_sha256":"a2327727a6de58d4596bd1e3d23e659a6f53dcfb34890e37f139cde46fb2442a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d212876b71427c7430f21d34490eb75c31b564cb3bdcdb2f9f8998e44144e521","5c723a8c0b647d2b445ef932f886ca93c7e914732135416b771297ae647b50ec","f7d45db77edac53f88baf6a2830880036b21c24f492d32f710b204f3d8e360bb","2f6475cbde544b5dffee94ed64f782d5da543b55e244ffd63ee3f9301a96c3d4","e4ea2414f4213df11a9e277245056e875ecf9935416680c65b12eb22842fe865","d6c8a8afa1b609cdf50b32a04ca22b080e5ac586db4cf03a5b36de29b47f25e2","393145ff969a45bd5305f0671d27b59b116396cb222bc901149915ab1da0d8b2","e3099ac9d5514ebfaf992579c5ed4810d7dd6a52ab51715ddef6eb2bb08a8579","150631e6f9cfa64793e43d11832cbb1fd84888d0f0f1fa973daf044cd554e44f","9beb4c8532128705e120db9b8feaa2383c84eb8521c949980ff5d2db65543810","4ab690a4f3fbc35f1c2a3322dd8fd3182ddc1a7ba8e9fd2e7374ef19247a25a3","795c01bce42457ff09c60356060819439336adef2b5b45d856ceb27e3f31aeec","a42fd2da652f9c31394433e1638ad3696777757229ee9e1e7db077ee499e45a9","adfdedab1121640