t, or an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. The inter-RAT measurement reporting events for E-UTRA and UTRA-FDD are labelled BN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on. The measurement reporting events for L2 U2N relay UE are labelled YN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on, and Z1.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2e39d9409247d976bab1fc84affd6a30d9bbb347618ef63729a36e72e7264366","original_member_sha256":"a2327727a6de58d4596bd1e3d23e659a6f53dcfb34890e37f139cde46fb2442a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5130808a00f0c469b9337a226b36c97d6915d62128823dc093bfd5c76bdafc75","b8db79e3de8aa00aed70fb5b17f0ffde97fa4ce2640dd6a53c0d1ec168789728","e32ff8a822f0294a52b0820a3d83bf2fc7eb452f10a7a4043ff592c3b09c2cdd","91571bfcb5d8b8023122f7f8bd7b60347926cf4b141af978593cc0301d0c717b","afda108f9b9e51bed87606ff95ab85ebf60443c25d80447adcdfd4ec8b1be0ce","f87770f4156bc5232743a621b2ab18adef3090cb02b4229c107c2e6c6fa55763","5b676b28b9937dcbf6f791c5b67e99556d014401b09d14bc2c91641874d4a876","fa105dbb279e5e2bd77a2836916df873020d77ac535446a98993968b4b341121","864cdece34d292ca86ca7cd36faa8a26a5f62024662113fc70d97c29c32a274b","228e8f11310497292c453b2522dd6d2f78781b5eb293259898008144ab74563a","b16323cfe467c2f3b6c58a36efed71eec3f8053e9be3f1892879513a8872bfa5","30c224f03cedc42a8a968028126c324a68c2abb04f35056fedcacd917d0ba3e8","be8d224370bc43578a65a08ced37fce6d18a92371be497cf10eaa187170cde15","a76ef875b5dad58009dcd88f1d414b81e65eca6ce30462f706fa6ba510398f56","971ff98fec8138d82f9573a7e301a5ca8ac153b8f23f58259687c5bc72f71bc0","1514fd4516e89897a79de8a7e4fcd331e00fac19ca674b00c09342790d51a658","cad1b67fb8c337b81e68bbcc03aaad55e264872dd3f354eb1214928bbb69a263","2f4ee9bdd8532c4872746de0e759ac6770751a9ded809891b51b3574f7f871bd","a0c40c5e89130e453180529cf35bd8d3aea521e5c949a4e959938c6df26d5b4a","6bd07bb552b2fc45ad24d90110e34bb4f070f662277e947b5eb19e1dab5349a0","41