::R2-2409923 Clarification on LTM capabilities.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2409923.zip::R2-2409923 Clarification on LTM capabilities.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"As CPAC, LTM SCG support should be excluded for RedCap and eRedCap UEs to maintain the simplicity and efficiency of RedCap and eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LTM SCG is not supported for RedCap and eRedCap UEs. ","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"It may be misunderstood that LTM SCG is supported for RedCap and eRedCap UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"9f70bee92f76649c6ed81d740db642fdfd93605b3845feafe499297c6a4d2e50","original_member_sha256":"d3bc2fd41c3f8e34d6778be1d149eaa1e928aa6297949f72f4cd287ce304e992","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5877177e8fcfc39459bdafc9c3da47ee0c6c70591699ff5f7650d7489d783c03","adce0c6ee4d680644f826db0793750312eba912ed5a2de9a71159634707ce242","577c9d949ba0a74a07e5a1ba7104d20e53cf2fe2c8a406227da29f5a750fe0c7","d730d29ac2adb195253103e0297bec75113146fa61d5f162f0fe00d15f529f25","d8678451972d3d62bc621c6abf162f8f0ae908ce1cffa0d0c5bfcdfcb8b77308","35993305186f370174bc12e984393c7396bf3ac02f2b24bfda4a83e9f9f86065","e5d46b8b7a39a2cdc2b546aa1da79dafa02fb42c8b7dfb9d0e80e1226ab9e392","24b78453fa54772a834c543814d01d180ee5188560ab1233f3ffd92aa9a29c9d","372af7feb5675840ec4ba243f8882c46ce153557c01daa1279fcb9a78e4954ea","13c6e224a22ae74cff96db62a1e5c2d12949a4d51ad1122077a5a6beb404d476","f0aff98eaf8a1c7606130d1dacad65bf2b357dfda5412a52974d300c0aa6824d","9e5febf024042e07772639b9b248bea5bc360276e17f9c71fe63258f455c49b3","86b3568e3207dd50a5ddce71beed02e8f89b13c9534106d17d8187469fb15b6d","50f074e08636a69e91c02ff5910153393b6472c4897a59185bf6aa77798f09dc","78b0a5325683b8c88abda02a69e2c67b4d4bb04df90f661cbd35c8a5ba0f755a","db407d63424d31e543bbd1a58ce31858b05fcc7479d42193710483bab6c5cb50","a374340fa2a37e7f5e991171afe96ed915dd3f49b774364a51646557a490842d","28c1d32a280