{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2410825.zip::R2-2410825_MACRel17.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer as expired.","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when instruction from the upper layer has been received for starting the TimeAlignmentTimer associated with PTAG:","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start the TimeAlignmentTimer associated with PTAG.","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when a timeAlignmentTimer expires:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the timeAlignmentTimer is associated with the PTAG:","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>flush all HARQ buffers for all Serving Cells;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>notify RRC to release PUCCH for all Serving Cells, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>notify RRC to release SRS for all Serving Cells, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any configured downlink assignments and configured uplink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any PUSCH resource for semi-persistent CSI reporting;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider all running timeAlignmentTimers as expired;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of all TAGs.","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the timeAlignmentTimer is associated with an STAG, then for all Serving Cells belonging to this TAG:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>flush all HARQ buffers;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>notify RRC to release PUCCH, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>notify RRC to release SRS, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any configured downlink assignments and configured uplink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any PUSCH resource for semi-persistent CSI reporting;","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer expires:","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>notify RRC to release Positioning SRS for RRC_INACTIVE configuration(s).","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer expires:","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear any configured uplink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PDCCH addressed to the MAC entity's C-RNTI after initial transmission for the CG-SDT with CCCH message has not been received:","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2ede92023a12ac332d9ec9faf8cb59f9cd6f2198d68014e3f210dbc1c2f34c95","original_member_sha256":"b7182257b58ed78c13e310a0e0320b7b2a32b1b09686f1a0345e4df8600b4a15","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6c52f511a17211bbdefba9f76306e74123bac13af105161dd7eeceaf5c6339e3","b77617bde24727363770a9a88d5e67903234af88a1782e646d79e5fa462ed3c4","f914e8a9fc3e2d1010b9021a89fa9997d8f8e411ddc14ce6154f9d01a56e1c8e","bd5b200f3bc19a73bc60a7acff5b6641d97429e88e452f8f98f427d43bcb5036","c99eb5f0d776e4ebe4eda2341ad8b1240411d51f6705fe5d9a2826962aa228d9","30a33279768cf67e42ddf2fe9f4a8810c2d4bed2c9904151478dd4fb23219304","9430c1fadc6db805793f6f52e9aaa314392d8a814ffaafc8acc90abb1a7377d0","21aa505ec35f743a5cabd05fbbe78672814bcae2f670f6bcc1d310af0a67ce6b","93c4d294d89d47357e8fd7ccd9d4bad2ef6edc49592a1c1f907aa676c4f863a8","ddaad7a7c815ae57e1de98fc3d6f4249e056e35b9c29351d1036ad2dd640e5b7","09eaa8ab33e42008c809f98e94fd6248bee977b08923d8c6062914d7bfccf2e5","7af6aa7e6e504c34f4e1c7c266edc7772b36330c3b8b38841398d1212ee0465b","d21928e5fdde050653956202dda121cd7c3ee1705e49903028bbb71249b526f8","79e03c02d44eaded9c2d3676915ac00ea3c8e77ab60b1b67feae1ad73c56b437","68ffda48467edc5f2dde6838bb240af9c1645ce9697204822b554a66224454d0","ddf3642573f59f954fad78ed92f69dc71847d44b84d947591b5845ae6f7c569b","bf8eb7c5e59a62f9cd410a8b2ece863f96494b5ed9d726094f373717fce6f745","63e683f2659604f6513caf35a0f2d246e1bab3fc2aaa629440d26996e190eb52","7d81608e2a46c89e059d032b4ae1234219162dd6ae8fbcac7a5f31f645464164","77b10e34e9fbe09494f67eeb67827e3971c48c40e891e85f496472fe32ab8f32","a5de995e445d33ee1401bae4eeddfe0d438f4671011c5b6a122326abcf33e8d1","6a2c715f7385412261515a070e4bd1552064517a7fd361312ccde0840bb4ed85","5ca38ecbcc0ad055856c6ddd24bc04c823bc2264a4e25cfdb819e44faa76a41e","04d65d747b475b978f8a2b3b8c8ddac5290f06f9811ce4a44332c29687a78572"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2410825.zip::R2-2410825_MACRel17.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2410825.zip::R2-2410825_MACRel17.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider ongoing CG-SDT procedure as terminated;","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the expiry of cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer to the upper layer.","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>flush all HARQ buffers;","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the MAC entity stops uplink transmissions for an SCell due to the fact that the maximum uplink transmission timing difference between TAGs of the MAC entity or the maximum uplink transmission timing difference between TAGs of any MAC entity of the UE is exceeded, the MAC entity considers the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the SCell as expired.","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission on a Serving Cell except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission when the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the TAG to which this Serving Cell belongs is not running, CG-SDT procedure is not ongoing and Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE as in clause 5.26 is not ongoing. Furthermore, when the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the PTAG is not running, CG-SDT procedure is not ongoing and Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE as in clause 5.26 is not ongoing, the MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission on any Serving Cell except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission on the SpCell. The MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission when the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer is not running during the ongoing CG-SDT procedure as triggered in clause 5.27 and the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer is not running.","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of Changes","paragraph_zero_based":199}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2ede92023a12ac332d9ec9faf8cb59f9cd6f2198d68014e3f210dbc1c2f34c95","original_member_sha256":"b7182257b58ed78c13e310a0e0320b7b2a32b1b09686f1a0345e4df8600b4a15","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3241d94552fafc36076dcac4cc3e5c6c3d755bf735124369f86d06e514dbe75e","17d3f26a34dfab76b4dbc458e63fbf6988d69a798f111bc92b7bd07b6093cef0","837232b9e3890ab522ee150ee535e9aa8509f15a71fb627b89a6b4e32bf51a6a","6fd3ce8933ab505897cddb8f32da0dc507ccc6a327908fec5b8f704cc2aee3b0","9c28dc4b791c34546405293316ade32963fe4b1050e75b921e6926d395e1a75b","1700b5ff807e26ea9c3995902280ed837a00080ccb64780bcafc3cbaec104a74","dd9d244565201f55ff4a854feb74f04709ebaba14f446a1e10191a0120652f66","2e7f424667bfac2d64242628c00c829af72b2cd85373fe9cd63580eab912ba07"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,199],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2410825.zip::R2-2410825_MACRel17.docx:p192"}
