{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Beginning of Changes","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2Maintenance of Uplink Time Alignment","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRC configures the following parameters for the maintenance of UL time alignment:","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-timeAlignmentTimer (per TAG) which controls how long the MAC entity considers the Serving Cells to the associated TAG to be uplink time aligned for the TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer which controls how long the MAC entity considers the Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE in clause 5.26 to be uplink time aligned;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer which controls how long the MAC entity considers the uplink transmission for CG-SDT to be uplink time aligned;","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT which controls how long the MAC entity considers Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE in clause 5.26 to be uplink time aligned when SRS positioning validity area is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall:","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when a Timing Advance Command MAC CE is received, and if an NTA (as defined in TS 38.211 [8]) has been maintained with the indicated TAG:","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the Timing Advance Command for the indicated TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is ongoing Positioning SRS Transmission in RRC_INACTIVE as in clause 5.26:","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRS positioning validity area is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT associated with the indicated TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer associated with the indicated TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if CG-SDT procedure triggered as in clause 5.27 is ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer associated with the indicated TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the indicated TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when a Timing Advance Command is received in a Random Access Response message for a Serving Cell configured with two TAGs or in a MSGB for an SpCell configured with two TAGs:","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the Random Access Preamble was not selected by the MAC entity among the contention-based Random Access Preamble:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the Timing Advance Command for the TAG indicated in the received Random Access Response message or MSGB;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart the timeAlignmentTimer associated with TAG indicated in the received Random Access Response message or MSGB.","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"475d0bd37e37b8aa508fe73eee1a8fb22927094fb103de8fe516608b9cb06d0a","original_member_sha256":"b6e2f6b9b9a49c6e03bb802fbf01fa6ee28f44f95781fdac844951b2e4b263a7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["43f33cc46603c87f9fa0fd77fbf0c93db79d5cec8b20269dfff5e48d6010932b","bcbcc805a33966bd284f29476ca1dd4d2290474278834d2b1a9b4ec14a9ff2a3","de8046f3855df1bbee17ec131fbcbb3c16fbafb9d7b8aa57f81a41094bd5fd2c","939405be33085d58203fe8572657e3dc17c4b7333443ea4a45d56134bfd3fa6c","e743e1891cf833a201a4251e78c629c50f68c1517f6c98fed17c8f8e75bf4515","48cd31cb1dc856f79343c4847c73e4c90c71c149c73ef0107819c5b20d27c643","c4eaa1564b54148391225b958ee8ab869848330777730f429a2348ce51b7a14e","156b104d0e935e45c2979b7c648e379f4226a5e394b6ba423e8924fcf1155f02","ed5dfc761536daab0e0b52e0635d87b5fb6e9f7b113298c42cb6827d3d3627e2","7bd45db186aa553a5d1fc1436eabd6702b2dd7355941c12db1c495e6e888c28f","5954a878bae21dd4a3b917298dbd2bb313b5d0416eab94381609e01cc8075256","02459eb4cf61504b59188668a72baf8fce690a5fa7abfd285b9889c13fdb10a8","143b00d45321f4219dbda94857f9cdf6ff912b04110c7f79b407dea6390f9acd","a09f87d92bead48f957b057228e01a07f9c334e435b676183b9cc36d647f806c","db1225ac3a8076e5775bd6ee942cea89b03a82c3d26d8bc05f432fe55898a253","e1c282f2ac77a54847ca555d2f8b93bb038124dece479a3857677624201e7551","128d2e3f46705cebc9d66136566c1e2c8324721f33a81df8df404c41d056c408","3986cca86ebc5e53644d6d47dbc6a1a0e1e30349a058430b8ceda00ccace6d78","1a3e8cac5d8e561c42713397260819c9eeb7ee1cfcb44f29a5541b483c0ad994","cfe1790b46a81f7c43dc7fa73a46eadc00a6e2bb564c5e3df957617c69c3433f","2704b7715a3918275e58a0c6d0820a2ef2595653ce1dbbe4f5f9e08a1e0c3d95","12751522de444e5b1518c2c300b79988b8c1d6a6199e5287c34a4e3eb49a23d5","bde9a67b2b978bd63521e26fbfe9a4412c7b6bb579889cf2756f1a55086019fb","c48d9659c99be968c81a676c3ce8e3e2d801c13fff024d04d3cb608834aeacfa"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the TAG indicated in the received Random Access Response message or MSGB is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the Timing Advance Command for this TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when the Contention Resolution is considered not successful as described in clause 5.1.5:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ignore the received Timing Advance Command.","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when a Timing Advance Command is received in a Random Access Response message for a Serving Cell not configured with two TAGs or in a MSGB for an SpCell not configured with two TAGs:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the Random Access Preamble was not selected by the MAC entity among the contention-based Random Access Preamble:","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the Timing Advance Command for this TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart the timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the Timing Advance Command for this TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when the Contention Resolution is considered not successful as described in clause 5.1.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when the Contention Resolution is considered successful for SI request as described in clause 5.1.5, after transmitting HARQ feedback for MAC PDU including UE Contention Resolution Identity MAC CE:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when the Contention Resolution is considered not successful as described in clause 5.1.5:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if CG-SDT procedure triggered as in clause 5.27 is ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the NTA value to the value before applying the received Timing Advance Command as in TS 38.211 [8].","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when the Contention Resolution is considered successful for Random Access procedure while the CG-SDT procedure is ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer associated with this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when the Contention Resolution is considered successful for Random Access procedure while Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE is ongoing as in clause 5.26:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"475d0bd37e37b8aa508fe73eee1a8fb22927094fb103de8fe516608b9cb06d0a","original_member_sha256":"b6e2f6b9b9a49c6e03bb802fbf01fa6ee28f44f9578