{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>notify RRC to release SRS for all Serving Cells, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any configured downlink assignments and configured uplink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any PUSCH resource for semi-persistent CSI reporting;","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider all running timeAlignmentTimers as expired;","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of all TAGs.","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the timeAlignmentTimer is associated with a TAG for an SCell configured with only this TAG; or","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the timeAlignmentTimer is associated with a TAG for an SCell, and if the SCell is configured with two TAGs and the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the other TAG is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>flush all HARQ buffers for all such SCells;","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>notify RRC to release PUCCH, if configured for all such SCells;","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>notify RRC to release SRS, if configured for all such SCells;","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear any configured downlink assignments and configured uplink grants for all such SCells;","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear any PUSCH resource for semi-persistent CSI reporting for all such SCells;","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the timeAlignmentTimer is associated with a TAG for a Serving Cell configured with two TAGs, and if the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the other TAG is running, for all such Serving Cells:","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear any configured downlink assignment, if the activated TCI state(s) for all PUCCH resources configured for the configured downlink assignment is associated with the TAG of the expired timeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear any configured uplink grant, if the activated TCI state(s) for the configured uplink grant is associated with the TAG of the expired timeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>clear any PUSCH resource for semi-persistent CSI reporting, if the activated TCI state(s) for the PUSCH resource is associated with the TAG of the expired timeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer expires:","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>notify RRC to release Positioning SRS for RRC_INACTIVE configuration(s).","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer expires:","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear any configured uplink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PDCCH addressed to the MAC entity's C-RNTI after initial transmission for the CG-SDT with CCCH message has not been received:","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"475d0bd37e37b8aa508fe73eee1a8fb22927094fb103de8fe516608b9cb06d0a","original_member_sha256":"b6e2f6b9b9a49c6e03bb802fbf01fa6ee28f44f95781fdac844951b2e4b263a7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a1f4fa0d859d7e1300daec2ae27bd076bc5001588c081bc62d50a5f7cfc4884b","8f14dccae4e422e356e3cfc246f4488d0256cf89c5357a45afbb7d13d98861ee","0a2f41a9f99aa98ca7ca2dd355c9391404e8f6443c0ac008decf26e83561f0ac","33fc6daddbaa0c9d720f45f0aadd0c5f91e9fcea19acb70b602347969b7e0f6f","f3fb77e39df7bb199d00cb395d5b01d8e170b1172342a6ed89bbd51549698f05","b148bb59796e6f9fcad70529bc95e9f3cd363a263317bdb2dda7c28e4e1c9afa","bbaa5408640573e941b77e2b33be4bbc3cb99fa42e0c82a85a5c4fc385292a08","83ea0979fda3cc490f34bd6b6fb085e2012eafdec7de1ee165aa4d3c4bb04355","2ef794d1d37efe008a07ffbdf7f1fd234dc71e56469e5259b9efec349a2a2893","066d82e69d5cadf9c7e4032e8cc4161055c7272495d3fe2c23dac95ed30c0ee8","63cee4bd65339e69a1b674a6b2f22a0b280b353d9f19308881101959e25414d0","20be79ceaf7f298bc6d054a2ac5ed174e8f5162d2e4a1481bd1879b2a2673928","0e64c5f15b0b475cedfcc0dde81a425447e3af24fe9cc5b5993bf1cc0a78fe15","6521a671b6f9f8aae10612a01d682ce6e8949d98dd248263c902195beb08a0e0","36d80981f86789de30e8727d8c0d942499d1a088b1ab4f7b9c048c22a2f34f59","dfbc31e18922600c31588ce5f6d2ffb06013b4ff66e5786c624d4697bac0041f","96e5a2b5c4846a02484512f7a7cb14396b1159ce5e1febe271dfea3cd63da371","33c7eade578a4f68520ae9cb57e2c3c1e8db94be0b4cf5fd3e5e42f9f76466e2","cb88f1492eea7879e0ab8cc1e24988e444a26001ced99ab864a823e51bea0a61","235905d32098291b699da0a35fe0d74c11285801930d6f51cf468294f246bea1","3725265b852722b0ff7a9074b9f8c0cb685d3674b88f48bd2d94f80a8083eb43","671ec8791560cfb0993f5455abc1d07db928697195462693e3081be8b84c2df6","a1490503f3bda6eb5bb0db0ac0716d3907c89712312bac995c642fef81c52faa","f845a1a914cf9a22a61fcc14d77e40cea17d5900335cd4199e032b908a7ea4a8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx:p216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider ongoing CG-SDT procedure as terminated;","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate the expiry of cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer to the upper layer.","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>flush all HARQ buffers;","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>maintain NTA (defined in TS 38.211 [8]) of this TAG.","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the MAC entity stops uplink transmissions for an SCell not configured with two TAGs due to the fact that the maximum uplink transmission timing difference between TAGs of the MAC entity or the maximum uplink transmission timing difference between TAGs of any MAC entity of the UE is exceeded, the MAC entity considers the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the SCell as expired.","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the MAC entity stops uplink transmissions associated to a STAG for an SCell configured with two TAGs due to the fact that the maximum uplink transmission timing difference between TAGs of the MAC entity or the maximum uplink transmission timing difference between TAGs of any MAC entity of the UE is exceeded, the MAC entity considers the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the STAG as expired.","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission on a Serving Cell except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission when the timeAlignmentTimer(s) associated with all TAG(s) to which this Serving Cell belongs is not running, CG-SDT procedure is not ongoing and Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE as in clause 5.26 is not ongoing. Furthermore, when the timeAlignmentTimer(s) associated with all PTAG(s) is not running, CG-SDT procedure is not ongoing and Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE as in clause 5.26 is not ongoing, the MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission on any Serving Cell except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission on the SpCell. The MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission when the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer is not running during the ongoing CG-SDT procedure as triggered in clause 5.27 and the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer or inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT is not running. The MAC entity shall not perform any uplink transmission except the Random Access Preamble and MSGA transmission on a Serving Cell using TCI state(s) associated with a TAG for which the timeAlignmentTimer is not running.","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of Changes","paragraph_zero_based":248}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"475d0bd37e37b8aa508fe73eee1a8fb22927094fb103de8fe516608b9cb06d0a","original_member_sha256":"b6e2f6b9b9a49c6e03bb802fbf01fa6ee28f44f95781fdac844951b2e4b263a7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["79b587389993949b892d3c183da1af553c5a7a06a4764d24ae677d6eb67562e7","c8b3bbe7846e8da00bef648234bb78079649ba8f1545a02c2eaf465fbf6026d7","1b323c064cb78460b1ab8b6aac10c023d52ac3ea7bee01fc5fabdd3e972bda23","e9a918c21872e19390efb60963483fb5a7c3e638d7a51de7edd22918a10d27b3","613c00b09c9bdfd0d989008b9b93a8667be97f9fa2e8e5e57b447c8c3266505d","c4c5d7a54ece1fcc7b0b4936b5ca025b3129b9a78fcaf5af9e9aaafa7998c801","20e3ef9e8723c48a246412ae788da105ee87536b66eabc7f363bb0b26a0aa588","dd9d244565201f55ff4a854feb74f04709ebaba14f446a1e10191a0120652f66","2e7f424667bfac2d64242628c00c829af72b2cd85373fe9cd63580eab912ba07"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[240,248],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2410826.zip::R2-2410826 MAC.docx:p240"}
