nfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e0c257c70d07100f1ede427a4f65f560f2201057cbf73ef45f430ec77898d451","original_member_sha256":"c33e87983ca56840fbfb3ece9b2b5c25c1e6cd4e9cf14026330d400169e5fdbe","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["161730e0441b8380da256f71bf094a50164817ff7052362ae7c2610d54dd0a72","df84768d57694511a601ba3c1a6f7ee65d5ea072e90d68d5b484d73c403253eb","82a27b051e67ed2bb34f451fc3421b36efa24d2ac32e49f5e1e2201c3deb2539","767adb2a192179ae5ed2d57e127e00a5d352c1de214d025be39e7a5a02b8e564","7903338e5e9fcdaf9db737df103abf05d33be69a540c9181d779e6f7a0d7db4c","68efae5905af5fdefcb1666ae57a9bd950ff3f67a747ff5c8911794882be6813","facd5c89d9553630bfa3b310b8795d0fa69e5a0bd76565ca7cb023c057689f03","059fa590597ff98bc88762aa64d2ef53ec46ed4e00f1c0a23b5967a8ac0403cc","a5f9ed33cfb18c576b6142d986c4c565764d64d25975e2f5ab35043267cf4c2b","95115cb59432ade74fd9c5ead3cc6242ec941443ffdf714f8b2fa82164609506","b77431b98ad0d157e4f7ff3dc0a4e8bd9f414f13a792ff3000c4bfc3411e5ef5","df9c573f410fff00618b49586303530e4ccba19acb08a78bda0dc25513fcefcb","a587372044234825a778cc4db9de9743fb3be0d9ae7043f4a8f9ba08115b83b4","718492afb33486bf506732b41b520da9929d8e871805cddddc3b271e228752e4","2a6bd39d2a7b267fb7498fb5953a37873a6e4d085e0acff5f5a32a0779609887","1f5cf24f93c6f14b00da471b2b7b77d78ca1d1cba85544e9db3c3c05c52b2a22","2ce9ee582d16b386af44c9bac7d046d9f89dda4844296e129b8a0d9ca928e502","aa822abd7ce7a35638b418c2393fc5b19450135ef840632c7e03b87c743e3f85","5466036223f718f16c535eb45f995e912ac8b53f7839c37731ec64d60a1713db","039439566740bc40ddff53786c3185c4032e3f466ccbe05190b2704131311b07","5dd5b12cc1075364d286dd5eab7eb10a5e54858d511b2ec0ec17d79ee5913e81","7f548ca646ce40ad2ad74f017f4018420b59177a2e98fdbee814a7b81290bc42","ba7524660acb5c32399ed4eaa6088df7e9f796a232f2e75c87d30bc3ddd13133","cdb6a60f21961c671f1e645cb85680b318121ff8f47ca0039bc7cecdb6dd1ec3"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2502074.zip::R2-2502074 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for RRC_final.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502074.zip::R2-2502074 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for RRC_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"==================================CHANGE BEGINS=====================================","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.5Acquisition of SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP not configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1, or","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo or posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB or requested posSIB:","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested SIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus in posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-BroadcastStatus of the type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus in posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-BroadcastStatus of the type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e0c257c70d07100f1ede427a4f65f560f2201057cbf73ef45f430ec77898d451","original_member_sha256":"c33e87983ca56840fbfb3ece9b2b5c25c1e6cd4e9cf14026330d400169e5fdbe","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b0dce9993f911d63ef9c7f656398253de44fc7f644dea79d48d2f9ad3945824f","507037ab7b06d482a6c9c195e6e6bf1d463ec0751d776442a4a5ba582ed3746f","929c613d4f42be2fd97f7d081870799918c60c807b599d0e1e0cea47215f53fe","46c46c667ee4bb53601289ca6430cc03e8eb60e774ba444edd89cfcb63331f46","ba8b9996d54888bc5636c4e5a1218b1e40b5a3c1d02df1af976b0e32a50d2d56","ce1ca019c88b1fa0b05544b88e55ba32432c108309183e81831c70231b3d1ca3","15653429a917c25c71798f11e2719976b96973544f132c073c0e47aeb1f946a9","3aa147a6795c92dbe05cfdbfed28f5b0bc9e7d68f6108621aa85031516c8480c","1b5725ac6e2769c8f50b367d5dd036d5cb0dd6e47462f047440d630fef020c1b","239f2240c857874689ffe7ed39797c1314735b702c436dae05f455b10318ed65","ad76d8db59c1d81e267c72b7af3bca1551a201a6a0c03fd4c40d598e4fc87a4d","dbc50093af7bcdf18105509e0f0210e1fddb6eb8f50bdd869bb11dd9f8652f5e","f87aaff707c2b6b76f6e2ff477a997962fc3235450d00cf64cef7c89f69adfbd","c5f557ced4aba7f161d3259749850404dafc3a65e943cc4d1aef4bb664b5e5b1","7fc0d778492e6c0a86e8341cd161994baf0459298d3824b3af4f14958e36c947","395054034034aa593a68a9efb106cbfc700169b72a0e16289968942bdd288c08","dcbd99da0b29ecfbc46ee2f2b4f8f469ee44a2e0d408af97a274aed473dc8861","d632f2f9879a0a8ecdf8b7d4f17a24546f0e728a127c2377a893b5fafe1743f0","22ebe5ce9f7dd24658b8dbf531574fdbfa1575a2e4d67a152ffa3e2634b443d2","0a3b8b1925a7770dd0fea38ecfdd34ff8b37078308d075157e37fd5186c026cd","e2f9aa2f40a70cf2c2f6fd3bd203713a5c804e0b5af0dbca9935d3e7454133f0","95e3e1b899179399edbf7707be76d91d25446e83d5a62468283d61a686dcd555","cbb536399cf6da57f4ac07425bf3011918de6950c95800a63055f442229dafa1","1903676d0222f13fd5a49030edb7649a56ca4cb38340167312d41936e159f53b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2502074.zip::R2-2502074 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for RRC_final.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502074.zip::R2-2502074 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for RRC_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested posSIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:UE may include on demand request for SIB and/or posSIB(s) in the same DedicatedSIBRequest message.","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.6Actions related to transmission of DedicatedSIBRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of DedicatedSIBRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required posSIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedPosSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested posSIB(s).","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the field onDemandSIB-RequestCtrlParam is configured: ","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if periodic delivery of the posSIB(s) is required by the upper layer; or","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the periodic delivery previously requested is no longer required by the upper layer:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the deliveryAmount to the requested number of periodic deliveries for the requested posSIB(s).","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the DedicatedSIBRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"=======================================================NEXT CHANGE===========================================================","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DedicatedSIBRequest","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The DedicatedSIBRequest message is used to request SIB(s) required by the UE in RRC_CONNECTED as specified in clause 5.2.2.3.5.","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: DCCH","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to Network","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e0c257c70d07100f1ede427a4f65f560f2201057cbf73ef45f430ec77898d451","original_member_sha256":"c33e87983ca56840fbfb3ece9b2b5c25c1e6cd4e9cf14026330d400169e5fdbe","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1e193ad60a0c4631a4c96d9214ddd1cbf720b9212e0e6b408f5a733ff57144fc","46ee1cce601a07270d972f26221549daec083b4bd8112d0d91f31f3e88e3b5a4","f21e9c4b4f384b60f7d9f48e5ffae958d3d8197ef0f438d9f41dbbfe7b391cfb","883ec26fccda5834f62ed2583e5