{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502075.zip::R2-2502075 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for UE capability_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-SideRTT-BasedPDC-r17","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports gNB-side RTT-based PDC, as specified in TS 38.300 [28]. A UE supporting this feature shall also support rtt-BasedPDC-CSI-RS-ForTracking-r17 and/or rtt-BasedPDC-PRS-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"hardSatelliteSwitchResyncNTN-r18","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports hard satellite switch with re-sync, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate the support of nonTerrestrialNetwork-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When UE supports this feature and does not support softSatelliteSwitchResyncNTN-r18, this UE is able to perform hard satellite switch with re-sync in a network supporting soft satellite switch with re-sync, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"inactiveState","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports RRC_INACTIVE as specified in TS 38.331 [9]. This capability is not applicable to NCR-MT.","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"inactiveStateNTN-r17","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports RRC_INACTIVE in NTN as specified in TS 38.331 [9]. It is mandated if the UE indicates the support of nonTerrestrialNetwork-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CY","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"07548170a78db80f735ccee09196c0bd7319249104911a4435888a81fa42ebc8","original_member_sha256":"4e1426c6554f6ae9bf90d915c14ab4f606ef4e51023d4fc251844e3b54784cc2","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e0d4a64ed91370e048ce31ad3f2cb8cdbf5fde78c442dabd1c27342cba197359","1de0662360e309f21d73b658ca4adabb179bd30d35218ab52c08885c5f67e492","43aea4b99ec5e22ba224f2c3740393620f927f2f85528dbf8d28dbf0d1b3f710","da5aee5f2a5855dd01d7ef6c1c4d96df5ac4baaebe4f4ccf75d4c58fae02e826","e89a9f17ceddd7328d380c50c978fd467e8aa9c58b8c748050bc40b82cc093af","eea6aa9c79cee188df8fc728de3dc189fa3d3f8fd39a899752466ffd368c0413","4a2cde0e32ffaf17d6e00f791451c0b7cb8546ef93effb9ee8a0cee8570304b5","9683e26a6c8282f3b8eeadcd2355ecf24a5b0212b9ce0d79ef13b7ab6c257101","5e4eb59d92450ff6a54d75bb48961feb0b5e183cc7091d96ce3aaf1a5197710a","7b0435efcafe3879290deeac3dd87314c9a9398592c5dd1b23ca6ecc37f351a9","cf0b6f70be726e3dec19e3ed39f7ea37f0bc947433f279f8bf5fd654955b09ba","6ce8d54ede20bf0f4e4f59c9ef87825b0c2ad53123aeae35c558cf3a7daf0636","aee8d4d6fe923ec7d1cec9e339434a32e1b3fbc960463069e4ec155721e788f6","d4