{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502075.zip::R2-2502075 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for UE capability_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ra-InsteadCG-SDT-r18","paragraph_zero_based":360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the selection of RACH resources instead of configured grant type 1 resource when triggering resume for MO-SDT or MT-SDT and next configured grant type 1 resource is too far, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate the support of cg-SDT-r17, or mt-CG-SDT-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ra-SDT-r17","paragraph_zero_based":367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports initiating MO-SDT procedure (i.e., transmission of data and/or signalling over allowed radio bearers in RRC_INACTIVE state) via Random Access procedure (i.e., RA-SDT) with 4-step RA type and if UE supports twoStepRACH-r16, with 2-step RA type, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ra-SDT-NTN-r17","paragraph_zero_based":373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports initiating MO-SDT procedure (i.e., transmission of data and/or signalling over allowed radio bearers in RRC_INACTIVE state) in NTN via Random Access procedure (i.e., RA-SDT) with 4-step RA type and if UE supports twoStepRACH-r16 for NTN, with 2-step RA type, as specified in TS 38.331 [9]. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate the support of nonTerrestrialNetwork-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"redirectAtResumeByNAS-r16","paragraph_zero_based":379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports reception of redirectedCarrierInfo in an RRCRelease message in response to an RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 which is triggered by the NAS layer, as specified in TS 38.331 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"07548170a78db80f735ccee09196c0bd7319249104911a4435888a81fa42ebc8","original_member_sha256":"4e1426c6554f6ae9bf90d915c14ab4f606ef4e51023d4fc251844e3b54784cc2","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e635653ecc6f9329f66b828fb48fd4bb00bdcba0deb776a9eb7d99b013a42f53","cb364ca78c7db862d1fdd0059c3df4aa534d14b1b28ab0f0eb4ac1ef084aefaf","ad20edc87a1176c47c91a7d4d332b2ed14f44ce8d8784013f4f2f79712b303db","3a1bccda4a7a1af768de91483df1e0ce53b9d7ac35fdc8f014a2d15993efd20e","b5e506dcdb8c64d6f8d32d749fc58e450c93595441030c1354467fd55f68a98c","b3d343d32f83020f2227b58c42a776f6936d12c79d8f85977e63bffb864eb28d","d31ca7869204b4bb6856b99b791b8736a3582cc384869dc67b6c03a7d57900de","c9c64325aa8b1a6a55fd8900b3a9cffd85a0ff267f5deb5c5fbd0ae582dd5