{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502076.zip::R2-2502076 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for stage2_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For a cell/frequency that is considered for camping by the UE, the UE is not required to acquire the contents of the minimum SI of that cell/frequency from another cell/frequency layer. This does not preclude the case that the UE applies stored SI from previously visited cell(s).","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE cannot determine the full contents of the minimum SI of a cell by receiving from that cell, the UE shall consider that cell as barred.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of BA, the UE only acquires SI on the active BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is configured with inter cell beam management:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the UE is not required to acquire the SI from the serving cell while it is receiving DL-SCH from a TRP with PCI different from serving cell's PCI.","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"====================================CHANGE END====================================","paragraph_zero_based":173}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"57a44441dc2231eda5a9e13afbfeda7be2575fe7ed2655e031198b8ccf913085","original_member_sha256":"162039dce987bc4dcbe7fe19d66ff9661a04ff195449c8e74879478f564af0a1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a9168150cfaca3bd29b2ceda9e0a57e84e38820766f36cd90bbf8db4f3f26791","ce968f8804fa502e82b380d75b8187045ce529f9680529a3d33bceb684e15e35","26e6257d0917bda36909e63e7f8ce9f92b504ade63871b2e128863a80577e1e2","582d0650d4cfda9555d7ec8e989b073beb1aa9434e4839c770d68a2cae9980c7","ba7c17bd317cf072914cd985fd0988c7947126979967847b735c0d15d77d2f13","957e5f79bf70b23519be560a35426ef55b85424293c991d61c6f1a2b90d5fe06"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,173],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2502076.zip::R2-2502076 Introudction of control parameters for on-demand posSIB request for stage2_final.docx:p168"}
