{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502078.zip::R2-2502078 Correction on UTW for positioning SRS freq hopping_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"D","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"There are currently some confusions on the wording “MAC instructs the PHY for SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping” in the MAC spec within the UTW window. This does not mean that the UE does not transmit SRS outside of the UTW window. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Some improvements in the wording have been proposed to make matters clear.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"On the confusion for MAC modelling, MAC spec has control over the transmission of SRS already as of today. One example can be seen in the DRX operations. ","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Revise the spec that within the UTW, the UE procedure for SRS transmission for positioning Tx frequency hopping is defined in the PHY spec. ","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-Operability analysis:","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ddebae022a1023b5fa169df11e1143a683d22a075bd471ce9203075b0e6cf8e6","original_member_sha256":"079347550824507143451300739b9458470390d3606d1be737bdc5d4836fbe92","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","ab118db76bef36a4505e56491a4fa0804b39f8ba0c0cfd6d6c15ce62798a4a82","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","1d049f432a92b1eec9f0ac8a6c9935e2adb40849fc94128f47418f48a2b8ec2b","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","f439ea8fefde97178c1c6b158c1ff05161a2262418d39e7b133465990e176835","dd3de490bf00baf5087f33777fa272abbec9623033d71526d5355fb97ee7f36f","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c