{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502078.zip::R2-2502078 Correction on UTW for positioning SRS freq hopping_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodic and semi-persistent Positioning SRS with or without positioning SRS bandwidth aggregation can be configured for Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping as in clause 5.32 can also be configured for Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall,","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the TA of the configured Positioning SRS is valid according to clause 5.26.2, and the conditions for positioning SRS transmission in clause 7.3.1 of TS 38.213 [6] and clause 6.2.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] are satisfied:","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct to the lower layer according to TS 38.214 [7] to transmit Periodic or Semi-Persistent Positioning SRS that is activated according to clause 5.18.17 or clause 5.18.37.","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"===========================NEXT CHANGE===========================================","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.32SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping can be supported for UE in RRC_CONNECTED and RRC_INACTIVE. The UE can be configured with UTW during which the UE is allowed to transmit SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRC configures the following parameters for the UTW for SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping:","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-utw-SlotPeriodicity: Periodicity of the UTW in slot;","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-utw-SlotOffset: Offset of the beginning of the UTW with respect to the beginning of the UTW periodicity in time domain in slot;","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-duration: Time duration of the UTW for SRS transmission for positioning Tx frequency hopping.","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When UTW is configured, the  UTW starts in the first symbol of the slot for which the following condition is satisfied","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CURRENT_slot modulo (utw-SlotPeriodicity) = utw-SlotOffset","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"where CURRENT_slot = SFN × numberOfSlotsPerFrame + slot number in the frame and numberOfSlotsPerFrame refers to the number of consecutive slots per frame as specified in TS 38.211 [8] and continues for time duration defined by duration.","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When UTW is configured and within the UTW, the UE's procedure for SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping is specified in TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"========================= CHANGE ENDS==============================================","paragraph_zero_based":138}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ddebae022a1023b5fa169df11e1143a683d22a075bd471ce9203075b0e6cf8e6","original_member_sha256":"079347550824507143451300739b9458470390d3606d1be737bdc5d4836fbe92","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5c6fec10f632a537b03f75731920f7e4e993358410a48425f6b5a25c1c01c25d","cd8b2891afff5dc1d21bbbe20eae7c90890caa91de9f854e550125dc57919111","6d22d180308679675512f9e2accb2e4b074961f1838cc2f59ef