{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2502080.zip::R2-2502080 Correction on SRS hopping in positioning.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"U2NUE-to-Network","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"U2UUE-to-UE","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UCIUplink Control Information","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UTO-UCIUnused Transmission Occasion - UCI","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"V2XVehicle-to-Everything","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ZP CSI-RSZero Power CSI-RS","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.26Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.26.1General","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodic and semi-persistent Positioning SRS with or without positioning SRS bandwidth aggregation can be configured for Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS for positioning Tx frequency hopping can also be configured for Positioning SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall,","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the TA of the configured Positioning SRS is valid according to clause 5.26.2, and the conditions for positioning SRS transmission in clause 7.3.1 of TS 38.213 [6] and clause 6.2.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] are satisfied:","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct to the lower layer according to TS 38.214 [7] to transmit Periodic or Semi-Persistent Positioning SRS that is activated according to clause 5.18.17 or clause 5.18.37.","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.32Void","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"aff77448aa0c29346e92838a8068d532bf7fc7cee6b626a0d28c35eb56bc62eb","original_member_sha256":"8fb21086219d6c05d0b1987abc685c28d97deafa9e4dc7a0bcec470d129ecf7a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cb3df97a9ff6b1468d624fa6ef684401dc733e061495c8f4398ebaeada8c7251","86b90624ac6598787995f60c63cb4058582ca5d73a105bd5c91c9e06a4c160d2","2c07c2dba0f77e4836f23fc6d0ce51c10976dc4a82d8d5fbae7d802b628b4860","5a8687f4b88957d2edeee67159bc87b65b0a8182830f618e5a912685babe208e","1f38f98ebafeb5f12841d69dc213167ed4651c65888f092a398c3e813d05f120","d79fdd0ab544c2a9926e64f0b741e021e58ed0b7a69a478c6a168652b7594675","0e68b48630a827bdf869f2d5549330089f7cf9698fdfc766a4babe584074d164","99576a233fe1034f850f9374bf47820eb468107f603c30f77ca6e5613bb0711a","498a828e0ceeb547aac13dc80087134dc8d356349c24ce50bcdef552e9d4834c","b24f552fec750455eb2c115e6fdca7f3d4fe112413b1e3e2ccbd683c62ee7f88","c91f532be430935f8dc0a0bb18b6cd1b0a2f573301c1cd9d75be4268e2be2553","078fe6d8b7bb6607e93f5512e9b284ef8028d7b4e1b6678021ba0819f450115c","7fc25713be497e8a34e712969f880b23c4b11ac07ac5badca90b0e4b39853b67","442ee2954801236023e8473ae5e29996d283856f6910137b6b94fab42d226ab8","9fb16b31160083cc47a8dea40ffbd704cf9184bac4f6f9959a5cf729c7e10167","b10653fd9ac3b72b30c47