{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2503192.zip::R2-2503192 RRC_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested SIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus in posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-BroadcastStatus of the type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus in posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo or si-BroadcastStatus of the type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700, if present, is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested posSIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:UE may include on demand request for SIB and/or posSIB(s) in the same DedicatedSIBRequest message.","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.6Actions related to transmission of DedicatedSIBRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of DedicatedSIBRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required posSIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if onDemandPosSIB-RequestCtrlParam is configured: ","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if periodic delivery of the posSIB(s) is required by the upper layers; or","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the periodic delivery previously requested is no longer required by the upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the posSIB(s) in the requestedPeriodicAD-PosSIB-List-r19 and set the deliveryAmount to the requested number of periodic deliveries for the posSIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> include the posSIB(s) in the requestedPosSIB-List-r16 in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested posSIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"238d3c199e96ece26711109ab9c6ea50c6e7a79f01d965f5726abaadc75d7d70","original_member_sha256":"aef358e3251a43545eb3096bd467322c204ec9bae5d4b3d32209cb0d70701bd4","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["708b834697a71703487b4150f5e8ea9c6add6701b533b552d0b49cb2a8b0d5a1","22ebe5ce9f7dd24658b8dbf531574fdbfa1575a2e4d67a152ffa3e2634b443d2","3c2f9791381d1211dfe6c5813493759bf4679ce66719e84e4b702d8562794228","e2f9aa2f40a70cf2c2f6fd3bd203713a5c804e0b5af0dbca9935d3e7454133f0","8f0f949340836474b4923d4f19603d661002bed3550e2407e2da94c8bf7cae57","cbb536399cf6da57f4ac07425bf3011918de6950c95800a63055f442229dafa1","2f92d780e157ba158565fef9ee2f2a806885b4293dc30b189126b1d8bb0d62ab","95515c952414b532896fee8986a06c7fd286e84011b4fed2f66bd8a89a0b4aaa","46ee1cce601a07270d972f26221549daec083b4bd8112d0d91f31f3e88e3b5a4","8ee20566423cb311895f0a97558fd2fbde71904e63e420bb143677c882c44217","dc0994534752565d576b38130e0dd7c45bc7267e32009a499299d0a32b7a5c3c","3a90e7d417f0f59fca3da31cf19f077cb3c11fd3254e2a6a3cae73ffb0ea827a","c9193d0a4e16d97103fe26e74f85e3af4ff7caed58181d1120dc1ed8dc11b8c6","6f67908e7e0d720eb018a8ff0b1203e76d19fc6f2e3ed5f6bacb7e2fb0e6e73a","a2fed4a0c75e4f73aeb4ee6e7abf5ea90e0087fc61773919a6437229f08b82cd","ab0977521ec91a471f78130652a613394d869f602996d7681e4d345db8ca56bf","117068c7ed6ed62ffce699abceefea05b5753944c9c5180717742658c4b632c1","d98b276198882e88ae442ff2f1c700bb08733a4e1f5663f791f7eedf5127edd6","3eaba7ab104fd7dff64e05bf2942a2e222441736661d213e83a20c12f177ca7f","9987e43a4772823a957abbf5bc0951cee3b4024eea5955bc94babb1720e3ef24","a8890f01a81f14841ed935e409a1b45d709bcab07a367d2498fe5a8834d21014","690fecb9b0c090d0df9ef88b5e3cc61babed10daeb84292bdaed90241757