{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2503192.zip::R2-2503192 RRC_final.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DEDICATEDSIBREQUEST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DedicatedSIBRequest field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedSIB-List","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of SIB(s) the UE requests while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedPosSIB-List","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of posSIB(s) the UE requests while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedPeriodicAD-PosSIB-List","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of posSIB(s) the UE may request with periodic control parameter while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PosSIB-ReqInfo field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gnss-id","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The presence of this field indicates that the request positioning SIB type is for a specific GNSS. Indicates a specific GNSS (see also TS 37.355 [49])","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sbas-id","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The presence of this field indicates that the request positioning SIB type is for a specific SBAS. Indicates a specific SBAS (see also TS 37.355 [49]). If th