{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2505772.zip::R2-2505772_MHSLRelayCap_CR_v0_Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether NR L2 sidelink remote UE operation is supported by the UE. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of supportedBandCombinationListSL-RelayDiscovery-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"remoteUE-PathSwitchToIdleInactiveRelay-r17","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether L2 sidelink remote UE supports direct to indirect path switch with target relay in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE state. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of remoteUE-Operation-L2-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"remoteUE-U2N-PathSwitchOperationL2-r18","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether enhanced NR L2 U2N remote UE operation for intra-gNB path switch and inter-gNB path switch including separate SL-RSRP and SD-RSRP threshold configurations for events X1 and X2 is supported by the UE. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of remoteUE-Operation-L2-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"remoteUE-U2U-OperationL2-r18","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether L2 U2U sidelink remote UE operation is supported by the UE. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of supportedBandCombinationListSL-U2U-RelayDiscovery-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sfn-DFN-OffsetSupported-r18","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3d0669bebb61232fe20acea50a76ee807988cbd3d6f41a5e37816ee6179e9413","original_member_sha256":"c7379de7097f64dafbf008e1c06b57228e6acf168e72c816abdff7ae0ffde250","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["629a56932e89f5be6206970144a0a213d788aaef741859edc12f8ed8b03d7849","72bdc85ed4d15aeab783da77621b15460f3d6f998cf66adc23a18e07cb00af17","0d94951a413348030bc2815554ab3222ab5626aa26d0bd9e4d2f56719089d411","59d8ba9b61e7ee8fca17102d5c72de1d8e586a22d2f08fd6ccb8467b5a73ba68","d811dd463d4fbb3a2f9ec4a713779612fcb55e09f7f5d6a630aab9f44cd0ba79","dfec34ef64c69d8c86969b2dbf82ac0025978d3729f1e4fc71b53be45272bd57","f8e1e4199eda7a43c4dd7788874818ff2f09a67c6897a7e0101805bf62c389a9","aa58830f4abee5e296f77b20095aaf060476b121d1f78ba9d116583b790ec5d4","d6a2520c6626f29ada93112ecb7c94efe2e83da2a4d964716b63061ce269d2b9","9c914fcb3401b3d8d1984197642123c095f1d59f088b91ccbd7e2025de58c892","904fdc1e1b928d482a9264dd5a45cdc5720cce56e1353d9acac8a70c7ad89edd","c92ed57d92982cb0725dd0e2c1d1bb465a1dfbda188734d3ee917be1ca0e55d2","76cab902ce66b7193547c2071b095c28c170648381e54a8bec1cfd01d6086ddd","57a247700dd5154e2c2d80055c3e2b6003614bc4159c47312a4b578b71524da5","93c37abe304ca9aa97dc4fe7545971c56415119003108814cb67138c900dbe4e","40b22bbfdff9d45477860d3ca874228c14e52fd4436f8b19acb4a730ba0110dc","c4f636234516e5005a88c585ced89809dd0a5eeb4ca28d63b3942e0a23dd4119","26ea0bf1ae60119d8fbff39f429630c914e25b3876a7d9f269ba7c55ede58908","e5ef20ce7fe0b3a70463cede0cf9b4fdfdd8a7c942799efc3d762d53f17220a6","4150539020a7da3521093d705e81c1d2fc7318de343c394dc3ff71af75c13334","fc9e918eef82e79566fbdff372e185e44b7e67d787b17f0e924ec134a7136bc9","2ce8d4b1be211c08675b3f7ba0928de983f4cb2e2a532ec822cae8e334842f40","0784fe575f00fa326615eb5ba40e61d2d99c5809309ec2f522d768ebc84efe4c","ec6535ca0567ee6628edf05c7d2f7f9f3e1ca3ee195c21ccba05f9ac709e062b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2505772.zip::R2-2505772_MHSLRelayCap_CR_v0_Rapp.docx:p216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2505772.zip::R2-2505772_MHSLRelayCap_CR_v0_Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE, when operating as an NR L2 sidelink relay UE, supports indication of the offset between SFN and DFN timelines.","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PRS-CommonProcCapabilityPerUE-r18","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the common SL-PRS processing capability, and comprises the following parameters:","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-maxNumOfActiveSL-PRS-Resources-r18: Maximum number of active SL PRS resources across all configured RPs across all bands in a slot assuming maximum SL PRS bandwidth in MHz, which is supported and reported by UE;","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-maxNumOfSlotswithActiveSL-PRS-Resources-r18: Maximum number of slots with active SL PRS resources across all configured RPs across all bands assuming maximum SL PRS bandwidth in MHz, which is supported and reported by UE.","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE supporting this feature shall also support sl-PRS-CommonProcCapabilityPerBand-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"splitDRB-WithUL-BothDirectIndirect-r18","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether L2 multi-path remote UE supports UL transmission via both direct path and indirect path for split DRB. A UE supporting this feature shall also indicate support of multipathRemoteUE-PC5L2-r18 or multipathRemoteUE-N3C-r18.","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGES","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A.4:Sidelink capabilities applicable to Uu and PC5","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3d0669bebb61232fe20acea50a76ee807988cbd3d6f41a5e37816ee6179e9413","original_member_sha256":"c7379de7097f64dafbf008e1c06b57228e6acf168e72c816abdff7ae0ffde250","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["db7e832f3fd6845d690fa521243015d1dbd93891c9f7e2670273cded17b83389","f916da5259d3b78cf8338bc62cf462bb74d36af0128d5a9aeabe7458833d5d52","4a292d6c9e0bb5ddecdc23348657b9cf1f5682617f200bd0746fc514576f2ca0","2c39679aed14c2c9e52d4c8b87dcce70083fba731862e45e9807173b721872d1","07b27581b378177ec63e22fbcb2f09ede680a5a43c46ed8525d4e0a4bf88b389","3ea48ea0774f12badfa3fee8a42c7df5c79d9b5cde473998cb3a96b95f38d5f5","b119c874f7e864e4fc99c75d6d52b1fae93463e30d0e2c8e53ffdf79e4f1b449","968636d6e1bedbacb3595343a537c96d09e49b6dbbc92a5097ce1681ef8e0269","80bf5e1aa49076ece9878a714cca7b76c77e9441db26353151327572d4ac0cba","af48faa4ef36c08bca726af14f5edf35de66f1bf17ceb7fa98a7978adaa415a8","b6b888942ba5a6a51ca8173bf5cade64a57026642cbe7b844d37d0391e899d82","639c99db8de63fc4359e0bb0373e5f1d44bad27ec9b60e087dc2a48ebbf4c217","bef2dae77cd134