{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2506780.zip::R2-2506780 Corrections on 38.305 CR for AIML Positioning.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-19","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"To capture the RAN2#131 agreement “The UE asks specific TRPs for PRS transmission with on-demand PRS configuration, i.e., within NR-On-Demand-DL-PRS-Request”, and some editorial corrections are made. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"To capture “UE-initiated On-Demand PRS transmission procedure allows the UE to request DL-PRS configuration information for specific TRPs” in 38.305 Clause 7.6.1","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Some editorial changes are made.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"979fe2ba5a5970300d42d6c082b964ff9175e28a978c861fb9fd885ab0869b6c","original_member_sha256":"845d752bab35e8e94c85337019358a0f9bfe17c6f04d5e6b9cae8fb230b11301","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c39c1cc1df024fc3571a34f7946636459243a3b378d2bcdc0554da16fb82d710","f071b0e223feba267569800cad8d73912afc084f7a0198f89803646cb1de388f","1a408e9e7650d33d6c64ee7e7b38ff803ee0c7fa679b31b8a1f3479d69e17c27","46bbe81b4bcba7743d866c5a7526bfa5aa99320562701f3de81afe307aea9cdf","6e6e3f7b31552740a1e67d88419145c48ae726fc39c36226234baac3a82cb7b3","ece13c0aef2e24ab52b8c2fc4422900435c72e38142e34b7ca9f8f773d25464b","35a82d59761563372b62733589b682576c5e04c8d5f263f58f6e0d4e9c10e692","5be1e67d466cb6ebd34775838a1ed34493aaef99756cf14cb715ea66557accfd","7442162c3e08e10e5e5cb741a709f27dd795a7224801f8a79a55e8b8df37cb59","a3dbcb1063936ab5c7e3049c320741f6106632cfc697a33568365a94bccfe871","d324bb675da8182fd1eec4ee29d4dea8e4b74490851c475716bb2e079d526455","f4b2ae84c6f3c5364a146976d3a87620dfadc4a5e59df62a26a88b34dfd87824","f4089e9ef6794395c0d6ed14b26f29ddb66be165982213f740148baff823a48d","af1957e4abef8b9c93692d145a8bbef7a1b1aa1cc83dba90f9cee079fdefe37e","303b6c827f5d7ce0292f402fcf61d38fa100591465501f5733d27b50a61707ad","6390c330d27c29a0c61f4947