wer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507098.zip::R2-2507098 RRC_R18_RLC-channel-config-v1.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507098.zip::R2-2507098 RRC_R18_RLC-channel-config-v1.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"First change","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7.2PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between the L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-RLC0 as specified in clause 9.1.1.4:","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in clause 9.2.4 if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE state;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between two UEs for L2 U2U relay operation, the L2 U2U Relay UE and the L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A L2 U2N relay UE initiates a PC5 Relay RLC channel addition towards a L2 U2N Remote UE if the sl-RLC-ChannelID reveived in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR is indicated for this L2 U2N Remote UE in accordance with sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay, and a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID was not configured before.","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered based on the derivation of PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration(s) for end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) as specified in 5.8.9.7.0:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current configuration contains a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5; or","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR has updated, based on which the PC5 Relay RLC channel is derived:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 was not configured before):","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config (in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or SIB12, or SidelinkPreconfigNR) or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5.","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"6a33b84ecdc1f33ed8f6c4004f7e6f935510b907b3185dac68233a5830e09dbf","original_member_sha256":"b825bcf088dee646717bcce3a09c4ddb86bbdb6f5f32b5ea519c42a69f1dcee4","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["315738738b76004d901f817378e97ad7a631c34aa19a5712a590bce88e6e3985","71052b07f52267c7bac4a6075ff0cfc1c4c40bfd5146448667a05ae680fb4797","a3c0f90a581423f3ff4ef7ee485b4f970b45e709c9c9be720582f55d4d757d88","92bc539961bfdddc7e73c22e43f9011ed5fb733fe31bdc390d36d064132383b9","338bff87595531f1f09298da74c285a8acc9d8690daaa6b2379f86930f47d73d","89349027c4f67c71e31dbbc1a7a9d96ea885ef2b14e2de447ca94c9081d5f780","4a513dd57173e5c1167bff41e72769cde8b919491a922651da09083d15cc1528","74c91352b601ea6c3b93a6ab11d02d72dd271b6093a019445ac29fb1c936aa25","af90f30a299e6d5338815910180683554a728ca90d386e989d2e6dde93ecce67","3ed0ed52f6f6d4b0bd305fa065a0e252b534162d4558f84c9c0b9b83ab1ab5ef","13b9db4d6d44989958647b4e5172ef624b04348494c64620e867632d9857154b","33337ba78dafa2f7d4db80cda696c81809864220c82abc62d8823cf56d898556","26692c553b39744593a962efd076b0defded25bce1a5f5c06d0169a7a6907ee2","0e00bb8bd167268ae4356492dd2970850c18fc0c3d61cc3213fb5b9d9e9a93b1","754f8988271a59f3e3d698cf130525a7f956c5c4a1fbe96b9b5e8269226506fc","cb21156e48d72098b79aacd4ba3827564d48d1ddd9f420b09955d85a3e2647ae","4861838f52068e4b21087023f862aeea6a8e994ca5c0b69d11b8b36b9973bd29","32c4c5871b6adc15052454abfcac2cda32772d192c9e472a20d651f064681bed","3d034c1ae4878489dfbdb29a7befd5eb17a4610f2c37a95e47143a51d81c03ed","67c3d0c431bb7e9da4095806d32dc42fb3922e2329b94d