coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bee20932aabcf7499ed0d684d3f0e81fbf9efe176f67eb754d6f22d70a3450f4","original_member_sha256":"3acf21675086b42decc367ab2f92558dbe7662050d483965693de95915905e49","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["10b78edd4db6950f105e1486b1776f1edcd5b24cb2ca2ef2b5e76c24f45a55b1","68df2b99e70dec8450036be8bcf94de725dfa7f48f2d5e149f5123a8c8fac8c9","154e4a6f6f43988dde99f9411149f2c0d6f8f4785c315fd9a4434b0dd8bcecae","695f6ea054744bcf718ebc4b54911239309727a832cf52a0f8667fee6cac4e4e","df763193a13b6d5d77df4805dbadc912cdbe1167b9d4d32fd70e557a32ceda50","b5cec20d74da4067172e1914db622dfd6d06da651ca6be5355b73c62673190a7","4d4fc2e6dc15365e7ca960a0b43a95446d988054805f2bc4da5695a59a4e9add","4b16740a1c78f0dfc261d6df2101f0004da504ba939e56c97721583d2cdfcdc0","798431e2a9029be97112fe5108168fbc20b81ef9d5ba16a4928df575bd5cf20a","eaa4c2e359ae7beedc96b42379ba0d7725797e7d9f36e966d54525e47533e866","ec898900c4307d72a52c782469196362108924e472b9707e416bf9017fa2738f","e7cac343ce6e6d3a1b66bcf74a0ea1ed81f4f96ae10aaf2a76e7df179edacf66","41166cb63d60a25a9ef34ed1bc8a4ee0be2dab5b5496c156d35a4e7af4923406","5ac73989eb2b2e237b98bb84661fb8bc09d0db7a8326013b721fa842e93d9f23","a75547934d28fa50e2aff92bd6158d97b0200d10265dcbfde8b021fdd75e6f36","f8285f760478627d689ddd7ffe1613780a8ac42eeaf0642c361c1d48f696101f","5c5a75bbcb4c41343beac84821afcde645ab0f79a6c41fe6b8cdb3e46ff297fb","324994f558c06ba025b46ab05793091547d7373aea91fed94874c08a500e3b38","f871a926577b9abc9a9bce7c8ee133439e626cb1df47952ab00f61faffe7f16f","2a3ff26b420c2143ce3c4715021af815b6d8e353668cb0dda3798b647377f942","33d9462730f49566e88a4120af57e76bea2a875833e802bf28eaf77832e75025","a1635ac900b49a6ec9d75cde9de376f5812d549b1154b95f770142dbc4729634","3635f4214fc5a542827a3e8c4ed85013441deac9d79b23b9898f93a28b9bbd3f","8c9b030b7ff7a1cecaf7fe307a12a5b3c182f33293291128d7801049df78cddf"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507099.zip::R2-2507099 RRC_R19_RLC-channel-config-v1.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507099.zip::R2-2507099 RRC_R19_RLC-channel-config-v1.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"First change","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.7.2PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between the L2 U2N Relay UE and L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-RLC0 as specified in clause 9.1.1.4:","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC default configuration of SL-RLC1 as defined in clause 9.2.4 if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE state;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon PC5-RRC connection establishment between two UEs for L2 U2U relay operation, the L2 U2U Relay UE and the L2 U2U Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>establish a SRAP entity as specified in TS 38.351 [66], if no SRAP entity has been established;","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>apply RLC specified configuration of SL-U2U-RLC as specified in clause 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A L2 U2N relay UE initiates a PC5 Relay RLC channel addition towards a L2 U2N Remote UE if the sl-RLC-ChannelID reveived in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR is indicated for this L2 U2N Remote UE in accordance with sl-SRAP-ConfigRelay, and a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID was not configured before.","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the reception of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message; or","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered due to the configuration received within the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>after receiving the RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message, if the PC5 Relay RLC channel addition/modification was triggered based on the derivation of PC5 Relay RLC channel configuration(s) for end-to-end sidelink DRB(s) as specified in 5.8.9.7.0:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current configuration contains a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5; or","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration in SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR has updated, based on which the PC5 Relay RLC channel is derived:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (a PC5 Relay RLC channel with the received sl-RLC-ChannelID or sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 was not configured before):","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>establish a sidelink RLC entity in accordance with the received sl-RLC-Config (in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or SIB12, or SidelinkPreconfigNR) or sl-RLC-ConfigPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure the sidelink MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance with the received sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfig or sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5.","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bee20932aabcf7499ed0d684d3f0e81fbf9efe176f67eb754d6f22d70a3450f4","original_member_sha256":"3acf21675086b42decc367ab2f92558dbe7662050d483965693de95915905e49","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["315738738b76004d901f817378e97ad7a631c34aa19a5712a590bce88e6e3985","71052b07f52267c7bac4a6075ff0cfc1c4c40bfd5146448667a05ae680fb4797","a3c0f90a581423f3ff4ef7ee485b4f970b45e709c9c9be720582f55d4d757d88","92bc539961bfdddc7e73c22e43f9011ed5fb733fe31bdc390d36d064132383b9","338bff87595531f1f09298da74c285a8acc9d8690daaa6b2379f86930f47d73d","89349027c4f67c71e31dbbc1a7a9d96ea885ef2b14e2de447ca94c9081d5f780","4a513dd57173e5c1167bff41e72769cde8b919491a922651da09083d15cc1528","74c91352b601ea6c3b93a6ab11d02d72dd271b6093a019445ac29fb1c936aa25","af90f30a299e6d5338815910180683554a728ca90d386e989d2e6dde93ecce67","3ed0ed52f6f6d4b0bd305fa065a0e252b534162d4558f84c9c0b9b83ab1ab5ef","13b9db4d6d44989958647b4e5172ef624b04348494c64620e867632d9857154b","43c891d0ba47fd131d724c6c4342deb4885baa3be41434b8a01d55df6b1fde3e","26692c553b39744593a962efd076b0defded25bce1a5f5c06d0169a7a6907ee2","0920e1ecdcdb903457a2980da2ba3f047f6e79c528519d56cf0ffc5e57e648d9","f6e1a7e8bb76d41dac3bd20e2c907586461964bc0a6ac964e6f7d18cb08da9d5","f1da3666d92f3684b8eee1192cf6a177e5fa14961c17689bb77ef58f93b20114","d30bbf3cfd56dc0d2ddbe448b1f0a361ec525d6d4e3346ba310c72f3524ccecc","32c4c5871b6adc15052454abfcac2cda32772d192c9e472a20d651f064681bed","3c9cb148eb321eff19f23b18b579038d3d05f6f89d38881f89853bd88bca8a12","e848bb543f4536312effa7fa48b37385790867ad493392