ame. Value zero indicates the first half and value 1 indicates the second half.","paragraph_zero_based":570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"integerSubframeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subframe boundary offset of the cell in which SSB is transmited.","paragraph_zero_based":572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sfn0-Offset","paragraph_zero_based":573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indiactes the time offset of the SFN0 slot 0 for the cell with respect to SFN0 slot 0 of serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sfn-Offset","paragraph_zero_based":575}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"94851d690deab33be3ba1762b150306a685848829ee5c3becd044fa864c9e30f","original_member_sha256":"af5393eb683fadf0dd3c6566b73d256550b329ea8a07b15d84a8b28390cafa79","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e48470b18ad7e46d869a9b837f290c71d80ac53dc47540871f37e358f33d5498","bffdeb3a3b9db02aacc07b4126d6f77a6dcd0e7e2b14f124de938536ec7a3616","87c2007fe3ea2d9b241018bebc9cfa4b98bc3768c08f8b8aaafbafe776c85f8d","e8e6fcf9357347a06d47482655d4a66e7e48b5777d4cff87b99b32dbba68039b","80d7a8cf46fd20e0a78fed646b122be3137bc4162f4e29a4b3d87d150a9ba386","77ced0fac78e3d2726a631dc0ecbb0ff45e9d6731ea33e49779d26bc410beb5a","381d926e6e3ae04c037e9d8084ebdf717e678cb557586da72c034b72d37dab45","a4c32487f38f4f47bfd5ba964b0d47dcc9fbd16a9f4e4665e27946a64ac41922","04db8ad60a9874d22ba8530f67709e9220b862fb6521999a00188c9899390941","5883a53cb116ef2f9f1891de4f85688a6f024726f4e0d75f3e4b1e79203a856e","a4ac130615fa4d79d6d4ed53dc43f565680343d99ff7f86012d6b1953aa7603b","0c4e849d0cd62007718b6cad411ca27498c7e0f797efd3527016582ace9ecca8","e536ad2f9a08ce39a9945567f1fb469510766381989f8e2d0faf4a4f8184d5c3","c6416a49826b0598424c7856761191d25e9748f91afca4b31ac1898bbd28c285","6e24e95da0bc024613ef294615dc0b6961054ba2ede058c44bf73f46e70528e0","caa374936e73117c1f28a0e6b67f59cc274d88dbaea436209dfcf6f20d72f888","f56913b2eb425149b85dd78b5dbbc9cdbeb886a10787309ab0684d51b4c29e48","e5ea43bb646069a968a57b55a04c6772cdeb0724ba7bb5378f2554756fd94201","ecf855dba021419b7023165a89804a1ed120f5185631c97ff44b7a713e3f5bc9","9e5d6e67bd3d0e2422b32c6dd13486e30af0090d6fb5ae5a242e895badae4702","091757f55fb126ccbbe78ce249a0893daec098ec147551d21e336c49090e969a","edf327ce17d7f3965907a95ab86a4582dbed0497a83d28ac4abb88590ccae4eb","637fa9818a70f148651a82ac49f578c834e71b747b80b4a9987d1e6ef2910b72","784686113a8f52d176b6665e25f59b7fe58204cbca64265f6e077ab002d4abe5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[552,575],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507328.zip::R2-2507328 Correction on NCD-SSB Configuration for Positioning(R18).docx:p552"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507328.zip::R2-2507328 Correction on NCD-SSB Configuration for Positioning(R18).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Specifies the SFN offset between the cell in which SSB is transmited and serving cell. The offset corresponds to the number of full radio frames counted from the beginning of a radio frame #0 of serving cell to the beginning of the closest subsequent radio frame #0 of the cell in which SSB is transmitted.","paragraph_zero_based":576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sfn-SSB-Offset","paragraph_zero_based":577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SFN offset of the transmitted SSB relative to the start of the SSB period. Value 0 indicates that the SSB is transmitted in the first system frame, value 1 indicates that SSB is transmitted in the second system frame and so on. The network configures this field according to the field ssb-Periodicity such that the indicated system frame does not exceed the configured SSB periodicity.","paragraph_zero_based":578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-Freq","paragraph_zero_based":579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency of the SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ss-PBCH-BlockPower","paragraph_zero_based":581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Average EPRE of the resources elements that carry secondary synchronization signals in dBm that the NW used for SSB transmission, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.","paragraph_zero_based":582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-Periodicity","paragraph_zero_based":583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the periodicity of the SSB. If the field is absent, the UE applies the value ms5. (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 4.1)","paragraph_zero_based":584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssbSubcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Subcarrier spacing of SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Only the following values are applicable depending on the used frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR1:    15 or 30 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-1/FR2-NTN:  120 or 240 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FR2-2:  120, 480, or 960 kHz","paragraph_zero_based":590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-TimeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The time offset between CD-SSB of the serving cell and this NCD-SSB. Value ms5 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 5ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol of SFN=0 of the serving cell, value ms10 means the first burst of NCD-SSB is transmitted 10ms later than the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted after the first symbol in SFN=0 of the serving cell, and so on. If the field is absent, UE considers that the time offset between the first burst of CD-SSB transmitted in the serving cell and the first burst of this NCD-SSB transmitted is zero. For UEs in TDD cells, the network configures this time offset to be an integer multiple of the periodicity of the serving cell's CD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of the third end ","paragraph_zero_based":594}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"94851d690deab33be3ba1762b150306a685848829ee5c3becd044fa864c9e30f","original_member_sha256":"af5393eb683fadf0dd3c6566b73d256550b329ea8a07b15d84a8b28390cafa79","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1cd5075d5e6ef72812b8e5f892491747db6d6a92a0284f87f512c4daba373b2d","3cb5bf5d93f1fac409f383582e68e81ae95ba6f2e89876b41b5850d65f20fdb6","2a1762f9a538b0fc7479dfcdd2156e0b322e6413782aac76395bae882aeecfad","c32a5dd