{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507330.zip::R2-2507330 Correction on NCD-SSB Configuration for Positioning(R19).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-19","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Per TS38.331, SSB-InfoNCell IE in both SRS-SpatialRelationInfoPos-r16 and pathlossReferenceRS-Pos-r16 IE can indicate NCD-SSB of the serving cell for which SSB configuration is provided in Release 18. However, the time offset between CD-SSB of the serving cell and this NCD-SSB is missing in current SSB-Configuration in SRS-Config IE.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"To add ssb-TimeOffset-r18 IE in SSB-Configuration in SRS-Config IE.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR SA and MR-DC ","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Positioning","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"6cf447ef83b3f28feadf4e8931d67c8cc1945c8cb922ae1af4aa83e358ac5897","original_member_sha256":"7a8210a9532f1161cc445693b9ebba29d25fff533bd090e41ac97b2833918798","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a76157f67bf337175a3c8bfc2caccbd7b10eead84754742b353a08e9fa00d668","09fd8713a1b8971c071df12adce13b3d6259952fddd9d8438e255c3b1b74c718","70544eba7b8a1975bb7bca585b5bcacc638c09ea9fda8077462dedf3db5e988c","8d7dcf01ef08da85ef91f13a250cde3481d28ed3632da7e8e0a0e42adabf6812","fb77c8e927bf7c27dc6d4237fca6e331c66da82dd01403e4076f6f41f0450434","ec8af0e0198e7ce57ff085eac4f9497b7be7eadf01c07f43f10a29f5ff61bc09","9f4099958a640e6e01d0e7667a9e9745022fabc32f677cf0c46818a25a32c47d","317bdd71312902a6c25c3d1ee96ace34f5f95b7c67ba3fb46c955311ebb2fbe0","5d4903a68c21540c035f289acf58039818013fac56c6e79d6b84c402c683d19a","a89b3d35fd51a6f6a12a7dad69275fd56c9411fe0a1405114356b6ba9502301d","c4a5072280f5ad4010db3b6eded542418039fdf878241783544011ad1bf9bcba","9f3cd2fb058055e820505bf53e19a27c18cba90e74c92cd69e762e1b25fad1d7","ba50356c4aa0eab231e38025ce0f6c6049d7a0cd3282a7fe06e961b56de25aa4","2578fa3ceac810d7b4cb7d42394b74c94691869b878903448204b1c3eb1bee0b","0