k operation and overall control of MDT is described in OAM specifications.","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The focus is on conventional macro cellular network deployments. In the current release no specific support is provided for H(e)NB deployments.","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2References","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following documents contain provisions which, through reference in this text, constitute provisions of the present document.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"0254bea9b44234fd4ae3ce61d1b7572c9739a2f3f98aac5d753159622ecf9743","original_member_sha256":"89d3a65a890ec1c34665df3994d13674a43f65265801792df8571bdbaed4c1df","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bcb6a1341babae4036140d2f1d144786509e4227de01aebf93cb68fad80c383b","f4132893d3cd777d6264810ff17d0c2b6ca0c99e896bbdbb91a8625cb92cca65","451171ad9ed758a5fb24d9f9e7be5507b07ad07c8ef33543fbb0634c774ef86a","adb3221d47a2235a09b35740d8d08de0aef07012cd8c4d15ae50598603db27f1","333e74dd1842edb575c752c64f0fdadd15c43d10da652a968e53471f94fc2e82","b1997a5295612d0606cd38a04f08c1e10b39e0ec462814179f9c3735191d6cc5","ad5cbfc0ad19a6b1784f0be2b509b83f32358ac64b4dbc7a5ebe00ea2ab9a036","91281e344533bb71d07ca080e3671598e3c25e3ce48d7d0dfea0ec65d4a5db31","4763c8a76bf71204a7d3619c9cedc7068b818927db3fe3e75051bb9ead5530a4","40048c4adcfa860dba98d4293f3905fb7baed525ea3cfe7b224c908be696d605","206f8bc4cce64ce178d0b5a8bbb38b20ecb968dbbd7479f60c07a4a644a0ce88","ebefef99087472f073256e465de948e32dd5af5833384075f990ced82759080a","d7b0322d838f49ab3f6b4da51ede0b4c4fc4fe55f7b784f50e89f8d430461377","879db2012a356d2ab7147b9a7edeeb864e03776f599c71a780d6966559b5cdd7","4e89e59fcc5cdc186a8960c2d6639acd79af3137910bb1b54f874f1e39ab616d","a0c97dfa2743e2827c286dc2aea54d501f3584dddc9e4470186fa50d79bce