_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c136d386c2ab7c411bdfab56c9560da44fc929eeaad6e4d81a109c97d0d25b9f","original_member_sha256":"65d9ccdf99e14a6f15f2b80367bbfb99fd1beb5a06d0e2fb13b1c52519336cad","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c1eac68875cfd60b3427635d55f322e5f8be8212d8d82f28d266377fab4bc346","4328dbc2e9ed59984edad9da9f918a037222a8bc1d4a7f801e449d0bf4e71fd0","b6d5bbe5126b23afe38289590c00f8e090273672960b7221828c7c1cee2fabcc","dca27312d7a1517d19ed558671871fab25e9b549c607883b97a78f9f3628f08a","6d3fba1314de1001e3753ed4f16b9c74cdf0271805f61b17dcc5b42bd590842f","617785343afc34ff86d7085e070e5171c849cf65b766df069d11ae4921b43535","3c343334b5e0a8aea994597032914065e02594fa2385d5e9d246b5d597505a26","cb9646e53a961acadd8b9d1cbe9977f71385aded0c0dd84e225defb7e8545ad8","e434e65a10e838afc9f35a37c5efebc215fd9aedc21692d7cc12941674744e85","48f27d1f338f2e6cabf1ff384625f9d1a5e67ab8190bf0af224f5e9fd5a2044d","dd0dda538fc8d6222e044643dd527131f7821cae2452bccfaf016f6b0a0976c8","731cd85286f824ffc8ab15b3e076faaf16231b040ec58d5b982eb0b04411f518","f0114d5ad1eac267962abbb727c5f6f34fa6599ec6e7ca0e59e13775cf2e37df","15446e336e26f8e8542354aaa67cefc1b9b0d8b4af76558f1b7e96594ab3e72b","032e9f858d3d59ab048f1c6847f25e5b233bb6ba0c88c96eee40690f328745ca","1ac810a1cab11c95a1df934fbe11d17d0c7b90f828c877e62a98a07ed58b7dfa","3cf32508acfe311d8e633219f6022d0a8feaa25eb80178664e777f1bc8c7d7bc","b3f8ba76ec829a0eac6003bc8cbccaed17d41a62756dd1214cc8a7fa8c87c76d","ebb18e058d1fac3e0efc9941e530e6c9327f91af82e47a50969e70a111afea2a","46076ae3efa38c93188b0235bb9054f263ed0633e0453ba027466c13166397bf","dcb00a9e6c6c316c0088d2dc5f1b8ad2617b4424352762cd9029642ce44b55be","adf91afec1ef44a2388772bd7103ea6e4f36004e933a3b58dc00af5209fde022","500ae1e95311986e752b9be027e0c22a78d267c2f0de2c686523828721158b14","1cef444d894cdacbe559bb45e53c3b2ef7f77da82c45f0f24d784d4541645307"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507533.zip::R2-2507533 Correction on processing of sidelink grant on Dedicated SL-PRS resource pool.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507533.zip::R2-2507533 Correction on processing of sidelink grant on Dedicated SL-PRS resource pool.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.22.1.3.4","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The condition check “if sl-PRS-MaxNumTransmissions …” is not applicable to Sidelink resource allocation scheme 1, so it will always fail.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Additionally, similar to “sl-MaxTxTransNumPSSCH” for SL data HARQ retransmissions, the UE independently selects the maximum number of SL-PRS retransmissions, which should be less than sl-PRS-MaxNumTransmissions. It is incorrect that the current condition allows the number of SL-PRS retransmissions to exceed the selected value, as long as it remains below sl-PRS-MaxNumTransmissions.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Moreover, there is no such condition check for SL data transmission either, as specified in 5.22.1.3.1.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.22.1.4.1.3","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editorial change: “SL-PRRS” should be “SL-PRS”.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.22.1.5","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Similar to Sidelink BSR (clause 5.22.1.6) and SL-CSI reporting (clause 5.22.1.7), the correct reference for SL-PRS resource request in this context should be clause 5.22.1.12.","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c136d386c2ab7c411bdfab56c9560da44fc929eeaad6e4d81a109c97d0d25b9f","original_member_sha256":"65d9ccdf99e14a6f15f2b80367bbfb99fd1beb5a06d0e2fb13b1c52519336cad","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","0c9cf460f4bba5455e131a20504c0671b184fe82f0f2df70236d047b9e82d01e","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","1d049f432a92b1eec9f0ac8a6c9935e2adb40849fc94128f47418f48a2b8ec2b","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","f439ea8fefde97178c1c6b158c1ff05161a2262418d39e7b133465990e176835","dd3de490bf00baf5087f33777fa272abbec9623033d71526d5355fb97ee7f36f","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af6435503a27154aade28f9b","c854d0782169874745b0b241ea5768eceab74b29521ae0cedb074a1d1f450375","b5048bb3f49d1a2989f6481a1657179787c53785a8bb677bd263211cc80e0b47","cee1e1dc6ec6dacda1b38289c13cb34a7bc00bf3aa6f287ca4fd21d6cb53dde2","16891e81f8358fa123feb32d35c5d11e2fe5479ec056d2ce8b51a3e595a8ab4b","dc74a61fa032166c56ecf36c54e31615bbb2cee331a3a87adfeb69383f8b5735","fc4bdc384fdfc406dacf628a8c0f071f67cc4c60b4a9441bd1111bce316082c4","5271ccc9b8ac157a35d9eaba5903ba7025377dcd1612483960bdecd54914c917","cfc3ac2f2653d88195ba57fb2076e3f9e2a9cbffdbb87ac18b32de4ded304944","4e4da406d1ae380d19ce4043be4c0eca0c13efdee1b19b854212ef48051850e3","45dabd25ec468bfa7b2acdedca0d358dcdc8614ba80685ec9d59a20ac775d136","faa19d24df9f2504abd8a2476c0615c91c57d53d76f2f29aedb18a7436b78bf8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507533.zip::R2-2507533 Correction on processing of sidelink grant on Dedicated SL-PRS resource pool.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507533.zip::R2-2507533 Correction on processing of sidelink grant on Dedicated SL-PRS resource pool.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Remove the condition check “if sl-PRS-MaxNumTransmissions …”.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editorial change: “SL-PRRS” should be “SL-PRS”.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clarify the correct reference for SL-PRS resource request.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis:","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options:","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL positioning","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR while the network is not, or ","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to this CR while the UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue since the correct UE procedure can be inferred from the other parts of the spec or other specs.","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For Sidelink resource allocation scheme 1, the condition check “if sl-PRS-MaxNumTransmissions …” in 5.22.1.3.4 will always fail, and the subsequent actions will not be performed by UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c136d386c2ab7c411bdfab56c9560da44fc929eeaad6e4d81a109c97d0d25b9f","original_member_sha256":"65d9ccdf99e14a6f15f2b80367bbfb99fd1beb5a06d0e2fb13b1c52519336cad","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2d87aa836e502dcbaa53ad6131796e38e4ec70723a5abbef65624f30059dd0bd","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","7423559940944ed0cc1fe176b76253cf9035dcdbfc0fac2f3e385feb311a2329","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009fb0a2849670c1b99dfd9f","6f383b2456c466755440785d195472e4370fbb6dfb1e5b733ea1092fea8265ff","e3db29f6ff33b24570c089ff3d9145095b1957376234ef9d95d65b38e22fdec5","2719ee87028d280e540a1e176693c4695450ea6582947cbe7641df0d7fe7dc26","4ca8bd411d49975f47c17a6bea9518c57b3c596bccfb83f6f95ea588b8493726","b7df039c6003db626a540d5dae9bf0bce8628c526c4062eb5a339826a2c0b878","3d02f1eff4086200c08c7387f1fcd7868768dcd69dcaae0ecca367fee818337d","8378c7a7040591689bcc5fc0fcf6758bd47599160b667c63bae1fc3a90142328","37110004cde5dc680607d96be4cc0d4ac2b145b9af38d3390393181dce9f4d52","71e3e5a29c241f70b35ea354aa6f22ff970164fb8b60d060f2fd642d70881832","0e47a47f1b464848859f3d5a2335e757b036bbb8a75194e1cd5c9c69e1a2fea9","b91694a905e16f6de795fe7b57474fe73f962431c5943ac663909e58473533aa","8bb8fa786144aca14527c9d00cf4260f77ef33f0586628ae0be5b0190bf8b6df","796e7e8fb250fda162b5dc4568edd60a3fe9ff7e3cbacaf88d57b7eb4708180f","3414e6c2c