ions to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-19","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR is to collect miscellaneous corrections for AI/ML for NR air interface.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following changes were made:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Editorial changes, e.g. italicized field values, inconsistencies in field names between ASN.1 and procedural text, etc.;  ","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Introducing a new list for reporting logged data for network-side data collection to avoid repeating the logging configuration ID for every measurement entry; ","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Changing some fields in ASN.1 from optional to mandatory;","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Changing some field names for clarity;","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Rephrasing some procedural text for clarity, better alignment with legacy cases, and better alignment with draft capability descriptions. ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["19ec77a66b38a3449175ddd50ef77a97dd065869d399ed6886a8dc6dbb1d3b9c","55ec72b9e6fccaf87bd17dbe9b879cad2a4e4fac4f0dc94a725407baab33fd60","1ee9f7cea70f4e8fd62aacb9c2977516e831e46df54b8b3668a01313e16101e5","2b58db967198b45c233ae927fcf368b8c9f5d716a7cf2990ef79f251972cf572","51256948e3acbf862c83068830241b01f934f8de6b1328ad1d60bf819571db54","1fe3ea6f7772d2c87a1c889691a688a2ebf13d8f378c4f413dc4589d7fed393d","eee9f47ad3ec4fde129d1769176b7719da60680e966c49d70b76e4d0b7c6441a","d1527102c6b4cfae28ba9f4587812ea825d35d2051edd1cb0abdb46e49dfa8ba","6715accb97d0c8947149dd10f96ce927cdefa1d37e81f63bfda2876daee246f2","fb15ac3d20c83e955e08269bd8208b97a3381e9dc1760700dadc889ab022bb85","5e699f68f476827dde4b56199347943deab815723998ecadc876146bdcc86bd0","138058f150eb2885a1d119dc88a99ba09de27a5e0d873c062a57786a69c43f36","93c3f4078f4ba7308f7ced