{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(show related CRs)","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"X","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" O&M Specifications","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FIRST CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.3Reception of an RRCReconfiguration by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions upon reception of the RRCReconfiguration, upon execution of the conditional reconfiguration (CHO, CPA, CPC, or subsequent CPAC), or upon execution of an LTM cell switch:","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig except for the entries in which subsequentCondReconfig is present, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the daps-SourceRelease:","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["039bcda0e6b85e0ce5e9a10ecc9508da18a9e5b825f34eb975829d7ffafe776e","a43dbb1c972f5a3783144fac307198a1018fc1822eb176224046c4de00ae52bb","79e8a8e846f609705cd645e096cb9d396171d7d2a87429c44c3193556d553919","621f531e07f6b7af87003b4b9bee5cc8ebdaf9a39028b60af3c4d55b39a69a50","4f081ca303785d3c0500ba2b189fb5951f3ccb3bcae2067ae54d9f5c426260f2","49132ba8e698f11ec4b0e4bc4441d0a25e666e1c929261500b2f6b92980d0f9c","950d8f8a0cdbb3bdd3e3a789d5d4652f833b13c76e84c6e7a3085fa768501e11","f6e7a34640b927e31d1ef529fd7d063e016505edc04be0f43006ec8117e7ba87","36b9225b064c31ed420ae6cc65c01111c72649afe5d156b52c4de4323c11bdfc","664c344d57f10b2c1181fe51adfde482e70db110aba55261665ce30fceaddbf4","4a6fe153b09b4336add998058d85fb4820bffd4d45c421c1497e5bc1c03d9d2e","bcf8538cc0932947ad26d142d1c94ed401086a7cf75adb5e1520302b2b5479b3","4158db48e3f82567cd7536751e6970819c04cea50490bdc3dd0bd02bc279fc59","024668064494cf69bd59a10cf9ba786173ef50dd6257cf818f3bcb9df27156bc","233066708b47a9abce6665762a04437dc844b09f40dfa0ed1866527725ab26f3","60712df605463cd12887800d2a4d4070eda3e0e1b77921be952557322f9050fb","b8e5804e5d35809b02009f4e493ae2b04e90eb04824202274f71e6509eb93027","9a51a3261df873fddbe4fdfd3bd774047472bcd35ebe8fe660389b0382eb1c9a","7914fc249b66922cf68a35409dc8c5bdc588cb142b089f3a213d29c987ac2985","22c665550fa6ad495c43438865b120fcb6b210194214320b74014f087b82b96b","1f7e8324102f7682b1529390d3723378cf3426a071bbcf5043e029cfecc51bec","acda17a20c956832f747110ce855a7da054dcf0c33e8ad6dedaf14e4e2f363c8","f275e3f930a9ceb8b1c40ef049b5cb76ad8aeddabbd20f35e18b6da3a01edab3","f60bbc2a0da37b31bcf0c2f66a8a7d36cf3dce9f373472e150491346f3354623"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration is received while the timer T348 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration does not exceed UE temporary capability restriction indicated via musim-CapRestriction included in the last transmission of UEAssistanceInformation:","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T348;","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration is received via other RAT (i.e., inter-RAT handover to NR):","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the fullConfig and the UE is connected to 5GC (i.e., delta signalling during intra 5GC handover):","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-use the source RAT SDAP and PDCP configurations if available (i.e., current SDAP/PDCP configurations for all RBs from source E-UTRA RAT prior to the reception of the inter-RAT HO RRCReconfiguration message);","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the fullConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the full configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the received masterCellGroup according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterKeyUpdate:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform AS security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the sk-Counter:","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution procedure which requires an update of the master security key, according to clause 5.3.5.18.6:","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the LTM-Candidate IE indicated by lower layers does not include an mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if this RRCReconfiguration message is not applied due to an LTM cell switch execution procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f5