{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the onDemandSIB-Request:","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if onDemandSIB-Request is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0a:If the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR was received embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message, the UE does not build an NR RRCReconfigurationComplete message for the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR.","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RelayUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N or U2U Relay UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.15;","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N or U2U Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d58ffa77cb74856499d1d2ae