{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPagingDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Paging message reception procedure as specified in 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedEUTRA-Info:","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform related procedures for V2X sidelink communication in accordance with TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10 and clause 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ul-GapFR2-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the FR2 UL gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13c;","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the musim-GapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the MUSIM gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9a;","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RPLMN is not included in plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement report for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idleInactiveReportAllowed is included in the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the UE is configured with at least one application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the procedure in 5.7.16.2 after the RRCReconfigurationComplete has been transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["953845498ca44771500179bf527296ebb0a912bf8b8be4f905ad7a11febd51c8","dea2e3237545c7aaf9ae99513fd7d742e360dc116201146478ce0242e570f67c","63e2f4fadad1f11f66d5199c56f569554c8d2628d7eade3e3556db1914671946","909e8ebd91ec85bb6ec19b0ed25f035dd816a3d1b35e2d2967daf21ed5459d19","83d017fe58c8d2939af720341bc004eb650a5ba58a909300ca3193d66fe0ebd4","c9669eb7ac1d262ff92b9ad620a05fe8f71413304434d6137ca28a2c8675027d","2863c85104af48cd35622a08262f360817c346d159720cd1555f79c9c61fec93","9b0fa865985e2e2a65f3ae72ec873e133efb89c6d7c2f4369624e542dae86390","7cfbe0ff30554d430055f3644c5dc0e716c5cb6f9fb5ee4baa2455033ff0b5ca","7160904c8262ea88490c84683cfd6ecd3bbaba2a8283c431ea2a48f6efe74851","bfcbaf2624e9121252921d33b329883547817f1eb814cf4f225eed4b4837eccc","bcd94add733f8618298b5381cbac0d31ea6713f5bd587e349a250d48bcd17f9b","33463dda5e06874317c0b599a59db7d66e9af0bec1d426cd49bb39c96aa7c655","80062f5952fca2f2324cdd16e14395662458415426aacdd2db95d329ae870e99","dd7b8050cdf8c8a92da53dfe5a46374e083a3aa6351f615e9986ee6ae90d8e0e","2b8dec797647ca982072c50d35d66a0e47ed354584395549ca3511f9b92efe52","12a82fd7b3a3fd4ac79dabe519ff9eb10cf68d9e8e2ec00f7f3c9fa6a57b875e","97d8ba6209a1449a100bb8768d10dc3d680fd5b4462df79094d015e42a3e967f","2ed8739a32868212ed74ebec952eccc7d1c3efe417d9249c85fb922ce7b31b52","b588b9ae76a2931a6e701ecd126ca6eb8f2047f0cf385ff9e09cf655af263f5a","09a21b7668c120d6424a88afeaeb136a612d0618e6278c0559966b6395e12d21","04f08ccdbed0118ec390b7b4a6e14a39f34e41f337539535593648a99f2926ba","e40b2b9ff1960e93662ba90ac2ad39f649169c44b0f735e57c622fac7dee4044","6e35ff4e9e0351f4a0c10f1e360bb829afb24ce88b6910390550bea379a5d075"],"paragraph_range_zero_bas