{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the UE positioning assistance information procedure as specified in 5.7.14;","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration of UE positioning assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the aerial-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>(re)configure the aerial parameters in accordance with the included aerial-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SL indirect path specific configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.17.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathAddChange or n3c-ExtIndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform configuration procedure for the remote UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay:","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the configuration procedure for the relay UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.17.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ltm-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ltm-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.18.1;","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration release procedure as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ltm-ConfigNRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ltm-ConfigNRDC is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ltm-ConfigNRDC includes ltm-ConfigurationSCG:","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the LTM configuration procedure as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.1;","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ltm-ConfigNRDC includes ltm-SK-CounterConfigToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d350ba378a1acbc2438afb647130b0fc136a9c0eaed613bece2fa6fde208c796","02a8f859b1fc739941d0643169aab33606d5d2a16af6eb0a58742de7f342627e","db9f6d7a29d5e687a2f12ef75d1068f64858aee64c79bbba3043348da7860756","89f059f41bd68b8572558f03fbdc273c9920e1dba380ff0268222b487ea5f5c5","41bcff93a8e5fb966fad33d736d