{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the LTM sk-Counter configuration release as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.10;","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ltm-ConfigNRDC includes ltm-SK-CounterConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the LTM sk-Counter configuration addition/modification as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.9;","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration release procedure as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the srs-PosResourceSetAggBW-CombinationList:","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosResourceSetAggBW-CombinationList is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the SRS for positioning transmission using bandwidth aggregation provided in configuration SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW as specified in TS 38.211 [16];","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release all the configuration of SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW;","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each SCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each SCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["91b7f8b431d1b76e5a36242631d0e6573c2adf054f0b5dc67801d79220ec75ac","edb2ada4a1880ff005c23f50e8a2793642481a0f73f3e7034cc2bd6652dae4e2","e38aac71be5df90bd837fa49df61c6f26b617b9e5e7ca6b42913f367bda2b87f","58ede0a2270a1ec5de8d90281cf77ceb3dc51cce70133cfd2b587e62df7f7781","61f034f737c474b51e958fa787d254dfa96b99e5287cbd162e355b96b4900b0f","7b436f467bcd3720d425d26f48b646778085c224a64d6cf051334572a30c381e","7392812fa4d45dbccd0997248c5501570bfe5f81efe319d257cb7ae137fcbbac","757ece9cf701e80e2c37cc9450159983229ac713a96ea518ef9ae2864800d10c","4fa32c37468d78823979c278b4125dc39c24f4ae24f68ec180b99333551c194a","c73bab650c11f6eff231430ee0f510927710467979414f6dd4902dc06ca3b069","ee03d6b38367a64c227f47e66f766599c105869183c8bda90b146060d4223072","963de26788448d062ca9aa8ee2515a82c0a8126ae0b1b2eaf55618337999029f","dca59f466e68f77cae1eed7455ac8edade102e92020c1c40ecf6f573426c4500","9764b48c9992d0b2856932ac6ce87ac47d269ba6ecc8eb6e14b47356a35c2f77","630c40cd7fe842b2ece1e0f578daf5946c3119b1269a21d1d8bbff007b3a8a2a","db17f7badf0678c2142f073e230c86b45bb6e432ffd76eb6a7c479bea631b53b","3ec8d8042100d22b43a2e825ebd5a0b585f6a8aa3b846500ce44f9c1784e727e","af9d62b0ee4692bde9cab0a7253b6767b83dcd856b8995d9f48206755521eb9b","c9bcb1e5b71fbe246ae9b044272c24768ec36753e15cc0ff64ef43217608a5ee","993e6b88ad9bd07c210956895a9f2da4fb5b7854a822673b872b0f81b95df90a","6d95eb16c62474bd312e158458bcdb4b11afa876ef477bfd6374b6ca2e2d0e70","93fc09f4b3b93538bec59b056cb0ce487a60629c070bddea3641799bda1341ea","3eecb57ff130f1ad9327f36716b3ac3b658ec30d4712751e3314697b3ee7f5a0","25f0083c805384a087617185e9c65e0b6e0d54ba45d524f5e2e663df13180ae4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[264,287],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p264"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0b:The UE does not expect that the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier is received in both masterCellGroup and in secondaryCellGroup. Network only configures at most one of reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent, reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier in one RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the eutra-SCG-Response the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the nr-SCG-Response the SCG RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and the RRCReconfiguration message does not include the reconfigurationWithSync in the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedCondRRCReconfig the condReconfigId for the selected cell of conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if a new sk-Counter value has been selected due to the conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC:","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include selectedSK-Counter and set its value to the selected sk-Counter value;","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and condExecutionCondPSCell is configured for the selected PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG and set it to the information of the selected PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-ConfigID-List stored in the VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included; or","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports the override protection of the signalling based logged MDT for inter-RAT (i.e. LTE to NR), and if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10] is included:","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T330 timer is running (associated to the logged measurement configuration for NR or for LTE):","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["70353ed7cc0f29c74f287dc5735c411a39057e365f643e07960a864c66baf15f","e6cedde279c6f5ef1582ed2ccbbae095433ddb1621473ce68b7964eac55d373a","f733b88249fc27fb67c58e2280d60114584f4e8ea47f64ace5cb89c56f5c4f45","292343daad5d0830aaea2610629505d8451dc87056a778085a19e5125e9d42b5","04768fddc580c469e6336a10139ed268e2f69def086f9affe52f3826efec6c79","18bd98ebb4c0cd9d747ba963bea09f44f98bfb6e45253e23498cc3518626ecd6","0de94471d7cd0057296c2e351180c1718d5456344427b51c2efde8c9bd145803","6bbb9c5446b0d1e8bb637e42676d989f1d81493e3da41a6ddc9a9f70c18f37cb","5fda563c1b4e4db4258a2c8c97df187d6155aa98054936dc1fd5b8407cb40578","e7fab5720b37f5474057f1ba9d63aa4245dd86c963443255b1cca03967124c40","bf3624309b5c50b38dc9c90786735142386faab68ecedfbf8c2b4fc8fd5a5ecf","e94e0739f7be339067d2a8409f6ab28b5770a6129f1590890d02d7ea207ec050","37778e5f9cd2db7d285ca5c32127bb09413c71b2522ed8440c3f22bd950a6676","c183c94b6314fa4a5c80317ebe22c07fbd0caa147d4c3561242311271cbcacb4","e9fd41f837693664e169f0de1e728dcd28911e33ac502a499aa013fb0f0a6e35","585ccb1975434c7873c6b607da4367eaae164f3987856e10c1051b9d2e5fafe7","e8a2e1210cfeb2d8c550fe70ee688f969f89de577ae2ac514759580e188baf2b","e018943a7c0eda94df7edc9c56d1677b86ecfc7d81c0e7876675abc17c7b7429","957674346cb1048564d4d59c296d23c4a6586096f50b86dc818a86d37939c873","a8f239868cb1785a9aa6c4083ea3fd1afc062c07016cddb28311adf8dde45a7c","7563c7be4d283cdaed2bbdffcc621f6a9e21b74ad863ed525584f6462110d94e","6b82746e1fd5c6468b00b14cb067922af1465690ad955119b96e6c0553fc4e80","8a12079ad7ea33aba5af0caeb9f33c42972a33a3591dea89b7906584b9161bb3","97a00784031c0516f0e9a0c2c190a09afc945ea4562f5b97cb291819c35f1a81"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[288,311],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p288"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE has logged measurements in VarLogMeasReport or in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList; or","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-Identity in networkIdentity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was configured with successHO-Config when connected to the source PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the applied RRCReconfiguration is not due to a conditional reconfiguration execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3, and the applied RRCReconfiguration is not due to an LTM cell switch execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the applied RRCReconfiguration is not received when T316 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions for the successful handover report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.6, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the MCG, or upon an indication from lower layer that the LTM cell switch execution has been successfully completed;","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if applied RRCReconfiguration is received when T316 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>release successHO-Config configured by the source PCell and thresholdPercentageT304 if configured by the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release successPSCell-Config configured by the source PCell, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration includes retainLoggedMeasurements:","paragraph_zero_based":335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bbe6e581b45b1497293aa3a8f5cd366b9c9265b7c8986000e08f121a5fbfd7b1","9f5e6813e513472ac0801de84b1534fd9a2fd2a7b856a678c0dd6eca4150ebc7","6f6c1b429a1e866d123221b6a59daaf65d13579e05e60498cc1651dd366f0295","663b7efae26aba44e7573ca08e02dd3358c98b5c46bb97ca466a002edcc1ec84","12084eefc5c7f50ec4e1e0ced9e0d378e39f27