{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this is the first RRCReconfiguration message after successful completion of the RRC re-establishment procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>resume SRB2, SRB4, SRB6, DRBs, multicast MRB, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE in case of single hop or for L2 Last U2N Relay UE, that are suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange was included in RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB1 is configured as split SRB and pdcp-Duplication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SL indirect path (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T421;","paragraph_zero_based":509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else (i.e. split SRB1 with duplication is not configured):","paragraph_zero_based":510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> when receiving RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message from target L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T421;","paragraph_zero_based":512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and when MAC of an NR cell group successfully completes a Random Access procedure triggered above; or,","paragraph_zero_based":513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE); or,","paragraph_zero_based":514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and upon indication from lower layers that the RACH-less handover has been successfully completed; or,","paragraph_zero_based":515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution and upon an indication from lower layer that the LTM cell switch execution has been successfully completed:","paragraph_zero_based":516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T304 for that cell group if running;","paragraph_zero_based":517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and upon indication from lower layers that the RACH-less handover has been successfully completed; or,","paragraph_zero_based":518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution and upon an indication from lower layer that the LTM cell switch execution has been successfully completed:","paragraph_zero_based":519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release dedicated preambles provided in rach-ConfigDedicated within reconfigurationWithSync, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release dedicated msgA PUSCH resources provided in rach-ConfigDedicated within reconfigurationWithSync, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-IndirectPathMaintain is not included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T420;","paragraph_zero_based":524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release all radio resources, including release of the RLC entities and the MAC configuration at the source side;","paragraph_zero_based":525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset MAC used in the source cell;","paragraph_zero_based":526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (sl-IndirectPathMaintain is included):","paragraph_zero_based":527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eb9a1dd07cca316dcd78e7c1b0cc80b6a72a1def3553775034e40bedb9131345","e36303c55fd3207c466bb3a07f5903bfc8d86b295b84a8e9b3faf7c9c5d27a84","53ae3dbb221f19943dc724bb5da22ce1a89a4a27ed755ba9a169656a6625115a","b90238ae7943471decce7e31bee24d684d1c4bdf10eedbe5f676033179028b6c","fb807094c8ebf3b9714a9b2d326aad77bce6b6b8de416557e9cc9d22a56765a7","f4791d382bccedb3a042479b7f2ade847e30d0edac9f917a97a605746a21ddf6","3240a665bf5c6554a671dc0a2016b623b69584932b9a2b5670a4a9bb29451ffa","d2a785bf41936d4578f3f2223e02921536a3e2aac915435e566da8c3523e88d4","3693939b01ed669b656b8f6a885652c00baf0e68c614bb57125d8453b5a12fe5","a3744c5ba94513ced493092fa5d3d1b83e4a2433f83c70b5b0b03a45b2da7e30","95c2d236fd06bb6f9cc2645026bba2b36b69feb8393200658bc8fb2aed65ec50","7b879658a473046fe55ede9ad651d07890bfd80961b3908c37423ac63c583601","75a16b7a00bdca64748b7f5b2753414acbd0329eb37608e5fe9452fca947c238","3dab4e633afd7867dcacfc324bfb7759e6efa070ef5f288438f646db964c4026","46cfc89b2fbf853842351d9bf8ea7e917acad1d9252a0eec8c377e60472d6360","503dd47bf94513d9c88ea4d1115de6ac0b6a4081590a3f405db31d7b70bb5a38","7bf81d6179e0e39a30a369676c5d901689da80ad1b748fb56dee5de537a0da50","d4397f2daf3f21b95e1aa485a1f22b12e20ab066789f2c136e34b4936aba04f7","f6c74437c18ffb6398b8847a70816d52ed35129768d27d3d9c8bdd196a2fc58e","44b884cfdc9de4143ea40a8de3ac59d17da530ce512d505b3ee4fa72fbdea205","e634cdd3d076d17c8506fc37511f2839455a8419ff2417a7e365e85bbf58ad8f","f34cdec19b2d737f2813755b0096d46236295e9c81cd04b191ed0434c202cc94","9d6c15df7bb47ad52c85915e972df56d81f50afa7773906ec43c0279f65c5e27","bf75a78bc207897b28de36753ac9a30d18d1de0e3b023f3befcd0b771665975a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[504,527],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p504"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release radio resources on the direct path, including release of the RLC entities and the MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>reset MAC used in the source cell;","paragraph_zero_based":529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if rach-LessHO was included in reconfigurationWithSync and cg-RRC-Configuration was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the uplink grant configured for RACH-less handover;","paragraph_zero_based":531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2b:PDCP and SDAP configured by the source prior to the path switch that are reconfigured and re-used by target when delta signalling is used, are not released as part of this procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for source SpCell if running;","paragraph_zero_based":533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the CSI reporting configuration, the scheduling request configuration and the sounding RS configuration that do not require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the measurement and the radio resource configuration that require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell (e.g. measurement gaps, periodic CQI reporting, scheduling request configuration, sounding RS configuration), if any, upon acquiring the SFN of that target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DRB configured as DAPS bearer, request uplink data switching to the PDCP entity, as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T350 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T350;","paragraph_zero_based":542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if RRCReconfiguration does not include dedicatedSIB1-Delivery and","paragraph_zero_based":543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the active downlink BWP, which is indicated by the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id for the target SpCell of the MCG, has a common search space configured by searchSpaceSIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13], of the target SpCell of the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>upon acquiring SIB1, perform the actions specified in clause 5.2.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the RRCReconfiguration message is contained in an entry in MCG VarConditionalReconfig that includes the subsequentCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each entry in the condReconfigList within the MCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there is an entry in condExecutionCondToAddModList within the subsequentCondReconfig that has subsequentCondReconfigId matching the condReconfigId in the entry of the condReconfigList:","paragraph_zero_based":549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if subsequentCondExecutionCondSCG is included in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>store in the condExecutionCondSCG in the entry of the condReconfigList the value of subsequentCondExecutionCondSCG in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f5b7455b2bddf837b9e9cf2e01ab2215d950bd0004ef00b11f5f953340a1c77f","4dcd0358bb5c6a3079e1deb47d9a9b9baaf7d1565cb34c1a1e0348f74835b737","62504ead3e722b536cfa7f9a13015fe3d3393bf7b4990355cb709be2a075535f","57074d6066d09b964b738d1e653802fd80470230fd74ba1b9253700ec8e09964","8c6748bf8634892d316b3d672d2ce64dea8885924a9fa652b65e5fdb082ab19a","12e5c5b143133238d711b05d228ecaf8b673c5237cbe2f6a126351b6d7579aa9","4ab06f33739ffa48b590d9fbfea4cbad44fb1bb6c758471e4bfb7c667877f501","e69caff6ffc6abd6b15775ecc685662979a81de785ed96f5d6cb81b94a22a0c1","8573ea40f7bab2564e33e0e93221c5c326047a5f8dbd8dde0032dc5e0228740c","5e6a9c065cfbc80d9fa78e0842b369c615fefce76840d52d10b02464efe50ba9","34ac0f3a6ed1ecc1ec159638b253670c453007652f4ce9bc7186cb16985d78f1","60271a19f1f7edd633be6765acaa1696e9dee7d517d87628a5657f823d794f86","47e8e2260160af3010d915cca3c20dc871ddb6ccaf3721923960af4c19b551bf","6e645df41c5e5eaa7f084602f5f011fc4ffc3dc765ea936ff3107ad07b642f1e","e1fb512b7fb9d8ccfc55a048ecdddfe7e0d5e2e93f001b4a81bc64aac8de38c2","88ea7b5612d4fee15f4c84a43408612b0c7a768cc8353110ddf9012d23f2a692","aa3b038e23ac50e45bdf6128ac684ea46e9f0eb733206f2aaf0fc568624b54a1","d59031705e62f05c3079dd39a726e954552a023b5bc45280f2821c6b0be54d4d","5479d22353be777dafb4a4c06188a6a48b7554365639a63a8ea34a6551f2e8b9","1e19d779531282ff35c8d1c107083bcbc5ba62eae3905847fb0d45ad6659b60e","16ac146d2a4bcd8e0b6f1ffdd5aea63cd2