{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the RRCReconfiguration message is contained in an entry in SCG VarConditionalReconfig that includes the subsequentCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each entry in the condReconfigList within the SCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there is an entry in condExecutionCondToAddModList within the subsequentCondReconfig that has subsequentCondReconfigId matching the condReconfigId in the entry of the condReconfigList:","paragraph_zero_based":554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if subsequentCondExecutionCond is included in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>store in the condExecutionCond in the entry of the condReconfigList the value of subsequentCondExecutionCond in the entry of the condExecutionCondToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG and the CPA, CPC, or subsequent CPAC was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries in the condReconfigList within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig except for the entries in which subsequentCondReconfig is present, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries within VarConditionalReconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.9.6, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each measId of the MCG measConfig, if configured, and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportConfigId is not associated with any measId indicated by the condExecutionCond or the condExecutionCondSCG in an entry of condReconfigList in VarConditionalReconfig in which subsequentCondReconfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig; and","paragraph_zero_based":564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the measObjectId is not associated with any measId indicated by the condExecutionCond or the condExecutionCondSCG in an entry of condReconfigList in VarConditionalReconfig in which subsequentCondReconfig is included:","paragraph_zero_based":565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup or secondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group during the last 1 second, and the UE is still configured to provide the concerned UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution or an LTM cell switch procedure, and the UE is configured to provide UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group, and the UE has initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group in accordance with clause 5.7.4.3 to provide the concerned UE assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the prohibit timer (if exists) associated with the concerned UE assistance information with the timer value set to the value in corresponding configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the leave without response timer (if exists) with the timer value set to the value in the musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig or the wait timer (if exists) with the timer value set to the value in musim-CapabilityRestrictionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message indicating a change of NR sidelink communication/discovery related parameters relevant in target PCell during the last 1 second preceding reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the UE is capable of NR sidelink communication/discovery and SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE has initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.8.3.2:","paragraph_zero_based":575}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1eaba500f878db8e04583f3ab7bf73fc68d6735ac3f0005d843fc97dfdf5d637","cbaaf039ad45ed809da0cd8f1fcb0c4d3e959681ef64de9c52411c33ee448105","f8bbc2ddf2326414c80597af0a13316f17ea5dbd1f79fb63cd8b13d3d309f7c5","e027a419ea8c62eed97718694c787786d9905de7119a0d80e00b3b851af182a3","93f581d0ab2eb857b1490e66efcac3f45ec33f410b50ce26113a73601818a00b","2a3c23603a0e300ab986d581af7e924acc6f49a6d7e567b5836c563b454db406","4c006795f5a4b6fca2731748cab9f892e6036de7d730de4548d28e3c11c79536","e4d978424491b0d42659f19757e26bffded164300327a36d87dcce54261e50ba","b589414f296217f9ab915b94f07ac5dacb80d582c3b830c21e0acdb91ab45ca2","69537e89f9251c7b7b7e8175fb874162686e3ccc2840ead2f58aea57d8cf1e63","6c3a6bbf46134578809d495614cf9a306ac591b19a124a2851962cb2e636672f","7a53c727fa3e6eaeba37b10b9a73944a905ab99b458efe6db0ce320e8dbc266e","85db9966105b2f43be41eded963b60a3287ca650af3708a8d8ae5b5569751bbc","e241b87aead8dbe532b3c19061042caa6aa06985629f03e7a91bc05e23212a3c","f00ac12cd5bb59dfe81b24566ec4ccd77a275e650eb066341143f1cb1ecb4f7c","6701ecbe7e2cf2b05388349af3cad2396b52384535431568be2dd46e13fddb31","5e8597bd898c9da08f7961ab230c480a5d5f1d1f94621c3990f83bfd0d9d1ce9","1575f6fb0e67ca8f55a98ca2fef4fbe07622760b46bd9daacc89057ea8b5b7c0","ba925f40a950591d83af28bc59d906a13cab0e1acd7fd24e262ccfcd7f61ce1f","cb79ea803612130b9aef0fb2e7b25756b06ce614eb08f7f1048803998593a166","9318bbf7951f22af16e7aec105302d7d18c0774f050aaa7d34554e8e386def1c","1e0b33e5359c2c16c032e08c82a17c5036cc31ccff48e51acc55379ef34e4bd9","2784813cac71646d309659146dd9aa90909d90de92bfc7f02c42c67705db0b62","e98c2e2ea6fffbe4a9519590addd2ab765d3079b3cc277da306228c8351c3594"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[552,575],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p552"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any application layer measurement report container has been received from upper layers for which the successful transmission of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message or at least one segment of the message via SRB4 (if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup) or SRB5 (if reconfigurationWithSync was included in secondaryCellGroup) has not been confirmed by lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if RRC segmentation was used for the MeasurementReportAppLayer message:","paragraph_zero_based":578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if RRC segmentation is enabled based on the field rrc-SegAllowedSRB4 or rrc-SegAllowedSRB5 for the reportingSRB (or SRB4 if reportingSRB is not configured):","paragraph_zero_based":579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>re-submit all segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission via the reportingSRB (or SRB4 if reportingSRB is not configured);","paragraph_zero_based":580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>discard all segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message;","paragraph_zero_based":582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>re-submit the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission via the reportingSRB (or SRB4 if reportingSRB is not configured);","paragraph_zero_based":584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup and SRB4 is configured in the target cell:","paragraph_zero_based":585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each application layer measurement configuration in the UE:","paragraph_zero_based":586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution, if transmissionOfSessionStartStop is set to true for the application layer measurement configuration and if the session status has changed since the UE was configured with the conditional reconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of a MeasurementReportAppLayer message including appLayerSessionStatus, via SRB4 for the application layer measurement in accordance with 5.7.16.2;","paragraph_zero_based":588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup and the target cell provides SIB21 or provides SIB1 including nonServingCellMII:","paragraph_zero_based":589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message during the last 1 second preceding reception of this RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution, and the UE has initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message after having received this RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message in accordance with clause 5.9.4;","paragraph_zero_based":592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE is only required to acquire broadcasted SIB1 if the UE can acquire it without disrupting unicast or MBS multicast data reception, i.e. the broadcast and unicast/MBS multicast beams are quasi co-located.","paragraph_zero_based":594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4: The UE sets the content of UEAssistanceInformation according to latest configuration (i.e. the configuration after applying the RRCReconfiguration message) and latest UE preference. The UE may include more than the concerned UE assistance information within the UEAssistanceInformation according to 5.7.4.2. Therefore, the content of UEAssistanceInformation message might not be the same as the content of the previous UEAssistanceInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.9Other configuration","paragraph_zero_based":597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the delayBudgetReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":599}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["57f271191fa60814b610d10140b69a317e9f56a0cf47b73969041ebe76f480c8","8e4e08a45d30830cf22be0ec760abbaaee790ef642071389affb83ecc6a4f579","0c8f0f1ade328187d6a82d19b65954526dd43fe13243d89b75d04c3f5f64181c","ac7bd77b530b4b3363dbb2be46aea18edf7c5b8276b4919489df6ac0086d2a14","7337f21d17caad9e863893fbe74f24193b0d776a7481d9ac059694913c593bbd","df038e44005f2d28e55a01b3088961237dd9e8389be81205eb243e00b7d04d5d","1a18a304b6d3a3fe50160dde5a4d00a7d3275788002d386e0e050c9d191a8298","024bac74b47cde0c8820b70b19a953c86f14625deae284351d55a7760fcc3700","5b2ee586194b46bafa25e08d99634731a341f05b220d76aba51b2097cadd6339","d2fccd49ba5e54e6706c0110519b741a7694ef64c3d3d573e85c49a651e7a61d","0e1c6b3cfcb70e2037c05f349a531a884bc5e26f2a0963d7fa1deee0a25628d0","3709858f91536362038835659cc30969a9810bfe7ad56ab2bd47ede087a28821","76c4b9ec9ba4f70c9d636d11482f8e1d8415dc3018fc778038d86290ad9498d7","0412fb9f060ee1dcb4f294b1ed1468a7d76ef428da00e6624bb3f526d95adb10","bbd5488372d9298cb961fceac509d8ad5e86cfce427ed5b92a5281356bb9972a","b567ace31650fbbf646ffefc3a2c1001a784312639301eb475ff5107d2b18257","edcfc025ea5c5371a6decfa5025cd374ac9f11f401a33e11572c256ad56221c6","b7b0f36ea0e22acbf5b36a0c40de5398d475e11d1faa06fba1bd9bed1616d660","7b31dd749aa7d4c36dc34bf258956d4c02698935d85df3582c60944b978bb407","3e9bd75423ecaa763740c90e078fb2842ada3a650e8372efac332f2419f6983b","b12b450891e484996d424e2b8c75c94d71f8571309ccb63931a0a1e4054f2825","39a60f3e91a85f0f59d6031e56e854b0bc9712a147698ce11528cac4e1f77c7d","0f485392c371db538871bf82e5b0496fb6c0ed4d6dab719ae06b6a6f18556c66","dd337fc25e5824a9597e3807309e34955f0a96c09acb0872667170bf4c3fb8ed"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[576,599],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p576"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if delayBudgetReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to send delay budget reports in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send delay budget reports and stop timer T342, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the overheatingAssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if overheatingAssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide overheating assistance information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide overheating assistance information and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the idc-AssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idc-AssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide IDC assistance information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the drx-PreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if drx-PreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters for power saving for the cell group, and its preference on cell DTX/DRX related parameters for PCell if cell DTX/DRX is configured, in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters for power saving for the cell group or its preference on cell DTX/DRX related parameters for PCell, and stop timer T346a associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the maxBW-PreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if maxBW-PreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if otherConfig includes maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth for FR2-2 for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTr