{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PCell with the configured grant resources for SDT and instruct the MAC entity to start the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the SRS for positioning configuration in RRC_INACTIVE and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaNonPreConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the SRS for positioning configuration in RRC_INACTIVE and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT;","paragraph_zero_based":844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaNonPreConfig is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaNonPreConfig, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList and perform actions as specified in clause 5.7.20;","paragraph_zero_based":848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:The Network should provide full configuration to UE for SRS for Positioning in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the LTM configuration release procedure for the MCG and the SCG as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the servingSecurityCellSetId within the VarServingSecurityCellSetID, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId of the MCG measConfig and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is NCR-MT and if ncr-FwdConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ncr-FwdConfig includes periodic forwarding resource configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to NCR-Fwd to continue forwarding only in accordance with the configured periodic forwarding resource set(s);","paragraph_zero_based":863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordi