{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release cell identity and relay UE ID configured in sl-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release of the SL indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if N3C indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as a N3C relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t380 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T380, with the timer value set to t380;","paragraph_zero_based":921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message is including the waitTime:","paragraph_zero_based":922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T302 with the value set to the waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>inform upper layers that access barring is applicable for all access categories except categories '0' and '2';","paragraph_zero_based":924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate the suspension of the RRC connection to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_INACTIVE, and perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_INACTIVE and perform cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the suspendConfig includes resumeIndication:","paragraph_zero_based":933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> perform the actions as if the UE received Paging message with the ue-Identity included in the PagingRecord matching the UE's stored fullI-RNTI, as specified in clause 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the multicastConfigInactive is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5e71eba19e909103a73d060378d578cc30fcdd067100f7064911f737b4867adb","60d84def41242778f2657b8d77eba5984bf99fdbf11b313d74ee74358f0cec84","76cde8d1f45066c8379d28744bd468dbe8dc227ac0ac19cdd3444ada31031273","b521a111d1b62dc26a5e30e64be05086671f63f04f3f4ee7a1e53a2613511d5a","431f4e06ae82c1f82079845962b615d70f2a2d4737524eb2060211673fd8cd66","ca5b4d230daf6bc59944ad47226c5132df3da1154fbb4f8bc042013098e0b094","d3b3a9ab29841e89ca41df3dd104cdcf0258d5ab6e9216397153ceb0a4005727","417ea906c821267e690cba1671a93235758d38e368c61c48feb53347af8a8190","ddd58dfb462f52378f512194f7ea43b80309541def918bcec6c1cbdfdee6c7a4","2b422390bd154a5d01d336b8b068e52805fd22df0d70a66e8be8434ffefdfa7b","3063926f0ef859f2d8736a7b450a7ea3efbccaa7ca3f2ceae9e676500742a895","e394078ed229442992f1df071e11894f3bc7d6e520f3f427ef1ebac024c6f7a0","3422b302b177e78b46bc70ed0836bd75e65439bd63ee2a169ed3650f3971b7bd","dc49bd8baec75c67ff99e2c75a3b440e87e44a4d8406b688c4428028a1568f24","7e4f90435abd754c0a35b9e7a7a72d7c9a381612bf252fa27631f80f63219a4f","93e37168e311d09d435c7654e391005487407040f24c0c038b9f5fb5f717d34b","925a8a3cf62c181cdf470288302c61b0677df61c5872396a88dfba63298aa7a4","99a61fdc281a21f904290503f876ac14ce11c4eeb2b96dbfa29bd26362088e4f","44a7cae6dcb0927243c3c47a44ac9b1479bc9d566a0d1ae2e4c3d1df8ec560a7","21554fcdb539a479272a0885550ae168de4e2f33eca6904decae24008b5b790f","b36f650e9fa733062a02cb495574fabc52eafba2d006afad0651a35d86532f41","535f5abad4b05916db089379205995e38797ad92b8b69e8ae8212456681c4403","124a196e6ccf73147e6401c75224b7e4c15955b1e0536a7fcaec41072f7e6e19","b92881180bb216933d582546e43beff49bea141739c98697f671b8bcb0c2302f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[912,935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the multicast PTM configuration is provided for at least one multicast session for which the UE is not indicated to stop monitoring the G-RNTI and the UE selects the same cell as the one on which the multicast session was configured in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the multicast PTM configuration as specified in 5.10.3;","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if multicast MCCH is present:","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>monitor the Multicast MCCH-RNTI as specified in 5.10.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release any CSI logged measurement configuration, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the logged measurement entries included in VarCSI-LogMeasReport, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with the release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Whether to release the PC5 unicast link is left to L2 U2N Remote UE's implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is left to UE implementation whether to stop T430, if running, when going to RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.10.3Detection of radio link failure","paragraph_zero_based":948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured and T304 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon T310 expiry in source SpCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon random access problem indication from source MCG MAC; or","paragraph_zero_based":952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon indication from source MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached; or","paragraph_zero_based":953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon consistent uplink LBT failure indication from source MCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider radio link failure to be detected for the source MCG i.e. source RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend the transmission and reception of all DRBs and multicast MRBs in the source MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC for the source MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the source connection.","paragraph_zero_based":958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["37f01c633fc631eac1e18543e41840a746c122d139f0b42eece6b3e21fdc2d56","f3e35589f0a0d7c7afd02ca922c4d9e8f3fcbd8af0a500095f1c28c98ed96ad8","65927230d878e044b252c89d442629ea84705e64b6383faecc7469af95667801","a728144a4f5b996233d970901cc2f6f2195bd37ee35f4cf4af02656e4be3f475","62ddff1b0fcfcd2960ffc40c89aac23b2d0c65c45a806b330ae838e01ce67130","12ff795c699a920cb0e96386cd9b7807a6f633d8fc81a71e325a49653fd45407","5f5a8d7b7cab60899eb4ade19f029f532cb3b9d4f7f983d2694112c7aaedf2de","ff362ba0ab0851e563ab13d752846f137950d04339dda7d44e006cc997b555e5","de342cfaaf6ab8bab2192c34fea59525f94e340eae8f742c1b43912618cd0e39","76f3dcf0bf24b85bb8a1c593e7698dced99075097e63a7e6a2257fe32a62391f","fff8c1041edd62b43423267b484cf6bb51f7d1c125cfd7559db63a8a18f37e34","e0f197e1c9fd7f2d7af39e12184fc344c01ea518a3aefe6330992706684ff90f","582bc5955aee12713bc7de2b55ba0133c4ce412ab04c53070db2fb04dc89b375","e43019dc20ba1030c530cb7a5c037db430a829c140ff7fbf753f2a47308bbf84","fcaa6bfcafce6cd505c24bda2617594d10fc388bb47f17401bcf797f2bc05591","c6fee4d2c57358aa85c9ea5969369db0ec9bdb886879365ecd5ba6259d251e56","d7435db000b7bbc66be86fbd123a44946838d496611bc338c594c38f32ff5153","1f27b7ba3ac49f85e59b84126d9d019eebe825ba0b4174ec1206134d5fff1946","3b6b9a1b933ac930f8e09b71439a3f38df1ae8fe52de284320c586f1b453dc1b","14483ad26615a56ecf8aaf1d78c88b000e3d188bc0a5cbd13da6103562eeea3b","aa90160de1066606db808dbb07d1b3228dd9029bf1986fcb47e77fcf08b6d7d7","665ac0e5ae8471016c5f70149c53561d56e774437f2538c72fec6a50902e7268","6e0aec0760bec96cd20890a611020aa621826fb821709a78257de91ebfc56b7a","6503a85fb484a6ad8ee0c3cda75c998dc905de9035249e1ca837e1ae6017b82f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[936,959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>during a DAPS handover: the following only applies for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon T310 expiry in PCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon T312 expiry in PCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon random access problem indication from MCG MAC while neither T300, T301, T304, T311 nor T319 are running and SDT procedure is not ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon indication from MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached while SDT procedure is not ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if connected as an IAB-node, upon BH RLF indication received on BAP entity from the MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon consistent uplink LBT failure indication from MCG MAC while T304 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the indication is from MCG RLC and CA duplication is configured and activated for MCG, and for the corresponding logical channel allowedServingCells only includes SCell(s):","paragraph_zero_based":967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.5 to report RLC failure.","paragraph_zero_based":968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider radio link failure to be detected for the MCG, i.e. MCG RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any segments of segmented RRC messages stored according to 5.7.6.3;","paragraph_zero_based":971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release any CSI logged measurement configuration, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard the logged measurement entries included in VarCSI-LogMeasReport, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if AS security has not been activated:","paragraph_zero_based":976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'other';-","paragraph_zero_based":977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if AS security has been activated but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, have not been setup:","paragraph_zero_based":978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>store the radio link failure information in the VarRLF-Report as described in clause 5.3.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'RRC connection failure';","paragraph_zero_based":980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>store the radio link failure information in the VarRLF-Report as described in clause 5.3.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if MP is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fe62625748e874fcc4fe12cf6387829b816dd78cd10232b2f3461df22890978f","cd2006caf5d81aa30e754d84df27532c265251