{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idleInactiveReportAllowed is included in the RRCResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":1176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured with at least one application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the procedure in 5.7.16.2 after the RRCResumeComplete has been transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":1178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":1182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":1185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":1186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":1187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume SRB2 (if suspended), SRB3 (if configured), SRB4 (if configured), SRB5 (if configured), SRB6 (if configured), all DRBs (that are suspended) and multicast MRBs (that are suspended);","paragraph_zero_based":1190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If the SCG is deactivated, resuming SRB3 and all DRBs does not imply that PDCP or RRC PDUs can be transmitted or received on SCG RLC bearers.","paragraph_zero_based":1191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the cell reselection priority information provided by the cellReselectionPriorities or inherited from another RAT;","paragraph_zero_based":1192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the measConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume measurements if suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":1196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":1198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1199}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b3