{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set referenceTimeInfoPreference to false.","paragraph_zero_based":1800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide preference on FR2 UL gap according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for FR2 UL gap configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":1802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set ul-GapFR2-PatternPreference to the preferred FR2 UL gap pattern;","paragraph_zero_based":1803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference for the FR2 UL gap configuration):","paragraph_zero_based":1804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include ul-GapFR2-PatternPreference in the UL-GapFR2-Preference IE.","paragraph_zero_based":1805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide musim-GapPreferenceList and/or musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList and/or musim-GapKeepPreference, or provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for MUSIM periodic gap(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include musim-GapPreferenceList with an entry for each periodic gap the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set musim-GapLength and musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset in the musim-GapInfo IE to the values of the length and the repetition/offset of the gap(s), respectively, the UE prefers to be configured with;","paragraph_zero_based":1809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if UE has a preference for MUSIM gap priority;","paragraph_zero_based":1810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for MUSIM aperiodic gap:","paragraph_zero_based":1812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the field musim-GapPreferenceList, with one entry for the aperiodic gap the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include musim-GapLength in the musim-GapInfo IE and set it to the values of the length of the gap the UE prefers to be configured with;","paragraph_zero_based":1814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>optionally include musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe in the musim-GapInfo IE and set it to the starting SFN/subframe of the gap the UE prefers to be configured with;","paragraph_zero_based":1815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference to keep all colliding MUSIM gaps:","paragraph_zero_based":1816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the musim-GapKeepPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":1817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has no longer preference for the periodic/aperiodic gaps:","paragraph_zero_based":1818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include musim-GapPreferenceList, musim-GapPriorityPreferenceList and musim-GapKeepPreference in the musim-Assistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE has a preference to leave RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":1820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set musim-PreferredRRC-State to the preferred RRC state.","paragraph_zero_based":1821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide musim-CapRestriction according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE has a preference for temporary capability restriction:","paragraph_zero_based":1823}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["02b499a382f09b946ccb1d2cc9d930a0a62e004200935784fc3c7a5208bad9c8","12a39b62610bc68957a109a5faa36498d34e624e2c72dda85871966acf904c46","ab9b61663c1ab64840ffa687e006ef0c4747d58d5105cdec39fb47978f795d9c","850237c7e3382d3a8f6f0c22cfbf3cede06751ad0d64217e08221b52b6d024bf","7455fcbe2268e6939d7f6e8bb454073e3549544acef75e11d75fd6bc7a9bdf6a","167180879e46c0e8e05efb7a5fd57fdb07ec15b82eb8198315caf1a24fe7bc4d","78714e252cdc360505d95b57ae90c6bd6b7b8c5c595ff8599adcb782362f2927","c20f1341a2a529cdb65ff115a69a558c8bd05df5b8a2219995e1427597776b13","293f79b30d8fa2915d3fb982c4f028fc5692d5ed4d3e73a48641f1d214a69b04","64beebaf24dcd19b1a23521cedf8a8d64bcd00514ae0fff3ae778e458b54a81d","a9280dbf108ba823fb2aee0b172229283b6aa0be316375d4e8650d60c8c1fffc","e8fbe114edffe314e5b8306dcaeec656a62d529b984ddc4267e85891a7e3f32c","f5d653dce438e763290af9a4a55ec86b7c55b7a4626a44beb674983a4079489c","774387acfd2107870c5194f62bdb3952114816fd4025de5d7eab0f95faa791b9","4e1fc75dfdac6e49e23be83143928bc5384f673801d956d79499c6d1ba4c1381","8d0c265acc7c7ac0ee31d716fceaf04eb698593882bfbafa39cef01fb1df94d7","495e56c09e0d6372845929baadd35731c8ea8e3ad49cff76c328e0917df55c09","57ebb481a0e08653faecd196c13dd6ca2e7d077f6d016f23edaf5c6b439bc54b","56f28d9c8c52ceacc6e5e25dfc19310edadd043027053184d234c7208e49e29c","a0da83f4e7511e0d3ecf3345d6d61597fb72eb68b10305e8cd905fff52c90537","8bf27a0d6e9c76ac74612c430036da4fe0ab94002947fa177da06e0cc8cfe1d2","fedf9c342bdbf39c31341efe706d1f58f7533c66b0b3db4cced6c211a225d652","1579ecd4d3653f6be6e9b13f6e3e21397388954678de39cd8bf9da950d348bd3","3693c800e86b7a97e059cd6f47df182b451126a44c4dc0d5e15f919f98d05b5a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":