{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE has a preference for serving cell(s), except PCell, and/or SCG to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":1824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the musim-Cell-SCG-ToRelease;","paragraph_zero_based":1825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set musim-CellToRelease to include the serving cell(s) the UE prefers to be released;","paragraph_zero_based":1826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set scg-ReleasePreference to scgReleasePreferred if the UE prefers the SCG to be released;","paragraph_zero_based":1827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE has a preference to indicate the serving cells with restricted capabilities:","paragraph_zero_based":1828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the musim-CellToAffectList the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the musim-ServCellIndex and the musim-MIMO-Layers-DL/ musim-MIMO-Layers-UL/ musim-SupportedBandwidth-DL/ musim-SupportedBandwidth-UL for the corresponding serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE has a preference to indicate the maximum number of CCs:","paragraph_zero_based":1831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the musim-CapRestriction for the musim-MaxCC the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the musim-MaxCC-TotalDL/ musim-MaxCC-TotalUL/ musim-MaxCC-FR1-DL/ musim-MaxCC-FR1-UL/ musim-MaxCC-FR2-1-DL/ musim-MaxCC-FR2-2-UL/ musim-MaxCC-FR2-2-DL/ musim-MaxCC-FR2-2-UL for the corresponding maximum number of CCs;","paragraph_zero_based":1833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE has a preference to indicate band(s) and/or combination(s) of bands with capabilities restricted which comprise of the band(s) that is/are indicated in musim-CandidateBandList:","paragraph_zero_based":1834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the musim-AffectededBandsList the UE prefer to be configured with capabilities restricted;","paragraph_zero_based":1835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the musim-bandEntryIndex for each band or each band of the combination(s) for which capabilities are restricted;","paragraph_zero_based":1836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the musim-CapabilityRestricted for the corresponding band;","paragraph_zero_based":1837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE has a preference to indicate band(s) and/or combination(s) of bands to be avoided which comprise of band(s) that is indicated in musim-CandidateBandList:","paragraph_zero_based":1838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the musim-AvoidedBandsList the UE prefers not to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the musim-bandEntryIndex for each band or each band of the combination(s) to be avoided;","paragraph_zero_based":1840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE has no longer preference for temporary capability restriction indicated by musim-Cell-SCG-ToRelease, musim-CellToAffectList, musim-MaxCC, musim-AffectededBandsList and/or musim-AvoidedBandsList:","paragraph_zero_based":1841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include the corresponding temporary capability restriction preference in the musim-CapRestriction;","paragraph_zero_based":1842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide musim-NeedForGapsInfoNR according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include intraFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each supported NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the requestedTargetBandFilterNR-r16 of NeedForGapsConfigNR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each supported NR band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNR-r16, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the measurement gap requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":1846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1847}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["13a8d78defe0eef3d838ba6b4ad8418c54af4dbc750f807d962bf8fe5e5a504a","4d1a8b41559a130d3622d3db03457f8446b1c4b57f65e5db85135be19d4a8618","949f3d9ac6cb4c977c264b2a8ae5da51b5580e4613e41346c86e013f53df0632","2076b1b92b6b723b4e237de661da4062df2217cf99cc25dfa81c75a60ee7e59d","8d0361f8355b42683384aee505a689d2271922b1ab2487f562ed8c8c20ab9511","7b43ca2add2261efe86ffcbac9bd7dd6b1586578881ead5e1171f6049ba02439","71238c788c620bf0b9f5169d4bbab4d43cef2e0ae58bdfe8a30aa497e47c69cb","a1c0ed62213dd4b1ca29644ce489b02e13c8bc35700de2bcc1b472a4beb9857f","5a2af003d9d93834be6836da5a5aa15c4190aaf6da0a276f02dc464259f4ab21","c6680daa18794b4ec6eeddf6f10e324ca93bb1b3cf29f8f70fe14deff15a5897","1c123eb8d0104c4d07bd45df3c24c93a039898f3c223eef3d0b1de2f984f4e8f","759949d94f86b33547ceb4d1c2a20e4140949b25748ebb21386822bfb1679909","0bee69945468d2de11e5f411a6c763e77a0618f83dc261750032173990a9906c","ebd5059543a246c9e4d8eedc027a2c3f9bfa50f1d1e3891d29218cc3672e841e","2c527ad515bb964f28df3ae73e1af83ebe0c87aed4b9d06201589785536094dd","f0c3d0bb2785d06646e59f6ee4bb4323f13c4741fa017cb24fbaa804d1f17ba1","a65ed66b66007063b9c32e6fcee4eec1221781fed52877e9815d1710bc7811c1","9d4a415e560d63c9e619ef1ad3dcad5707ecabd372e715c229ec85a493e55652","74f5eaaa6b891b916e8ead131f5148abafc4d2aa0beac504f616fa6c3bf584d7","6e1dc07fb145e772e65a261181c0715bca38cf0daf72ff0cea1e9edc9bbfe448","12fed949b78408a45d95eb4d1eb176d44550429ae6aca4f0d1950cfdbaea7dc2","7956d94947519e7355ab4f55d726755f8075084d58a541bdf3c35b32cb7d8ad1","da0cf6420769b0dc91ed3ca190ea1dd28a0fb6988c5930ed807f146c5b952480","e7ffe395e8996be5ce56830fbf103c0f53864f2acefa9435638f6ff8900f1444"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1824,1847],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1824"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the measurement gap requirement information for each supported NR band;","paragraph_zero_based":1848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of a cell group according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE performs RLM measurement relaxation on the cell group according to TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":1850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rlm-MeasRelaxationState to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rlm-MeasRelaxationState to false;","paragraph_zero_based":1853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of a cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each serving cell of the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE performs BFD measurement relaxation on this serving cell according to TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":1856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the n-th bit of bfd-MeasRelaxationState to '1', where n is equal to the servCellIndex value + 1 of the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the n-th bit of bfd-MeasRelaxationState to '0', where n is equal to the servCellIndex value + 1 of the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":1859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to indicate availability of data mapped to radio bearers not configured for SDT according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the nonSDT-DataIndication in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include and set the resumeCause according to the information received from the upper layers, if provided.","paragraph_zero_based":1862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication of preference for SCG deactivation according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include scg-DeactivationPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the scg-DeactivationPreference to scg-DeactivationPreferred if the UE prefers the SCG to be deactivated, otherwise set it to noPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":1865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication that the UE has uplink data related to a deactivated SCG according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include uplinkData in the UEAssistanceInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":1867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication about whether the criterion for RRM relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled or not fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":1868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":1869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1871}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ce6bed5ab9c3a68d0442079c33a292b4d9bc64889908ca6c6523267f1f65b6c5","8f5c4437d0a4e8013eafa4a442f13d1e3c40e0ce444b9fc8c48a05a798c5ad38","279dbe252e1938ef418cad4f5fe98a858c327cdc54e1b5e89ceca438f820d506","a7b224888ea5736d29fd8f6dc9ff1059c50c1a97c1bc648399ac88bb7e3bbd3f","148b01151596320351fd23a1c9e061c8ca85e9350de3d2cb371d3ec4ae62ad2a","7849dc49af3a0d3fc1b58d16313795763324517e3a63d8af7d2945dcca4f95b2","5dc1b14a75a105d69126c8543cd4014d85529faf42c7ea27dafac627a146d45c","7184e7fae5dd94fb149bebe22ff645599fa9de19308feb23c20983c6f3a14251","c07d383589300b71afe95bb8ee32bfa7293977f1cec17bd9ff72686c9a821bf3","58a7edc3a04ecdf4a458d9e04dbc732f43dc24e893f562702cae22f017269f30","82c8f5794709b4f38d70d0c487600ff21a5f41a22a2dd9b70749d1589da301f6","f07dfa8f730ec903c95c437aa7644e93d6ce4a39af1af8038c454a034bb8b3b1","93b7344366633efe3e6cd570498229156e45b5b44d069185c76efe5594a32f40","238173da7b9d0cec175eecf0595ab33b78b7a4b06d936910adf0695afd8f3a87","71d1a460298505691107892be9057cbea5add38370097dd0cfe552f31f10876f","6e44b82133ddb3176a847446a5d2edcada8074502ea1797c36351a546dd9365f","1b750c9e3f319dc620b279c4d06e949710e540f50520cc329660cee46f4cd395","c6dfcd8697930549a1a7dfdb007bf01c8c10f8b0b8e2b706a4108b0f9bf713f9","5941ac26a6f450308b545c971aae28d6571118114f41450527a3d477b5d69ee1","69d2ec744c7c65393f67cb93c79df4e7257d84eacbd0450d3ec2a89356b10d33","d9d2c9a691d1871bfef0448c056c2dc22aed2c37c320e2cd9fe057b0356b79d3","4c8963c6d062cecd6fc54575956c5bb373ffb9fc27ee83acd45a48acb6654595","7b52dfb427eae010b827df82355672f645e6e685b04be57710d378fc5e62a1f4","b53efa5613d840a33da9bb34bcfc7e84739b95ed90d79a8b5a9b7dc25c64c5a2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1848,1871],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1848"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment to false.","paragraph_zero_based":1872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) according to 5.7.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the propagationDelayDifference for each neighbour cell in the neighCellInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide preference on multi-Rx operation for FR2 according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for not operating on multi-Rx (i.e. not supporting simultaneous reception with different QCL-typeD) for FR2:","paragraph_zero_based":1876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set multiRx-PreferenceFR2 to single;","paragraph_zero_based":1877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has the preference for operating on multi-Rx for FR2):","paragraph_zero_based":1878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set multiRx-PreferenceFR2 to multiple.","paragraph_zero_based":1879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to indicate the availability of flight path information according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":1881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide UL traffic information according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each PDU session for which the UE intends to provide UL traffic information in this UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":1883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set pdu-SessionID to the value of the concerned PDU session ID;","paragraph_zero_based":1884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide UL traffic information according to 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T346l for each QoS flow of this PDU session for which the UE intends to provide UL traffic information in this UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each QoS flow of this PDU session for which timer T346l is not running and for which the UE intends to provide UL traffic information in this UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":1887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T346l associated to this QoS flow with the timer value set to the value of ul-TrafficInfoProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set qfi to the value of the concerned QFI;","paragraph_zero_based":1889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the jitter range measurement is available; and","paragraph_zero_based":1890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not provide jitter range since it was configured to provide UL traffic information, or if the measured jitter range has changed since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message containing jitterRange:","paragraph_zero_based":1891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set jitterRange to the latest measured value of the jitter range;","paragraph_zero_based":1892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the burst arrival time measurement is available; and","paragraph_zero_based":1893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not provide burst arrival time since it was configured to provide UL traffic information, or if the measured burst arrival time has changed since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message containing burstArrivalTime:","paragraph_zero_based":1894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set burstArrivalTime to the latest measured value of the burst arrival time;","paragraph_zero_based":1895}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4e122b43f5ccf0b163b51fd8eb69ec1b805abc081140e4e3309ab12298550992","ae9525f95fc35e871f0927901710e860dd9a21409647c7cd7722c31e8c02fa41","0968f0712132ed4003422d30b3d6d1cd3bed69b363375145c0afaeb4f6b9b094","0bff311c3d8b2411b1baf462710231d15f47045a1609a2123c9c5d4456125d62","971b6ac5006a79a14964cf17aeee5cb2b207ccc0e03cdff16eb552de5f5badfb","e6f9aabd921b963e08359da85758be9bac47ed790f000d568f09fca25aa7b326","3f12d5b6ef62f8cf276664cc4af41dba19d960f9c64c1f6b5be4e07cda00595b","56d587ad1db5c66487fda594340b361e9fff3b988987533b6042aa8c53f9eb44","6fb026c05b75868535ccd85eb601ab198e6ac41afd7a40a31eb843f9099789f7","4ba8c33e5088f278c7232f7e23df76d0a13cc096f75db13c05158c45d97d6f57","c1d60b6e5b2470efc3232113a9ca69e0d3f192ea3361a098cf0180b90c7c3b57","3fe45098100502f904dc0ca1e9c5569ad571f82d676636c21874fe714dc21508","b2883b27fd2f4ab32122f012fc1a205dbc4fbc83a2ecc93ae18790dbf46b6872","9d1e5a3ebf6e7da5d50fd36ee63d4b90e7154d91058b4dfdcdd579e9b9603656","8acd51d9cd4360e7b080698bff1765ed39046ca7c8bbeb276d96541e044bfc63","bafcf0b45291e925dfa8fa1e6068b00e85517cb0b64cc2864e17007e9decd909","cd82915eeb46e80e3aeab20395f3128b78b4464ec6b67c7d2ebaa928c1a04641","cbbd713b2b93b598c82adb7f41d7abf62e08553a9005f5fa36603849a292ba0a","31d31469d103c6d037e8babd78d2048eda354474f8446acb62d5316179b0f936","8f374acc068d491faf03f3522c3ae0a23b8faf26ee6d0c20fc2959903322babc","a0b133a3ffe23b45a2fe048c85ff76118a8ce1daac9cfd15637529b9b9633626","c9477a4210476eb63e1ea33ba3b62a0f6cfd6d2591ba9230c3bceac0760a8f31","f3394b990b2213a2e6e825a576df003b985226575abc0850b4b126ecc42cf20b","3e86f750de2bf4366d21af6e28999c36f83b1f596e69a7bc8241fc5ea3a23fe5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1872,1895],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1872"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the traffic periodicity measurement is available; and","paragraph_zero_based":1896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not provide traffic periodicity since it was configured to provide UL traffic information, or if the measured traffic periodicity has changed since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message containing trafficPeriodicity:","paragraph_zero_based":1897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set trafficPeriodicity to the latest measured value of the traffic periodicity;","paragraph_zero_based":1898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not provide pdu-SetIdentification since it was configured to provide UL traffic information, or if the information previously provided in pdu-SetIdentification has changed since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message containing pdu-SetIdentification:","paragraph_zero_based":1899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is able to identify PDU Set(s) for the QoS flow:","paragraph_zero_based":1900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set pdu-SetIdentification to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set pdu-SetIdentification to false.","paragraph_zero_based":1903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not provide psi-Identification since it was configured to provide UL traffic information, or if the information previously provided in psi-Identification has changed since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message containing psi-Identification:","paragraph_zero_based":1904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is able to identify PSI(s) for the QoS flow:","paragraph_zero_based":1905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set psi-Identification to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set psi-Identification to false.","paragraph_zero_based":1908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s) according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include n3c-relayUE-InfoList in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to report the UE's preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if gapUE is configured under measGapConfig; and","paragraph_zero_based":1912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has the preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio for per UE gap:","paragraph_zero_based":1913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perUE to the preferred gap occasion cancellation ratio;","paragraph_zero_based":1914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if gapFR1 or gapFR2 is configured under measGapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has the preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio for FR1:","paragraph_zero_based":1916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set fr1 to the preferred gap occasion cancellation ratio;","paragraph_zero_based":1917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has the preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio for FR2:","paragraph_zero_based":1918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set fr2 to the preferred gap occasion cancellation ratio;","paragraph_zero_based":1919}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256"