{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if gapToAddModList is configured under measGapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the preferred gap occasion cancellation ratio for each measurement gap configuration with measGapId for which the UE has preferred gap occasion cancellation ratio;","paragraph_zero_based":1921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide lpwus-OffsetPreference of a cell group according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include lpwus-OffsetPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on time offset for LP-WUS monitoring:","paragraph_zero_based":1924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the timeOffset to the preferred offset value;","paragraph_zero_based":1925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to report assistance information about the applicability of configurations subject to applicability determination procedure according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include applicabilityReportList in this UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":1928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell is configured with at least one reportConfigId associated to a CSI-ReportConfig including csi-InferencePrediction, or including reportQuantity-r19 set to p-CRI-r19 or p-SSB-Index-r19 or p-CRI-RSRP-r19 or p-SSB-Index-RSRP-r19, for which the applicability status has changed; or","paragraph_zero_based":1929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated serving cell index was included in an entry in applicabilityConfigList within applicabilityReportConfig and the applicability status for at least one of the associated entries in applicabilitySetConfigCSI-List has changed:","paragraph_zero_based":1930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include an entry in applicabilityReportList in the UEAssistanceInformation message, and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the applicabilityCellId to the serving cell index of the cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each configured reportConfigId associated to a CSI-ReportConfig including csi-InferencePrediction, or including reportQuantity-r19 set to p-CRI-r19 or p-SSB-Index-r19 or p-CRI-RSRP-r19 or p-SSB-Index-RSRP-r19, for which the applicability status has changed:","paragraph_zero_based":1933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include an entry in the applicabilityInfoReportList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set the csi-ReportConfigId within applicabilityInfoReportId to the corresponding reportConfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":1935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set the applicabilityStatus to the applicability status of the configuration corresponding to the applicabilityInfoReportId;","paragraph_zero_based":1936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the applicabilityStatus is set to inapplicable:","paragraph_zero_based":1937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>if the UE prefers to release the concerned CSI-ReportConfig, include releaseConfigurationPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":1938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each entry within applicabilitySetConfigCSI-List that changed applicability status, associated with the concerned serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":1939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include an entry in the applicabilityInfoReportList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set the applicabilitySetId within applicabilityInfoReportId to the corresponding applicabilitySetConfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":1941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set the applicabilityStatus to the applicability status of the configuration corresponding to the applicabilityInfoReportId;","paragraph_zero_based":1942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the applicabilityStatus is set to inapplicable:","paragraph_zero_based":1943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["64576060c19d82174b0096ba02d657148a14e622fa25643620d7e240612c17cf","50f3be663830cc95aa1dc3543b5644413f16effb92d9f10522d53d4b67ac00b1","9c6d131539ce84176d926819e28497f4e807c80419ab89ae6d8829d0f5cd0aef","d225c5c311bb7f4fd1305bf2e7dc9cee916e1fd59cf07c198c064514acc61b23","1df35a4fa74431bfd1c5f1a8163e147ecc0e076e6db3d961a1f272593b4fbe81","2a4f61ac1da752373dae91461525c6a1daa2f3c161c83b39546088c01e5ca0cd","0902558e950a0ec513b8723683b9cde5634dd28d64c340a5019f433823356cd8","778c1a345d7d56086f3a6ebaeddae4938ec82a9d4e0a2c3786901bfe645e2ee6","68408975cc7701003ae2e1802aa6c054bd9427fe8c9d2ac1fde8c15b27b65f3e","8b2ec8f7ee99a416da409ef67b9c51e94c01128b46757c42c15e4bcd5c0d9530","024c74644e15e2d63ad785f9f4e55aa7fb2d2c4e2ed2fcc3588e164debaa4e06","794cd0f951541a2e160aed879fee39a413c34cbb82fc69a0eff0b8a87e338156","d0abe6eccae8f33a2765007013e13b5bd5d2480028935a61b67c8eb9b32f7829","3bba620126313395a83a487f3084cc9a959a18251e9dac0bb57bc3fad3f108ab","514d1dec01d1321dd29572b5ffc8afd6ffc03f2e9a668fb037c011d123816962","3d9bcf0bc30eb894f3e57f66657305564299e8475214c1ad9731e99d0f9fe028","0351043e158d3a570f999752ef7c98aeca4cc703ab708bcc9dc35f10dc06a70c","d8d776bab059a600df05e95940975d5fbc6c068b8605ec7374e5c2f66154874c","9ab717494bfb4edb8ae4accdad09a5492af580f4d8e3fa5b2f51ffc6f0033cd9","60416f0fdd4bac4779d66fd977a33be5c7966be0faa391e04185f8fabcc88aae","7924a56d47626f8666f3895a5df6b2f608fc789c093c8d253d53a79e912f463b","60edd2b07b696b780eddbff90522c1ecbc8f11219e79f0d1158dbb140432c14e","4c38f4b05f440d36bf76f202012bc1be7a41e22562d674afa6ba634b54d4cc47","cbbac88ac764c77f5ec3c8420bcacb64183cee1a67efff3e300128c28d9b1e5a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1920,1943],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1920"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>if the UE prefers to release the concerned ApplicabilitySetCSI-Config, include releaseConfigurationPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":1944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to report the UE preference to be configured with radio resources to perform UE-side data collection according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include dataCollectionPreference in this UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE prefers to be configured with radio resources to perform data collection:","paragraph_zero_based":1947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set dataCollectionStart to start;","paragraph_zero_based":1948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each serving cell configured with candidate UE-side data collection configuration(s) in dataCollectionCandidateConfigList and for which the UE has one or more preferred radio resource configuration(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include an entry in dataCollectionPreferredConfigurationList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the dataCollectionServCellIndex to the serving cell index of the cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include in dataCollectionCandidateIdList the dataCollectionCandidateConfigId associated with preferred configuration(s) from dataCollectionCandidateConfigParameterList;","paragraph_zero_based":1952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE no longer prefers to be configured with radio resources to perform data collection:","paragraph_zero_based":1953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each serving cell configured with one or more UE-side data collection configuration(s) corresponding to a CSI-ReportConfig and for which the UE prefers to stop UE-side data collection:","paragraph_zero_based":1954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include an entry in dataCollectionStopConfigurationList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the dataCollectionStopServCellIndex to the serving cell index of the cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include in dataCollectionIdList the reportConfigId associated with the CSI-ReportConfig including the UE-side data collection configuration(s) that the UE prefers to stop;","paragraph_zero_based":1957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide assistance information related to logging of measurements for network-side data collection according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE determines that it has entered a low power state:","paragraph_zero_based":1959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set lowPowerState to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the memory reserved for the logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection has become full:","paragraph_zero_based":1961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set memoryStatus to full;","paragraph_zero_based":1962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if loggedDataCollectionMemoryThreshold is configured and if the amount of logged data related to radio measurements for network-side data collection has become equal to or above the loggedDataCollectionMemoryThreshold:","paragraph_zero_based":1963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set memoryStatusto aboveThreshold;","paragraph_zero_based":1964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide location information for assisted SMTC configuration in RRC_CONNECTED state according to 5.7.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the referenceLocationReport with a number of closest reference locations to the current UE’s position determined by closestLocsToReport;","paragraph_zero_based":1966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEAssistanceInformation message for configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication or NR sidelink positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":1967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5d6913278de68d1c03d6c2cbd1ffdaab4971a84a2ee6df961ad458a58dc61600","a10ad06051417a80dc123ac77cb68e09d1404f7158172346533e93b9e7f6959e","f72c0031859717afc8a490c8a319855f70344d8b9f35133c7d7b3bc5bc7c2fcb","495de3dff342b597b28d937c9e841b8002ea54630f66ccef36d7251dec50c92b","2b30c48e26d1d8270c6d28ca5fec8bdbc9403f2d1e3bd6f4c2ed22d1c970b25d","1b171b902052a833d0cdb51ad4693fc1c06b1989d87b57f23a4947f6ca24b370","a104ca168712ae70363f5184dcb9f2c3e08a856aed09f54465d3c2a188d1bee1","523230d7a5e71a383a87f7ffe73bbc5af42333b02bcde30c7cd052a98f13517e","1dd421a3125315fb40574862fa06c6b48ec0ff86b5fdf8f8e729a9a8a9c0b400","cce07a1dd4df326af7df9131a0f1544b722c129a9d634f7951482f489d0a4508","e36b00aafe57b485d9da44bf807f4f4b2375933e58583f36992021e02a28cee5","afd649e767ffb9864255ae163956b8968e79a6d9e60692c43ebfc1d261bc96a4","20a48d7d98a8f8956488149c57a8ec30db509732628f393131d1494db6e61373","2d6669045c10a872e17bb5e3666b3aed4b698b62541c3f1f8b07c04bcaca74a4","3979ee6a711fa60fdab2d18ec222dd938cfe562a1da0fc3353130e601530103b","90d8c6ac5d429edbf34ad05ce3a8ac19a1d97b0b323ae6f62ed0fdae7b3c85a7","2c85f20e9c30b6d927fffba298b1a2c5d982418dcaeb0a4f9a1f6c3aa06239ed","ab2352f16fcbf2461beea8c7ccf080256d623b78044a8f6bc0c943995b478a5b","ed23897879f18233a6cc35b2efba93030b6c3c1cc704324cb9a771c066f66375","5d15843ca8df6946c5e7af5a12a67996d064efdfa916f689e5177299bb4717f0","39f5260b9202cece437dede730d0b5fb8c5eedaf08a4701c66bbc5fbd1e06e97","0e56056f86589151d8ba2e681a4d66be834d2d131e42e9ecaca94d6229ba901f","09d755bc831f6ed02e1eab7724d313784804b1f473d76d432759767878f2a6d5","3bbcfd6d52980810e60a2f4bfe4001c677c2a4a97d3d13f06aeb9f9cf7e9d2cc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1944,1967],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1944"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink:","paragraph_zero_based":1968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the sl-UE-AssistanceInformationNR;","paragraph_zero_based":1969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":1970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the sl-PRS-UE-AssistanceInformationNR;","paragraph_zero_based":1971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is up to UE implementation when and how to trigger configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication or NR sidelink positioning.","paragraph_zero_based":1972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was triggered to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication by an NR RRCReconfiguration message that was embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation to lower layers via SRB1, embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferIRAT as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.28;","paragraph_zero_based":1975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure was triggered to provide UE preference for SCG deactivation or to indicate that the UE with a deactivate SCG has uplink data to send on a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":1976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":1978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":1979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":1982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":1983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE assistance configuration that triggered this UE assistance information is associated with the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":1985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via the NR MCG embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in 5.7.2a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6",