{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ltm-CSI-ReportConfigToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configured CSI report settings for LTM as specified in TS 38.214 [19].","paragraph_zero_based":4153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Pool of NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet which can be referred to from CSI-ResourceConfig or from MAC CEs.","paragraph_zero_based":4155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Pool of NZP-CSI-RS-Resource which can be referred to from NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet.","paragraph_zero_based":4157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportTriggerSize, reportTriggerSizeDCI-0-2","paragraph_zero_based":4158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Size of CSI request field in DCI (bits) (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.5.1). The field reportTriggerSize applies to DCI format 0_1 and the field reportTriggerSizeDCI-0-2 applies to DCI format 0_2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.5.1).","paragraph_zero_based":4159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scellActivationRS-ConfigToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configured RS for fast SCell activation as specified in TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.1.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":4161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-RSRP-MeasResourceSetToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Pool of SRS-RSRP-MeasResourceSet for SRS RSRP measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":4163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-RSRP-MeasResourceToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Pool of SRS-RSRP-MeasResource for SRS RSRP measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":4165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Text Omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":4167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-ReportConfig","paragraph_zero_based":4168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-ReportConfig is used to configure a periodic or semi-persistent report sent on PUCCH on the cell in which the CSI-ReportConfig is included, or to configure a semi-persistent or aperiodic report sent on PUSCH triggered by DCI received on the cell in which the CSI-ReportConfig is included (in this case, the cell on which the report is sent is determined by the received DCI). The IE CSI-ReportConfig is also used to configure UE initiated CSI reporting. See TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.","paragraph_zero_based":4169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":4170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":4171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-REPORTCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":4172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportConfig ::=                SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":4174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    reportConfigId                          CSI-ReportConfigId,","paragraph_zero_based":4175}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7864602ca009682531a75867c5d0448968bc54f01be32b31edcc96a7cc74ffc8","374d26e8ec470f107c8141b1d642a6abaadbac42b5d1ac7e7697a75f75516188","0f3a3eda63f0c4fe5d16a10fdc1391d1772b2ce7a9c113606feed7afc30d4b49","7f475e4e228c65b24a19ec44c93133018c30845c6fdd4eeddf3fc0f9e554823e","7d2ede8a