{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"aerial-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to indicate the availability of flight path information for Aerial UE operation.","paragraph_zero_based":5329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"applicabilityConfigCellId","paragraph_zero_based":5330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell that the applicabilitySetConfigCSI-List refers to.","paragraph_zero_based":5331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"applicabilityReportConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to indicate the applicability of configurations subject to the applicability determination procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":5333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"applicabilitySetConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":5334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ID of a set of prediction related parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":5335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"applicabilitySetConfigCSI-List","paragraph_zero_based":5336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each serving cell the list of sets of prediction related parameters configured for UE applicability reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":5337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":5339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"btNameList","paragraph_zero_based":5340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific Bluetooth beacons. NG-RAN configures the field if includeBT-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":5341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":5342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the bandwidth of the candidate frequency range around the center frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":5343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCenterFreq","paragraph_zero_based":5344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the center frequency of the candidate frequency range.","paragraph_zero_based":5345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqListNR","paragraph_zero_based":5346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each candidate NR serving cells, the center frequency around which UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":5347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqRangeListNR","paragraph_zero_based":5348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the candidate frequency range with the combination of the center frequency and the candidate bandwidth, around which the UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":5349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"closestLocsToReport","paragraph_zero_based":5350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of closest reference locations the UE should indicate for assisted SMTC configuration in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":5351}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e94352942c9cbbfb4c3c8b8cdccc671520d7eecaaf00874833a96c8c5ac8b420","0ba9ebe033929bf4d768ce91e67b836785ca5083651d46e1cc37638452362a8f","ee9f477b96d9bc0fcc5563d41d8d4e4661d087c5145df7e1150cff8476e1ad3f","33c24d04a7dd286cd23f6a446691628e1144f6083d85b755dc700947bc339fae","52ba6e453fdd3200983d4d3fe444db4546b04f94317ecbbb5061f3dc342f0