{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507680.zip::R2-2507680 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connectedReporting","paragraph_zero_based":5352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE can report a preference to remain in RRC_CONNECTED state following a report to leave RRC_CONNECTED state. If absent, the UE cannot report a preference to stay in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":5353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionCandidateConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":5354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ID of a candidate configuration for UE-side data collection.","paragraph_zero_based":5355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionCandidateConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":5356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each serving cell the list of candidate radio resources configured for UE-side data collection. The UE is not expected to perform measurements solely based on the configurations provided by this IE.","paragraph_zero_based":5357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionPreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report its preference to be configured with radio resources for UE-side data collection.","paragraph_zero_based":5359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":5360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Index of the serving cell that the dataCollectionCandidateConfigParameterList refers to.","paragraph_zero_based":5361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for delay budget reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot4 means prohibit timer is set to 0.4 seconds, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's DRX preferences for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":5365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for DRX preferences assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapOccasionCancelRatioProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for transmitting the assistance information of gap occasion cancellation ratio. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapOccasionCancelRatioReportConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio.","paragraph_zero_based":5371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"idc-AssistanceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about UE detected IDC problem.","paragraph_zero_based":5373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information related to logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection. When configured with loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig the UE reports that it has logged radio measurements for network-side data collection when the memory reserved for logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection has become full and it reports when it determines that it has entered a low power state.","paragraph_zero_based":5375}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"8ea3f2cd17cc64a7fc93b34e322a9917fea2f6fb2ccc8fd888363f550f5f01ad","original_member_sha256":"a9ae874fc8477ca54ba94d75064a5096273f26d409ca0f0a3ac4dc63a68b1cd6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7f41e5e06e689c41c38a165a8a94d3805957f8cd99175f31022c6e955433f101","10e9a9a5d269b8fa65025cf0a0a1ddef61aa223debaf9d5992997bd6ee8db9cc","4c9368ebbc0b8df4026b64450b2ffb84e48a0e454c977811281881f81201a7d9","f0a031be9b02bc2a5064c94c0b60f18f7d14de7f2712faedacf83243b8fccf7e","e52095819bc5e593678eedf76ab33b46712015c43d0acacdea9dcd03b7a05760","11548af25331ee984f56286e4f6066b7757e917858b7434ad8e036ffa37a6b88","79ac195bdf9d522a022efe6176ee23b6ef6460232c8c555fddabb95a24d9b449","be96e408b2723a5f039e25415eb349eccd40a703bb15a9b051e9ca09a1f4c8c2","549b3963bdef2c2541eab9f1feacbd1f96331783654827658b8ea6c51708959e","47e6bbe26471ebe1fbae70092a8a5184bb1ec4c032b00ad5d85cffc1674853ed","97f1a2c47a73a678f15d35916e094d0511d71d50cd78042c7411e825382baa56","db9f0d166414e63f37c1a56ef3bea79833bac0cf42faf19fa6fb85329e26f5fb","9300d10c31947465f43265637f68dbdd18e7bac656c21feeb858781e00c1e9b8","310c22cec839b156e6872a4787c32654dda59c9433267d8b48098a286bfd399b","af58b13be69831696229c70f0fdb7d3a1f4bf3b262fa18c17c4f290d731d4cef","e045906bb08cf0e4f66c76d67362761ad3738b6d9b3d0d9ad8189b41170fa6cb","3755b8f4423c9bceb549e9c6eed190a90025e12869ee47ff166da164e3bc4413","97b06690bee5030ff0fd4aa45894be6846bbe078501abe0fe9eff6ff7c72c291","82b50305e3a888ee6ce0d054209a90faf99190bb1139da501ee848dfb8494683","df5d165b532c419174d75bb696e5fb35cf5cc81cf1fcc7c48ac9cc42f8ced649","6b0d03a76f58f84be99c9e55748b3319ab65881dd697fc26b0777fb132ded0b0","465c08867431d