{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the SCG according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig includes mrdc-ReleaseAndAdd:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform MR-DC release as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the RRC reconfiguration according to 5.3.5.3 for the RRCReconfiguration message included in nr-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the RRC connection reconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3 for the RRCConnectionReconfiguration message included in eutra-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform MR-DC release as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 00:If the UE receives, within an LTM candidate configuration, an mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig set to release even if no SCG is currently configured at the UE, the UE does not consider this as an invalid configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the radioBearerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the radioBearerConfig2:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the measConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedNAS-MessageList:","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward each element of the dedicatedNAS-MessageList to upper layers in the same order as listed;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedSIB1-Delivery:","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the action upon reception of SIB1 as specified in 5.2.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["43f0961b702c05894b2e6b2ecf51f73acdb95f85196f85f5f1c555359fc6a6f8","475