{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:If this RRCReconfiguration is associated to the MCG and includes reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig and dedicatedSIB1-Delivery, the UE initiates (if needed) the request to acquire required SIBs, according to clause 5.2.2.3.5, only after the random access procedure or the LTM cell switch execution towards the target SpCell is completed.","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedSystemInformationDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the action upon reception of System Information as specified in 5.2.2.4;","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if all the SIB(s) and/or posSIB(s) requested in DedicatedSIBRequest message have been acquired:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPosSysInfoDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the action upon reception of the contained posSIB(s), as specified in clause 5.2.2.4.16;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if all the SIB(s) and/or posSIB(s) requested in DedicatedSIBRequest message have been acquired:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the otherConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the other configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the bap-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the BAP configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.12;","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the iab-IP-AddressConfigurationList:","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform release of IP address as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if iab-IP-AddressToAddModList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform IAB IP address addition/update as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the conditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e9cfa324ea724ddf2ce33b1e915e96465258e206b0b217edb1d48fe9b6c96304","43eaf57280f