{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the LTM sk-Counter configuration release as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.10;","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ltm-ConfigNRDC includes ltm-SK-CounterConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the LTM sk-Counter configuration addition/modification as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.9;","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the LTM configuration release procedure as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the srs-PosResourceSetAggBW-CombinationList:","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosResourceSetAggBW-CombinationList is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the SRS for positioning transmission using bandwidth aggregation provided in configuration SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW as specified in TS 38.211 [16];","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release all the configuration of SRS-PosResourceSetLinkedForAggBW;","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each SCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each SCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["91b7f8b431d1b76e5a36242631d0e6573c2adf054f0b5dc67801d79220ec75ac","edb2ada4a1880ff005c23f50e8a2793642481a0f73f3e7034cc2bd6652dae4e2","e38aac71be5df90bd837fa49df61c6f26b617b9e5e7ca6b42913f367bda2b87f","58ede0a2270a1ec5de8d90281cf77ceb3dc51cce70133cfd2b587e62df7f7781","61f034f737c474b51e958fa787d254dfa96b99e5287cbd162e355b96b4900b0f","7b436f467bcd3720d425d26f48b646778085c224a64d6cf051334572a30c381e","7392812fa4d45dbccd0997248c5501570bfe5f81efe319d257cb7ae137fcbbac","757ece9cf701e80e2c37cc9450159983229ac713a96ea518ef9ae2864800d10c","4fa32c37468d78823979c278b4125dc39c24f4ae24f68ec180b99333551c194a","c73bab650c11f6eff231430ee0f510927710467979414f6dd4902dc06ca3b069","ee03d6b38367a64c227f47e66f766599c105869183c8bda90b146060d4223072","963de26788448d062ca9aa8ee2515a82c0a8126ae0b1b2eaf55618337999029f","dca59f466e68f77cae1eed7455ac8edade102e92020c1c40ecf6f573426c4500","9764b48c9992d0b2856932ac6ce87ac47d269ba6ecc8eb6e14b47356a35c2f77","630c40cd7fe842b2ece1e0f578daf5946c3119b1269a21d1d8bbff007b3a8a2a","db17f7badf0678c2142f073e230c86b45bb6e432ffd76eb6a7c479bea631b53b","3ec8d8042100d22b43a2e825ebd5a0b585f6a8aa3b846500ce44f9c1784e727e","af9d62b0ee4692bde9cab0a7253b6767b83dcd856b8995d9f48206755521eb9b","c9bcb1e5b71fbe246ae9b044272c24768ec36753e15cc0ff64ef43217608a5ee","993e6b88ad9bd07c210956895a9f2da4fb5b7854a822673b872b0f81b95df90a","6d95eb16c62474bd312e158458bcdb4b11afa876ef477bfd6374b6ca2e2d0e70","93fc09f4b3b93538bec59b056cb0ce487a60629c070bddea3641799bda1341ea","3eecb57ff130f1ad9327f36716b3ac3b658ec30d4712751e3314697b3ee7f5a0","25f0083c805384a087617185e9c65e0b6e0d54ba45d524f5e2e663df13180ae4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[264,287],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p264"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0b:The UE does not expect that the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier is received in both masterCellGroup and in secondaryCellGroup. Network only configures at most one of reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent, reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier in one RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the eutra-SCG-Response the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the nr-SCG-Response the SCG RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and the RRCReconfiguration message does not include the reconfigurationWithSync in the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedCondRRCReconfig the condReconfigId for the selected cell of conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if a new sk-Counter value has been selected due to the conditional reconfiguration execution for subsequent CPAC:","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include selectedSK-Counter and set its value to the selected sk-Counter value;","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and condExecutionCondPSCell is configured for the selected PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedPSCellForCHO-WithSCG and set it to the information of the selected PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-ConfigID-List stored in the VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included; or","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports the override protection of the signalling based logged MDT for inter-RAT (i.e. LTE to NR), and if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10] is included:","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T330 timer is running (associated to the logged measurement configuration for NR or for LTE):","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["70353ed7cc0f29c74f287dc5735c411a39057e365f643e07960a864c66baf15f","0af89a1f63e1d278c9c9ed077f5e95261804dd3e08c342b31a577e3af3ebed2d","f733b88249fc27fb67c58e2280d60114584f4e8ea47f64ace5cb89c56f5c4f45","292343daad5d0830aaea2610629505d8451dc87056a778085a19e5125e9d42b5","04768fddc580c469e6336a10139ed268e2f69def086f9affe52f3826efec6c79","18bd98ebb4c0cd9d747ba963bea09f44f98bfb6e45253e23498cc3518626ecd6","0de94471d7cd0057296c2e351180c1718d5456344427b51c2efde8c9bd145803","6bbb9c5446b0d1e8bb637e42676d989f1d81493e3da41a6ddc9a9f70c18f37cb","5fda563c1b4e4db4258a2c8c97df187d6155aa98054936dc1fd5b8407cb40578","e7fab5720b37f5474057f1ba9d63aa4245dd86c963443255b1cca03967124c40","bf3624309b5c50b38dc9c90786735142386faab68ecedfbf8c2b4fc8fd5a5ecf","e94e0739f7be339067d2a8409f6ab28b5770a6129f1590890d02d7ea207ec050","37778e5f9cd2db7d285ca5c32127bb09413c71b2522ed8440c3f22bd950a6676","c183c94b6314fa4a5c80317ebe22c07fbd0caa147d4c3561242311271cbcacb4","e9fd41f837693664e169f0de1e728dcd28911e33ac502a499aa013fb0f0a6e35","585ccb1975434c7873c6b607da4367eaae164f3987856e10c1051b9d2e5fafe7","e8a2e1210cfeb2d8c550fe70ee688f969f89de577ae2ac514759580e188baf2b","e018943a7c0eda94df7edc9c56d1677b86ecfc7d81c0e7876675abc17c7b7429","957674346cb1048564d4d59c296d23c4a6586096f50b86dc818a86d37939c873","a8f239868cb1785a9aa6c4083ea3fd1afc062c07016cddb28311adf8dde45a7c","7563c7be4d283cdaed2bbdffcc621f6a9e21b74ad863ed525584f6462110d94e","6b82746e1fd5c6468b00b14cb067922af1465690ad955119b96e6c0553fc4e80","8a12079ad7ea33aba5af0caeb9f33c42972a33a3591dea89b7906584b9161bb3","97a00784031c0516f0e9a0c2c190a09afc945ea4562f5b97cb291819c35f1a81"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[288,311],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p288"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE has logged measurements in VarLogMeasReport or in VarLogMeasReport of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList; or","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the registered SNPN identity is equal to snpn-Identity in networkIdentity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was configured with successHO-Config when connected to the source PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the applied RRCReconfiguration is not due to a conditional reconfiguration execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3, and the applied RRCReconfiguration is not due to an LTM cell switch execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the applied RRCReconfiguration is not received when T316 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions for the successful handover report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.6, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the MCG, or upon an indication from lower layer that the LTM cell switch execution has been successfully completed;","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if applied RRCReconfiguration is received when T316 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>release successHO-Config configured by the source PCell and thresholdPercentageT304 if configured by the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release successPSCell-Config configured by the source PCell, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessPSCell-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful PSCell change or addition information available in VarSuccessPSCell-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessPSCell-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successPSCell-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration includes retainLoggedMeasurements:","paragraph_zero_based":335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bbe6e581b45b1497293aa3a8f5cd366b9c9265b7c8986000e08f121a5fbfd7b1","9f5e6813e513472ac0801de84b1534fd9a2fd2a7b856a678c0dd6eca4150ebc7","6f6c1b429a1e866d123221b6a59daaf65d13579e05e60498cc1651dd366f0295","1ff65fd11c605ae6e95b66eb3e44928001397f118f30485d42d25bc117c27804","12084eefc5c7f50ec4e1e0ced9e0d378e39f27677dc5bbe7574a6236fb6fcdb0","16f290ebbd0942e5a790461aad1627a5fdd4fde2abd8631af7425243fd11bf05","1a712fc6fdb85655f3d546c118f287f4fee30cb1bf63ca716fa273d45abbfb97","89e9ffcd05bed3c10e6690f3441c396803f75d52bc808393ccdbafda69681514","b519d2bd5cb824c8495b05aa7eab1ec5f74ad4bbf6b7d170c391ea5e646dd6d4","78d068421039b5144d9d6741e1da87c483049c73b289e940c4e4899adca24ea4","2a6a577387f8bb43812709032ab0d68bbe2514b7d9257d7743bd4e331c9accff","8cc245663bc7bea035f7ad5c162e03e0d5e0fd22a715be0f1b3f61d325ed8c73","3b33c0e1f64120bc616e266f3e701d376e3d88de923384d0d8b38503335b93fe","fb0323b8bc73f95d64292f546929fde10efbc543232e8dcd53aa1375c3dcb9be","f233ba0712b474187cd92669cb20c5f1bb4cef47c5d13af2727b548bddbd9551","596f64d2db6fee5b3b0c6882505f01ced5c0a53e780f6831a10b728bf550751e","adc7edd3accb90802831d3f0094781a93428352fb0b40d31208f52c7092f97ac","2ea6ca0f95f271ed441a05227b620943a63fca06ffe1dc08025ea12d0e1e4f76","269636cf4561b888eb487d5ccda755ff60365bffdc77f037ed32ac8a1eaa9411","ac46eee7e9343a12ab8b94dbbe7798a9db7328dd81ecf3e87fb540c003a3dc77","d7e397c967c214e21254682570aac52ffd9d8683bf96956ebcaeddae6477ad95","2441377e583b7168f927594d54626aebf1ffc7244b0a7a8b7353d869bad0d2ae","df2eedff12df584225a63acb09e420fc1b11a37e6e45c6eec69b3042a74930b6","fc45b943f295fadf969b30a1af80ac8a619e270528e215759983022403e7c685"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[312,335],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p312"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has logged measurement entries available in VarCSI-LogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include csi-LogMeasAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard the logged measurement entries included in VarCSI-LogMeasReport, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1, but not within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup or E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration or E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume:","paragraph_zero_based":340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the NeedForGapsInfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information; or","paragraph_zero_based":343},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForInterruptionConfigNR and set it to enabled; or","paragraph_zero_based":344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForInterruptionConfigNR is enabled and the NeedForInterruptionInfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapsInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include intraFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>for each supported NR band that is also included in requestedTargetBandFilterNR, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the corresponding gap requirement information for each supported NR band;","paragraph_zero_based":351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the needForInterruptionConfigNR is enabled:","paragraph_zero_based":352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the needForInterruptionInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include intraFreq-needForInterruption with the same number of entries, and listed in the same order, as in intraFreq-needForGap;","paragraph_zero_based":354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7> for each entry in intraFreq-needForInterruption:","paragraph_zero_based":355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>include interruptionIndication and set the interruption requirement information if the corresponding entry in intraFreq-needForGap is set to no-gap;","paragraph_zero_based":356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include interFreq-needForInterruption with the same number of entries, and listed in the same order, as in interFreq-needForGap;","paragraph_zero_based":357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7> for each entry in interFreq-needForInterruption:","paragraph_zero_based":358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>include interruptionIndication and set the interruption requirement information if the corresponding entry in interFreq-needForGap is set to no-gap;","paragraph_zero_based":359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7f60841952884d44b093a145946facf81efeec757b85b716b848fb8beeaf2c42","686829ad42d3ff6b01a18ac495b4320e5cf6104e08f07ec73abcf384d72065ce","bdf93b2b4fc51408efe0adb7765728029063ad9ddc1347a6919382aeb924a04d","ad249c65929aa08847e93f9fd09ed504650d656b045cc1d6ce6c42ef98f486ce","c5a31cf1279f3f6f34791faaf990f43f7843a39e6167c14080cb0978ce576f9d","e867ce1f61202a7e6b41f3640c386cf4d789d04ebea4d5d38fe2342ada4142d4","e30e39494d7544868b90b66ca0dfb48da32b104b8c7a980ed072c3be32c0efc4","1b06431e8ed4df30c9c46e9f9d5344db7806a0c2134a5012c623465757d652e9","45116230fb823e13c801072b7506c5cf1885bf8ca4c114e67673ac9bea505b2a","e7037410673e320cd7a7e38f5595cc7b21a5dd5294b0eedd2d484b0b5e2f2ef2","e1265723acc1ceec9ff94ace3591dbc5f90f14287e2734e02bc3b5a5a51fe826","d2e2ad86797673914a2df55168355b2b8d839c688f8a38c005404658fe5d92d0","610fba7506940f9031caa3f00c8ab75b9a4ce80095e79c13e3debbeb71ce5285","11f6697a203855c04f3ba24ae9295e4f2980aeadbc471b323504cc2e7b927e53","31e62f247b60f3fe3617d8c44d83ed43d10f3dcd548bfb1be8560ff9d201deee","ba4563b5eb261b96b1002f748bf7e201f8157828a1546fdd5043e99408a18141","a25a86277543a3f08fac9f769c2b719815d454981546e2e81697403070ecf365","72b9647644e46396b3943b431ffd3e5203b9e5cd7fb79c950a239051c7363ea5","485de5c16cf4b1cb48d91fde346792d31ae2b42d709bb0891706d28453f88141","b07e4becf72de9e3759bde80cb1d8608e6699da3e7a616e3993030ec5184b7ae","3d19f7772e898156bb4e9f6c5c084b8cca08c72a14511c8a28b5a64d3a0926ce","26e05d35865c05c394e6bce8f4c367a12360482275fc244ab17ddf5863931554","e4053e607f7014fc5fdcca6fa96e92ea83ae59ab4f8ab5b4f2ea2fad6a2594ec","77c4c82257a289fdbda87c35fefd4d73a1d84cd837b36ff59f3498cfdbd95200"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[336,359],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p336"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForGapNCSG-InfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include intraFreq-needForNCSG and set the gap and NCSG requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>for each supported NR band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR, include an entry in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include an entry for each supported NR band in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA; or","paragraph_zero_based":370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA is configured, for each supported E-UTRA band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA, include an entry in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the NCSG requirement information for that band; otherwise, include an entry for each supported E-UTRA band in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports successful handover report for MCG LTM cell switch and if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE supports successful handover report for MCG LTM cell switch and if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the current registered SNPN identity is included in snpn-IdentityList stored in the VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has (updated) flight path information available:","paragraph_zero_based":377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE had not provided a flight path information since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if at least one waypoint or a timestamp corresponding to a waypoint location that was not previously provided since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state is available; or","paragraph_zero_based":379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if at least one upcoming waypoint or a timestamp corresponding to a waypoint location that was previously provided since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state is to be removed; or","paragraph_zero_based":380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if flightPathUpdateDistanceThr is configured and, for at least one waypoint, the 3D distance between the previously provided location and the new location is more than the distance threshold configured by flightPathUpdateDistanceThr; or","paragraph_zero_based":381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if flightPathUpdateTimeThr is configured and, for at least one waypoint, the time difference between the previously provided timestamp and the new timestamp, if available, is more than the time threshold configured by flightPathUpdateTimeThr:","paragraph_zero_based":382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["efa46ae0de7633d88d8ae6686dd27adaa5c9e4506f1b54742011c0b9aeff8bb1","e6c04758cbefa794d9e71a791684aae3bf48c126da327d2b5d32ccd94af56ef7","de3c389ff3aab26030b2c256b9253ec0169fc2e186c98205cb998736faf9a914","e96f12908f0255df8d7c9a8f7fdd204fb61d6951b5580ee94316428c8f410478","9cb4ea27108ada2e7a31d1ddc13c5c5cb96bafcfec448b28f72c42186e6605b9","e383b0b0c6c2f2e86db2e57f0c24a57506c0c33c7611fd2ad500f4ed7ee5dbb0","27f8f2ce7bfe0443248030e2c08c89357f8b5f7e9c9c69ec38ea2e93bd758b64","4588269b3ec63e36f655d2a1d673184fc6fc16577e004ae40d70a65d43dce53b","3c56ad7c6f2e6805e0323da5e1aad9faacd373b49d24f5ba8ec099c0470df484","1e49a5250a227c0528ef3f78ed81ca3490627688d54f4b3d17303244599dbc5c","bd30049f06282a1e8e1e1c459ac29ac3e0c14eb2346c7616e8ac1812cd5718ce","1b4b8f06aaebb24f46bc87bd4f1c00ae1f30e3a8bacde8c638b847285620fd17","f70a97bfc7ca2d7152e3bc0beae34d380c4c23fe588c6263e3dfdd23249272c8","db20011f5f17b707641acb888d5c1bbd15a7d10973b1d7a23c5e8965d097ac3e","675980378f3f8eaf3fd7698c66f90cbaab60e41f2403753303b0ef252ad17570","af1ad55b7ec3a7dd8f4da42008d49047782e98ec31dd1f38789511c4991115f0","c88c684e27ca9f102a33dd1d2d84dae270a2c96ad073da2406406241124a73f6","80d09118a3ed1b514e45c2db68323814c0051d35b8e1288f30b199a6ffbd8b2f","4160a9b3e407e974622fc264322b020489be545506682018dc166bf0ea2145ba","37a1e7829238054af353446e9c5d01ef02c6695e59c4ac5f99cff279393d3895","b5e5b251cdf685334827f3a7a6e6bcc0c15e7190fe2338aff4a0de84944136f6","e7f9447d24cebf1b4a2f6b147dfd276fa21d8a2f6698ff266d9b70bb3bf34ea2","755c0094548172a767d442596e525bc8ade851d3e5515fc1f597ee7f9a6a99b5","974f0d68750588b921a0c43934a6d4102211182a03d6fbc0f936f34e496ef15f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[360,383],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p360"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0c:If neither flightPathUpdateDistanceThr nor flightPathUpdateTimeThr is configured, it is up to UE implementation whether to include flightPathInfoAvailable when updated flight path information is available.","paragraph_zero_based":384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has at least one stored application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured which has not been successfully transmitted since entering RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include measConfigReportAppLayerAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution procedure according to clause 5.3.5.18.6:","paragraph_zero_based":387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the appliedLTM-CandidateId the LTM-CandidateId of the applied LTM candidate configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if this RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1 but not within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if a new sk-Counter value has been selected due to the LTM cell switch execution procedure as specified in 5.3.5.18.6:","paragraph_zero_based":390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include selectedSK-Counter and set its value to the selected sk-Counter value;","paragraph_zero_based":391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured in this RRCReconfiguration message to provide location information for assisted SMTC configuration in RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include referenceLocationReport;","paragraph_zero_based":393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for at least one serving cell, the RRCReconfiguration message includes in csi-ReportConfigToAddModList at least one CSI-ReportConfig including csi-InferencePrediction, or including reportQuantity-r19 set to p-CRI-r19 or p-SSB-Index-r19 or p-CRI-RSRP-r19 or p-SSB-Index-RSRP-r19; or","paragraph_zero_based":394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes at least one entry in applicabilityConfigToAddModList within applicabilityReportConfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for at least one serving cell, the UE is configured with at least one reportConfigId associated to a CSI-ReportConfig including csi-InferencePrediction, or including reportQuantity-r19 set to p-CRI-r19 or p-SSB-Index-r19 or p-CRI-RSRP-r19 or p-SSB-Index-RSRP-r19, for which the applicability status has changed since the last transmission of a message containing applicabilityReportList (in RRCReconfigurationComplete or in UEAssistanceInformation or in RRCResumeComplete); or","paragraph_zero_based":396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with at least one entry in applicabilitySetConfigCSI-ToAddModList for which the applicability status has changed since the last transmission of a message containing applicabilityReportList (either in RRCReconfigurationComplete or in UEAssistanceInformation):","paragraph_zero_based":397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each serving cell associated with any of the configurations above, include an entry in the applicabilityReportList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the applicabilityCellId to the serving cell index of the cell;","paragraph_zero_based":399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each configured reportConfigId associated to a CSI-ReportConfig including csi-InferencePrediction, or including reportQuantity-r19 set to p-CRI-r19 or p-SSB-Index-r19 or p-CRI-RSRP-r19 or p-SSB-Index-RSRP-r19, that is included in the RRCReconfiguration message or for which the applicability status has changed since the last transmission of a message containing applicabilityReportList (in RRCReconfigurationComplete or in UEAssistanceInformation or in RRCResumeComplete):","paragraph_zero_based":400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include an entry in the applicabilityInfoReportList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the csi-ReportConfigId within applicabilityInfoReportId to the corresponding reportConfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the applicabilityStatus to the applicability status of the configuration corresponding to the applicabilityInfoReportId;","paragraph_zero_based":403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the applicabilityStatus is set to inapplicable:","paragraph_zero_based":404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the UE prefers to release the concerned CSI-ReportConfig, include releaseConfigurationPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each entry within applicabilitySetConfigCSI-ToAddModList associated with the concerned serving cell, that is included in the RRCReconfiguration message or for which the applicability status has changed since the last transmission of a message containing applicabilityReportList (either in RRCReconfigurationComplete or in UEAssistanceInformation):","paragraph_zero_based":406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include an entry in the applicabilityInfoReportList and set the content as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eb9e874c0749bd341c9a579f82bc95f15a466e9f476775d52a5db739408ffe53","bf82f01351bde22a31516c3fff655df22ec6681df4b607acf1a1abcbc84392ac","33655f7e65ff7c44307dc75cc02195b4d43812d01a9d3290b2887923c3721739","744f93988ebf338d3e22e37739be8be6bfe39a001b269012bbae6439412b71da","4d82b269635ce6109f349eb06b7f4521e0f42a62d8e70fad370c29dcdc77a584","6de520bfcc92310f63fdfcd17d21e401486c074f1a2e08c9d9b227e1c2dab138","527ef70a97f78da62f182dac82d757ac109cba74893dc0657c1a3cd76e9236e6","2783747a64fc3f941fca6d4eeee42bd2bf673282b1811c72b4f2f322639dd72c","c85ac78905d8de9aa971ee00dd6061bf93a89151a1627c5a1b777c3c01feef25","4f60ed5e9e2d131d81c8c377c18d674dbe0f7524241d00d0780491849f6b7d21","e9a1c881f92e587ee102713eefc2c988828f03a374c89f67d547e933f4aa39bf","59740d873c8ee2770edc47e27d8a5123e12a454be1ee521393e4fb10e7b865c9","4c618c27232f984f582a3b38e1bad217a6a276e7345d5ec605cba3c235507fee","7e22cea4fae93c0f9fbe1d3b2c1d942132b42dfad920ea55f2e217b966f3ea99","0988b1eb6bd814ce3ca7bca32acd9932d7a43e87f049ef3435081cf767e56144","e5524dc3306e3836570776250d565ae82609c29b39a95fe4422e3260b013bfc7","7bbf6d803b967d5adfcaea079790b3b79b1a9cb24f5d0ec72ba490e9bfa2a7a1","b9df81b90c22d0775d8bf038e0ce96b50f546c7c9789833f97489b7eaa49d15f","da779c548fe59282194f66c2cee01cf9ced4610fdd2400484c7668a29746add0","05b67ad672fea4e6b9e9c9c70f60bcfb6c5121a50684828c16bfec326caccd8a","ac38decfeaf9c434e3d783b171fb492f60c6468031faed467ad69fa3b903374f","3723e3957d31b393d69ad1e0b72a7f29ecd8f07b58cedd1baa3164202e423c16","ca7cece43fa57a6b53faa1b7879f18f03c6dd8b45dc2b2e30abf75d7fa2f3535","a1edc4fbe38a59d152410e5a47bdac1f5e275aadfd46a272f372ae35b14fc334"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[384,407],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p384"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the applicabilitySetId within applicabilityInfoReportId to the corresponding applicabilitySetConfigId;","paragraph_zero_based":408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the applicabilityStatus to the applicability status of the configuration corresponding to the applicabilityInfoReportId;","paragraph_zero_based":409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the applicabilityStatus is set to inapplicable:","paragraph_zero_based":410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the UE prefers to release the concerned configuration in ApplicabilitySetConfigCSI, include releaseConfigurationPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with E-UTRA nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig (UE in (NG)EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via E-UTRA SRB1 as specified in TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfiguration within MobilityFromNRCommand (handover from NR standalone to (NG)EN-DC);","paragraph_zero_based":414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for CPC which is configured via conditionalReconfiguration contained in nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig specified in TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.2a.","paragraph_zero_based":416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was included in E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionResumeComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.3.4a;","paragraph_zero_based":418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3/5.3.5.4/5.4.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the scg-State is not included in the E-UTRA message (RRCConnectionReconfiguration or RRCConnectionResume) containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG activation as specified in 5.3.5.13a;","paragraph_zero_based":422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the E-UTRA RRC message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration or RRCConnectionResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message or if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the Random Access procedure on the SpCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":431}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc869384f08fffc337ed0504a0884e466014d7179a827f357dc480dbb54457de","b062b857a8774bf4dbff25fa43eafb8a6f166e531a84bac4fb2c7be3bf6541b5","5469b8d4075f08eb8c2283159df27d919f7324b105834393e1b6226e975c753b","72712421ea23292906719bb26c5247c298c02eb7bc71033ec611c20c23ca7067","ed06b5e10f95269e6669c26f853de40828508dd6814fa04bad18aea1ee7979c7","68dee69903b1caaa06a68b3b3ab0649180713eff36ab165d4a49598685b4a48f","619e289aa5f9e5ade4ab55244e4c17799c38717b245cc5322dbe321e64040331","6d2a7342cb1abbca028ed0c68367329ea88675c6f4513097ef47452188d3c720","1f0584a2af1f98f6fcd86ca712133c28085f1b5190564a7524247b4d907ef314","443f6e9cb236e4fa15e18c6783c844b51ec7e1ff6ae8d23fa6d9d5f6a0ec2f7f","ba8b08f171c7b1bf7bcae90455c66406afa5232067107a78ebe7b22477ac23e6","69fdf08ee61f83c352c0a3cafd70b1ec6c79e57cdaf4961b8f50d32d2eb007a9","15290db19bb5a1d88a9b1ce2fc7a17eaf7000cc2fee5bad28fe4cbe79fe2188b","ba434131fc59388ddf634232c95b8a6b2eebb94f8e1a0e5b4424ba7874028e58","7580c8e9a0c257ed58fd5ac343a44eec6ec28c6e325cca4fdc5e51347a513ce8","2014fd1f3bb317a7c49b1d7f6cf875160ef1fb9cb2fa33f61a6b0a6aa298d301","bdab60d5067083c2c1113267c706a57458dff15864aff0e34ae7db46323e747c","d00df1037fefdafde543e1e7ce0d7cecdb94c971cc662a07deeb224e049ee1be","c7acbdb5299691f6f39925fb1483f49477d5a22c92e6f6da2d097566aefec76f","ff08537ea78afe9329b664e9b2c8083a09384b3ef102ea15f373584024bf763d","fe66a366e2720dabcce0214d195b7d08ccb4c364248358cecfbd40f3332d09a9","20f3045c22989a0fd2b8a5b41fc0be865d1e05277347c9e24e1aacc604103b40","46d35ee173d59fbfb8506c3083c195d5786c7c98a1205435d082e28173f384b4","f181a774986097e13c1047daeb22b7e5b22cec67e49ed1a3d404ec4000a19c92"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[408,431],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p408"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig in RRCConnectionReconfiguration message received via SRB3 within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3/5.3.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the SpCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The order the UE sends the RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message and performs the Random Access procedure towards the SCG is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (RRCReconfiguration was received via SRB3) but not within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In (NG)EN-DC and NR-DC, in the case RRCReconfiguration is received via SRB1 or within DLInformationTransferMRDC via SRB3, the random access is triggered by RRC layer itself as there is not necessarily other UL transmission. In the case RRCReconfiguration is received via SRB3 but not within DLInformationTransferMRDC, the random access is triggered by the MAC layer due to arrival of RRCReconfigurationComplete.","paragraph_zero_based":445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1 within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup (UE in NR-DC, mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup was received in RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume via SRB1):","paragraph_zero_based":446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for CPC or subsequent CPAC which is configured via conditionalReconfiguration contained in nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup; or","paragraph_zero_based":447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to an LTM cell switch execution and is configured via an LTM-Config IE contained in nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB1 embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in clause 5.7.2a.3.","paragraph_zero_based":449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform SCG activation as specified in 5.3.5.13a;","paragraph_zero_based":451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig in nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message is not applied due to an LTM cell switch execution for which lower layer indicate to skip the Random Access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE was configured with successPSCell-Config when connected to the source PSCell (for PSCell change) or to the PCell (for PSCell addition or change):","paragraph_zero_based":455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0f93908c5a8d9d298cd46f41a502c2df425e37e8ef7983bb2eccd5ebd368ac23","86d1d7e23c30d1ed87f2c91ed5643c91bfc60fdfc9dd87ec3313d1225129e138","2a7732cfd8d0902da06e65072f8e611a71b1f9870d7ec10aced889f3ad7fa279","c66baa80444fd4b761480d1c9889a7b0f8140da771a8c675d651a53aec7cad4c","254d09a9cea3d5c8163bc30ffe6c8fc651bd1c758f5efa566deec9a70318c739","af4e763b1656d7a3ac9e9f8b7cb3a0edfc7515fb1ddb614eeda2bb75c6f1a591","201994c94e51839eb4beb0567088c8bdedda2d003d3303e720bd589f21452247","a1132eb7773ab1a350446127a421837f5580e45ed694884236a22996c1f58ee7","59a271ac06461b2a872f7f42e1c088c6ad747d23e373ab56828fde700aa9c312","7486027d15c57052b6b7a9ca2add69a9e53dc54d0d28a546f8b0a4c0d844c309","ba91e8202b35b5374fbcb815afd6b5c9aa4c1e9edfdf817965cb9c0751ca9f69","75d7d8a9c05405f76be575bb0cd7ae6e8262f4e611923697daf29915bc05f750","c7fb4bd3a2f9afc8f322252504a0dbc61e959a76f212a8afc036c66c0fc68211","6bff453c35ed2bf39bc0c60431f4253376b5d7c34eea9cd1e039a4a96102792b","fac67e7860d2c788b3cdbc21c738382e27be9e48a6498643bed160829e34a706","43cdc2bacf325a7ed3700829e1332811546b7b40e75cb07c6dd8e9b133efb512","6cb190767e0a5180ca0d4ec39d39646b9980ef7066ac8905e98d3d4a55461ce4","5f958f16a98df2e55b012f5759a3bd526f1381bd0969fe0f36063738a3628e33","9569756c007d78387b50fca4cf85baa2b9bfab9c5723d8fb17f16de0b2ee7ecd","76708f767487d150149a0dd5eb1e82491fe24cb6df0cecccc5056573de01218f","df13cd2a431629cc31ad132bf2cd2ee63bc7f5816a04a88201409af63f2598c6","f2859b2b5671c6f0880d9a4ee60bc4d7cf74426cddf71483f25897be332c78e7","3788240054ed5d707e8774a851499db83c36cafa1087879c830862cfb1dea41d","98b18cd1c7b297ccad8e6248ac53a87a45b5ad1f446f75946583c3cea82b1df3"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[432,455],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p432"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions for the successful PSCell change or addition report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.7, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the NR RRC message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else","paragraph_zero_based":463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:The order in which the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message and performs the Random Access procedure towards the SCG is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB3 (UE in NR-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup (NR SCG RRC Reconfiguration):","paragraph_zero_based":469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCReconfiguration message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig in nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the UE was configured with successPSCell-Config when connected to the source PSCell (for PSCell change) or to the PCell (for PSCell addition or change):","paragraph_zero_based":473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>perform the actions for the successful PSCell change report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.7, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e14803