{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the ul-TrafficInfoReportingConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ul-TrafficInfoReportingConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide UL traffic information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide UL traffic information and stop all instances of timer T346l, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes n3c-RelayUE-InfoReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself to be configured to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s).","paragraph_zero_based":750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes gapOccasionCancelRatioReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if gapOccasionCancelRatioReportConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide UE's preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio in accordance with Clause 5.7.4.","paragraph_zero_based":753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide UE's preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio;","paragraph_zero_based":755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T346o, if running.","paragraph_zero_based":756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes applicabilityReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if applicabilityReportConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to report applicability information of configurations subject to the applicability determination procedure in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to report applicability information of configurations subject to the applicability determination procedure in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes dataCollectionPreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if dataCollectionPreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on being configured with radio measurement resources for UE-side data collection in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on being configured with radio measurement resources for UE-side data collection;","paragraph_zero_based":766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c0260a756298c0389fce8b67e89853898650b3a554acbd92dc7329be3a44b4da","81b434b15538d40f50e46f196c336a634b2395b7417dc6e38bc177ec37418d4c","b4db70913542d1942773ccc589e127305abd642a4fec8817d1171cb9e72831b1","9448d89b8df055e5c7571eb3916ed1a39f575683ef84834600001f8780d6eede","8984dc3bafc92d7a0ffb85baaad2eff67da21a96d4b7337111824f144e51f8e1","78068caf60f27aabe8a352ab545372197babb172e8675c834bd9e2da592a172a","c649f561d81c6a46372a17890cc22793548e3279f145c0a02c221581b1a4e20d","bca260940e5f2ffd298ce53f3d0e6997bfe8de09b6340513856edaa57a027ffa","be97e2c0236925853c8180376dd990c6bfb200d436208953f8d15d6d9a5ae609","db9aa9f03a388bcc857206ae389ae036f31b2d018762b3fccedc7909b539426b","2ab4b8cd1f8f3c3cb8aaed524ba7f016fbc7bbb8113b882cddbf01185474f30b","e22336ade5aeb5780a37a265f5ba2105a71f7d9951d6ce7274964f55af469355","9d2251dd50dde69a4bdfd4bdbb8603353dae76e6c06063127a6b3d2ed790bc0d","91ac56f6e01f8875d10a1a7a822a961610706312894324430587221065e9954e","ad4d4a1df9d628b1fb31b0727743fc2e59fd578427b75f722e6cfee1fef44650","e3080fc368696cdebea2958ec8c80e30ca71d7ae3c808860918e75cbc6d966a1","f7ad5efbaeeed12119b4e14163db0199b7747fa9a999df1259865c1bd910d4ef","aab636f71e8d4aaee04cf3111d97d1a62e7036db4e0baa022d55c3980547603c","36bae047a9415dc054cce5e125b7c0cd95576b2aa232bcbeca1570d1ae3d0ed1","0480c10ba17888a740c6a8ea8cf8c713ee3d86a52bb350e50693d1b63bdf17b7","9b83acb6fe1422a2c96cb5e6ea0d8b674339d741b216d6eccbd560a7e4c85f21","e210cdbbd8c7935fdce52f6c0edec9041d50c70b424ddfc561a8924921f59c99","4d623697322eb7cc4e262973327f4b28fcbffb28d3280763c5ab9d05d8feaf2c","b56629c84e451463cc5541398f1c308e59d594ceb39fdedede4d4cf29c9b2cf2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[744,767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to report assistance information related to logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to report assistance information related to logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection.","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.8.3Reception of the RRCRelease by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>delay the following actions defined in this clause 60 ms from the moment the RRCRelease message was received or optionally when lower layers indicate that the receipt of the RRCRelease message has been successfully acknowledged, whichever is earlier;","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:When the RRCRelease message is received on a HARQ process with disabled HARQ feedback, and when STATUS reporting, as defined in TS 38.322 [4], has not been triggered for a logical channel associated with the SRB1, the lower layers can be considered to have indicated that the receipt of the RRCRelease message has been successfully acknowledged.","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T380, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T316 is running;","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports RLF-Report for fast MCG recovery procedure as specified in 38.306 [26]:","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the elapsedTimeT316 in the VarRLF-Report to the value of the elapsed time of the timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the pSCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the information included in VarRLF-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T346g, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T348, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the AS security is not activated:","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ignore any field included in RRCRelease message except waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with the release cause 'other' upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ed2100c67cab3b5ef7ab0f2106eaf88f51c1344