{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measReselectionCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measReselectionCarrierListNR in VarMeasReselectionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measReselectionValidityDuration:","paragraph_zero_based":823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measReselectionValidityDuration in VarMeasReselectionConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleValidityDuration:","paragraph_zero_based":825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleValidityDuration in VarEnhMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes suspendConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the received suspendConfig except the received nextHopChainingCount;","paragraph_zero_based":829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdt-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the DRB in the sdt-DRB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the DRB to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-SRB2-Indication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the SRB2 to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each RLC bearer (except those associated with broadcast MRBs and multicast MRBs) that is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for SRB2 (if it is resumed) and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fa48f36b7bc2e61d7e59b7240d07ed1acd92ad622c5ba40d921508b8d549b21f","34944774cd7a2ef1151d1cfad8f99710b420576c6782db515fcb057611cc4bc2","c31db64245dd85d4eb60e90fd911f925da14b2c197410597c44895e21f187cf6","2ede651ebe105f08c817acb47dbe154ebe70a8ed4a6b0eb0ac164cedc8a4a28a","c62693430ef025bf041817005cca9ccd1b6586971f3d2535ffa924f84f889548","460b121d05c39fea6060a918a51a882d44ff15b98c0d67a7202c943078c6192b","70bd8a332afdad914a30f577e7de86908e4cbf848f218eb4af20c4be8514263a","29d07fc666525379c7ad7aaa3369b4cce31d4