{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to NCR-Fwd to cease forwarding;","paragraph_zero_based":865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and is not configured with MP:","paragraph_zero_based":866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish or re-establish (e.g. via release and add) SL RLC entity for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish RLC entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the RAN visible application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any RAN visible application layer measurement reports received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the procedure in 5.5b.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message with suspendConfig was received in response to an RRCResumeRequest or an RRCResumeRequest1:","paragraph_zero_based":877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>in the stored UE Inactive AS context:","paragraph_zero_based":879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the KgNB and KRRCint keys with the current KgNB and KRRCint keys;","paragraph_zero_based":880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value of nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the cellIdentity with the cellIdentity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the suspendConfig contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the value of the sl-PhysCellId in sl-ServingCellInfo contained in the discovery message received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> else:","paragraph_zero_based":886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the C-RNTI used in the cell (see TS 38.321 [3]) the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d3ea0ec8ee6899fcd734fab327a239d1f3d2ac57b5f32c28cb920d4e8471a915","55536854048302c0c7fbe862c1f8e3dac4743b63e0842b02be17436ad7b4b8d1","33d22d1c6674836a798168de6c3219915139642f879f5905c71f51763216ebe3","32e5cef2db4a4f1a40d590d2932451bb72bff920a5e17814bbb5e085ab1ee23d","b602b0ef5902384345ec9f03b804ab8d97f78d90b919de37c048084b7aeff333","9efb73ebb165a0224531d7f3bcbecb666618f4161552fc3e92e00c4869bef3f7","0274bc96dc70c40bdf5173f0d8fc0981ae05fd01c545bf1efd0f144998f6a4e3","7151815919c1550de481ee3e65c20975e62bed62ec7017206a07082a99bab91c","0aebe30373c2a73eea90a5fcd16232546c0e748292ab00c5363e585d22096e6d","8fc3a3148082968f1d661cb6399dfcd433eebce047e13a2281945960451a1340","85723b36c134ed946cc06744437ff529dd84c50ef9fe03653c3f2e29e8efa463","ac988ae0febd9bdfaaab06c22a6e80f053b5ccb721b483c11142b39c40180fb7","0fbde8ab7a6beb14de625a185df3e1faabd0a70176aa3eeac8734fab3c45d214","f0f8a548122c40cea1c1eda0754e683abed0c6e3f84aa8dfd91cec066bd141eb","50cb83d523b989da951b164a715e6b35f6a5aa195cee92755b94f7d641e7cd3f","cbdd21a3ae2d8149e67610c47d5d5ba3ba03e0525c3167a2396a0481ce79821a","7ffebfad31d9fc51dc6b1a43dab999fa408b813cb7bb81ea4dc54977195a8b5e","0821bcb0066a8913d051ef196ee965b97c93d6dc1114c151efb52ae27f332ad1","a27e8dc79fe82b96541a8e08d699f57de1edd767414bc9e368e2805529901ae1","671a459d009888209bb19b4fdb979555f0f06d49b416fedf778bdccde4313a6a","992e9e12f6f5a60c309c3440aa7a94ae7e6c15e35153ea0c4fe0234510f1a81d","61160bac56eb9076f5e7be328243cc8bea420a2fb555c70a71d75b9b3074a184","9d4ee4981fd20d6795fc8a999161914d529a03f0330c40a59042dda2d03da688","cc47c287a0be1134f61e90596a39adfe41bb6b23146c8533432203d2152d9b41"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[864,887],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p864"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the physical cell identity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value associated with the current KgNB;","paragraph_zero_based":889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319a if running and consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store in the UE Inactive AS Context the nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message, the current KgNB and KRRCint keys, the ROHC state, the EHC context(s), the UDC state, the stored QoS flow to DRB mapping rules, the application layer measurement configuration, the C-RNTI used in the source PCell, the cellIdentity and the physical cell identity of the source PCell, the ncr-FwdConfig (if configured), the spCellConfigCommon within ReconfigurationWithSync of the NR PSCell (if configured) and all other parameters configured except for:","paragraph_zero_based":892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within ReconfigurationWithSync of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within ReconfigurationWithSync of the NR PSCell, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within MobilityControlInfoSCG of the E-UTRA PSCell, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-servingCellConfigCommonSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-aerial-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-cellDTX-DRX-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1c:suspendConfig is not stored as part of UE Inactive AS Context, except for the fields explicitly specified.","paragraph_zero_based":901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store any previously or subsequently received application layer measurement report containers for which the successful transmission of the message or at least one segment of the message has not been confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:NR sidelink communication/discovery/positioning related configurations and logged measurement configuration are not stored as UE Inactive AS Context, when UE enters RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>suspend all SRB(s) and DRB(s), except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>suspend all multicast MRB(s) associated with multicast session(s) not configured for reception in RRC_INACTIVE;","paragraph_zero_based":905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate PDCP suspend to lower layers of all DRBs and multicast MRBs associated with multicast session(s) not configured for reception in RRC_INACTIVE;","paragraph_zero_based":906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release Uu Relay RLC channel(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release PC5 Relay RLC channel(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:A L2 U2N Relay UE may re-establish the SL-RLC0, SL-RLC1 and SRAP entity after release.","paragraph_zero_based":910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SL indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["36e1cd836fdfb3afd36d31ac92d5152bf12c27a92c80b3abe16c75c8892cbb2e","6b315e4c3b8b0680afcc517fe894c4e3a2ff3c6b9d8bfde30ff801556b01ac37","e7f90c3d3abae2e054ac11ecdad583741b87fae0b0979f4cca7c1cb9e70ed7ef","08a490e7c64e48acb174681864fc4f1091bca6d0392493d8d4fa7f3d077a85e1","58baa3ba8a9ab96cf55d3fd837c65be1aa0636027104975d50214c2c182b829e","6e8835d3b8f109880a82445080b48dcd459e8ba863502c8d7996d29890980979","3a6ea3b3d9b0ea1768d702d3711d9282a775066b1b977b97c1ee3adc0c68eeb2","fb0af46934679a529021edae4ff90d0fe63959dc1d553ed69ada325d85243fd4","18c659a6ddf05d89877fd870e41e022229b4f6ebfd9b7f3071754228d5a213d4","3c48dbffe4156f423d622662814e935965ddb39d1ab8603c9e978b59ce448713","f9cbedff6d1e3ec7d37c09b9cf652e96c6d7819a9ce083f9be76691aded84e8b","9c951f6c669ceb0fd331445b5d4ae83b81bbae7894598262eef1c6140b431775","e6e030850362ab9fd751e454b6564c0839bb168c8f7b851df9eba944c0bae0a7","e83e5e528919a56c5eba6b35ec258651f69301f638579e08a644cc5be3df581b","3c5a3db3a222feb5c27bfeba47a787139cec1cce9e8f15d853d0b4124f80ce0c","37d65af6c0486c54419f1742ee9bfeb31e92daf9abd68acaab2efc4999815684","e90e408f202b53e514598b39e58306cf18e927fca49397ab59c0789aa9e3189d","8b63c5a487a08e3d95eb78f5da6c1157ff50b36f6dfd9b638ab340f3db28e4bf","8bbc9302a4e74b04dcb20bbee9f7df490761952ac9995bf891107df33342b0f7","1c91873e30850f0f02c7465e27c3595ee9ab204d87be2f779485c77b654bb9ea","60dfb3a60211f9fa7b33f5bf0c4a17892d6191b26727c710029aba62a9c9b916","7fa569b29c5c8461fe97c32e0485948ffaef39692584feb63e905a0e81503d03","7bb5fa23c6babda2053cfa143fb1e8070f2cb77ae913f1e2d361935e73d0eaa6","81398fa7dbda8fe964ced4a630d68031a8e4fbcfe2cbf643d7a553e25d1996d