{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release cell identity and relay UE ID configured in sl-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release of the SL indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if N3C indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as a N3C relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t380 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T380, with the timer value set to t380;","paragraph_zero_based":921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message is including the waitTime:","paragraph_zero_based":922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T302 with the value set to the waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>inform upper layers that access barring is applicable for all access categories except categories '0' and '2';","paragraph_zero_based":924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate the suspension of the RRC connection to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_INACTIVE, and perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_INACTIVE and perform cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the suspendConfig includes resumeIndication:","paragraph_zero_based":933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> perform the actions as if the UE received Paging message with the ue-Identity included in the PagingRecord matching the UE's stored fullI-RNTI, as specified in clause 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the multicastConfigInactive is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5e71eba19e909103a73d060378d578cc30fcdd067100f7064911f737b4867adb","60d84def41242778f2657b8d77eba5984bf99fdbf11b313d74ee74358f0cec84","76cde8d1f45066c8379d28744bd468dbe8dc227ac0ac19cdd3444ada31031273","b521a111d1b62dc26a5e30e64be05086671f63f04f3f4ee7a1e53a2613511d5a","431f4e06ae82c1f82079845962b615d70f2a2d4737524eb2060211673fd8cd66","ca5b4d230daf6bc59944ad47226c5132df3da1154fbb4f8bc042013098e0b094","d3b3a9ab29841e89ca41df3dd104cdcf0258d5ab6e9216397153ceb0a4005727","417ea906c821267e690cba1671a93235758d38e368c61c48feb53347af8a8190","ddd58dfb462f52378f512194f7ea43b80309541def918bcec6c1cbdfdee6c7a4","2b422390bd154a5d01d336b8b068e52805fd22df0d70a66e8be8434ffefdfa7b","3063926f0ef859f2d8736a7b450a7ea3efbccaa7ca3f2ceae9e676500742a895","e394078ed229442992f1df071e11894f3bc7d6e520f3f427ef1ebac024c6f7a0","3422b302b177e78b46bc70ed0836bd75e65439bd63ee2a169ed3650f3971b7bd","dc49bd8baec75c67ff99e2c75a3b440e87e44a4d8406b688c4428028a1568f24","7e4f90435abd754c0a35b9e7a7a72d7c9a381612bf252fa27631f80f63219a4f","93e37168e311d09d435c7654e391005487407040f24c0c038b9f5fb5f717d34b","925a8a3cf62c181cdf470288302c61b0677df61c5872396a88dfba63298aa7a4","99a61fdc281a21f904290503f876ac14ce11c4eeb2b96dbfa29bd26362088e4f","0406d24f925bf005a2d1dfd215e3944d618f7ae369ad66fa9cacd451f65d0caf","21554fcdb539a479272a0885550ae168de4e2f33eca6904decae24008b5b790f","b36f650e9fa733062a02cb495574fabc52eafba2d006afad0651a35d86532f41","535f5abad4b05916db089379205995e38797ad92b8b69e8ae8212456681c4403","124a196e6ccf73147e6401c75224b7e4c15955b1e0536a7fcaec41072f7e6e19","b92881180bb216933d582546e43beff49bea141739c98697f671b8bcb0c2302f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[912,935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the multicast PTM configuration is provided for at least one multicast session for which the UE is not indicated to stop monitoring the G-RNTI and the UE selects the same cell as the one on which the multicast session was configured in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the multicast PTM configuration as specified in 5.10.3;","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if multicast MCCH is present:","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>monitor the Multicast MCCH-RNTI as specified in 5.10.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release any CSI logged measurement configuration, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the logged measurement entries included in VarCSI-LogMeasReport, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with the release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Whether to release the PC5 unicast link is left to L2 U2N Remote UE's implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is left to UE implementation whether to stop T430, if running, when going to RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.10.3Detection of radio link failure","paragraph_zero_based":948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured and T304 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon T310 expiry in source SpCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon random access problem indication from source MCG MAC; or","paragraph_zero_based":952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon indication from source MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached; or","paragraph_zero_based":953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon consistent uplink LBT failure indication from source MCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider radio link failure to be detected for the source MCG i.e. source RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend the transmission and reception of all DRBs and multicast MRBs in the source MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC for the source MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the source connection.","paragraph_zero_based":958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["37f01c633fc631eac1e18543e41840a746c122d139f0b42eece6b3e21fdc2d56","f3e35589f0a0d7c7afd02ca922c4d9e8f3fcbd8af0a500095f1c28c98ed96ad8","65927230d878e044b252c89d442629ea84705e64b6383faecc7469af95667801","a728144a4f5b996233d970901cc2f6f2195bd37ee35f4cf4af02656e4be3f475","2e7aed7e8cc22795466d8dc980d051074380fc37e5daf58a970cc79498928fba","12ff795c699a920cb0e96386cd9b7807a6f633d8fc81a71e325a49653fd45407","5f5a8d7b7cab60899eb4ade19f029f532cb3b9d4f7f983d2694112c7aaedf2de","ff362ba0ab0851e563ab13d752846f137950d04339dda7d44e006cc997b555e5","de342cfaaf6ab8bab2192c34fea59525f94e340eae8f742c1b43912618cd0e39","76f3dcf0bf24b85bb8a1c593e7698dced99075097e63a7e6a2257fe32a62391f","fff8c1041edd62b43423267b484cf6bb51f7d1c125cfd7559db63a8a18f37e34","c9c03c6b3384deae32ffa90f37105d21e2fe90d77c97c31efff3df1d0b27cf03","82453a1b08f6ffa4006447f5864e6a51d7c9c1bc38c8c88cbc7392c8c8aeb782","e43019dc20ba1030c530cb7a5c037db430a829c140ff7fbf753f2a47308bbf84","fcaa6bfcafce6cd505c24bda2617594d10fc388bb47f17401bcf797f2bc05591","c6fee4d2c57358aa85c9ea5969369db0ec9bdb886879365ecd5ba6259d251e56","d7435db000b7bbc66be86fbd123a44946838d496611bc338c594c38f32ff5153","1f27b7ba3ac49f85e59b84126d9d019eebe825ba0b4174ec1206134d5fff1946","3b6b9a1b933ac930f8e09b71439a3f38df1ae8fe52de284320c586f1b453dc1b","14483ad26615a56ecf8aaf1d78c88b000e3d188bc0a5cbd13da6103562eeea3b","aa90160de1066606db808dbb07d1b3228dd9029bf1986fcb47e77fcf08b6d7d7","665ac0e5ae8471016c5f70149c53561d56e774437f2538c72fec6a50902e7268","6e0aec0760bec96cd20890a611020aa621826fb821709a78257de91ebfc56b7a","6503a85fb484a6ad8ee0c3cda75c998dc905de9035249e1ca837e1ae6017b82f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[936,959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>during a DAPS handover: the following only applies for the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon T310 expiry in PCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon T312 expiry in PCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon random access problem indication from MCG MAC while neither T300, T301, T304, T311 nor T319 are running and SDT procedure is not ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon indication from MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached while SDT procedure is not ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if connected as an IAB-node, upon BH RLF indication received on BAP entity from the MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon consistent uplink LBT failure indication from MCG MAC while T304 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the indication is from MCG RLC and CA duplication is configured and activated for MCG, and for the corresponding logical channel allowedServingCells only includes SCell(s):","paragraph_zero_based":967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.5 to report RLC failure.","paragraph_zero_based":968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider radio link failure to be detected for the MCG, i.e. MCG RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard any segments of segmented RRC messages stored according to 5.7.6.3;","paragraph_zero_based":971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release any CSI logged measurement configuration, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard the logged measurement entries included in VarCSI-LogMeasReport, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if AS security has not been activated:","paragraph_zero_based":976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'other';-","paragraph_zero_based":977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if AS security has been activated but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB and NCR, SRB2, have not been setup:","paragraph_zero_based":978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>store the radio link failure information in the VarRLF-Report as described in clause 5.3.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'RRC connection failure';","paragraph_zero_based":980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>store the radio link failure information in the VarRLF-Report as described in clause 5.3.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if MP is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fe62625748e874fcc4fe12cf6387829b816dd78cd10232b2f3461df22890978f","cd2006caf5d81aa30e754d84df27532c2652513931fceb8103bed005a0cacfb1","de4c0ac2b45310a83421a04be2eb80b78266275133458aa00da4ba5fd1c16682","bb488cc099467876a421dade4e995abb8096ff0ca8c6adbdee1945915fb30442","b3f90f40f612c87c76ff1fa82d6375908458bf94721b36c8a9ba09415754bd42","03e075fff9df1810714730c25aaf9ac0ee80c22124f2205ce5b51dc0e8b8bee9","335bbeeedd713c24a7c4af29c2aa81d51810f422678e7c5d55b8f62a47933531","a36723d2e29ed0765753a109ef686484bf1214c6c91a950c2b1b0eb1a44ff6a2","f403828ef49936ac0ffd6830373dacb94338fbfd298854b13d0d163ee2f23cf3","79b9eeead45569c32b06c1cc0bf9a58fdf626b24f4e567e388b69dc8a33ae5ab","5d64fa8a08dcc243938db6e76d300dfafbd46131f4c7e820fb2df2d35a823d9e","6bf46b62a00e79d82e7a6ba26918892143fd7b806cb5a21469b55576dbea5ab0","c651fc6af88526e82f323d6946b675cb228f24cf3d5b2a2bddcb8fb2c2e08c0a","88ed5fa75ccd22b081f28a1088d5fa49c3e85bd9fcdbdf2463f2e61a890e5463","22d9b84271d5b09ebfe975731bd5203005d3ee0168a53fbba144f99eeefc9b1a","ab8fff6f524ee675bd8c150129492fc3e591cc6837b43bc176e8cedc7d33b0bb","fc3af253da050ef8c727f42b99365d3cbc632dcd29350784805a56ecfb9e5bb2","fda34d50fa2f10dd1d71bf93bde2a148e4eedcbdb3ce89f212d675102d0b15ca","d49d13ee6bc7e764c9d41cf15d2ed083152fe0ff4a58cec5935737dd20eca3cf","4c1d714a35923608ee9bd5e11bf8eab9fbee9f6300229c6c962a6b40f3d4f2c2","277d6a65afeec24bdb5f4fe9179db3980dbcc54d35127adabb605eabb0ac9b42","1716227b6647c089db852a6274cb18b61d29b513113d3d6ff43f08291c9092c1","58546a89f2994f6b4a03bb4479edf64f0546f41f692acbc1f23641818c671813","751362e28c78df12dd93da31ceff84fad439d54cbad985ee1af6a17626f29a35"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[960,983],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p960"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if T316 is configured, and MP indirect path transmission is not suspended; and","paragraph_zero_based":984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if neither MP indirect path change nor MP indirect path addition is ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>initiate the MCG failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.3b to report MCG radio link failure.","paragraph_zero_based":986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the UE supports RLF-Report for fast MCG recovery procedure and if T316 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the SCG is deactivated at the moment of detecting RLF in the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the mcg-RecoveryFailureCause in the VarRLF-Report to scg-Deactivated;","paragraph_zero_based":992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the pSCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>else if SCG transmission is suspended at the moment of detecting RLF in the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the pSCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the scg-FailureCause value in the VarRLF-Report according to 5.7.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the elapsedTimeSCG-Failure in the VarRLF-Report to the time elapsed between SCG failure and the MCG failure;","paragraph_zero_based":997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if T316 is configured; and","paragraph_zero_based":998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if SCG transmission is not suspended; and","paragraph_zero_based":999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the SCG is not deactivated; and","paragraph_zero_based":1000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if neither PSCell change nor PSCell addition is ongoing (i.e. timer T304 for the NR PSCell is not running in case of NR-DC or timer T307 of the E-UTRA PSCell is not running as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10.10, in NE-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":1001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>initiate the MCG failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.3b to report MCG radio link failure.","paragraph_zero_based":1002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":1004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A L2/L3 U2N Relay UE in case of single hop or the L2 Last U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure:","paragraph_zero_based":1006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>either indicate to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release with its child UE(s)) or send NotificationMessageSidelink to the connected L2/L3 U2N Remote UE(s) or to the child UE(s)) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":1007}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["809fb37fd025745a3df0dc26740df100c6fbc4e2bb26e9310487f12953a50cd3","a54e297a5f2c1ba8ad95ff99673164e60118c53e6530afd734aa6f053380079a","21033e2f9027cfeba6bf4d3bf3c54442fc43c8ecc2528436f415af147522a5d7","8ca80b987626686e9b3312257d01c92de072173e96d0acd33c1d018d29f35896","0a23b367766dbe87024f19f7b5cac7788b1c2dae752a6e16236465f47e2b8550","713755b4fd01e0cecb86fe37dfd5154c1e53aa53c6186cbc31586ab80233843b","b6b2237e2b46c9b310d64bc2e86aa26455158986c9ce4f3450543d21a6d263b0","7422fc227f70b491511d8ced6ea7cc31374bed7f1194f12be1404114367c6a1b","412f628b7cde447b679db720429dc9df17039bcf058264373b653ab6979c8d26","ac342eaa8a83c425083e9fa66d11d6780205e1928329436d29f8345f1997d450","bbc913dbb33a5c45b3f9156cfd80f89da3cdbdf9dcd476115650fbd6333ecbbb","1194f4858c48aa3b98778ccd32e4ca81903c166a8b55f39bbf1b2909a8608876","6c553ee2c85e08ff695d03c77c33fb2a07f30cf4cad7880198028f0a046aab44","11e2b84e2f83d0d29eb48e4a71861924a4e9b9a66296871fb0d1e9c5577c87a7","44d221999604369a8a85aa8f31c47c777fd780e73fd1726b9d9b3347defe364d","15ce0f85948783669fddde841a12d4f00f76fb158e6d925dc06e529b14125a32","be38efc8ef62b0a4ba126bed59bc4babf650c0f99e2eec01eddc8b0ac50c1f1a","2fae819bdcb46155592bbe1013948833f2287f3e3762cb7ea04edcdb6cb29d9e","a8e5ef355560f6aca542dbfed5ed5806c810b3df14558e17adad68acd55cdda2","72c7502d778b0cece3aa641d9a4a55dfa2e55ac54ea4aa490eab0bcacd8d0f7c","c9b2eb8912f121c5cba7785190faaa214d18fb33d040bae5f540bfb6a81b92a4","8ead5e743b25ead6ea49d8ba19c701b2c4beffd768be7836be3865437fa16fe4","54fb86fdaa4025e2db927d8b8bef932ff1717eb0040dd083b35cc03c30b6e16c","98b2148a4f365e2035d6838452ab3f00d3ef6b95cfd5394989bc8050a437c11a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[984,1007],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p984"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A N3C Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure:","paragraph_zero_based":1009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicates to the associated N3C remote UE via the Non-3GPP Connection.","paragraph_zero_based":1010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:How the N3C Relay UE indicates Uu RLF on the Non-3GPP Connection is left to implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T310 expiry in PSCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":1013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T312 expiry in PSCell; or","paragraph_zero_based":1014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon random access problem indication from SCG MAC; or","paragraph_zero_based":1015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon indication from SCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached; or","paragraph_zero_based":1016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if connected as an IAB-node, upon BH RLF indication received on BAP entity from the SCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":1017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon consistent uplink LBT failure indication from SCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":1018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the indication is from SCG RLC and CA duplication is configured and activated for SCG, and for the corresponding logical channel allowedServingCells only includes SCell(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.5 to report RLC failure.","paragraph_zero_based":1020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider radio link failure to be detected for the SCG, i.e. SCG RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":1022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the SCG is deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":1023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop radio link monitoring on the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layers to stop beam failure detection on the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":1026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the SCG failure information procedure as specified in 5.7.3 to report SCG radio link failure.","paragraph_zero_based":1027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":1029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE supports RLF-Report for fast MCG recovery procedure and if the UE detected SCG failure while the timer T316 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":1030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the pSCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1031}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5daa45f3277bd322b0aca525e365c61a629be9367ce84028a6a639953ea49b24","2bdf794c5f2d1b80d68d8adf78d640942c32c962344e999b5e3e8a59bbcc39f1","4ae0615626ec96fedcf69b4c0c22cbd95bcdb683ff34151df33240c25aa35781","3761283ba038c5070fb879eeceeda7e984e18d2e57cc5f0bc22f9f2419d3e549","8365d38a2def5f04b30e9ec3ec4e7b881a17d7cb1cefe81021c18afe6f807df3","92e8e7e82d099527f498e2f209940c86863f30953d21ee8c0596f7fc999be1d5","4ded90bdf2703a305cee5adeb7ffd11275124fdaba6f69bb3a1ec22e9424af0a","d06c2122701f047632d0a6951aa0624c60b678b3e79eb4d1104d322f9993ac11","cc3695721b393b2e848e766e3603c41491133da134c4e374f2d93893b88490b0","72fff1f76663695b617e35e7c852b56a488d7436738146257ffa20b9890387af","ebac21fc9c6a7c07630373d5e8a85a69c9d64beea070516cb1613edcc3ca5afc","e0249499ac8a4646d0fef0f11a7ff5a17fc4af7ad3b22870f07d524d4f01f37b","c437dfd67ec76048d7dc6697710513314cc3f37c6efd877921508776ca957e93","f95945e338ce45796f93b892493f368643181d04ef97d439239f4a3bf51c1342","f03f73bc98374dc30da445a8b03918b583800d03ac6fd05bcb217049608aa9ac","8dbad66231f773a15ebefa4ebdf76f23d92b568ca1ae8d6d3e2c06bad38f9384","e2e27c91a34d6cf3315d1d15967d148dfcf1c7bd569e9c1ea365ffc8b3a4ee4c","06187d9e63ccb649ea2c4b10bb3851989cd2db001a0e3e1c9be845e46d790402","04b69c67a71d3bccbc76f0815ae5be2a51b8c13c228a7f037b6a33900b348f8a","9550e56d8d74c8564137e01c051c9de260b60710a872515f101fd9b8b805569b","2963a397284598f7e2996d942c48ccb46439767ddb5077ab81546b50168a6270","ed42d9bccd383f29fe3ee96affb0d97ec3d0fc40531156fba83499de680322dc","3cf9b7fb08806c17fecafa080b4c20fd632242d4da3c400cd8000395548778c9","248e629838d2c026a3a08e62a3a064d9c01a67063c7fdbf378d554fd52942259"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1008,1031],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1008"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the scg-FailureCause in the VarRLF-Report value according to 5.7.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the elapsedTimeSCG-Failure in the VarRLF-Report to the time elapsed between MCG failure and the SCG failure;","paragraph_zero_based":1033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include scg-FailedAfterMCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else (the UE is in (NG)EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":1036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.11UE actions upon going to RRC_IDLE","paragraph_zero_based":1039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":1041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is NCR-MT:","paragraph_zero_based":1042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to NCR-Fwd to cease forwarding;","paragraph_zero_based":1043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the variable pendingRNA-Update to false, if that is set to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if going to RRC_IDLE was triggered by reception of the RRCRelease message including a waitTime:","paragraph_zero_based":1045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T302;","paragraph_zero_based":1047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T302 with the value set to the waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":1048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>inform upper layers that access barring is applicable for all access categories except categories '0' and '2'.","paragraph_zero_based":1049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T302;","paragraph_zero_based":1052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":1055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e620ecb88b5a2188ac5b98e6ed0b9019e7efb6a63c0bdab7161248eaf3d714b4","f6964f33814a4bad29be6c1bfaef5408eb52f92a8418c94bc48e1fe0834a7e3f","60f88f9b64184c8ea8fe998ac94d85907f25aea08ec01bc2292c9a28d2345f5c","31f9a4ea1245c64e879454eb3332bcb75c17bd8c8b5780a149c25043bf52aaef","795d9bfa5aae13291a88894d6bcb2cbd1232e38b70332357df2ea12e642a2839","118e93310669bb11ac2578de91866534a9310fbf24047577940cc9262ca55c49","417452d557d2a3206a6391ce058081731786e97586f7f91f10718191e515ec7f","47470858e45f1d578fc603eac7cfe978dc700bff93b2c9431502252c6a3c74c9","f90a96fc441d9b8ae57a4ce6773f2f1f53e59662bc7a65f27bb6e1a3caf7a440","c5c4ae8fbf5d9da7e7512cdeba67bf16e53e4718d3a8c8d3d48c3f1fd8327b1e","f372de970e38802f2ab9f15347e1ab23b0880be083ccc0dd017ddadd2ebf0ad0","ec26a5f79862a73ec8507d707d594ba0bb987395f9ad7f1d2fa0a8680791652a","f865709fccf2b1d611f7319040cbf6aa19a0502a8eb55d15446de329f86d6a23","4389c8273ffdc4f4de865bfc7e7a6ab61a5a7b727bd57bdd410d36b47f133bf6","4aa428c63e7ebe2e09c22ff61b58f7ed1c894498d6fca8d25e4d3a08f1aabdf4","cc1dbc71cbfd0d58367a8605f46f96562941ec7388c6a99b4de5d5a1a8548445","b9c86ae383087462d95ab221a068041e077caff23580f781ab9955962d587bb9","3e6bf00605ebd27a87aa7c5d7fc3f204571053ac04cbfa5dfa6f62d8e622610d","4f9d1f5f6d99e812a93059eb6fc3c27255521d5e8c6518a6f72093e9cf37ec95","0c257c806471a87e2141c75007090b0c143ea41595b4f2d962f69320ea4d71da","a8c43cd2c9e98faf0b099772adc3d6a332d442480d7adfde5b46591a205c6552","1158301ca6983401c2403a84d7938a04e9f4751fd016c71f21ccf34526dbf12d","b61bdb57d83deeb976a1d7f759fd183863e41d3a63925381f752883281219a18","006b5f33ea500b36bef2b68e7770d334400c62ec4619f9ce01c756d58d757a43"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1032,1055],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1032"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is leaving RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":1057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if going to RRC_IDLE was not triggered by reception of the RRCRelease message:","paragraph_zero_based":1058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if stored, discard the cell reselection priority information provided by the cellReselectionPriorities;","paragraph_zero_based":1059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SDT procedure is ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":1061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T319a, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":1063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop all timers that are running except T302, T320, T325, T330, T331, T400 and T430;","paragraph_zero_based":1064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard the UE Inactive AS context, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the suspendConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the aerial-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform LTM configuration release procedure for the MCG and SCG as specified in clause 5.3.5.18.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>remove the servingSecurityCellSetId within the VarServingSecurityCellSetID, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each measId, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":1072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard the KgNB key, the S-KgNB key, the S-KeNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SL indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release cell identity and relay UE ID configured in sl-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":1079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b6af214df2abce6d0b9713d8b0ff035efcd90f3e3b2df95820edb346281b4e48","3aeaff1d7fd9911c0439cbd7bdc799db90c80a8298e04c341ad402ca133b48e7","f718cea8143b653ec95a35915af891a9294b08c41a953a42cded49206d7baced","d6c4b0059bd27203773d289ce3d4136b1cd1d2b113a7d3f7359519888c936e07","6a7c3ee360ae23babc7cf1a95b680004d2877c4e689ca7c2d8e076edb643c907","7a192bae1d8a244cdc5ed4216e84cfacbbcdc039dd967044df855c9f3e088783","75a5b217e96d9acfc42111f43f96101508b2c95dfc3094aefb0d30b8e05ad3cd","c38b2d792592a038c7f6b4af1e9b3b75c76c95ec89ba2c05a93248fbdc0aa36b","0b30f567e0f441f875627f884c6339a5d4da1ca9929e48cc8ade221ff3f029e7","ab1be2e0fad2aaf03e2c126147a5fd34e08271cba2bce5ffa485746aa216a71d","5325ceb60f83098dc44b1c335cbbed4afe24df13a53eb848809822ac2407bc07","d7e5029c634047138561421a28271dcf1c5255e0dbade6cda242d1744e3cffdc","66d1576e2c9488b39055188154fb695d29c905065e0e5690403be15818e233aa","2a7c67160a980069b4cabd1ca280ac28b6c1d8049119e963b8bf495003a14afb","e1188c4dd6a5dd1b9a58c1ac7bf8611177af76c31f1ae31578b238e2cb11a562","fe0317ea482e1ff3554341b1a80c59fe3c28f51b0df309bbbc91d55139d4bf75","4bf9a562581a73a3d174b278f5d92d23cb4af3a0e29c2ac3a0b21ff0169b6a40","9781fa964608f057bd67ec0d2604a48d6735f88e646e88289d1c39080cfe89aa","43b44ec0e114b16130191fc6c90c4844104afba5dd910102b2f9138c72ae0e17","0fccfecdd99470e010326e7403d7a680e67478c11d8bb20e39f4de2bd20a9f9f","fdb05c28f95b1bdf17a9f92dc238c89a6eb0905029cf04780ec4b4c751d38e36","798ed97456c7e94bf83c3eab7dca96fd1e1f04c89e83da0c7d8c9b0bb279ecb1","8b23dfd5a148f63c63919498a8ed1dd5a6150385ce1c138e39362ee8d878f07c","9e0e0524ca87920e8129c7d202d0df0ecc820b288e2702b5f57b4e4d242a5085"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1056,1079],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1056"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release of the SL indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":1080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if N3C indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release n3c-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":1082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":1083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as a N3C relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":1084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":1085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":1086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release all radio resources, including release of the RLC entity, the BAP entity, the MAC configuration and the associated PDCP entity and SDAP for all established RBs (except for broadcast MRBs), BH RLC channels, Uu Relay RLC channels, PC5 Relay RLC channels and SRAP entity;","paragraph_zero_based":1087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:A L2 U2N Relay UE may re-establish the SL-RLC0, SL-RLC1 and SRAP entity after release.","paragraph_zero_based":1088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate the release of the RRC connection to upper layers together with the release cause;","paragraph_zero_based":1089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each application layer measurement configuration without appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the RAN visible application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard any RAN visible application layer measurement reports received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate the procedure in 5.5b.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard any segments of segmented RRC messages stored according to 5.7.6.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>except if going to RRC_IDLE was triggered by inter-RAT cell reselection while the UE is in RRC_INACTIVE or RRC_IDLE or when selecting an inter-RAT cell while T311 was running or when selecting an E-UTRA cell for EPS fallback for IMS voice as specified in 5.4.3.5:","paragraph_zero_based":1100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":1101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_IDLE, and perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":1102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9b259e4421e4c037735251d7194adcdcfc94fa566998ef061075cea693a63370","ac1ac364e809ca4ddfacf0945bc2a904a820187a8d7ab5ec107fe30bd03b4ba8","bdc2d03fb002ece69a40e2ad7d121cc7312994220fd5da0d645020303ea6d320","0d6025a024ea25583df0eeaa353706452206ffdc1f02f91c1402db842ecba77b","5f76a7da3fab1131d90d45b36306522eeff912db20aa4ca1304bfe788c34a013","f4932b801315d7df16c1b5fd618e6091684b5349c4d334c49472f81eba05cf6d","35dee6142f3519618c50729822110fb1ba9e4719799960f78b6350c6bd3bc03b","8b2ba02fe264e0bb4c597dd0eeced7ece12b7c668f493b10242403ab61080d7d","820be81f7c63df5827cb77105ebc825f5fe1ca9d4568dbd67e0f36197861386f","d7cfa631eac484d84215b71424ffe85d6c424e1ecf268eeb53d0e31687d5c276","7d3ec339906602aa56e516d91ee0e815601d7ffef9aea79b3c719974b7885c55","cf2e119364b86ff34b2bf3d75c995746efb2c756f77e3f15a2060798dba24ed7","067476f86c0b016a58e027275b94f57608798831a2860c33301a89597ecf039a","426b71d51e9bfdf0b4af79f42b881a93cafabd5aa5b1c659f4c67843d0df6996","76dc3c3684d7ddb6f4334c73536e20986f485fad13b59118d2e4952e33c9f9df","133ed90944848b4bdbc603ff16a14f7de135f472100028338b4ca2d3fe3e89cf","7b42071f51dbf4ad89ad627a9b58fceb45e9a7a73fe557806d308b6fbf4ccfc3","119627f65442ad1918c309bb0a807f2b2db0b9171c64e6a8a308edb481976ad8","af9142bc282a1522cd66fb5748956714fe93220472f9cc3b1330895bbb0144fb","62dbdf307db1ea947f3c3055e816c8140921f0da93b3a6577ede05d000b17f35","f7edeb63ea9c5e206b6ff57b746015b7169488aa96f834f6617d963cd19435a4","e133cbd89c5f742fb50d5037e49ed5e8b70209f73c030796ff8eee6f07aac2f0","461c2241d7366592398ad9252a9ca36968de339b042f3d702fc03b6df7744ec1","60f9a7e5c57351997c2d15d4946411a4d18d93959dd35cd4543fd53d6fbf544f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1080,1103],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1080"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_IDLE and perform cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":1104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard the logged measurement entries included in VarCSI-LogMeasReport, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Whether to release the PC5 unicast link is left to L2 U2N Remote UE's implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:It is left to UE implementation whether to stop T430, if running, when going to RRC_IDLE.","paragraph_zero_based":1109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.4Reception of the RRCResume by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":1111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T319, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T319a, if running and consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":1114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T380, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":1117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the fullConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the full configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":1120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume does not include the restoreMCG-SCells:","paragraph_zero_based":1122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MCG SCell(s) from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":1123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume does not include the restoreSCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MR-DC related configurations (i.e., as specified in 5.3.5.10) from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":1125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>restore the masterCellGroup, mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup, if stored, and pdcp-Config from the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":1126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to consider the restored MCG and SCG SCell(s) (if any) to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":1127}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f7cfabb0dd4d5337e69ba9086e67243c405dc8761d200245a2e284a6425a4c30","290a0ef51715ab5818567abfac1edda17d761445bddf130fca257d47777ed5a8","e6c23f7043fbecc0883fb176b29957c864e49933c11de6ca3b5cab69eb3bc205","bcb1181a8af32a65fe97e0d1a92b599e6d5c8592ab7b44a6d8b3b1db9e42f9cc","796b48152a20d94974e7617c799d2b9e25eb7c1c7418bbae02afb97fcf4f576d","08d2be35d56d348653a8f37ad938005bfc81a6c65a8f5a5d7742a3e6fef8cacc","cb3ffb09aab43cca6b6c5ef48c242eb1a2b7c87eb1ffa05149db4e36654419b3","4fb6e9194ee19457fe07f454039588b19e62b71d179781c7f61397a81a1d6fa2","5ec878ba5b9c7b6608630d76663e9f6f7e96c58874fb3b5c97243f105fc6fa6a","512c75d3ab4ca13a4101e5bf237a799844674237278895ddcdd00a6249fa2b13","be3fba2baa55ab3bcab4c12b1caa192b1752f9c3478e7e0ef7bb79b4296ad19b","007251fec63c6c2a8a2b885787dd1b50886b558b5991cb877c9e9a5a881b86d5","66c6a66fce472878e7a27e135ad0251a2e5898f1e6ebc956c621305b68ffa963","b3c4de0a1e350ddfcd217a3366553559a6081a2a2902ff257c07b319ca80ef81","8476ae5f27c4a26ffb670e63d236c8ee3005f569cd5758ae6d2896c4fb5eb7a9","31df69c0c228b8ce90d954cf1b49272d11ea8f91a66a006216772275d1954196","36eb0f176eac05307ed158ea82fc94edbdc7fb5aace98f8b0f8b5b04145f5933","a763ba085ec5e733df73c09de1bd488ba8a2d9af9dc96adb777e581e6cd6ece7","0ea1d14b22e667bc2a42437c35b28acf266ca265954a5aa555e5c5b2006a6041","dc6e9069651edb7cb51f7a02222e1c5d1b61e33e711f266afa5e3f6e34fdb8b0","945114d33ae70e4278fcd1cf989ec6b1c577bb9e14c39e5bbe5a28f703ddecb3","b94930479ceec7b540c62d45dc3dcc8826c3dcfa9510ba83be10a3d985293ae5","1b88e554e46098ab7d253cd693e8e79c49758c5a2b3230de222cc48e460a0ebf","45813c47f409aca4fcbb52c8edfaeacf5f0152f53cc63ba89d30c00d42d08781"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1104,1127],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1104"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":1128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the used nextHopChainingCount value associated to the current KgNB;","paragraph_zero_based":1129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured to receive MBS multicast in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":1130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":1131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":1133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to start the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the PTAG indicated by tag-Id, if it is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":1134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":1136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaNonPreConfig is configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList is configured and if the cell is not listed in srs-PosConfigValidityArea:","paragraph_zero_based":1138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop inactivePosSRS-ValidityAreaTAT, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":1139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the suspendConfig except the ran-NotificationAreaInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":1140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":1141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the received masterCellGroup according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":1143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the RRC reconfiguration according to 5.3.5.3 for the RRCReconfiguration message included in nr-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the RRC connection reconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3 for the RRCConnectionReconfiguration message included in eutra-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the radioBearerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":1149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sk-Counter:","paragraph_zero_based":1150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1151}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0402a0756024502db8a3f53ec42969e4616d3e4cf3f9fb955ee4dad04d595ab8","53348024ba89e1ce972003cb18e6d166a18ab1c80f5aa44ad99e2091beb584be","8730b52fc15e5d06898a5a014b8fee943fc7fec0e8d88bcb5fe99d425871961c","3b357243