{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the radioBearerConfig2:","paragraph_zero_based":1152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":1153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":1164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each application layer measurement configuration with appLayerIdleInactiveConfig configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RPLMN is not included in plmn-IdentityList in VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the measConfigAppLayerId and inform upper layers about the release of the application layer measurement configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":1171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the application layer measurement configuration including its fields in the UE variables VarAppLayerIdleConfig and VarAppLayerPLMN-ListConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard any application layer measurement reports which were not yet fully submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to send application layer measurement reports for the measConfigAppLayerId;","paragraph_zero_based":1174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1175}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha2