34 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p1176"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T302;","paragraph_zero_based":1201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>enter RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":1203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate to upper layers that the suspended RRC connection has been resumed;","paragraph_zero_based":1204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the cell re-selection procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":1205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop relay reselection procedure if any for L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":1206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the current cell to be the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the of RRCResumeComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the upper layer provides NAS PDU, set the dedicatedNAS-Message to include the information received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provides a PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":1210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":1211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the selectedPLMN-Identity from the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the selectedPLMN-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers from the plmn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":1215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":1216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":1217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":1220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":1221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has idle/inactive measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell available in VarMeasIdleReport:","paragraph_zero_based":1222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the idleModeMeasurementReq is included in the RRCResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":1223}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3846360d74d4a9c0f2a9b050d32323c9924eb2aea8bbcfd169614b2621300d56","3f26f31a88e2159922ca3be1ec275fcf828fdab1a9b5f94a95388c6c287c9db6","5514ead8453f4ca10c93d1b86169a13ba125