{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR1:","paragraph_zero_based":1752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-1:","paragraph_zero_based":1756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR2-1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR2-1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 and reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide maxMIMO LayerPreferenceFR2 2 of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group for FR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":1764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2 2:","paragraph_zero_based":1765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2 2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR2-2 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR2-2 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide minSchedulingOffsetPreference of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include minSchedulingOffsetPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 (TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.1) for cross-slot scheduling with 15 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-15kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1775}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["01607df4009357b26583f175b9f008075feaab47b983438f7394b2cc17580430","826cd1593db2add68d6a2eb20f6c146e9833fdbb8aa021a46f83f04e7624b3a5","b18728226fcd7ea6161a29ab96bf99072be7a20fb1778355ec8a1d18d1343133","4e1989804e55c323d0faf99c91b97c2c2d72487f56387bdee0312cfc4744289a","de93a34a376b1c4fffe721c084d14bbecc99ed60e16a99e8fca436a68445559f","538926aaf6d80e913f492ee834cdf59626b8f504bf7077ea57a291bc0baac985","bfc08687e3527568b3f48e253385a0c047accb62a0aa76ef2d8f06a7787101a2","97d5e028854f1cdfdfbddb0a920cad9648873ae07ff8bab1e94d294426cf16cf","078c112516423d656879d2211f5709e29761a42afa54971a79c103bcf2a72eca","fe53a78c5225ed48c3bcdc21e94d70c98a29d34d5d035915987eb8cd16fd5792","22fe5c3649ddf860f282976eed9645002c4cac4981ef7e24f121446c55e774c1","9ae9a4769453a9d411e05129671d7160a7b5e0bea57a8f3064a24327a2419d55","15bbbaa68c43cfb3d56f848834be242ebbee0799701ec7453cbba4d3f9379734","f64562d5b44ef998a0f4256debf87ac6b1440b10d87149e4cc2d6795e12f20bc","853250eabee9e9c791677107f051665c17a3b0de56d59ce4b040270a4b920e41","5274c6a0820a909ab7da3311134282272b3f094c166d78406d2513768d8300ed","3fc1ea14eb1d127c57f6a9cc381f92f0e9aaeba653