{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the list of RA reports that is stored by the UE for up to maxRAReport-r16 number of random access procedures. If the UE is an eRedCap UE, this field is used to provide the list of RA reports that is stored by the UE for up to 2 number of random access procedures.","paragraph_zero_based":3792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rlf-Report","paragraph_zero_based":3793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to indicate the RLF report related contents.","paragraph_zero_based":3794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"successHO-Report","paragraph_zero_based":3795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the successful handover report if triggered based on the successful handover configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"successPSCell-Report","paragraph_zero_based":3797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to provide the successful PSCell change or addition report if triggered based on the successful PSCell change or addition report configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":3798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LogMeasReport field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":3800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteTimeStamp","paragraph_zero_based":3801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the absolute time when the logged measurement configuration logging is provided, as indicated by NR within absoluteTimeInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":3802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"anyCellSelectionDetected","paragraph_zero_based":3803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to indicate the detection of any cell selection state, as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. The UE sets this field when performing the logging of measurement results in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE and there is no suitable cell or no acceptable cell.","paragraph_zero_based":3804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"inDeviceCoexDetected","paragraph_zero_based":3805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that measurement logging is suspended due to IDC problem detection.","paragraph_zero_based":3806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measResultServingCell","paragraph_zero_based":3807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field refers to the log measurement results taken in the Serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":3808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nsag-ID","paragraph_zero_based":3809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NSAG ID with the highest priority, for the UE that was configured with slice-based cell reselection and was not able to perform a cell reselection to a cell asscoiated with the NSAG with highest priority (as specified in TS 38.304 [20]).","paragraph_zero_based":3810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"numberOfGoodSSB","paragraph_zero_based":3811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of good beams (beams that are above absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, if configured by the network) associated to the cells within the R value range (which is configured by network for cell reselection) of the highest ranked cell as part of the beam level measurements. If the UE has no SSB of a neighbour cell whose measurement quantity is above the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation or if the network has not configured the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, then the UE does not include numberOfGoodSSB for the corresponding neighbour cell. If the UE has no SSB of the serving cell whose measurement quantity is above the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation or if the network has not configured the absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, then the UE shall set the numberOfGoodSSB for the serving cell to one.","paragraph_zero_based":3812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"relativeTimeStamp","paragraph_zero_based":3813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the time of logging measurement results, measured relative to the absoluteTimeStamp. Value in seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":3814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reselectedCellId","paragraph_zero_based":3815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["083e7bf35bf5e0a566a48397f08d33642ed9aee0f120e90c3335f7e27bd60d50","bcf66f68f7b618f5e56b464845688e8903356740c64699d6b4a8cae49a0594b0","c30a3bbc2478155ee532348f09d598d801827d41e3616b550b97c09587a40dce","06763a8d17bbf4fec60e49f8bc428d4c1332587a942c68f90d52dd0ec1fbcfe9","a24fb69cb6c627da642a11b1c56ba046c514a1175adaa1cbcb45439ea7a8b872","1b072fe7ffef86f1cbcb64f951ecadb528fc2bbe2adf2ac3dab39ea3e566f28d","7c1807e5a61998334cf4251c4c4f177a3e4a844dca74f0a8c068221b44140712","21ff4f88fb04c4fe07589129a98dc8b9da8a4dd69dd8f90bef5bef8d6e8baf77","01422c8f91ce8040f3d026d19039f97c38254950af0b4c6e3e675b80c63e013b","95f0cb8c472efb9b1e42095da6f12eaf780e16381909311f48a0d276233d83b3","c5e0a5ae139333396ce008ccaa12d9f95eb7cd29da52701d0bfd90ecba83abdf","43e2beb2b712993f1290d8b8fd35d69bf48785ee5565b2d826189794dce513f2","4c33e0a58c42de1943453ae08c2d587b256444bdb5725044280c99791dcad9da","97152fa095ea4054b3882250556c94883c14a35f1ed294a840b8b100cba0f682","53c3557e5203153f068d9dfd436b197ece9253da49829b4ffb60cdedd8d2fc55","dc3a310dc690d85e63d565278b124e30a201246b7602ef8fc5eb66130dea8908","6ab7c7610b84bf263d8a5279b75aa2d87ae9b7619ae742590b2319e76fd7fff0","efa9404abc6a3947bc4533727bcc27eab0d928ed376e3dab4f236ae83c49d164","5c66763669be2b8a0e2dad664e17e50eb93b3eeccecd0207539202d745812aa4","6019a983cd67b24607baee5e68c71e0543ab3383434c1241bc33c66f618995d6","b77c