{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-MeasConfig","paragraph_zero_based":4225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-MeasConfig is used to configure CSI-RS (reference signals) belonging to the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included, channel state information reports to be transmitted on PUCCH on the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included and channel state information reports on PUSCH triggered by DCI received on the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included. See also TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2. The IE CSI-MeasConfig is also used to configure logging of channel state information for the serving cell in which CSI-MeasConfig is included, as specified in 5.5x.3.","paragraph_zero_based":4226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-MeasConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":4227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":4228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-MEASCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":4229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-MeasConfig ::=                  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":4231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-Resources)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-Resource   OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":4232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToReleaseList    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-Resources)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceId OPTIONAL, -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":4233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetToAddModList  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSets)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":4234},{"li