{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportTriggerSize, reportTriggerSizeDCI-0-2","paragraph_zero_based":4320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Size of CSI request field in DCI (bits) (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.5.1). The field reportTriggerSize applies to DCI format 0_1 and the field reportTriggerSizeDCI-0-2 applies to DCI format 0_2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.5.1).","paragraph_zero_based":4321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scellActivationRS-ConfigToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configured RS for fast SCell activation as specified in TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.2.1.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":4323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-RSRP-MeasResourceSetToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Pool of SRS-RSRP-MeasResourceSet for SRS RSRP measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":4325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-RSRP-MeasResourceToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Pool of SRS-RSRP-MeasResource for SRS RSRP measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":4327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Text Omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":4329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-ReportConfig","paragraph_zero_based":4330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-ReportConfig is used to configure a periodic or semi-persistent report sent on PUCCH on the cell in which the CSI-ReportConfig is included, or to configure a semi-persistent or aperiodic report sent on PUSCH triggered by DCI received on the cell in which the CSI-ReportConfig is included (in this case, the cell on which the report is sent is determined by the received DCI). The IE CSI-ReportConfig is also used to configure UE initiated CSI reporting. See TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.","paragraph_zero_based":4331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":4332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":4333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-REPORTCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":4334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4335},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportConfig ::=                SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":4336},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    reportConfigId                          CSI-ReportConfigId,","paragraph_zero_based":4337},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    carrier                                 ServCellIndex                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":4338},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourcesForChannelMeasurement          CSI-ResourceConfigId,","paragraph_zero_based":4339},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-IM-ResourcesForInterference         CSI-ResourceConfigId            OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":4340},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nzp-CSI-RS-ResourcesForInterference     CSI-ResourceConfigId            OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":4341},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    reportConfigType                        CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":4342},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        periodic                                SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":4343}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7163526473f8b152eb5b6daf209c15bd35760019ec6e69670cce1971b9309928","86ab8fcee96292dd78064e56594b274a0294ff6fd70711a18f9d27fcf98d55e6","afad0ca9d53e4a28484a