{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"portIndex4","paragraph_zero_based":4872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Port-Index configuration for up to rank 4. If present, the network configures port indexes for at least one of the ranks.","paragraph_zero_based":4873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"portIndex2","paragraph_zero_based":4874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Port-Index configuration for up to rank 2. If present, the network configures port indexes for at least one of the ranks.","paragraph_zero_based":4875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"portIndex1","paragraph_zero_based":4876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Port-Index configuration for rank 1.","paragraph_zero_based":4877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TDCP field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":4879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delayDSetofLengthY","paragraph_zero_based":4880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures a set of Y delay values for TDCP reporting, see reference TS 38.214 clause 5.2.1.4. The symb4 denotes 4 symbols, the slot1 denotes 1 slot, the slot2 denotes 2 slots and so on. The value slot10 is applicable only to SCS >=30kHz. The parameter Y, see reference TS38.214 clause 5.2.1.4, is given by the length of the set of D values.","paragraph_zero_based":4881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"phaseReporting","paragraph_zero_based":4882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures the UE for phase reporting for TDCP reporting see reference TS 38.214 clause 5.2.1.4","paragraph_zero_based":4883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":4885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":4886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"codebookBased","paragraph_zero_based":4887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optionally present, Need R, if codebookConfig-r19 is configured. It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":4888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Text Omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":4890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DataCollectionCandidateConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":4891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DataCollectionCandidateConfigId is used to identify a DataCollectionCandidateConfigParameters.","paragraph_zero_based":4892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DataCollectionCandidateConfigId information element","paragraph_zero_based":4893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":4894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DATACOLLECTIONCANDIDATECONFIGID-START","paragraph_zero_based":4895}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c9525f105826d195f7d430e172624eee82aefca2d327f3218835dd661aac0435","1e7de23f2dc5713ea04f881170878c24f0a94e22c97037c19db217488c5bfb5d","a84d2f9339b668703db5f4338e758acf1b641a8faf42effd16f134a1c13c6507","db8cbe22dbcfdfeea264bf8f75d4a978aebdf76c730ae6067768c73e1630f968","9061c1799b987876bcd929ce96bd5c487534922120ea611fe1a3a959e5b3393c","50085d7d53813717b7d092722181cad360a28eec5dda1b080d5f9e741d494bae","8dc9527d17cb9f709ae1218ac544c1e2a2e4d5d3fb7ac7945fa995e5c6cfbb56","d13b53e9ce78a65126306f122465b58e5792affd089a45f89feb497b2c7575c5","686084774263b4a5952bcb7a98533b27e01b9978a8038af196689afee0c7b186","89dfd2480141d65e373c9cfb860408ef5a0f45fdfb7182a289a97bf977b1f4f1","e9b37508565944fd37730bee2924c9a0b7503c47e87470b5175ba