{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon RRCSetup, only SRB1 can be present.","paragraph_zero_based":5064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO-toNR","paragraph_zero_based":5065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If mrb-ToAddModList is not included, the field is mandatory present for UEs other than NCR-MT","paragraph_zero_based":5066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-in case of inter-system handover from E-UTRA/EPC to E-UTRA/5GC or NR,","paragraph_zero_based":5067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-or when the fullConfig is included in the RRCReconfiguration message and NE-DC/NR-DC is not configured.","paragraph_zero_based":5068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of RRCSetup, the field is absent; otherwise the field is optionally present, need N.","paragraph_zero_based":5069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DAPS","paragraph_zero_based":5070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, need N, in case masterCellGroup includes ReconfigurationWithSync, SCell(s) and SCG are  not configured, multi-DCI/single-DCI based multi-TRP are not configured in any DL BWP, supplementaryUplink is not configured, ethernetHeaderCompression is not configured for the DRB, conditionalReconfiguration is not configured, and NR sidelink and V2X sidelink are not configured. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":5071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MRBSetup","paragraph_zero_based":5072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if the corresponding multicast MRB is being setup; otherwise the field is optionally present, need M.","paragraph_zero_based":5073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N3C MP","paragraph_zero_based":5074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present if the corresponding radio bearer is being setup for MP with N3C indirect path, need R. It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":5075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Text Omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":5077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RLC-BearerConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE RLC-BearerConfig is used to configure an RLC entity, a corresponding logical channel in MAC and the linking to a PDCP entity (served radio bearer).","paragraph_zero_based":5079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-BearerConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":5080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":5081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RLC-BEARERCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":5082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-BearerConfig ::=                        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":5084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    logicalChannelIdentity                      LogicalChannelIdentity,","paragraph_zero_based":5085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servedRadioBearer                           CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":5086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        srb-Identity                                SRB-Identity,","paragraph_zero_based":5087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["759485d2b9643dc25c0b3ce7f9b810cd99fea44a41bbce59dc79e3ef94df9a0a","4f3525eb698db08cba98102da7e2ec0167a6f4bb51984be1c598f0ae2289fcdc","76045aa2a13de290dbfa2d28c5ba8ea17a4b08ec6035ec642affd0d38a6dcc3c","f7a58de599acf77378c251554ab54072c3ef3b3898e1507f4fb15ae58db85091","ac19d311411eeb