{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to indicate the applicability of configurations subject to the applicability determination procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":5520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"applicabilitySetConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":5521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ID of a set of prediction related parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":5522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"applicabilitySetConfigCSI-ToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":5523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each serving cell the list of sets of prediction related parameters configured for UE applicability reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":5524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the relaxation state of BFD measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":5526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"btNameList","paragraph_zero_based":5527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific Bluetooth beacons. NG-RAN configures the field if includeBT-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":5528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBandwidth","paragraph_zero_based":5529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the bandwidth of the candidate frequency range around the center frequency.","paragraph_zero_based":5530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCenterFreq","paragraph_zero_based":5531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the center frequency of the candidate frequency range.","paragraph_zero_based":5532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqListNR","paragraph_zero_based":5533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each candidate NR serving cells, the center frequency around which UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":5534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateServingFreqRangeListNR","paragraph_zero_based":5535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the candidate frequency range with the combination of the center frequency and the candidate bandwidth, around which the UE is requested to report IDC issues.","paragraph_zero_based":5536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"closestLocsToReport","paragraph_zero_based":5537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the number of closest reference locations the UE should indicate for assisted SMTC configuration in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":5538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"connectedReporting","paragraph_zero_based":5539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE can report a preference to remain in RRC_CONNECTED state following a report to leave RRC_CONNECTED state. If absent, the UE cannot report a preference to stay in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":5540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionCandidateConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":5541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the ID of a candidate configuration for UE-side data collection.","paragraph_zero_based":5542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionCandidateConfigToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":5543}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e236572b59c750f567bf1f40352d6abf3e1c4fa9e729744a13707065b6532e54","55d04da476f108dd217bd1f886e5beef9b9fb593c637ee1c6fca6382c16dd87a","1ebe905722899ac6d5ace16dc9bacb13eae5b73e104ebb41194999bf3895299a","210c8f1983fbc1addce