{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates for each serving cell the list of candidate radio resources configured for UE-side data collection. The UE is not expected to perform measurements solely based on the configurations provided by this IE.","paragraph_zero_based":5544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionPreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report its preference to be configured with radio resources for UE-side data collection.","paragraph_zero_based":5546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dataCollectionServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":5547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Index of the serving cell that the dataCollectionCandidateConfigParameterList refers to.","paragraph_zero_based":5548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for delay budget reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot4 means prohibit timer is set to 0.4 seconds, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's DRX preferences for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":5552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for DRX preferences assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapOccasionCancelRatioProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for transmitting the assistance information of gap occasion cancellation ratio. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapOccasionCancelRatioReportConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report preference for gap occasion cancellation ratio.","paragraph_zero_based":5558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"idc-AssistanceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about UE detected IDC problem.","paragraph_zero_based":5560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information related to logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection. When configured with loggedDataCollectionAssistanceConfig the UE reports that it has logged radio measurements for network-side data collection when the memory reserved for logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection has become full and it reports when it determines that it has entered a low power state.","paragraph_zero_based":5562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"loggedDataCollectionMemoryThreshold","paragraph_zero_based":5563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Memory threshold for the UE to report that it has logged radio measurements for network-side data collection, if the amount of data in the memory reserved for logging of radio measurements for network-side data collection has become equal to or above this threshold. Value kB16 means the threshold is set to 16 kB and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lpwus-OffsetPreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE’s preferred time offset for LP-WUS monitoring. ","paragraph_zero_based":5566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"lpwus-OffsetPreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5567}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bad81e8dafd98a73d1c6caca641e4753cbeb42a9ac4569af95fff66dd0c647e1","86ae9950a1d6897445ecf7ecde188b8ce6ea7662f8153192c5ffbf2846790262","5205eb3d893ad760dd21f95475930680c2d3a3f2c0a17d4e0bad91ab576d8be2","c1ef7e936c4df95667f43bbfbd94ebe6faa6dc34d41db2966f9f9340d5f392cb","18ce975a9ed43f4de58a8f86cad47bf54a685d63c1657a1053c38ce5d9729393","f3e139c0e900a0c2baad764d6206cae7364ed86f0392b4d566b9a102eba22ddd","d53d9416c06041d55658db3476e68d9c1f92be53f0de95e046a13a1a6d5c623a","bc58af69429f877d606c2d2a5e95fd3e1ac168cce3257ed5189b9b628c2f68e5","cce95658b4964acceca9632dcf65367daa7eef9c317de74ce44158051a7c2f90","d975bbd971b1510f0ddd791cd70f20b209d139200da94787057bae688a894613","e5fae918e1a43b102df098afe899cb0dfdce351c600d58f1a2173092647a56f0","f2c688c88152a9f688f8584e61a0527508d1c69761b2e24b3f6db650f87a5903","cff0759c3d7fea51958a71a78f06fcfea3dba6e55fe7e02562e1bf38bc8f8981","9db393079fbac2ad2d9317e70f29bb13bfbb42eadef3c4af1158f9072f78b4fd","ecb84d8dae4f2f1a70a3108ff7ef4b6056c5c7ab3e24259f87ccd36293bd2451","3fc68f67867910902b29344e00bb4a6abf697169fb381b178dbb98f51e9af0f1","09e1264406b06a32a1f1ae0c30f60133f8f95c1059f9b270c09616cd858033dc","0e82b3c97e21082f658c5a93d9aab2e9859bb0923b61b1532ba77bc0624f097e","0f3e204d5b22a707