{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for offset preferences assistance information reporting for LP-WUS monitoring. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred bandwidth for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":5570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for preferred bandwidth assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxCC-PreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred number of carriers for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":5574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2","paragraph_zero_based":5575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred bandwidth for power saving for FR2-2.","paragraph_zero_based":5576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxCC-PreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for preferred number of carriers assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred number of MIMO layers for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":5580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2","paragraph_zero_based":5581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred number of MIMO layers for power saving for FR2-2.","paragraph_zero_based":5582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for preferred number of number of MIMO layers assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":5585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred minimumSchedulingOffset value for cross-slot scheduling for power saving.","paragraph_zero_based":5586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt","paragraph_zero_based":5587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preferred minimumSchedulingOffset value for cross-slot scheduling for power saving for SCS 480 kHz and/or 960 kHz.","paragraph_zero_based":5588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":5589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for preferred minimumSchedulingOffset assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":5590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"multiRx-PreferenceReportingConfigFR2","paragraph_zero_based":5591}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["10dcbcba3f3dace33bb1501e2a0f430bbb85035098de413f7c595dd322c55449","42786f4af20c7d0bdf00d6b437608c99ef40db49b6d6141e6bfa626cc072f0a8","e495aa8d7dbec1f43cc222f892c37e1ca8bd0b08e32ed499fd752b33e8f34f70","21e436f2a01d250ce03726e4ae91a14dab3c1c3e37494af08dbc17eda55caf5d","bac5d8429b424d628c8651a6f4a728a651a55ab1831abc13e9ec068db6327556","3b3592f985e58690ed303a0ce1763f2f5cb1f67190ace283f4d7f0a00d4db4a1","9eaa9457a2c2669086f57e029773a0340d672f4b90b45e23452d436e5025a835","6637fbc576ecca38ee62263e409ee27396d8d486fbea0a68c6af3856362f3e40","79d3b0116cf9893d74de3d87e74a0966e545e346c21ca15abe78666fc32f00a0","27c2eb428317098faf7e7147354b8736a4c8e2e51b6a0ff838399ecf7275892d","59623c8fe57aca3c6e7d144a250a7bb26c7a47a9ba1267213c4c7825ebe724ef","43e5be08ea58c5402339724464c0962426e3701c0d15f2323c28db5634cd6e8c","2cc9d22f7df040c052541aa69a4be8192b6e0ef5abe8d448af43cfdc6a54a48d","21122e993fb9091d902e29cf51379d14109cdfcf0112f368f17e505c99ddde63","d64e8d662403d3e949d24ce457569cb66637f0d7308d7f3c8faab336191cf112","431f8532b2d66265acc7e86655b6ddb98f7bc5d3134f7b1f6f3aa290665b351e","021e6dd5323998bdd9dd7409e28f397e026429b710a