{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-HANDOVER-PREPARATION-INFORMATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":6480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":6481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HandoverPreparationInformation field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":6483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"as-Context","paragraph_zero_based":6484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Local RAN context required by the target gNB or DU.","paragraph_zero_based":6485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rrm-Config","paragraph_zero_based":6486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Local RAN context used mainly for RRM purposes.","paragraph_zero_based":6487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":6488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The radio resource configuration as used in the source cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-CapabilityRAT-List","paragraph_zero_based":6490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE radio access related capabilities concerning RATs supported by the UE. A gNB that retrieves MRDC related capability containers ensures that the set of included MRDC containers is consistent w.r.t. the feature set related information.","paragraph_zero_based":6491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-InactiveTime","paragraph_zero_based":6492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Duration while UE has not received or transmitted any user data. Thus the timer is still running in case e.g., UE measures the neighbour cells for the HO purpose. Value s1 corresponds to 1 second, s2 corresponds to 2 seconds and so on. Value min1 corresponds to 1 minute, value min1s20 corresponds to 1 minute and 20 seconds, value min1s40 corresponds to 1 minute and 40 seconds and so on. Value hr1 corresponds to 1 hour, hr1min30 corresponds to 1 hour and 30 minutes and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":6493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AS-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":6495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rrcReconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":6496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the RRCReconfiguration configuration as generated entirely by the MN. If the TMGI-r17 is included in the MRB-ToAddMod-r17 in the RadioBearerConfig, the plmn-Index is replaced by the PLMN ID, if needed.","paragraph_zero_based":6497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sdt-Config","paragraph_zero_based":6498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the IE SDT-Config as generated entirely by the last serving gNB. This field is only used during the SDT procedure and the RNA update procedure with UE context relocation as defined in TS 38.300 [2], clause 18.2 and 9.2.2.5 respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":6499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceRB-SN-Config","paragraph_zero_based":6500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the IE RadioBearerConfig as generated entirely by the SN. This field is only used when the UE is configured with SN terminated RB(s).","paragraph_zero_based":6501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceSCG-Configured","paragraph_zero_based":6502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value true indicates that the UE is configured with NR or EUTRA SCG in source configuration. The field is only used in NR-DC and NE-DC and is included only if the fields sourceSCG-NR-Config and sourceSCG-EUTRA-Config are absent.","paragraph_zero_based":6503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3febc103d4c63e2b6e3596bee32b80a8d87aa99dc03d5f20ee3d54fc1c873471","9ae5099a7a4ffe25c310bd7adeeb6fbc5b382207b2b8b7c1db8fb690a30b862a","91043ddccdb8a87413fef49ee41cf46758ee24cbea987321ab46140bd0b4dc79","7799f0ebacd6c47ade1913867aba48300fbed8d2415de0c37a42b0eebe97060d","3dc19d7111f65337fb725502729d3e695b16d5199fcbcadebaee345236d00372","3f1788f48381d71e8a9cb7df56b98642f8d1929f4cb243ebaa40c6ff2a55e751","fa3e6536d581f4cfe35e5b0d04aed09a19b74a79b8b93b7cfbc3bbe1dee81035","dfbf2c8e8362311dab01cf187f656f2725d541a2bfc665440f3ed6f8159912de","cb7be27c3dcf25ae6b7ebbe010c52d0c03a15a42a5a0aea75a10830f3f647650","a3668ae7edba04070bc7231906ee2ec171717fe2b1d7a40d090bf7c8995d358c","3523d4d7b8cdbaa674a2b71fcabf0c9a6670147bd2e839b835f4d09130296b95","2fd5b9a7b2ef50cf4a1929e36a7be56154f08e80fdd75ea3509ff5163263e9a3","3713ced4f99ca02b628fe59b5cafc99c61c8862f48ce927a490629b824c3dd2b","9272420bc4d7070cdddc9251b68e9bff6bceaf46e0ccb9e54f1ec230cf4f8218","4c21b8301bb7be940ab4412ec96b850b6c2ede718a585f18a1071fd69a3b8b4b","60c6f8485c729b8cdcd6eac5c6ae1e011f98e8e0a4f01a47689bcee7fd928179","556d42c52787b7db3fa4965ee47e485bf1524554c875a389287a31285393fa9d","612ce559432a7023179bbe79a5447c3a35bb7069a1e51d85a71ec04f0c3fec59","68aae35747797a5398b9df0d4288f0c405319e413276a2e8057fb2ef5282cd15","e795866c3724ccfd7ab36553c74d5453516a5b98ab6d73cb78cdff0c678f6cbb","2784fa887c8334785a6883c366dcaabac7e5edd9f6077766fb8d3d20a5287c92","22044b033c7412a6c1ae867c87f2bbf452fe79a0cd89207e0d1c9007074b9055","8ec56017a1ef2e4447baa90691c055586e1b1805f8fd87fe124d2644bb17d4e8","e7d573004fcb4578623c0a2e6ddf2bc730e87276e707cc0b0080ed63650c73cc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6480,6503],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p6480"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceSCG-EUTRA-Config","paragraph_zero_based":6504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the current dedicated SCG configuration in RRCConnectionReconfiguration message as specified in TS 36.331 [10] and generated entirely by the SN. In this version of the specification, the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message can only include the field scg-Configuration . This field is only used in NE-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":6505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceSCG-NR-Config","paragraph_zero_based":6506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the current dedicated SCG configuration in RRCReconfiguration message as generated entirely by the SN. In this version of the specification, the RRCReconfiguration message can only include fields secondaryCellGroup, measConfig, and conditionalReconfiguration. This field is only used in NR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":6507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList","paragraph_zero_based":6508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the IE SRS-PosRRC-InactiveValidityAreaPreConfigList as generated entirely by the last serving gNB. This field is only used UE is preconfigured with SRS for positioning with validity area and during the RNA update procedure with UE context relocation as defined in TS 38.300 [2], clause 18.2 and 9.2.2.5 respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":6509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AS-Context field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":6511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"configRestrictInfoDAPS","paragraph_zero_based":6512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes fields for which source cell explicitly indicates the restriction to be observed by target cell during DAPS handover.","paragraph_zero_based":6513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbsInterestIndication","paragraph_zero_based":6514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes the information last reported by the UE in the NR MBSInterestIndication message, where the plmn-Index (if included by the UE in tmgi) is replaced by the PLMN ID, if needed. A TMGI for which the plmn-Index points to a non-serving SNPN is removed from the NR MBSInterestIndication message.","paragraph_zero_based":6515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"needForGapsInfoNR","paragraph_zero_based":6516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes measurement gap requirement information of the UE for NR target bands. The field includes needForGapsInfoNR in RRCReconfigurationComplete message, needForGapsInfoNR in RRCResumeComplete message or musim-needForGapsInfoNR in UEAssistanceInformation message that is last reported by the UE, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":6517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"retainLoggedMeasurements","paragraph_zero_based":6518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indication to the target gNB that the UE shall retain logged measurements available in VarCSI-LogMeasReport at execution of the handover. If included, the target gNB is allowed to include the corresponding indication to the UE within the HandoverCommand message.","paragraph_zero_based":6519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"selectedBandCombinationSN","paragraph_zero_based":6520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the band combination selected by SN in (NG)EN-DC, NE-DC, and NR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":6521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sidelinkUEInformationEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":6522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field includes SidelinkUEInformation IE as specified in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":6523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sidelinkUEInformationNR","paragraph_zero_based":6524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field includes SidelinkUEInformationNR IE.","paragraph_zero_based":6525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-ApplicabilityReportList","paragraph_zero_based":6526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes information related to the applicability of prediction configurations and/or sets of parameters for prediction configurations that has been reported by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":6527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e9aaf64df9d6aeda3eedf3149da2de1174ba68f0c3fe5aa03e3a1e8c025a13b9","d2614af3022f0f66a784e160e66d7f81fb26155775ce312da7c5915c2dcaa638","2b16f04b6dd92e47bdfdf52704c0aae3b2135488f70ed4e41855c30e53937d83","5ac9a3e9eddcb1c25208450870b411ae148cc03c5a156de37af84a3d9fabbb1a","57fbf36dbdcd2645a7892d06cfdec9d2cf37e710f9bce7abc204355dab4059b7","29cc4bc12e8630c69ebaf887864ddf0e7a4130a91aeeee32303fe45abbed4c7c","25c0734d004ff0b5e4479fe0f532079a6fa95172befcd374c7daa71bb1c024d4","7c6bbbe84fb73959af0429f58a61c8698b9a1afdd221618ca7e2ca90f7ee7ce2","09af96e8a26d2a86a5c64a2b03a12b2fa6fb4f77d8b5e2e06d934977de25f622","98d7775fa329a604bd6fea2d0e1b05779941e732e65b1799ccc2063bae014eb8","df4563184c4858b3c8fefdafea02beb2ea60fcfb1c2154e8a8ff03af06c619e1","c57a9979c33012e32d70855a72361bddf396316e8df4d7abc2418fc95ba234de","900cc62fd883c59753445e348e2c03f8aa8156eab6e24b5fe62b1a8c4a77bcf2","cb2d6533746ba23f2982c8d68d0bda2bf36e9747100fc0e7cda4563875f26a6f","c039cfe43236a9e0426f967b7ba626c5051180c43f784ad2a3d7f76d6492df38","02e1bc31700483edc34e07af49867d44d8092538b13aaae7e166631bf51bbdc7","12cd7fcfa323ee073ffc913f57f4d7e51c702ebf24c3cca493cd7ae86bc8256d","f79810c49f3ff88e1a35ec6219f25e73eb14542aeff81371ee89554cbdb90844","f09e1918726ad07b4edeb392552ea3551ab47e07fa354c9d4601763466b6163d","e7f37e441991fb8dfbe1c23a40aaf3455a9593c444ee454abd5a4e2f559a0de9","994dace4e72b062ea413d4709026ed04aa6138f491cab4e9349f046ca5ee47b1","ecd293745e715a8e64fd2a1a1ba2c477db65be6569be55240e6f8417cdf015f2","419cc64fa0e80b3dabb18ba25942ef69b22e8c04d17ecdf33109d302ce9feb80","9e8c61f4531a4f815d8a8e04d2ef088204dc260dbddb013a35a9cd34614df7da"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6504,6527],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx:p6504"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2507934.zip::R2-2507934 Corrections to AIML for NR air interface.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ueAssistanceInformation","paragraph_zero_based":6528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes for each UE assistance feature the information last reported by the UE, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":6529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ueAssistanceInformationSCG","paragraph_zero_based":6530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Includes for each UE assistance feature associated with the SCG, the information last reported by the UE in the NR UEAssistanceInformation message for the SCG, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":6531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ConfigRestrictInfoDAPS field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":6533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceFeatureSetPerUplinkCC/sourceFeatureSetPerDownlinkCC","paragraph_zero_based":6534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates an index referring to the position of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC/FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC selected by source in the featureSetsUplinkPerCC/featureSetsDownlinkPerCC.","paragraph_zero_based":6535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRM-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":6537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":6538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of the best cells on each frequency for which measurement information was available","paragraph_zero_based":6539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoListSN-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":6540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of EUTRA cells including serving cells and best neighbour cells on each serving frequency, for which measurement results were available. This field is only used in NE-DC. ","paragraph_zero_based":6541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":6543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":6544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO","paragraph_zero_based":6545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of handover within NR or UE context retrieval, e.g. in case of resume or re-establishment. The field is optionally present in case of handover from E-UTRA/5GC. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":6546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO2","paragraph_zero_based":6547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present in case of handover within NR; otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":6548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The following table indicates per source RAT whether RAT capabilities are included or not.","paragraph_zero_based":6550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"2c923ef844b31b26bf72e49b8af09884ed1bea6239f8c29d803b9a85603b7844","original_member_sha256":"fca6127e1480323bfb803b07914e61c1b7dcc13de0d3c550e3d33fe0e7ccc48f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fdd527be33c7d2f7ab486d229f2e08c4a1e3afc970b99c70cf3755294202c836","27093c894588498bc019ef8e1756cd78ab8056a060012d0d026b7090925688e7","e294f8c5ac93984dd50fb6c8497ba78343a0277337a32c35b8743dc4f7252d07","d505e10fe16af0b14a71a20731b9135e6f658ad1a1572f5bfec7df9396d67049","018abcaf27726fb716222255fbb67a58968601b6195e33ba5c32b97357d7865a","17891347dd2e5f7833bc0f7a6994ca711d116646fa45ab085b6dcdfea33c3bd5","28ccd937549ddf89576e1fd542812454c44dab4347aa04e2124939d51df5eed6","7e89376540e166aa9090e1158d94ae7d53d35aa80c28be73f759c8e8ed9c8156","1850222ad9