{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2508140.zip::R2-2508140 - Miscellaneous SRAP corrections for multi-hop U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-19","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 3.1, the Terms for Last Relay is not aligned with other spec.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 4.2.2, one typo in Figure 4.2.2-2.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.2.2.0/5.2.2.2, the handling of the last relay operation for identifying SRB0 of the Child UE is not clearly captured. ","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.2.3, for the receiving operation of U2N Remote UE, sl-EgressRLC-Channel-UL is not applicable here.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.3.3.2, for BEARER ID shared by SRB and DRB, it should be sl-EgressRLC-Channel-DL to refer.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.3.3.2, as agreed in RAN2 #131b, the intermediate relay UE can use default RLC channel configuration for SRB1 if the dedicated configuration is not provided.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 3.1, add missing sentence “The child UE is the U2N Remote UE in case of single-hop L2 U2N Relay communication.”","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 4.2.2, add space between “theChild” in Figure 4.2.2-2.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"6e23435eeacd9e80f1e0683e55055ecbbee5d19c78466808d2fe0004034394b2","original_member_sha256":"a8d9516b82c5e2539803e906ff9ee9a60c90f11ecbbbd141e0cc3b3fdf0f3a80","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","da86009f7484cb0e4b9b0113aaf3a023fb44e482ded34b8e7a12f3bc276608e9","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","708b7a0a19488cac7c721b34a6df0d329658b486a41a7eee39ef3a364762c7b8","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","9179ba236853e4a73f15d3d408619f0f62540850e6daa878c17cdc8a8f26dbb9","dd3de490bf00baf5087f33777fa