{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-19","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Correction of miscellaneous non-controversial errors (typos etc).","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.3.3e, add the missing text in the NOTE i.e. which procedure (e.g. EDT, random access procedure, CB-Msg3-EDT) is initiated is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.3.6, IE UE-EUTRA-Capability, change the “FDD/TDD diff” field from “No” to “-“ in cas-Muting-5GB.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No impacted functionality","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["54a0ee23f7f54d4e98a2b1fc610a97490426be874d738aba6b308f73f1b4c96f","a72fb5616d802928e04b923ea8733fbfbb784e971849998fddbd84c44feb342c","a7c990fc18cc0dec5450a3617bfd527482dc695572ba22b1d3e4df5449e5a39d","a452856e06011048580ff328e6fa096490bf847203ce94e0207c53741864a01c","c15e9da18a4745d023e65efbe5cb0c1c005b9d82e475506d50862da2dc995e9d","5ebe1acf0e5c5cacb14bebac5c1eabf72610c56530548d1c0883175b1a13872e","baee5fef3f1535fa95231586b1e8741c129ceaf4fcd2278892f4f385aa36083b","2a12bdb64fefe24e29b81ce0cce5b363b14e176d5d4792cee682df49650327c7","1dd66f48aa23940d873eb53a0feea6f1c8bce056057d27c13ac85b4c3968a2b9","e11469ed1b16dc52a841de0635d78ddf950cad790969d4c683905a72d16c37ca","16046c1839e2a733429639e1bacedbf6ab4b6794ac038352133262710ce7ac7e","40b09d78745082f44db472923f757d8458a6f4fa5ff9115502f178f2bd9ea94d","e43f8ff0b85d8e448f070385a343cde4f6fe26a0adbb93c2868820e903d6acf3","f933e0c2efce3cd6ab1d4761588e9c3faad79e17ed74d984df103fd799a42781","cb46aead572a062150cc3476e74dc25b0757198466ddec062643755f03b87e63","ce1899a91337479ba605527d995378a05f6ab93ded6b32f6346c2db9978780cb","14ff82d91a2dfe111ec