ndication from lower layers, the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:When receiving the CB-Msg3-EDT failure indication from lower layers, the RRC procedure is re-initiated. Which procedure (e.g. EDT, random access procedure, CB-Msg3-EDT) is initiated is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e39f314682c78b5c0508dd2cdbd966266eda8c085894d807761f83e93b1f33f6","8d3c6b4fae1a9c3fc59635283c78ea793ff052c81b272394b8f9d74932b5b753","02f722b8d39b14e4cad9002060de04f74a312f29b97c217d5809efb496e792e4","c2b0e48d679495621106ba6a645d63efb26f1c28f13bc1c57e818b66497ae4b8","2e2233365b098266a19ae7d52a7498cf54aa078511360a6c4c01dff7a60cdab8","ba23cc00b1ac6cc348c0e144c249a441ce3d4f814a724dea3af2738e5249dd84","bc872c9656effeaab300ad956a2ca315bb5b4c719864ed439e48a69b3fbc3bea","e47110dcbb30aaa3fe5b4a488c08ba11a8aace62343dbe6a1d8b52fb4f38f467","5c66b6fadb1d06975490dea2cf6822b8d04fb76f1c03e8baa727955c2c9b5907","e6c6227df8d352c0427fd823cd78ba8d60fa926a94bfef4f108ad5020a3fe235","3f7f51ec5c130315e41a01a2cb2a6e2f2e9760be8415d811bc5a24114c7574d1","2b3fbff8b6178c214725fc7e71b29478d10a23903a545b2a390eb155e1022ebb","7ce482f0c9ca1de711abe67a611a172b246f560ed46530af9a2f2cfd514c6fc6","080387b546a5e9a20da57c32ce98477df1bf240e2a57128a9ad8e671054e9c47","8da75a550fafd3fde2b1a1177e8cca7110ce434103f3bbc00b18ccf9522d8775","0ca53dce2e494bd7f5812c2a44ad71651fbe41e10d8117aaf768614df2d9380b","1bd60892e09447080a2e711c66f48c9ae32d376f511199c75784f3bf7c4ef644","618480db6cdddcd3f66cbec803317636f18793bec97e638ea589884870a2b5b4","d3f90e2543959a3636f1af