{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports handover from E-UTRA/EPC to NR TDD FR2-1.","paragraph_zero_based":3624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":3625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-EPC-HO-ToNR-TDD-FR2-2","paragraph_zero_based":3626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports handover from E-UTRA/EPC to NR TDD FR2-2.","paragraph_zero_based":3627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-EPC-HO-EUTRA-5GC","paragraph_zero_based":3629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports handover between E-UTRA/EPC and E-UTRA/5GC. ","paragraph_zero_based":3630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":3631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-IdleInactiveMeasurements","paragraph_zero_based":3632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports reporting measurements performed during RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":3633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":3634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-SI-AcquisitionForHO-ENDC","paragraph_zero_based":3635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports, upon configuration of si-RequestForHO by the network, acquisition of relevant information from a neighbouring E-UTRA cell by reading the SI of the neighbouring cell using autonomous gaps and reporting the acquired information to the network.","paragraph_zero_based":3636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":3637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventB2","paragraph_zero_based":3638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports event B2. A UE supporting NR SA operation shall set this bit to supported.","paragraph_zero_based":3639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventD1-MeasReportTrigger","paragraph_zero_based":3641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the UE supports location-based measurement report triggering in RRC_CONNECTED in earth fixed cell (i.e. event D1).","paragraph_zero_based":3642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eventD2-MeasReportTrigger","paragraph_zero_based":3644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the UE supports location-based measurement report triggering in RRC_CONNECTED in earth moving cell (i.e. event D2).","paragraph_zero_based":3645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedBand-n77","paragraph_zero_based":3647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d36a227cf595145c956b2ea7134ff2fbd382e5a4a42327c0f4f309ca34ed6146","fe4fd22986e8f9ddb28a67cff21d6160d49e80eb9a509563d4450e9c3f0e5c3e","0a598b02c726c3c329388a1968a1fcde1e2320349b579761ed3a180602209ced","f10b30a3f078dfb95e64efc2990386d5ff85fd30f810d7c860528fbb4c61908e","de08313fb6c5240bd929bba88e503fb314d487baaa6b6b96907e7bd221f1a16d","df70cd7766001ab4014c801d4943ac8ac3f7d2147b79dffdf548b33d0f2d7fdf","a338d442196c4d21b2040964940e6197098e143d0acb922906cbed13a9f32869","58c1ba7573f15ce8ec1c1d7f5dec3c181bd6a5bc7a2c9a98b34f3b80c04c58fe","d5de70a5c0d38a8e60513b1b122ce34a0c8f0361cdd79f0885c7044c153b521f","06016dec34efbf55913e52bdeb1ca89a8f1cf70e3cef1fcc216082eac8dbcbb3","a69088c352439485c94534af3d19709380cc577c257ae1582e61cce1223866ec","71699c796065e47074704fd12b79da3792be89ea498e41c2606cc96284339276","259516485f886f98634629e5694b901297aadbf41b958ee9199a6cd037d69983","8100833d02120ee01fdf83539cf8ef25e088210b2236ffe3fad1a012900f6758","800062a4d7ef6eaadd574e2a6b0a1c18888ee644c54f6a97668a5e880e3f8720","d0fc69ab6ce2a97aebe8f477c56a0ca53d6d39bac113f15bb34cc0fa20685345","c6985f122327fa1d9d991b7cae69848a2358c6f1a66c60965209f67972ca1f6f","38c0a4950a478096e8cf52d1714d8ded58b7dcd31a5d60e1df27ba0be2c70cb8","09fba0f139c33dac1b664c0408f0728cd969e9de1fcf5f26b2e66024f4e86e36","39b8a0d02a782832c2ab67fdf3e4bd5646beb543e0e3f6c47b20d3fd25ae1ff9","c6e0a0c86651cd66a873543588d7a77ee8eee7df4a5a393f099f1e82d8c93ee2","9eede015f89718355232f0e87608fff6efd4cd9493a5cc744393ad436ba32e72","51fabb0e463e69bccc46d103b2e152b817973c2c0c1f72c8e6af3e6f87d1db7e","98f0d15e5f6f4e570e50ddcfc6a359fad398dd5aa1f43b7e7623d0d0809abae0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3624,3647],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p3624"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is only applicable for UEs that indicate support for band n77. If present, the UE supports the restriction to 3450 - 3550 MHz and 3700 - 3980 MHz ranges of band n77 in the USA as specified in Note 12 of Table 5.2-1 in TS 38.101-1 [85]. If absent, the UE supports only restriction to the 3700 - 3980 MHz range of band n77 in the USA. A UE that indicates this field shall support NS value 55 as specified in TS 38.101-1 [85].","paragraph_zero_based":3648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedBand-n77-2","paragraph_zero_based":3650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is only applicable for UEs that indicate support for band n77. If present, the UE supports the restriction to 3450 - 3650 MHz and 3650 - 3980 ranges of band n77 in Canada as specified in Note 12 of Table 5.2-1 in TS 38.101-1 [85]. If absent, the UE supports only restriction to the 3450 - 3650 MHz range of band n77 in Canada. A UE that indicates this field shall also support NS value 57 as specified in TS 38.101-1 [85].","paragraph_zero_based":3651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedFreqPriorities","paragraph_zero_based":3653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports extended E-UTRA frequency priorities indicated by cellReselectionSubPriority field. A UE supporting NR SA operation shall set this bit to supported.","paragraph_zero_based":3654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedLCID-Duplication","paragraph_zero_based":3656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports use of extended LCIDs 32-38 for PDCP duplication.","paragraph_zero_based":3657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedLongDRX","paragraph_zero_based":3659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports extended long DRX cycle values of 5.12s and 10.24s in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":3660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedMAC-LengthField","paragraph_zero_based":3662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the MAC header with L field of size 16 bits as specified in TS 36.321 [6], clause 6.2.1.","paragraph_zero_based":3663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedMaxMeasId","paragraph_zero_based":3665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports extended number of measurement identies as defined by maxMeasId-r12.","paragraph_zero_based":3666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":3667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedMaxObjectId","paragraph_zero_based":3668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports extended number of measurement object identies as defined by maxObjectId-r13.","paragraph_zero_based":3669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":3670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedNumberOfDRBs","paragraph_zero_based":3671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0462ed13aa69ddaaec78449039deffbc581eede3ee5a1323928d32fda8acb910","c9fea0bf76bab7a658f0205bd08896af989a998a1ec6c71c9e2eda045772ffa6","9f4ebae51fd7dd8b4b11790adb0f6c9f93947132aa2c141bf8197628699b880e","b64fc9bb0e7ea42aac9cfa30e5f7f0d4fc3ee5e9394fb231726dc56b56b863d6","2584d771c557298c154cb5d157ea25f7651dcad7063b64c09ee70551b49bd79b","1033234079aeb7a2b4fa04247b6469b4313fcb3ba34010eeb6318cebe28971b6","a2c65f871c146472bc40c5caba718acf9330e5d0680da9a2dbeb2c559c952bcd","8589dbb040d20059d6fd052922531d8f3ec5309749d7e14694253f7e1de5deb1","50286ae2c5e1c958b772b08f90b149fb090500a22b2fc620146f1f0aa14c4f0f","a8f5f32da5ef4abb631696a10ffab837b15c3983f61839582e8d7ab02ba7016a","612c1e3eadd3ee8cbf9cfaf7539bf240d8d602370d5eacaceea8f42386d11b49","6bdb42a612ac69c91d7072bc79589de4361a52e07cc50fcfd4fbc6e76f4705ad","2f7f59fd525c9077dc1a6e6a069bca71903423ec09e0c3bea87830def73c5c16","af5019e87e9b4d0b2faf0fc6741f512d4dba6a917e1e425d469e213ea73f9ee7","ed504cb152dabd374b1694dfba52125c0588aea688069fc60943aa7cacf3849a","409cd06dce84919b97438e8cf24a94f2817f3a056cb7a0157143d9173e6c55d7","9ddf810813c0b8d5f8ba709bf39d3701e89c37d0e6bb9a4105d8a469805f7cb9","45f7ec429424100f6758942041a984fad84256deb2a0c190100061546b9b1795","73eb67ff53faa81dedbf23fe8e2fe6c306109fb8a423ff3c338ce2775359b177","574139cdf8ac6cd61b819af3bcc353b35e5ebec013b2c2ca9766214d8c98f670","7a40478658fa09fb46691ebaf1e968f0aede9190669a0af5315e4e68171d181e","24595d20004d25c9a8edcda910305b59dd43220441412303b1e4987ab81d4990","831c2e24392c4f57665198135f54cc7114a0981ad9cd0fb2bb1ff73f581c10ec","0e8a590d87a0cf263a0488c147149ab7e480c489f71049e235e09955e92392f1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3648,3671],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p3648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports up to 15 DRBs. The UE shall support any combination of RLC AM and RLC UM entities for the configured DRBs.","paragraph_zero_based":3672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedPollByte","paragraph_zero_based":3674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports extended pollByte values as defined by pollByte-r14.","paragraph_zero_based":3675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extended-RLC-LI-Field","paragraph_zero_based":3677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports 15 bit RLC length indicator.","paragraph_zero_based":3678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedRLC-SN-SO-Field","paragraph_zero_based":3680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports 16 bits of RLC sequence number and segmentation offset.","paragraph_zero_based":3681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"extendedRSRQ-LowerRange","paragraph_zero_based":3683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the extended RSRQ lower value range from -34dB to -19.5dB in measurement configuration and reporting as specified in TS 36.133 [16].","paragraph_zero_based":3684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":3685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fdd-HARQ-TimingTDD","paragraph_zero_based":3686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports FDD HARQ timing for TDD SCell when configured with TDD PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":3687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":3688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"featureGroupIndicators, featureGroupIndRel9Add, featureGroupIndRel10","paragraph_zero_based":3689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The definitions of the bits in the bit string are described in Annex B.1 (for featureGroupIndicators and featureGroupIndRel9Add) and in Annex C.1 (for featureGroupIndRel10).","paragraph_zero_based":3690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":3691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"featureSetsDL-PerCC","paragraph_zero_based":3692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In MR-DC, indicates a set of features that the UE supports on one component carrier in a bandwidth class for a band in a given band combination. The UE shall hence include at least as many FeatureSetDL-PerCC-Id in this list as the number of carriers it supports according to the ca-bandwidthClassDL, except if indicating additional functionality by reducing the number of FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id in the feature set. The order of the elements in this list is not relevant, i.e., the network may configure any of the carriers in accordance with any of the FeatureSetDL-PerCC-Id in this list.","paragraph_zero_based":3693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetDL-PerCC-Id","paragraph_zero_based":3695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["afe8b64f66b0faa80aeaf7455c5bc77d90df15655d199e5ee61f51245e14cc7d","c4f785a81c012d4f69de2623d299b612580d7342378ed98d78bb78df526f32ba","d7997f3be4cb8449be0809b714f8feb4811d9d7f69ca36d881bc244dad625d65","65424fdf40e22c5313d2c7f4392c106ac594ae5f20e1a86b3d907ffc5638a11b","7bb13598be6633287f440800422a082573faacfad88a3a81d7b759a03db09e74","c957f4200b4f4edbca0eebdf656b37ac9af9407642ceb6790bbd106cb4d51808","82a9446d11022461e3683fb5054801dce4df8640f8c6673c0eb0755ee1a288e1","9725d923be52f5ed439017f79da9e38c6832886b185fe0ea9311be976095fc96","6e50c77a17c1003f496b967ac287171f270a26f837aec95a8b59c6852874c3e7","55d94efe1357c1a52dc100c0a7427b39ae581bdc922ece89915c01ad62684f60","54e15c4456e7641d7512d5ee53587950ca7b698184b3b2b8778d33d87f4b28e8","9ce4ed59109aab4b946d7ed687ab988e282134b69a95923f793d7ee077d1ee52","6874fd93b4ceeb26b28de635417b29d3a5fc2738a2860557bfafeaee3d2e612f","4a209ba46e12aafbaf6211e563dd586a97e8984777ae60b3eb5cce67b2b73a89","6b19a254becff9ce191eccd07084ad60809786d7c8bc05fd46cbfdb3c05260f6","15d332ce045551b81ebec4515d4ddf2a4163a1ba89c6ba8e282ae40a12949ad5","e6a60f2edc0b555030359c7a9f9580cc119cf0b448cef6913516a68aae24d0d5","cd511af0801fe64672721e52d6497f7af3ed5ae19b7cd29899079598ef6b87c7","cd53283d6612e04189e0e4bdfca0c61f670bffed2e368af1a0e319665b95eef7","b30aff6b262cc40085ebb415cd4ca34a9747f9d86ad8e6983b5f614f3dcb7bc0","164c884d7cfd16880476e1b8bdbec77be4c974b41d3fd8837d2fb95d4de1fd9a","879f9ea0402045e387a51e2a6edb0e1f7f2663cb2b828f8eb856008b8d596442","a5232e6c1826a4f456bd7ab78264cabb3be7175986b859cee46a0d020fd7defd","58356ad2e7e97b149346648d9f289d824109678bde355d68a2aac5326a42b468"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3672,3695],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p3672"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In MR-DC, indicates the index position of the FeatureSetDL-PerCC-r15 in the featureSetsDL-PerCC-r15 list. Value 0 corresponds to the first element in the list, value 1 corresponds to the second element in the list, and so on. Value 32 is not used.","paragraph_zero_based":3696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"featureSetsUL-PerCC","paragraph_zero_based":3698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In MR-DC, indicates a set of features that the UE supports on one component carrier in a bandwidth class for a band in a given band combination. The UE shall hence include at least as many FeatureSetUL-PerCC-Id in this list as the number of carriers it supports according to the ca-bandwidthClassUL, except if indicating additional functionality by reducing the number of FeatureSetDownlinkPerCC-Id in the feature set. The order of the elements in this list is not relevant, i.e., the network may configure any of the carriers in accordance with any of the FeatureSetUL-PerCC-Id in this list.","paragraph_zero_based":3699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUL-PerCC-Id","paragraph_zero_based":3701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In MR-DC, indicates the index position of the FeatureSetUL-PerCC-r15 in the featureSetsUL-PerCC-r15 list. Value 0 corresponds to the first element in the list, value 1 corresponds to the second element in the list, and so on. Value 32 is not used.","paragraph_zero_based":3702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fembmsMixedCell","paragraph_zero_based":3704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE in RRC_CONNECTED supports MBMS reception with 15 kHz subcarrier spacings via MBSFN from FeMBMS/Unicast mixed cells on a frequency indicated in an MBMSInterestIndication message.","paragraph_zero_based":3705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fembmsDedicatedCell","paragraph_zero_based":3707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE in RRC_CONNECTED supports MBMS reception with 15 kHz subcarrier spacings via MBSFN from MBMS-dedicated cells on a frequency indicated in an MBMSInterestIndication message.","paragraph_zero_based":3708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"flexibleUM-AM-Combinations","paragraph_zero_based":3710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports any combination of RLC UM and RLC AM bearers as long as the total number of bearers is at most 8, regardless of what FGI20 indicates.","paragraph_zero_based":3711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"flightPathPlan","paragraph_zero_based":3713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE supports reporting of flight path plan information.","paragraph_zero_based":3714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fourLayerTM3-TM4","paragraph_zero_based":3716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports 4-layer spatial multiplexing for TM3 and TM4.","paragraph_zero_based":3717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fourLayerTM3-TM4 (in FeatureSetDL-PerCC)","paragraph_zero_based":3719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c0d8202c18b5b88383032f8fcb4ebd892be22bb622eaf62e3485bebc426d97c5","ed8c38e32479c444d6338fc181b779cdacc08ac9ae96a0260cb6cef6b3fef7dc","22666784631bd98a793cd17dcf4276a788acfc624cc03ddb826852e6adefc30b","ef62fe16ce02fea2784908a71a2fbf76528e475bbee62c63ccf34c80e76dc683","8965653a2d7b5f738ab1494b5a212ddcfd99b5fa789af5d4a1ee98a3fdc5ea04","e37b4fd2171620cf975fc05113c6023f83564a2e51f2e09705138d4ba43eb23a","07f5fbe256bddeb10408bc8da603a713507dde57c38df0b49d43e93fc855da6a","955064f6f65cbe608c5397b972934d6375b6bcc03302709baecf87ffe8a7948e","d7b2dfa790e3c4bc07ebf30fe349a6427cd3cab3f900fdbd78caae595c9ff5c5","15e6ed0df0fc45f031e93ca3f7261716ba81b8a449019c8ea695f3adcfb9bfe1","4d91a410adc5938ca7cd186cfce272ed0ada60c38efd78ad78cc3d4173fc73f8","67777daa8e276051e1a402334461ae33831b04c15a81a39e3c461ace9f49c86a","d12dc17874c1fb24a68297350f7e245e0e9a42e47af3e7d25af874165d00f572","206c9117df4ff48abe6c6c93491aceecc90420b219f48a373584fa2bfe3ab1de","5e5b3c4042898a94263b1543356d5885576b1dae2c1bd359d961966bd49bcc5f","14153ecf85dec242ae6fee18b7a8fa770eb32de32388ffdcc75584c9fa9746fb","d2e0f70d7740434fbe8467f73eb0d73db889562faad50998a49bc0a1544897ad","55803a1a8bc7d58fe3faa41e90d5ff16f80725a546f2db365a36a8c7c80fe51e","ccd06dceefb007af9fffb43b28b0586ee3a62828d6e785e551df71889fb2e7c2","00bfbfe85fc56ebe7ac3de4acbe129a0617de2010e7932e6345566c773fd7efb","dc092975e99cbf87b82057b4989448ee7082b13a934863f68099caeacda95d45","9df8451c1fea182beefaf6fcf1cdc77f0c34bce3a7e2e8b30fc1869324bd3210","c90ce44bdae6206adfeac1acca8993ebc2be6aec53d191a62c3c22935b396017","f272befb9812b816fb3f9bfa8c0c666a88d7ff0115b1264264fb8358f7f0174a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3696,3719],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p3696"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports 4-layer spatial multiplexing for TM3 and TM4 for MR-DC within the indicated feature set. If this field is absent, UE supports two layer MIMO for TM3/TM4.","paragraph_zero_based":3720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fourLayerTM3-TM4-perCC","paragraph_zero_based":3722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports 4-layer spatial multiplexing for TM3 and TM4 for the component carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":3723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frameStructureType-SPT","paragraph_zero_based":3725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the supported FS-type(s) for short processing time. The UE capability is reported per band combination. The reported FS-type(s) apply to the reported maxNumberCCs-SPT-r15 for the given band combination.","paragraph_zero_based":3726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"freqBandPriorityAdjustment","paragraph_zero_based":3728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the prioritization of frequency bands in multiBandInfoList over the band in freqBandIndicator as defined by freqBandIndicatorPriority-r12.","paragraph_zero_based":3729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"freqBandRetrieval","paragraph_zero_based":3731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports reception of requestedFrequencyBands.","paragraph_zero_based":3732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gaplessMeas-FR2-maxCC","paragraph_zero_based":3734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports inter-RAT NR FR2 measurement without measurement gap as specified in clause 9.1.2 of TS 38.133 [84] while the number of configured serving cells is less than or equal to the indicated number. This field is applicable when only E-UTRA serving cells are configured. The UE reporting this field and supporting (NG)EN-DC shall not indicate support of independentGapConfig in MeasAndMobParametersMRDC within UE-MRDC-Capability (defined in TS 38.306 [87]).","paragraph_zero_based":3735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-ID-Length-Reporting-NR-EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":3737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports Inter-RAT gNB ID length reporting towards NR cell when it is configured with (NG)EN-DC. If the UE supports reportCGI-NR-EN-DC-r15, the UE shall support the gNB-ID-Length-Reporting-NR-EN-DC-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":3738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-ID-Length-Reporting-NR-NoEN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":3740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports Inter-RAT gNB ID length reporting towards cell when it is not configured with (NG)EN-DC. If the UE supports reportCGI-NR-NoEN-DC-r15, the UE shall support gNB-ID-Length-Reporting-NR-NoEN-DC-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":3741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":3742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"halfDuplex","paragraph_zero_based":3743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["578439e192864c206bd9bde265c98a6e6e7fd17bfbea1dcf7a78a3