{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports subframe set dependent UL power control for PUSCH and SRS. This field is only applicable for UEs supporting TDD.","paragraph_zero_based":4488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":4489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-CRI-BasedCSI-Reporting","paragraph_zero_based":4490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports CRI based CSI feedback for the FeCoMP feature as specified in TS 36.213 [23], clause 7.1.10.","paragraph_zero_based":4491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-TypeC-Operation","paragraph_zero_based":4493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE uses this field to indicate the support of all of the following three features: QCL Type-C operation for FeCoMP, the capability to support separate PDSCH RE mapping for different PDSCH CWs in non-coherent joint transmission and the capability to support handling new DMRS port to MIMO layer mapping for the CWs, as specified in TS 36.213 [23], clause 7.1.10.","paragraph_zero_based":4494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qoe-MeasReport","paragraph_zero_based":4496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports QoE Measurement Collection for streaming services.","paragraph_zero_based":4497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qoe-MTSI-MeasReport","paragraph_zero_based":4499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports QoE Measurement Collection for MTSI services.","paragraph_zero_based":4500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":4501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rach-Less","paragraph_zero_based":4502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports RACH-less handover, and whether the UE which indicates dc-Parameters supports RACH-less SeNB change, as defined in TS 36.300 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":4503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rach-Report","paragraph_zero_based":4505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports delivery of rach-Report.","paragraph_zero_based":4506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rach-ReportForNR","paragraph_zero_based":4508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports NR RACH report in LTE, upon request from the network.","paragraph_zero_based":4509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rai-Support","paragraph_zero_based":4511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c13e631c3aa240a2554f743811e3c21a69f42baafdd9ba8cf821dcb127f64557","5a280dc0fbae74411097a39a1e3c67b62066efcc1b521b1f4a93d79a495c48af","51181928a8a95b95e5aac6197e566de5b883a0b4a89f5ca2329492c9dd4c6a6c","606878ebea5eaef13cad1ead6f7610dfad4af4aacb43238868ec86cf91266f43","1715f7afcdadf90f243d77496e3415da2f61e457e8e4f6fc84568771420fc42f","3f632de058d5bd5bdc83301a73e9f53f4b48b1aa7677096e1594719d1dc01933","6af4ab21ca7dd0e2e99873df903de563d648d014fed45fe55b1f9d84ac546174","933cdc57a2af2c0ce68e22b267facd66bb87ffe5a81b6325458d736b32868b11","deb757f38cb5258229eeeb40888635dbadf2684159caf0367667aaaba1e40464","aa762bf758efe1615bab5c0f17e0008d292b84888920e4b4604f3889cc21c37d","f85297db6aac93b31e752b4379da928a806892539d7fd51acc565da368526843","c14aaf0eeee7359544163b1bbc74cac18c4ff4ccdab8905dd9717313c640493d","0e6213ef01b7a1efd6cfa6445362de9291200918dc414be938dea294cd631269","3827995108a97aa37b7e50c6215607a636e12bf17cdb856e1a54ca06b228fdbd","262126241e69b4a033be7216341ce88a10918a8d4844a0291edf28037b20dcab","3c8a7e1a45c76112cc45d40e35052b4b07dde05f0153b5e0adcad134bbb69857","90261142f7c6b29bae1c8dbca7a347171f9c7c89d0c7ba53c2d7c6f900ff1950","c15ca2b939ab5765e4a7620bcb25c3956f82be4e71f58a3c135d3a5d761f0b22","5d061378676fa45cfe318e96e25b2e1e98a279291d10875d54d70b2fac73b39a","6b45a7b3b3c3ed88f53ca1e15adb64f2f46ae02a1f923ad72346247294a74ad2","418a9568f442102a86789b75dcf219bee0084ee2ed8aa5a198d0b61569e8fe1f","b370b9e809202b41a6ed1c5f0e48918f09af0cd5c6fa360e29f6a618f0ae2d3a","19fc74496b7f5c5c66eeee59a52327f12e7f4b13e3b8995af3eb46ec30cf3c31","3a071caca632a64822b366246a91580a10d4b696d676fd41607a5575074e8afb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4488,4511],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p4488"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Defines whether the UE supports release assistance indication (RAI) as specified in TS 36.321 [6] for BL UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":4512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":4513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rai-SupportEnh","paragraph_zero_based":4514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports 2-bit RAI when connected to EPC as specified in TS 36.321 [6].","paragraph_zero_based":4515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rclwi","paragraph_zero_based":4517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports RCLWI, i.e. reception of rclwi-Configuration. The UE which supports RLCWI shall also indicate support of interRAT-ParametersWLAN-r13. The UE which supports RCLWI and wlan-IW-RAN-Rules shall also support applying WLAN identifiers received in rclwi-Configuration for the access network selection and traffic steering rules when in RRC_IDLE.","paragraph_zero_based":4518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"recommendedBitRate","paragraph_zero_based":4520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the bit rate recommendation message from the eNB to the UE as specified in TS 36.321 [6], clause 6.1.3.13.","paragraph_zero_based":4521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":4522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"recommendedBitRateMultiplier","paragraph_zero_based":4523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the bit rate multiplier for recommended bit rate MAC CE as specified in TS 36.321 [6], clause 6.1.3.13. If this field is included, the UE shall also include the recommendedBitRate field.","paragraph_zero_based":4524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"recommendedBitRateQuery","paragraph_zero_based":4526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports the bit rate recommendation query message from the UE to the eNB as specified in TS 36.321 [6], clause 6.1.3.13. If this field is included, the UE shall also include the recommendedBitRate field.","paragraph_zero_based":4527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":4528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reducedCP-Latency","paragraph_zero_based":4529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports reduced CP latency.","paragraph_zero_based":4530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":4531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reducedIntNonContComb","paragraph_zero_based":4532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports receiving requestReducedIntNonContComb that requests the UE to exclude supported intra-band non-contiguous CA band combinations other than included in capability signalling as specified in TS 36.306 [5], clause 4.3.5.21.","paragraph_zero_based":4533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reducedIntNonContCombRequested","paragraph_zero_based":4535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["728d4116ec0ee422b65d106a3b3e8ef20dfbe89bed5bdcb1834fcb336640e246","c9689b998103de8b866482908e3cba46ffb3718fe8b5d116c679dd51e007b186","de972f91fedc71061b04c875a941a189e9187ad1f7f31d570a97524126ef7388","0fb88560a134a5af8e0d34c918fbe77bf77f95a58b8e697cf067481ced5be851","2ac4bed38aeb27e60351c109617d3ce89eb6320d57c05b797541b9098935a616","89e8e16f1f991b1fef2514f57b9d9f8240b3ac8e5f7a803e74618e4cf9df61dc","79484d184251e6057780ca9471b39f54d0b45f91afa2999e9f706581ba92b93f","9071599ad62347c22ca10413e8c6def8bd81ceb52c13d120683a593bee955107","9ca328a72c2684c0c7ccb4c63d67974bbf306c17464040b57461186ad6325f0f","0033b3b6e460ca8bd1dfd22e76a194c9bd72023392c6cad0e5084a1ee74b93dc","320a4cb2f7b80d279c5ea31d98c1c80701aa82f1962b6c5d98ced5642d7f4ef7","ef39e7c3c89e3dbdf2c0f87b0f747019e434482e3d1af98a22a5c7327a74e80f","b4735375a1f3512930823e592ad524c6b70ec3afca17077640dc9d1e53e8908b","939b08c913d4e280e3a60540ab403bb57c72c88e16b02fca8e0a1d7160b14bf7","e75de36be687f3b5d9f91786eecc8557833b47287fd4a12b7acfde42c003a995","418e85f9a3b91151c029aa50a5f76397c43f3503fcacddac84946e6e33b840b0","4080b50178fc057c448c796bcf36e9224e9d2eee8d6a1d99522603e5cbdae198","0e140dba01293d3709bf7da8368b987e84dde9c49e2dbb83408f3afb89be6adb","ebe6f47df15f51d03cbed29e50af8c22a14383fc5f1e44a753f01728be95c657","39e0d387315913437edbb12c48a7c8095a4e59ee9615529b820d93731fa6edc5","c8d3e79b83855d030c8670f6fa76695862d46dd3f7f1e654de50d1dfe01a3bb5","087e4e595f19f7df185a57b87e9a5851e61be08f5ce7bb1e776514a87619030f","f0ec79a04c1c3d9ed0567fa16198a2d6b3aad59b3238ce319b947ce136cfa996","5f83306d3173b9e97d087b9cd2bc330f01e9d7bbdbd92c0b65203627a7b3bc34"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4512,4535],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p4512"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE excluded supported intra-band non-contiguous CA band combinations other than included in capability signalling as specified in TS 36.306 [5,] clause 4.3.5.21.","paragraph_zero_based":4536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reflectiveQoS","paragraph_zero_based":4538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports AS reflective QoS.","paragraph_zero_based":4539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No","paragraph_zero_based":4540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"relWeightTwoLayers/ relWeightFourLayers/ relWeightEightLayers","paragraph_zero_based":4541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates relative weight of processing FD-MIMO with 2/ 4/ 8 layers with respect to non-FD-MIMO with the same number of layers, see NOTE 8. Value v1 corresponds to relative weight of 1, value v1dot25 corresponds to relative weight of 1.25 and so on. This field can be included only if the UE supports the corresponding number of layers (i.e., 2/ 4/ 8 layers).","paragraph_zero_based":4542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportCGI-NR-EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":4544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports Inter-RAT report CGI procedure towards NR cell when it is configured with (NG)EN-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":4545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":4546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportCGI-NR-NoEN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":4547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports Inter-RAT report CGI procedure towards NR cell when it is not configured with (NG)EN-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":4548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Yes","paragraph_zero_based":4549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resumeWithMCG-SCellConfig","paragraph_zero_based":4550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports (re-)configuration of E-UTRA MCG SCells.","paragraph_zero_based":4551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resumeWithSCG-Config","paragraph_zero_based":4553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports (re-)configuration of an NR SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":4554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resumeWithStoredMCG-SCells","paragraph_zero_based":4556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports not deleting the stored E-UTRA MCG SCell configuration when initiating the resume procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":4557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resumeWithStoredSCG","paragraph_zero_based":4559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["84c53774af5236d4df40895c6dadfc1b64a9b314be08541d3e56b85d4d953f60","dddcc461cfb1676e825fc843d5fbc8351182d6f26c80d6b493b91d920f5d2275","b786115807fcccb931450b4d66cc1761f3d53623b490474b98de20350fa6d315","864264db1781badb3847e82be8353339bc08c14a6bd8c320f90ae620a4e99b1a","541c00ec47730b909b38937ba5a7be86bb0011be693f94e25a6c2eee84718efa","f1349f583e6c5fef73986d712495702904bf8539a8531ba17ea758addb5ae8a6","c639e3d0e77049b25e51d4bd598ef530a80b46bd4d995f9a1c8bb4eb6dbd521b","87b6d40f61d33df9fbc3648562dc6d7ceee501076ea7f23c2b7ddddfc586f547","b0398412b321256c27b8a357bec09edf7c473d34d58f5bd1c62aed0016df0ca9","e0c7ec33aeefdba29edee031f45296a4c19e40bc3b45f24cb7f018ccbeb734e9","07e5e00878a3838791b953fae319ab2c595a918d5ed52ddec1350d7a93f750b0","36acf33b1cc08fc615c951ef8b6aa4ed198277e98bec4ac01d97caef9185efe9","f2c1379c8718737657bf0aa0262541c7c9deaf2a6f9b4a45e88a6157884654e6","248dd8e09bb4efc3f651c9c4090b574696b05fcd0dc39c6fef16e4805de86951","0e0287e3f5b94b7d560cebd6025c42eef2f07dd837b0f9bdc2b42f711fd2ffbd","e8a618ed8efed2ee47790b5a1ebf66df44d931d9a548f471de1b744d2bb5ec92","ea43b075a243e700b7e2b175ec379b81eca992dda3b21bb75382df1b89e98912","af3aacc59103f68d6d203176f915bfe9f042c8592b3e2970c2fcb52dc315c44f","5ecb2181ab5dc5c1cfd61c8934dd74c694f17ce8d48834f2b225d7e4a7bdac2a","f60aa7a7b2bdd214f4454ce4cbc8a1704fb0acabff0b5df4ce20da227c70251e","33d9f053aeb37595e38e46218d6f5a675eda0932e531084ef54a65da2e61872c","fc47be98685e1d9a7bb562f1ea59079d4bca79c96137baf8e7e491c4e9c6d58e","d176451dbad9684ff247969c14b95c087c574e1d48d823ae52bd2a04b745e21e","74935f33e56c79d8ab539a7461d0a0a7ffdc77d548ec85fb42950d3eac2d28ee"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4536,4559],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx:p4536"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the UE supports not deleting the stored NR SCG configuration when initiating the resume procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":4560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-CapabilityPerBandPairList","paragraph_zero_based":4562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates, for a particular pair of bands, the SRS carrier switching parameters when switching between the band pair to transmit SRS on a PUSCH-less SCell as specified in TS 36.212 [22] and TS 36.213 [23]. If included, the UE shall include a number of entries as indicated in the following, and listed in the same order, as in bandParameterList for the concerned band combination:","paragraph_zero_based":4563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For the first band, the UE shall include the same number of entries as in bandParameterList i.e. first entry corresponds to first band in bandParameterList and so on,","paragraph_zero_based":4564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For the second band, the UE shall include one entry less i.e. first entry corresponds to the second band in bandParameterList and so on","paragraph_zero_based":4565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-And so on.","paragraph_zero_based":4566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedBands","paragraph_zero_based":4568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the frequency bands requested by E-UTRAN.","paragraph_zero_based":4569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedCCsDL, requestedCCsUL","paragraph_zero_based":4571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of CCs requested by E-UTRAN.","paragraph_zero_based":4572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedDiffFallbackCombList","paragraph_zero_based":4574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CA band combinations for which report of different UE capabilities is requested by E-UTRAN.","paragraph_zero_based":4575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rf-RetuningTimeDL","paragraph_zero_based":4577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the interruption time on DL reception within a band pair during the RF retuning for switching between the band pair to transmit SRS on a PUSCH-less SCell. n0 represents 0 OFDM symbols, n0dot5 represents 0.5 OFDM symbols, n1 represents 1 OFDM symbol and so on. This field is mandatory present if switching between the band pair is supported.","paragraph_zero_based":4578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rf-RetuningTimeUL","paragraph_zero_based":4580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the interruption time on UL transmission within a band pair during the RF retuning for switching between the band pair to transmit SRS on a PUSCH-less SCell. n0 represents 0 OFDM symbols, n0dot5 represents 0.5 OFDM symbols, n1 represents 1 OFDM symbol and so on. This field is mandatory present if switching between the band pair is supported.","paragraph_zero_based":4581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-","paragraph_zero_based":4582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rlc-AM-Ooo-Delivery","paragraph_zero_based":4583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["326ac9d038f02b5113d0f794b4f380a6a20627357001c7a483ec626