{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509161.zip::R2-2509161 36331 R19 Misc Rapp.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"13","paragraph_zero_based":5280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"01101","paragraph_zero_based":5281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"14","paragraph_zero_based":5284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"01110","paragraph_zero_based":5285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"15","paragraph_zero_based":5288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"01111","paragraph_zero_based":5289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 6:UE includes the intraBandContiguousCC-InfoList-r12 also for bandwidth class A because of the presence conditions in BandCombinationParameters-v1270. For example, if UE supports CA_1A_41D band combination, if UE includes the field intraBandContiguousCC-InfoList-r12 for band 41, the UE includes intraBandContiguousCC-InfoList-r12 also for band 1.","paragraph_zero_based":5293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 6a:For multiple BandParameters entries with the same bandEUTRA and same ca-BandwidthClassDL in a supported band combination, the UE capabilities indicated by BandParameters are agnostic to the order in which they are indicated in the bandParameterList, under the condition that the set of the capabilities indicated for the concerned bandEUTRA (e.g. bandParametersDL and bandParametersUL) are used together, and the concerned BandParameters correspond to the supportedBandwithCombinationSet for which set of channel bandwidths for carrier(s) is the same among sub-blocks, as defined in TS 36.101 [42], Table 5.6A.1-3, Table 5.6A.1-4, Table 5.6A.1-5.","paragraph_zero_based":5294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 7:For a UE that indicates release X in field accessStratumRelease but supports a feature specified in release X+ N (i.e. early UE implementation), the ASN.1 comprehension requirement are specified in Annex F.","paragraph_zero_based":5295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 8:For a UE that does not include mimo-WeightedLayersCapabilities-r13, or for the case with no CC configured with FD-MIMO, the FD-MIMO processing capability condition is not applicable (i.e. considered as satisfied). For a UE that includes mimo-WeightedLayersCapabilities-r13, the FD-MIMO processing capability condition is satisfied if the equation 4.3.28.13-1 in TS 36.306 [5] is satisfied.","paragraph_zero_based":5296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5297}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bba13f43bf9f9da1510e8bdb4b93207d82d3fbb590e153518aea1c934313854c","original_member_sha256":"d5729ee741f893aa83122cf8a780d8f66a4f43b530a05b8ace1245a510abed95","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bcc00530a71eb1f9edef65f3b9b2ae777db5893663e73cd51be28be6f34fb52e","234eb6f9ff4a9b336eee7da706fac906d288e14e371c623f8bd5fc546c3a0175","d1660873c53a05560f1347f7449e8573eafa5954eae3db0bedc7f298f03980b5","39a8699fcbfd0b074ba541cfacc391fd26df49768d34da4729c1541e3c9c5808","bdabffcaa51db0caa1649cbaf55a1f9a7858b12242ec6a012536f97664878977","57add8fa716b1b7d123763215f76201903ccc5f62dbc5d9a570aad7cae856d4c","255d5417581529d236cfc44996bfc9bdf87b5567f7faa6f2cfec69d4e89ae0e5","e9dd46249fdadbd60b0c5f46099ef050bd523583577bc2594ce9e4db7afbe69f","64700517af38b5aca8a9ca225522b07b5dba9a71b0e486a72930b4cb6c9701a5","f5b50c84a020620509a47ec09dd909e38b6c641284017af5ecf44a21d2f30f1f","93b1665574981ff6c94ea