{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509465.zip::R2-2509465.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-19","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19) Rel-20(Release 20)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Since the IEs NR-DL-TDOA-ProvideLocationInformation, NR-DL-TDOA-RequestLocationInformation, NR-DL-AoD-ProvideLocationInformation, NR-DL-AoD-RequestLocationInformation is used for both, UE-assisted and UE-based mode, “location measurements” in the description should be replaced by “location information” that is usually used to mean both, location estimate and location measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The unit \"meters\" should be changed to SI unit \"metres\" (as used consistently in LPP) at various places.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"\"device\" should be changed to \"target device\" at various places.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field description for refEphReq in IEs GNSS-SSR-OrbitCorrectionsSet2Req, GNSS-SSR-ClockCorrectionsSet2Req, GNSS-SSR-URA-Set2Req is incomplete.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"“location measurements” in the description is replaced by “location information”.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The unit \"meters\" is changed to \"metres\".","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"\"device\" is changed to \"target device\".","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field description for refEphReq is completed.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"031803c101a10e427d1f230cc629e09e0bd01d184d1e2938f387ad803c3911dc","original_member_sha256":"2bae8d5ac03017cc49187eaa8fa5f66dd9d41d8add52aa40b5603598875c82af","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3a0bdd1430819bb85d6667dd566da8e849e54468000be50c51381c3304924c8e","4c48a77eebc60d3f02f39c0be15c298f60b042f7ba679a4a98d209eae0dc543b","8720d92ed495003f3fd634676d5ca0515527edae9ca70a4405a418f7518bb68b","3cb88eac26eb730bf8e33b5c9dcc7bef39164531fa55651e6995c92e0a9a7df4","0bfec6ca70cc14d2de34405800bb8fd0c91a77f4e8b3098f86f431086ac4de9f","0f94008cb0110c9bd3bd4f90d0d642be76ccddcb76a9c126d564ae0be6737195","fe8a084d07dcc20cb561045274f92fb00942b3c2db8d38955c4c4ce38875939f","e9cdfd4e4f5dfb395e1d4e5337eecf5c598565cb124001e69620c607bfbcdca8","21c872835be3a0bb137ab48eac5c7d49be93684