been generated by BDS, and UE shall use these parameters according to the description given in 5.2.4.7 in [23], [50]. When the dataID has the value ′10′, it indicates that the parameters have been generated by NavIC, and UE shall use these parameters according to the description given in [38], [55]. When dataID has the value ′00′ it indicates the parameters are applicable worldwide [4], [7].","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"alfa0","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the 0 parameter of the Klobuchar model, as specified in [4], [23], [38], [50], [55].","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 2-30 seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"alfa1","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the 1 parameter of the Klobuchar model, as specified in [4], [23], [38], [50], [55].","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"031803c101a10e427d1f230cc629e09e0bd01d184d1e2938f387ad803c3911dc","original_member_sha256":"2bae8d5ac03017cc49187eaa8fa5f66dd9d41d8add52aa40b5603598875c82af","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0f638957461d3068082a5c7089f30c9d7e4d5196d4e6aa4995e895fd683e8f26","048e2989cb7f79f5690842ac85a189cb44bf12be0c960daf5804e76279335eb8","5b0022110ab8bf85219017815105f899a3bf60830cb12cf4e4ee3d29c64d1aba","2229cafb43e472cb2f8521e6ae07ed5865c50ff4df41fdf0de745300c56e96fc","d11810c411532fc84916a644c55cfee8a7cb967facb9bfdd261b7aa7987102af","8c1bed89b5d3f1257702dd21bbd04baf7b31b15aab6efccf8bce063a0ef1f253","b0f6f00baadbf4acfa983a9b7c919dd79e7149ac96d65a902e3dbccd15c7243f","795bb7d12fe2052858655100f1921f2e2bde647e291cbfbf4e0ef2324ee3a5b6","65cdabc702dd0d2464f095d79b5dfc59e146b35fc7389d1c06eb57040a9c6261","3762823cc36b457fdccb3a1203b065a39b1c17b72630ac7e67fc607b