{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2509471.zip::R2-2509471.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.2.2.0/5.2.2.2, add last relay operation for identifying SRB0 of the Child UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.2.3, remove “or sl-EgressRLC-Channel-UL”.","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.2.3.3.2, change “sl-EgressRLC-Channel-UL” to “sl-EgressRLC-Channel-DL”.","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.3.3.2, add the using of SL-RLC1 when the corresponding dedicated configuration is not provided.","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The Terms for Last Relay is not aligned with other spec.","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Typo remains in Figure 4.2.2-2.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The handling of the last relay operation for identifying SRB0 of the Child UE is not clearly captured. ","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Wrong parameter captured for U2N Remote UE operation remains in the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Wrong parameter to refer.","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Default SL-RLC1 cannot be used.","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.1, 4.2.2, 5.2.2, 5.2.3, 5.3.3.2","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"824a7bac8b90a08f9c293c8307b4f9799ba11ab540515c3a2f934fb64b1eff8e","original_member_sha256":"ea179417e72d27050f309eb5d0934180343e1eb6483f937dc1b0eef874b15949","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eed6cd331e94f0ef27f468a2c3ab1abccf3796fb610e56c60f16c9e123a316e0","efe7cfb9abfae4b9700ea61fb030bb1731076de78ccf0b9dda7f34505ba86b77","0b0884ab7b8cf69fd92eaf8ea212bf8033e88e227f92ba08994ec3c0d57f9db3","9b0964fa1d8f2352764ad39684552cdf034d9499334c97459e81a957d392fb0e","23da18bbbcbc650fad7a07ef8006251a7a06ae59113986d1a2b8d37f6d71a8d1","85f9fe225bf206da5b28016fbb39c62cb1368eb1244f4f20547ea6629294dc69","378adf0aa423995360841de5b3ff121413a3320bd55a44c2044b1a4823324310","187fdc709f1b9db3dcbdc46c58abd67c992e427fc72f46d622f68b5ff9a06106","50bfa6435180af055b16b9077ee5170bd87bf41075a797fc42acae3a5f36fa78","84d64f22af6748222691e114e1a1eaf0daecd65224a560009941f584359fb3a0","8a1a269db1a5f2988c67c27a0d729ba606368e504846e92bb1a37f5387d75d51","9063c3ad52a817be01ad9f9fbaca50105113a187f1f7868a61af85f7480242c8","95577c6e01d44a486ba9e654ae34e75a05d6c21cabd3e12dbc12bf367a0dc2d9","d3098623b4dfc23a1a4b383cc6c305d01a4c1c56ac54d5853c2f6542bbe0ad3e","d88bc81b05cdcb5373fcefe52e78f5e5b7ea4e37e19c0d9ebb00bb2abbe8ad2d","61cf31ccb32ca743f815831546a63f3d4f37ea5f4ff7e02e623d0e686dc91277","341fbc56bda1331f82ffa5c6ee8acec38bedd7ae7b004ec147f58eb00eff4359","d3262b1816fab55992cffb02c05a6ffa91b6523e243fbbc95fea56d1d4a60b90","c3683d587e9395b4366df402366a37ae834beabe3792a5a1f587771601d39ee